(782037, 86231, 19040, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus around the veil and how vivid the color of the eyes are.</td>', 'I like the soft focus around the veil and how vivid the color of the eyes are.', '2004-06-28 01:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(782039, 85693, 327, '<td valign="top">Love the color. YOUR not afraid of color..very flattering. I also think you''ve captured a joy in the eyes. Nice going. 9</td>', 'Love the color. YOUR not afraid of color..very flattering. I also think you''ve captured a joy in the eyes. Nice going. 9', '2004-06-28 01:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(782041, 85622, 22580, '<td valign="top">Background seems a bit dull. Maybe the use of a fill flash might also have helped.</td>', 'Background seems a bit dull. Maybe the use of a fill flash might also have helped.', '2004-06-28 01:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(782044, 85923, 22580, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit overexposed. Parts of shirt seem to blend in with the background.</td>', 'Seems a bit overexposed. Parts of shirt seem to blend in with the background.', '2004-06-28 01:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(782045, 85623, 327, '<td valign="top">10 Beautiful</td>', '10 Beautiful', '2004-06-28 01:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(782047, 86140, 327, '<td valign="top">Professional, high fashion, NYC look and feel about this shot. Bravo.</td>', 'Professional, high fashion, NYC look and feel about this shot. Bravo.', '2004-06-28 01:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(782049, 85526, 327, '<td valign="top">Upper right side? Her arm, distracting. The rest of the shot is really well done. Good entry. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Upper right side? Her arm, distracting. The rest of the shot is really well done. Good entry. Good luck in the challenge.', '2004-06-28 01:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(782052, 85891, 327, '<td valign="top">Only negative comment I have is the reflection in the glasses. I think the tripod should of been moved to clean that up some. Over all I like this. Good entry.</td>', 'Only negative comment I have is the reflection in the glasses. I think the tripod should of been moved to clean that up some. Over all I like this. Good entry.', '2004-06-28 01:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(782056, 85554, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks a lot like a high school year book photo. Nice background and light.</td>', 'Looks a lot like a high school year book photo. Nice background and light.', '2004-06-28 01:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(782057, 85816, 4159, '<td valign="top">There are easier ways to find subjects.   ...cool lighting.</td>', 'There are easier ways to find subjects.   ...cool lighting.', '2004-06-28 01:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(782061, 85893, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute expression, good color. Would only comment that it could be a bit more sharp. Over all I like it. Good work, cute girl.</td>', 'Cute expression, good color. Would only comment that it could be a bit more sharp. Over all I like it. Good work, cute girl.', '2004-06-28 01:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(782063, 86315, 6172, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if it''s such a good idea for her hair to blend with the background so well</td>', 'I don''t know if it''s such a good idea for her hair to blend with the background so well', '2004-06-28 01:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(782067, 86243, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice, interesting background.  Beautiful model</td>', 'Nice, interesting background.  Beautiful model', '2004-06-28 01:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(782069, 86316, 6172, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt.  I can tell you probably didn''t have very good lights to work with.</td>', 'Nice attempt.  I can tell you probably didn''t have very good lights to work with.', '2004-06-28 01:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(782070, 85780, 6172, '<td valign="top">not bad but the face is too shiney</td>', 'not bad but the face is too shiney', '2004-06-28 01:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(782073, 86306, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute! I would of liked to see more of the guitar included in the shot.</td>', 'Cute! I would of liked to see more of the guitar included in the shot.', '2004-06-28 02:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(782077, 86228, 327, '<td valign="top">Good focus, light, pose. I do think her eyes are stunning and would of liked her looking more at the camera. Pretty girl and a good relaxed model. Hope this does well.</td>', 'Good focus, light, pose. I do think her eyes are stunning and would of liked her looking more at the camera. Pretty girl and a good relaxed model. Hope this does well.', '2004-06-28 02:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(782078, 86089, 10686, '<td valign="top">I love the look here, this is outstanding imagery. I love the cross processed look. I''d appreciate some guidance on how you got this look. Not sure I like the title tho, could have been better there, but oh well. - 10</td>', 'I love the look here, this is outstanding imagery. I love the cross processed look. I''d appreciate some guidance on how you got this look. Not sure I like the title tho, could have been better there, but oh well. - 10', '2004-06-28 02:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(782079, 86089, 200, '<td valign="top">awesome shot :)</td>', 'awesome shot :)', '2004-06-28 02:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(782080, 85568, 16241, '<td valign="top">good, i can relate to this look</td>', 'good, i can relate to this look', '2004-06-28 02:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(782081, 85542, 327, '<td valign="top">Repunsel! Love the light. Maybe a darker lipstick. 8</td>', 'Repunsel! Love the light. Maybe a darker lipstick. 8', '2004-06-28 02:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(782084, 85623, 16241, '<td valign="top">the best in the challenge for me</td>', 'the best in the challenge for me', '2004-06-28 02:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(782086, 86312, 327, '<td valign="top">Darling shot, good pose. Light is a bit harsh in spots and the focus could be a little more sharp. I like this and hope you do well. 8</td>', 'Darling shot, good pose. Light is a bit harsh in spots and the focus could be a little more sharp. I like this and hope you do well. 8', '2004-06-28 02:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(782087, 85334, 10686, '<td valign="top">This is just cute as heck, great DOF too. 9</td>', 'This is just cute as heck, great DOF too. 9', '2004-06-28 02:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(782091, 85970, 4159, '<td valign="top">Interesting...  very interesting...<br/> <br/>on its own, pretty nice shot, though flash might''ve been a bit bright and direct (sharp shadow behind, pinprick in eyeballs).</td>', 'Interesting...  very interesting... on its own, pretty nice shot, though flash might''ve been a bit bright and direct (sharp shadow behind, pinprick in eyeballs).', '2004-06-28 02:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(782093, 86125, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice image 8</td>', 'Nice image 8', '2004-06-28 02:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(782097, 85894, 23454, '<td valign="top">Perfect! I love everything about this picture. The white chair on the white background really allows you to focus on the subject. Great!</td>', 'Perfect! I love everything about this picture. The white chair on the white background really allows you to focus on the subject. Great!', '2004-06-28 02:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(782099, 86275, 23454, '<td valign="top">This is a great photograph. I love the lighting and the soft warm hues on her skin. But, I would prefer her shoulders to be in focus, and to show more of her instead of just her head.</td>', 'This is a great photograph. I love the lighting and the soft warm hues on her skin. But, I would prefer her shoulders to be in focus, and to show more of her instead of just her head.', '2004-06-28 02:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(782103, 86309, 23454, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, timeless photograph! Wonderful job. My only complaint is that her face is so shadowed. I like the bright side light, but a soft glow on her face would have made it perfect.</td>', 'This is a beautiful, timeless photograph! Wonderful job. My only complaint is that her face is so shadowed. I like the bright side light, but a soft glow on her face would have made it perfect.', '2004-06-28 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(782106, 85273, 4159, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  This is a ribbon.  The eyes are mesmerizing, and the focus thing somehow works.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  This is a ribbon.  The eyes are mesmerizing, and the focus thing somehow works.', '2004-06-28 02:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(782111, 86219, 4159, '<td valign="top">DIffuse glow makes this a bit eerie.</td>', 'DIffuse glow makes this a bit eerie.', '2004-06-28 02:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(782116, 86140, 4159, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of this one, for some reason reminds me of Amelie...</td>', 'I like the composition of this one, for some reason reminds me of Amelie...', '2004-06-28 02:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(782117, 86121, 4159, '<td valign="top">The picture itself is pretty good, but whatever effect you put on it is off-putting - the glowing head and chest thing.  Nice capture of the eyes, though, they''re expressive.</td>', 'The picture itself is pretty good, but whatever effect you put on it is off-putting - the glowing head and chest thing.  Nice capture of the eyes, though, they''re expressive.', '2004-06-28 02:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
