(782127, 86305, 7322, '<td valign="top">Next time, try focusing on the eyes. They look like empty sockets--very spooky. I don''t really like that his ears are folded back. That''s just weird.</td>', 'Next time, try focusing on the eyes. They look like empty sockets--very spooky. I don''t really like that his ears are folded back. That''s just weird.', '2004-06-28 02:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
