(782151, 86315, 11518, '<td valign="top">Eddy, I think a black or darker background would have worked a lot better.  As it is it is too similar in colour to your wife''s hair and dress, this makes her kinda blend into the background.  The lighting looks a bit harsh too.</td>', 'Eddy, I think a black or darker background would have worked a lot better.  As it is it is too similar in colour to your wife''s hair and dress, this makes her kinda blend into the background.  The lighting looks a bit harsh too.', '2004-06-28 02:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
