(782168, 86134, 7322, '<td valign="top">She is a very cute kid but her hair looks either greasy or wet. Next time, I would suggest waiting untlil her hair dries or using less hair product. The capture of her eyes is very nice and her lips look natural.</td>', 'She is a very cute kid but her hair looks either greasy or wet. Next time, I would suggest waiting untlil her hair dries or using less hair product. The capture of her eyes is very nice and her lips look natural.', '2004-06-28 02:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
