(782254, 86287, 7322, '<td valign="top">The lighting is way too dark. You can barely see the subject''s face. You need a spotlight somewhere near the clowns face to make a strong statement about theater, etc. The clown make-up looks amateurish (the white is very streaky looking)</td>', 'The lighting is way too dark. You can barely see the subject''s face. You need a spotlight somewhere near the clowns face to make a strong statement about theater, etc. The clown make-up looks amateurish (the white is very streaky looking)', '2004-06-28 03:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
