(782383, 85780, 22580, '<td valign="top">Wow, nice composition. Colors look a bit pasty. Background needs some lighting and the dark/black areas seems to have little detail.</td>', 'Wow, nice composition. Colors look a bit pasty. Background needs some lighting and the dark/black areas seems to have little detail.', '2004-06-28 08:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(782384, 86312, 22781, '<td valign="top">This is beautifull.<br/>But because I get thes comments on my picture: The lipstick is overkill :) <br/>I like the softness in this picture, and it''s a lovely girl.<br/>Just on the serious side, there are some dark shadows that maybe could have been avoided by different lighting. (7)</td>', 'This is beautifull.But because I get thes comments on my picture: The lipstick is overkill :) I like the softness in this picture, and it''s a lovely girl.Just on the serious side, there are some dark shadows that maybe could have been avoided by different lighting. (7)', '2004-06-28 08:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(782385, 85568, 22580, '<td valign="top">There seems to be some kind of light halo on the left side of his face. Pretty straight forward shot. Looks like a regular photo, not one that would seem to be taken in a professional studio.</td>', 'There seems to be some kind of light halo on the left side of his face. Pretty straight forward shot. Looks like a regular photo, not one that would seem to be taken in a professional studio.', '2004-06-28 08:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
