(782416, 86107, 22580, '<td valign="top">Hmm, were there some some editing done to the face? The piece of hair sticking out on the right side of the face seems to be a bit distracting.</td>', 'Hmm, were there some some editing done to the face? The piece of hair sticking out on the right side of the face seems to be a bit distracting.', '2004-06-28 08:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
