(782555, 86315, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely background, model, pose and coloring.  Her skin just glows.  Very pretty.</td>', 'Lovely background, model, pose and coloring.  Her skin just glows.  Very pretty.', '2004-06-28 10:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(782556, 86103, 8860, '<td valign="top">Had the border not spoiled this I think it could have scored well, and is actually quite novel. However, it''s so intrusive that it kills much of its charm. Clever idea.</td>', 'Had the border not spoiled this I think it could have scored well, and is actually quite novel. However, it''s so intrusive that it kills much of its charm. Clever idea.', '2004-06-28 10:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(782557, 86229, 16230, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The look is nice and soft without seeming blurred, and the skin tones and colors look good too. A little more light on the right side of her face would have been better I think. The brighter background competes for attention with the subject.</td>', 'I like this one. The look is nice and soft without seeming blurred, and the skin tones and colors look good too. A little more light on the right side of her face would have been better I think. The brighter background competes for attention with the subject.', '2004-06-28 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(782558, 86287, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Subject is too indistinct and under lit. Image is fuzzy and soft with what looks like some rather rough editing. Subject offset further to right would emphasis the loneliness/sadness.</td>', 'Nice idea. Subject is too indistinct and under lit. Image is fuzzy and soft with what looks like some rather rough editing. Subject offset further to right would emphasis the loneliness/sadness.', '2004-06-28 10:32:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(782559, 85972, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful work.  Perfect lighting, and those crystal-clear whites of her eyes really stand out.</td>', 'Very beautiful work.  Perfect lighting, and those crystal-clear whites of her eyes really stand out.', '2004-06-28 10:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(782560, 86314, 16230, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus. The background objects are a bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus. The background objects are a bit distracting.', '2004-06-28 10:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(782564, 85241, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice face! Strangely, because the face is upside down I think having her eyes open further would help the viewer see more personality and ''grasp'' the image. The right way up she looks great but those eyes look just a little too closed for aesthetic perfection.</td>', 'Nice face! Strangely, because the face is upside down I think having her eyes open further would help the viewer see more personality and ''grasp'' the image. The right way up she looks great but those eyes look just a little too closed for aesthetic perfection.', '2004-06-28 10:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(782569, 86084, 8860, '<td valign="top">She looks like a reluctant subject which renders the shot a bit less effective. It''s also an unflattering angle doesn''t help. Had she opned her eyes and looked at the camera she would have looked mischievous or flirty. <br/> <br/>Lighting is flat which makes it look like camera flash, whereas directional lighting would create more mood and bring form to clothing and hair.</td>', 'She looks like a reluctant subject which renders the shot a bit less effective. It''s also an unflattering angle doesn''t help. Had she opned her eyes and looked at the camera she would have looked mischievous or flirty.  Lighting is flat which makes it look like camera flash, whereas directional lighting would create more mood and bring form to clothing and hair.', '2004-06-28 10:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(782570, 86280, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual (although reminiscent of another challenge shot) and effective. Eye is in a strange position though. Looks like some editing has shaved off part of her reflected nose!</td>', 'Unusual (although reminiscent of another challenge shot) and effective. Eye is in a strange position though. Looks like some editing has shaved off part of her reflected nose!', '2004-06-28 10:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
