(782575, 85334, 12448, '<td valign="top">You''re going to get nailed because it''s "not a person" and therefore, "Doesn''t meet the challenge" comments.  Well, you know what I say to that?  "PTHLBTHLBTHLBTHLB!"  This baby is adorable and is just as human, if not more than most people I know!  I love the expressive eyes but the DOF hurts this shot to me.  I know they are long dogs (I have one myself) but they aren''t that LONG, LOL!   Excellent capture, an 8</td>', 'You''re going to get nailed because it''s "not a person" and therefore, "Doesn''t meet the challenge" comments.  Well, you know what I say to that?  "PTHLBTHLBTHLBTHLB!"  This baby is adorable and is just as human, if not more than most people I know!  I love the expressive eyes but the DOF hurts this shot to me.  I know they are long dogs (I have one myself) but they aren''t that LONG, LOL!   Excellent capture, an 8', '2004-06-28 10:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
