(782675, 86213, 7703, '<td valign="top">Is this a self portrait?  it looks like the person is streaching his arm out to take a picture of him self. but very well done .. I think this one will be in the top 5</td>', 'Is this a self portrait?  it looks like the person is streaching his arm out to take a picture of him self. but very well done .. I think this one will be in the top 5', '2004-06-28 12:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(782677, 86281, 2764, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop?  It feels out of balance with all that stone.  The colors are so nice, as is the pose and the sad expression, I think it would be stunning with a much tighter crop.</td>', 'A tighter crop?  It feels out of balance with all that stone.  The colors are so nice, as is the pose and the sad expression, I think it would be stunning with a much tighter crop.', '2004-06-28 12:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(782678, 85956, 2764, '<td valign="top">Therianthrohy?  She/he looks like a leopard with the spots and the cat eyes.</td>', 'Therianthrohy?  She/he looks like a leopard with the spots and the cat eyes.', '2004-06-28 12:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(782694, 85938, 9295, '<td valign="top">Absolutely perfect. Even with just the thumbnail, I could tell this was an extraordinary composition. I love the soft pastels and the grey backdrop is the perfect balance to her silver wand. This little girl is an angel and you captured it perfectly. I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t ribbon. Good luck!</td>', 'Absolutely perfect. Even with just the thumbnail, I could tell this was an extraordinary composition. I love the soft pastels and the grey backdrop is the perfect balance to her silver wand. This little girl is an angel and you captured it perfectly. I''ll be very surprised if this doesn''t ribbon. Good luck!', '2004-06-28 12:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(782696, 85273, 2780, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, 10</td>', 'Fantastic shot, 10', '2004-06-28 12:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(782697, 86309, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is an amazingly professional looking shot. 10</td>', 'This is an amazingly professional looking shot. 10', '2004-06-28 12:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(782698, 86089, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but spoilt by the title. Also the background is a bit too similar in colour to the skin. 6</td>', 'Nice shot, but spoilt by the title. Also the background is a bit too similar in colour to the skin. 6', '2004-06-28 12:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(782701, 85241, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, with a good pose and composition. I think to really make it special you should have made the whites of the eys and the teeth brighter in post-processing. 7</td>', 'Nice photo, with a good pose and composition. I think to really make it special you should have made the whites of the eys and the teeth brighter in post-processing. 7', '2004-06-28 12:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
