(782723, 86305, 17578, '<td valign="top">I love the thoughtfulness of the photo.   I know like mine he is a part of a family and therefore human.  You have captured him well and I will vote high because I know how difficult pet pics can be.  Love the tink of pink with the ears back. 10</td>', 'I love the thoughtfulness of the photo.   I know like mine he is a part of a family and therefore human.  You have captured him well and I will vote high because I know how difficult pet pics can be.  Love the tink of pink with the ears back. 10', '2004-06-28 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(782724, 86099, 22392, '<td valign="top">the colors are very warm and her look is touching.</td>', 'the colors are very warm and her look is touching.', '2004-06-28 12:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(782727, 85568, 327, '<td valign="top">It''s okay. Maybe a little more sharp. Nice entry. 8</td>', 'It''s okay. Maybe a little more sharp. Nice entry. 8', '2004-06-28 12:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(782728, 85698, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cute, very. I think the back drop is bit busy, but this is good.</td>', 'Very cute, very. I think the back drop is bit busy, but this is good.', '2004-06-28 12:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(782730, 85334, 17578, '<td valign="top">Love your picture, I can tell this doggie loves you.  I can see it in the eyes.  Great shot and I won''t slam you for not being a person because I believe he is part of a family and therefore this is a family member portrait.  10</td>', 'Love your picture, I can tell this doggie loves you.  I can see it in the eyes.  Great shot and I won''t slam you for not being a person because I believe he is part of a family and therefore this is a family member portrait.  10', '2004-06-28 12:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(782731, 85910, 22392, '<td valign="top">I don''t like jokes with pets, like putting hats on them. And it bothers me that his front paw has been cut of. The background is way to distracting to make it a nice and truthfull portrait.</td>', 'I don''t like jokes with pets, like putting hats on them. And it bothers me that his front paw has been cut of. The background is way to distracting to make it a nice and truthfull portrait.', '2004-06-28 12:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(782734, 86226, 22392, '<td valign="top">you will get this a lot, but this doesn''t meet the challenge at all. No studio, no special lighting and although it''s a nice horse and a nice girl, the picture is nothing special.</td>', 'you will get this a lot, but this doesn''t meet the challenge at all. No studio, no special lighting and although it''s a nice horse and a nice girl, the picture is nothing special.', '2004-06-28 12:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(782736, 85956, 22392, '<td valign="top">too overprocessed. Doesn''t add to the portrait.</td>', 'too overprocessed. Doesn''t add to the portrait.', '2004-06-28 12:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
