(782761, 86283, 327, '<td valign="top">Handsome. Great light and focus, good pose. The shirt collar!</td>', 'Handsome. Great light and focus, good pose. The shirt collar!', '2004-06-28 13:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(782764, 86257, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice relaxed expression and good light. I think the flaw is the crop. The crotch, knees and lower chair don''t add anything to him or the shot. It''s good work but we care about the guy, his eyes and not the shorts or seat of the chair. :)</td>', 'Nice relaxed expression and good light. I think the flaw is the crop. The crotch, knees and lower chair don''t add anything to him or the shot. It''s good work but we care about the guy, his eyes and not the shorts or seat of the chair. :)', '2004-06-28 13:09:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(782766, 85934, 327, '<td valign="top">Handsome man, great light, pose and expression is relaxed. I like it all except for the blue pillow at the bottom. Well done. 9 from me.</td>', 'Handsome man, great light, pose and expression is relaxed. I like it all except for the blue pillow at the bottom. Well done. 9 from me.', '2004-06-28 13:10:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(782768, 86147, 327, '<td valign="top">Could  be a bit more sharp, remove the white on the lower left and the mole on his forehead. I love your lighting and his expression. 8~</td>', 'Could  be a bit more sharp, remove the white on the lower left and the mole on his forehead. I love your lighting and his expression. 8~', '2004-06-28 13:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(782770, 85827, 327, '<td valign="top">Her body is lost in the background, maybe a different top.</td>', 'Her body is lost in the background, maybe a different top.', '2004-06-28 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(782772, 86219, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition, light and love the soft focus. 10~</td>', 'Lovely composition, light and love the soft focus. 10~', '2004-06-28 13:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(782773, 85897, 22922, '<td valign="top">Very strong theme, composition is nice, lighting is a bit too harsh here, I think.  Good shot overall and a probable ribbon for the challenge.</td>', 'Very strong theme, composition is nice, lighting is a bit too harsh here, I think.  Good shot overall and a probable ribbon for the challenge.', '2004-06-28 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(782776, 86275, 327, '<td valign="top">Only two little things I dislike about this, her shoulders-showing the little bits and the knuckles. The hands don''t seem naturally posed, it''s like she is showing her rings..why? Lovely girl, great face, eyes. I love her smile and your lighting is very good.</td>', 'Only two little things I dislike about this, her shoulders-showing the little bits and the knuckles. The hands don''t seem naturally posed, it''s like she is showing her rings..why? Lovely girl, great face, eyes. I love her smile and your lighting is very good.', '2004-06-28 13:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(782778, 86167, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful eyes. Just that white of the left arm is a bother. 9~ This is really a good entry.</td>', 'Beautiful eyes. Just that white of the left arm is a bother. 9~ This is really a good entry.', '2004-06-28 13:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(782780, 85865, 22922, '<td valign="top">A very natural look, with sophistication all out of proportion with the subject.  You have a normal kid in a high-class shot, very nice. Focus could be a tad sharper.  Great job overall.</td>', 'A very natural look, with sophistication all out of proportion with the subject.  You have a normal kid in a high-class shot, very nice. Focus could be a tad sharper.  Great job overall.', '2004-06-28 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(782781, 86095, 327, '<td valign="top">Great eyes and lips!! Fantastic face, and expression. I don''t like the wrinkles in the shirt and jacket. The shoulder pad looks too big. Nice work and good luck.</td>', 'Great eyes and lips!! Fantastic face, and expression. I don''t like the wrinkles in the shirt and jacket. The shoulder pad looks too big. Nice work and good luck.', '2004-06-28 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(782783, 85855, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute cute cute!! Love the light on her. 9~</td>', 'Cute cute cute!! Love the light on her. 9~', '2004-06-28 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(782784, 85865, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice relaxed pose and good crop. I only wish the face was sharper. Good entry.</td>', 'Nice relaxed pose and good crop. I only wish the face was sharper. Good entry.', '2004-06-28 13:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(782785, 86243, 327, '<td valign="top">10~ Love this, love her, love it all!!</td>', '10~ Love this, love her, love it all!!', '2004-06-28 13:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(782786, 85334, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and light. Weener dog! 9~</td>', 'Nice focus and light. Weener dog! 9~', '2004-06-28 13:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(782787, 86305, 22922, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, doesn''t feel like a portrait in the traditional sense, but evokes emotion and humor.  I wish I could see his eyes, though. A very powerful shot, regardless.</td>', 'Interesting take, doesn''t feel like a portrait in the traditional sense, but evokes emotion and humor.  I wish I could see his eyes, though. A very powerful shot, regardless.', '2004-06-28 13:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(782789, 86134, 22392, '<td valign="top">very nice and simple.</td>', 'very nice and simple.', '2004-06-28 13:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
