(783023, 85894, 11518, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, professional-looking portrait.  Badass photgrapher with badass equipment and badass son for model makes for badass photo!  :) 10<br/> <br/>I''ll eat my Rebel if this does not ribbon :D</td>', 'Beautiful, professional-looking portrait.  Badass photgrapher with badass equipment and badass son for model makes for badass photo!  :) 10 I''ll eat my Rebel if this does not ribbon :D', '2004-06-28 15:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(783024, 85923, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is quite a bit high-key. The desaturation looks gives her eyes a very odd and unnatural appearance. This is not too be mean--I''m giving you an objective opinion since this is very likely a loved one and we tend to see with the eyes of love---she is a really cute girl and this is a great expression but her ears stick out a tad with her hair tucked behind. Not so much that  I would be likely to notice in everyday life but for a lasting portrait, I would suggest next time, have her wear her hair down. My eye keeps straying toward her left ear.</td>', 'This is quite a bit high-key. The desaturation looks gives her eyes a very odd and unnatural appearance. This is not too be mean--I''m giving you an objective opinion since this is very likely a loved one and we tend to see with the eyes of love---she is a really cute girl and this is a great expression but her ears stick out a tad with her hair tucked behind. Not so much that  I would be likely to notice in everyday life but for a lasting portrait, I would suggest next time, have her wear her hair down. My eye keeps straying toward her left ear.', '2004-06-28 15:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(783025, 86313, 15810, '<td valign="top">Really interesting pose and great colours.</td>', 'Really interesting pose and great colours.', '2004-06-28 15:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(783027, 85526, 15810, '<td valign="top">Superb capture of the dark skin tones which are notoriously hard to get right. Beautiful work. 10</td>', 'Superb capture of the dark skin tones which are notoriously hard to get right. Beautiful work. 10', '2004-06-28 15:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(783030, 86229, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like this accept for the cropping of her bodice. It looks really pouffy and ill-fitting. A slightly higher crop, or a slightly lower crop to show more or less of the dress would have made a difference. Because her face is in quite a bit of shadow, my eyes keep straying to that sparkly, white, poufiness.</td>', 'I like this accept for the cropping of her bodice. It looks really pouffy and ill-fitting. A slightly higher crop, or a slightly lower crop to show more or less of the dress would have made a difference. Because her face is in quite a bit of shadow, my eyes keep straying to that sparkly, white, poufiness.', '2004-06-28 15:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(783031, 86275, 9618, '<td valign="top">Great subject, good lighting, but the hand positions don''t look natural. It looks as if she is showing off her rings. If that is the intent, that is great, but if not, the hands cast a shadow on to her chin.</td>', 'Great subject, good lighting, but the hand positions don''t look natural. It looks as if she is showing off her rings. If that is the intent, that is great, but if not, the hands cast a shadow on to her chin.', '2004-06-28 15:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(783032, 86140, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very nice sexy pose, but there seems to be some perspective distortion (voluntary?) probably from a wide angle lens.  Nice effect though. 7</td>', 'Very nice sexy pose, but there seems to be some perspective distortion (voluntary?) probably from a wide angle lens.  Nice effect though. 7', '2004-06-28 15:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(783034, 86167, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice pose. The bright right elbow drags my eye away a bit to the corner , but not too much. Good work.</td>', 'Nice shot and nice pose. The bright right elbow drags my eye away a bit to the corner , but not too much. Good work.', '2004-06-28 15:37:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(783039, 86103, 15810, '<td valign="top">If this was submitted as a joke then.......ahahhahahaha....excellent. <br/> <br/> If not please accept my sincere apologies but the picture is dreadful.</td>', 'If this was submitted as a joke then.......ahahhahahaha....excellent.   If not please accept my sincere apologies but the picture is dreadful.', '2004-06-28 15:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(783040, 86107, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting from a full frontal flash shot.</td>', 'Very harsh lighting from a full frontal flash shot.', '2004-06-28 15:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(783041, 86213, 14700, '<td valign="top">Ordinarily you want the subject to look into the negitive space... but it really works well with this one.  I would have stood back another ten feet from him....standing as close as you are sorta makes his nose look much larger than it really is. Overall a great shot.  8.</td>', 'Ordinarily you want the subject to look into the negitive space... but it really works well with this one.  I would have stood back another ten feet from him....standing as close as you are sorta makes his nose look much larger than it really is. Overall a great shot.  8.', '2004-06-28 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(783042, 85284, 18677, '<td valign="top">focus looks perfect.  the soft focus may have been just a tad overdone, but not enough to significantly affect the score.  good job!</td>', 'focus looks perfect.  the soft focus may have been just a tad overdone, but not enough to significantly affect the score.  good job!', '2004-06-28 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(783043, 86314, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but the background is a little busy.</td>', 'Nice capture but the background is a little busy.', '2004-06-28 15:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(783046, 86307, 7322, '<td valign="top">Her lipstick is rather overpowering her face. I''d rather be focusing on her beautiful green eyes than her rather unnatural cool red mouth. Someone with this warm coloring should be wearing a warmer red or other earthy, spicy color. I think the focus is a bit too soft. She''s an attractive model in a nice pose and her outfit is well put-together.</td>', 'Her lipstick is rather overpowering her face. I''d rather be focusing on her beautiful green eyes than her rather unnatural cool red mouth. Someone with this warm coloring should be wearing a warmer red or other earthy, spicy color. I think the focus is a bit too soft. She''s an attractive model in a nice pose and her outfit is well put-together.', '2004-06-28 15:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(783048, 86107, 15810, '<td valign="top">Lovely close up and gorgeous skin tones...very well done. The eyes have been captured beautifully. Not deducting any points but  Q. Why didnt you take the shot in portrait format?</td>', 'Lovely close up and gorgeous skin tones...very well done. The eyes have been captured beautifully. Not deducting any points but  Q. Why didnt you take the shot in portrait format?', '2004-06-28 15:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(783050, 86076, 18677, '<td valign="top">the soft focus was just a little overdone, to the point where it looks more out of focus than soft focus.  lighting, pose, and background are good.</td>', 'the soft focus was just a little overdone, to the point where it looks more out of focus than soft focus.  lighting, pose, and background are good.', '2004-06-28 15:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(783053, 85891, 9821, '<td valign="top">very creative, I like the "look" ... seems a little dark and maybe not enough depth of field + my attention is rawn to the red light on your eyeball.</td>', 'very creative, I like the "look" ... seems a little dark and maybe not enough depth of field + my attention is rawn to the red light on your eyeball.', '2004-06-28 15:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(783054, 85893, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great child portrait, you''ve really captured a "moment" here. Great work.</td>', 'Great child portrait, you''ve really captured a "moment" here. Great work.', '2004-06-28 15:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(783055, 85827, 9618, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like the colors, but a reflector in front of the subject would help with the shadows on her face and neck.</td>', 'Good shot. I like the colors, but a reflector in front of the subject would help with the shadows on her face and neck.', '2004-06-28 15:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(783058, 85554, 11518, '<td valign="top">Background is too similar to the model''s shirt...makes for a flat monotone portrait.  The face is well lighted though.</td>', 'Background is too similar to the model''s shirt...makes for a flat monotone portrait.  The face is well lighted though.', '2004-06-28 15:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(783061, 85894, 9821, '<td valign="top">Great Job as usual Jacko. Sam''s eyes look a little oversharpened, but you did very well lighting everything up under the hat without blowing out the chair too much. Great.</td>', 'Great Job as usual Jacko. Sam''s eyes look a little oversharpened, but you did very well lighting everything up under the hat without blowing out the chair too much. Great.', '2004-06-28 15:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
