(783063, 86243, 15810, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait but I find the background a little busy. I''m sure you model has some beautiful Sari''s but the one she is wearing is a little dull in colour too. Perhaps a brighter coloured Sari would help stop me looking at the background carvings.</td>', 'Nice portrait but I find the background a little busy. I''m sure you model has some beautiful Sari''s but the one she is wearing is a little dull in colour too. Perhaps a brighter coloured Sari would help stop me looking at the background carvings.', '2004-06-28 15:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
