(783067, 85273, 20577, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... No matter how this does in the challenge you can be proud of taking a picture that a mother and father will cherish forever. If this is your child I can''t imagine how happy you were when you saw it. Awesome....</td>', 'Beautiful... No matter how this does in the challenge you can be proud of taking a picture that a mother and father will cherish forever. If this is your child I can''t imagine how happy you were when you saw it. Awesome....', '2004-06-28 15:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
