(783073, 86219, 9618, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I like how you got the ring in the shot and kept it natural looking. I also like the soft focus. The only complaint that I have is the bright sky behind the gentleman.</td>', 'Nicely done. I like how you got the ring in the shot and kept it natural looking. I also like the soft focus. The only complaint that I have is the bright sky behind the gentleman.', '2004-06-28 15:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(783075, 86213, 15810, '<td valign="top">Brilliant capture which really gives the viewer an idea of this man''s character. You have grabbed a superb shot here, beautifully lit and brilliantly composed. A Ribbon awaits I''m sure. 10</td>', 'Brilliant capture which really gives the viewer an idea of this man''s character. You have grabbed a superb shot here, beautifully lit and brilliantly composed. A Ribbon awaits I''m sure. 10', '2004-06-28 15:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(783076, 85972, 11518, '<td valign="top">The pose looks a bit unnatural, the green glove kinda disappears in the dark background and she doesn''t seem to be leaning on her hand.</td>', 'The pose looks a bit unnatural, the green glove kinda disappears in the dark background and she doesn''t seem to be leaning on her hand.', '2004-06-28 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(783077, 86140, 9821, '<td valign="top">The angle is awesome and I like her expression as well .... I''m a little distracted by the shadow on her chest .... but it''s still very cool.</td>', 'The angle is awesome and I like her expression as well .... I''m a little distracted by the shadow on her chest .... but it''s still very cool.', '2004-06-28 15:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(783081, 86107, 7322, '<td valign="top">Her lipsitick is rather crusty looking because her lips are chapped. Also, it is far to overdone for a model of this age. I know it is very hard to capture eyes this dark.  I have nearly black eyes myself--I''m aware of how difficult it can be to capture highlights when the irises seem to disappear into the pupil. It can be done with careful lighting and exposure. What I see on my monitor are rather flat, black irises with tiny dots of white. Kind of unsettling. It might be due to overly soft focusing.</td>', 'Her lipsitick is rather crusty looking because her lips are chapped. Also, it is far to overdone for a model of this age. I know it is very hard to capture eyes this dark.  I have nearly black eyes myself--I''m aware of how difficult it can be to capture highlights when the irises seem to disappear into the pupil. It can be done with careful lighting and exposure. What I see on my monitor are rather flat, black irises with tiny dots of white. Kind of unsettling. It might be due to overly soft focusing.', '2004-06-28 15:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(783085, 86134, 9821, '<td valign="top">I think a reflector on the left would have taken away some of the shadow on her face, but overalll I like it. Nice sharp eyes.</td>', 'I think a reflector on the left would have taken away some of the shadow on her face, but overalll I like it. Nice sharp eyes.', '2004-06-28 15:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(783089, 86116, 11518, '<td valign="top">Good pose, good lighting.  Red background works well here.  I like how she is off-center.</td>', 'Good pose, good lighting.  Red background works well here.  I like how she is off-center.', '2004-06-28 15:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(783090, 86115, 18080, '<td valign="top">Excelent shot.<br/>9 from me<br/>my only crit would be the focus on the spot on the backwall is a little bright and highlights his bottom.<br/>Good luck</td>', 'Excelent shot.9 from memy only crit would be the focus on the spot on the backwall is a little bright and highlights his bottom.Good luck', '2004-06-28 15:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
