(783115, 85542, 7322, '<td valign="top">This image is disturbingly Lolita-like to me. She has too much lipgloss and she appears to be wearing nothing but a neclace under the low-cut, over-sized tuxedo jacket (an odd choice of costuming, IMO). She has gorgeous Rapunzel-like hair and beautiful skin which you''ve captured well.</td>', 'This image is disturbingly Lolita-like to me. She has too much lipgloss and she appears to be wearing nothing but a neclace under the low-cut, over-sized tuxedo jacket (an odd choice of costuming, IMO). She has gorgeous Rapunzel-like hair and beautiful skin which you''ve captured well.', '2004-06-28 15:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(783116, 86231, 9618, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Beautiful eyes and skin. I think the lighting is good also. A full smile might have been better though, and I''m not sure about the angle. Maybe it''s just me, and if I am the only one that says anything, please just disregard it.</td>', 'Nice shot. Beautiful eyes and skin. I think the lighting is good also. A full smile might have been better though, and I''m not sure about the angle. Maybe it''s just me, and if I am the only one that says anything, please just disregard it.', '2004-06-28 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
