(783142, 85827, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very shiny, creased background overwhelms the model. She has a nice expression but the shadows in the lower portion of her face (under the apples of her cheeks and under her chin) are very unflattering.</td>', 'Very shiny, creased background overwhelms the model. She has a nice expression but the shadows in the lower portion of her face (under the apples of her cheeks and under her chin) are very unflattering.', '2004-06-28 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(783143, 86281, 7322, '<td valign="top">Her makeup looks shiny and unnatural when compared to the casual outfit and setting.</td>', 'Her makeup looks shiny and unnatural when compared to the casual outfit and setting.', '2004-06-28 16:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(783144, 86312, 14593, '<td valign="top">cute little girl...</td>', 'cute little girl...', '2004-06-28 16:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(783148, 86107, 19475, '<td valign="top">Beautifull light. Her eys really stand out. Maybe placing her evenmore to the left would enhance it further.</td>', 'Beautifull light. Her eys really stand out. Maybe placing her evenmore to the left would enhance it further.', '2004-06-28 16:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(783151, 85241, 19475, '<td valign="top">great pose and relaxed eye contact.</td>', 'great pose and relaxed eye contact.', '2004-06-28 16:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(783153, 85273, 19475, '<td valign="top">So cute. Lovley potrait.The catchlight in the eyes are wonderfull.</td>', 'So cute. Lovley potrait.The catchlight in the eyes are wonderfull.', '2004-06-28 16:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(783160, 86037, 9821, '<td valign="top">i like the idea, but I''m not sure where the main focus of the photo should be ... the eye on the left, or the eyes on the right, which appear half closed because of the angle.Also, seems cropped a little tight on the left. Nice depth of field and lighting seems good.</td>', 'i like the idea, but I''m not sure where the main focus of the photo should be ... the eye on the left, or the eyes on the right, which appear half closed because of the angle.Also, seems cropped a little tight on the left. Nice depth of field and lighting seems good.', '2004-06-28 16:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(783162, 85901, 12962, '<td valign="top">Of all the portraits in this challenge, this is the one that I come back to often.  Composition and lighting are just exquisite ... I love that the shadows and shirt blend with the background and that the left eye is not under the shadows (seen a lot of these with what I call raccoon eyes).  On the other hand, I just wished you used another model just because you''re so recognizable now :-) ... no offense meant because you''re an attractive model but the recognition factor might turn off some readers and give you a low score because you just won recently...  wonderful job ... I hope to follow your set up someday.</td>', 'Of all the portraits in this challenge, this is the one that I come back to often.  Composition and lighting are just exquisite ... I love that the shadows and shirt blend with the background and that the left eye is not under the shadows (seen a lot of these with what I call raccoon eyes).  On the other hand, I just wished you used another model just because you''re so recognizable now :-) ... no offense meant because you''re an attractive model but the recognition factor might turn off some readers and give you a low score because you just won recently...  wonderful job ... I hope to follow your set up someday.', '2004-06-28 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(783163, 85893, 9821, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a spontaneous moment and less like a "studio" shot, but her smile is great the catchlights help a lot. Well done.</td>', 'This looks more like a spontaneous moment and less like a "studio" shot, but her smile is great the catchlights help a lot. Well done.', '2004-06-28 16:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(783166, 86309, 9821, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a little dark in the shadows ... very nice scene ... cute girl</td>', 'Perhaps a little dark in the shadows ... very nice scene ... cute girl', '2004-06-28 16:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(783167, 85284, 18080, '<td valign="top">Nice work<br/>i love that she is looking into the light<br/>good luck</td>', 'Nice worki love that she is looking into the lightgood luck', '2004-06-28 16:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(783168, 86167, 18080, '<td valign="top">Good capture<br/>love the lighting</td>', 'Good capturelove the lighting', '2004-06-28 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(783169, 85972, 12962, '<td valign="top">I am not a very good judge of portraits - but I like the skin tones and the dash of color and the highlighting of the eyes.  Your viewers are readily pulled by the beautiful brown eyes.  Just wished it was a little bit more off center.</td>', 'I am not a very good judge of portraits - but I like the skin tones and the dash of color and the highlighting of the eyes.  Your viewers are readily pulled by the beautiful brown eyes.  Just wished it was a little bit more off center.', '2004-06-28 16:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(783170, 86275, 18080, '<td valign="top">Nice shot<br/>my only crit is that she looks a little uncomfortable</td>', 'Nice shotmy only crit is that she looks a little uncomfortable', '2004-06-28 16:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(783171, 86037, 12962, '<td valign="top">Beautiful pensive pose and lighting expecially on the eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful pensive pose and lighting expecially on the eyes.', '2004-06-28 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
