(783304, 85855, 16004, '<td valign="top">good picture!  lighting is superb, the pose / posture is very nice.  her hair is very neat, gives the impression it has been touched up a little bit (and left a slight halo whiteness effect).  but that said, still worthy of a ten in my book (one of three in this challenge).  i like especially the mix of greys and blacks of her hair, t-shirt and the background.  tastefully done.<br/></td>', 'good picture!  lighting is superb, the pose / posture is very nice.  her hair is very neat, gives the impression it has been touched up a little bit (and left a slight halo whiteness effect).  but that said, still worthy of a ten in my book (one of three in this challenge).  i like especially the mix of greys and blacks of her hair, t-shirt and the background.  tastefully done.', '2004-06-28 17:36:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(783305, 85334, 23454, '<td valign="top">Despite the fact that the challenge clearly stated the photo should be of a person, I think this is a great shot. The lighting is very nice and the catchlights in his/her eyes are wonderful. I do think that his/her whole body should have been in focus instead of just the head. Had the subject only been a person, I would have scored much higher.</td>', 'Despite the fact that the challenge clearly stated the photo should be of a person, I think this is a great shot. The lighting is very nice and the catchlights in his/her eyes are wonderful. I do think that his/her whole body should have been in focus instead of just the head. Had the subject only been a person, I would have scored much higher.', '2004-06-28 17:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(783306, 85334, 22392, '<td valign="top">His (her?) head is beautiful in focus and the eyes are very telling. Too bad that the body is very much out of focus. I would have liked a deeper DOF, or a different crop from just the head.</td>', 'His (her?) head is beautiful in focus and the eyes are very telling. Too bad that the body is very much out of focus. I would have liked a deeper DOF, or a different crop from just the head.', '2004-06-28 17:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(783307, 86116, 22046, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are great. I love the way the background brings out her coloring. I also like the left-side position but one thing bothers me a bit. I''d like to see just a bit of space to the left of her. Now it feels like she''s got her head against a wall or door listening.</td>', 'The colors in this are great. I love the way the background brings out her coloring. I also like the left-side position but one thing bothers me a bit. I''d like to see just a bit of space to the left of her. Now it feels like she''s got her head against a wall or door listening.', '2004-06-28 17:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
