(783368, 86212, 18080, '<td valign="top">I think if you had turned the models face slightly more towards the camera it would have been a nicer and softer picture. At the moment there is a really harsh line down her nose.<br/>Nice idea though, i do like it<br/>good luck</td>', 'I think if you had turned the models face slightly more towards the camera it would have been a nicer and softer picture. At the moment there is a really harsh line down her nose.Nice idea though, i do like itgood luck', '2004-06-28 17:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
