(783582, 86046, 22781, '<td valign="top">Roger looks like somebody I know... But he''s not called Roger..<br/>Lighting and shadows are a bit harsh...<br/>Nice picture overall</td>', 'Roger looks like somebody I know... But he''s not called Roger..Lighting and shadows are a bit harsh...Nice picture overall', '2004-06-28 19:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(783586, 86271, 22781, '<td valign="top">It;s a good portrait, nothing fancy, nothing special, just nice for friends and family, just as you would expect to turn out if you would go to a studio photographer.<br/>So good Challenge entry.</td>', 'It;s a good portrait, nothing fancy, nothing special, just nice for friends and family, just as you would expect to turn out if you would go to a studio photographer.So good Challenge entry.', '2004-06-28 19:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(783588, 85970, 22781, '<td valign="top">Edit: I just found you on your brother''s picture.<br/>I see the humor in it to have 2 "same" pictures in this challenge, but here''s an idea.<br/>When you would have taken a picture with the 2 of you together, you on the left, and your brother on the right, and your brothers shot, exactly the same picture, but you on the right and your brother on the left...<br/> <br/>This would have made it even more obvious and funnier. Well if it is meant funny offcourse otherwise this whole text would make no sence..<br/> <br/>Lighting good, backgroud good, focus good, hawai shirt very bad!</td>', 'Edit: I just found you on your brother''s picture.I see the humor in it to have 2 "same" pictures in this challenge, but here''s an idea.When you would have taken a picture with the 2 of you together, you on the left, and your brother on the right, and your brothers shot, exactly the same picture, but you on the right and your brother on the left... This would have made it even more obvious and funnier. Well if it is meant funny offcourse otherwise this whole text would make no sence.. Lighting good, backgroud good, focus good, hawai shirt very bad!', '2004-06-28 19:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(783590, 86060, 22781, '<td valign="top">I just found you on your brother''s picture.<br/>I see the humor in it to have 2 \"same\" pictures in this challenge, but here''s an idea.<br/>When you would have taken a picture with the 2 of you together, you on the left, and your brother on the right, and your brothers shot, exactly the same picture, but you on the right and your brother on the left...<br/> <br/>This would have made it even more obvious and funnier. Well if it is meant funny offcourse otherwise this whole text would make no sence..<br/> <br/>Lighting good, backgroud good, focus good, hawai shirt very bad!</td>', 'I just found you on your brother''s picture.I see the humor in it to have 2 \"same\" pictures in this challenge, but here''s an idea.When you would have taken a picture with the 2 of you together, you on the left, and your brother on the right, and your brothers shot, exactly the same picture, but you on the right and your brother on the left... This would have made it even more obvious and funnier. Well if it is meant funny offcourse otherwise this whole text would make no sence.. Lighting good, backgroud good, focus good, hawai shirt very bad!', '2004-06-28 19:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
