(783758, 86076, 15403, '<td valign="top">I understand what you''ve done here, but I''m afraid a lot of people will call this out of focus .  To me, it''s a beautiful shot, exemplifying the "rule of thirds".  The softness/blur works with her expression and the title.  Beautiful work...</td>', 'I understand what you''ve done here, but I''m afraid a lot of people will call this out of focus .  To me, it''s a beautiful shot, exemplifying the "rule of thirds".  The softness/blur works with her expression and the title.  Beautiful work...', '2004-06-28 21:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(783759, 85972, 18820, '<td valign="top">Her hair is a little out of focus, and her expression is blah, but the composition is very nice.  there seems to be a little edge on her glove that is distracting.</td>', 'Her hair is a little out of focus, and her expression is blah, but the composition is very nice.  there seems to be a little edge on her glove that is distracting.', '2004-06-28 21:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
