(783994, 86197, 11738, '<td valign="top">A nice try at soft focus, but the image seems too soft in some parts, especially around the eyes.  I will suggest a good resource if you would like to perfect the technique of softening portraits without losing too much focus: "The Photoshop Book for Digital Photographers" by Scott Kelby.  This book has sections on easy to use techniques to produce better portraits.</td>', 'A nice try at soft focus, but the image seems too soft in some parts, especially around the eyes.  I will suggest a good resource if you would like to perfect the technique of softening portraits without losing too much focus: "The Photoshop Book for Digital Photographers" by Scott Kelby.  This book has sections on easy to use techniques to produce better portraits.', '2004-06-28 23:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
