(784573, 86120, 14603, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far, for both the technique used and also for having the bravery to submit it, as it will probably get as much criticism as plaudits.<br/>It seems to work on a diagonal..with the lightest portion in the bottom left and the darkest , top right.<br/>I love it..we don`t see enough of this type of stuff for me.<br/>The only thing I would have changed was to take the rings off as they are slightly distracting  in an otherwise perfect shot....10</td>', 'My favourite so far, for both the technique used and also for having the bravery to submit it, as it will probably get as much criticism as plaudits.It seems to work on a diagonal..with the lightest portion in the bottom left and the darkest , top right.I love it..we don`t see enough of this type of stuff for me.The only thing I would have changed was to take the rings off as they are slightly distracting  in an otherwise perfect shot....10', '2004-06-29 09:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
