(784700, 86116, 22781, '<td valign="top">Janet looks nice, very soft, but on her forehead, at the hairline it looks a bit strange.<br/>And I don''t know why, but her face looks like its "curved" I dont know how to explain it..<br/> <br/>But, nice picture.</td>', 'Janet looks nice, very soft, but on her forehead, at the hairline it looks a bit strange.And I don''t know why, but her face looks like its "curved" I dont know how to explain it.. But, nice picture.', '2004-06-29 11:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(784704, 86276, 22781, '<td valign="top">Not realy my taste, I can''t see the face because of the hair, and because of that her nose sticks out, So when I look at this picture I see the nose first.<br/>The shadows and almost overexposed highlights disturb it a bit.<br/>That''s only MY opinion.</td>', 'Not realy my taste, I can''t see the face because of the hair, and because of that her nose sticks out, So when I look at this picture I see the nose first.The shadows and almost overexposed highlights disturb it a bit.That''s only MY opinion.', '2004-06-29 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
