(784714, 86275, 22781, '<td valign="top">A beautifull face, but it looks a bit out of proportion.<br/>The glasses look mutch wider then her eyes are apart and that destracts me...<br/>If you would have used a different focal Lenght and created some more distance between the camera and the model then this would have been better.<br/> <br/>(i''m just making this all up to sound inteligent :-b )</td>', 'A beautifull face, but it looks a bit out of proportion.The glasses look mutch wider then her eyes are apart and that destracts me...If you would have used a different focal Lenght and created some more distance between the camera and the model then this would have been better. (i''m just making this all up to sound inteligent :-b )', '2004-06-29 11:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
