(784888, 86231, 16046, '<td valign="top">I think this shot could have been in the "Stepford Wives" movie,  she looks like a doll. I would like to learn how to get the same results. 9</td>', 'I think this shot could have been in the "Stepford Wives" movie,  she looks like a doll. I would like to learn how to get the same results. 9', '2004-06-29 14:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(784889, 86275, 12827, '<td valign="top">Beatiful eyes! Looking over the glasses like that is a great touch!  It brings focus straight to the eyes!  Great portrait, but the hands are troubling me.<br/>IMO, I would like to see them more fist like - the current hand pose seems very unnatural.  For this particular crop I would also like to see more arm, maybe just past the wrist! 7</td>', 'Beatiful eyes! Looking over the glasses like that is a great touch!  It brings focus straight to the eyes!  Great portrait, but the hands are troubling me.IMO, I would like to see them more fist like - the current hand pose seems very unnatural.  For this particular crop I would also like to see more arm, maybe just past the wrist! 7', '2004-06-29 14:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(784892, 85816, 16046, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and creativity of this image, the floor was well thought out. This shot gets a 10 from me, but I think others may not find it meets the challenge. Good luck</td>', 'I like the lighting and creativity of this image, the floor was well thought out. This shot gets a 10 from me, but I think others may not find it meets the challenge. Good luck', '2004-06-29 14:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
