(785007, 86281, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and captivating model, I like her pose. I do wish the lighting was better so there was more seperation between her and the background wall. I feel the wall to her right, picture left is too dark.</td>', 'Beautiful and captivating model, I like her pose. I do wish the lighting was better so there was more seperation between her and the background wall. I feel the wall to her right, picture left is too dark.', '2004-06-29 15:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(785010, 86287, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like this version of a clown picture (the sad clown), but I think the picture is too dark on the whole. Could have used a spot for his hair and face to brighten things up.</td>', 'I like this version of a clown picture (the sad clown), but I think the picture is too dark on the whole. Could have used a spot for his hair and face to brighten things up.', '2004-06-29 15:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(785015, 85780, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great portrait! I like the composition and subdued colors. I do however think that the hat could have gotten more light to bring it out, and it appears that a noise reducing program was used to excess.  Still, a compelling picture, imo.</td>', 'Great portrait! I like the composition and subdued colors. I do however think that the hat could have gotten more light to bring it out, and it appears that a noise reducing program was used to excess.  Still, a compelling picture, imo.', '2004-06-29 15:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(785021, 86213, 16004, '<td valign="top">This is a very charismatic shot that deserves to do bloody well.  your bloke is well posed / composed, and all the whites and creams in the picture compliement as a whole.  very nice - 9.</td>', 'This is a very charismatic shot that deserves to do bloody well.  your bloke is well posed / composed, and all the whites and creams in the picture compliement as a whole.  very nice - 9.', '2004-06-29 15:27:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(785030, 85241, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a nice picture, but the angle is a bit too interesting to fully appreciate, in that it hurts my neck to see the girls face.  the eyes have reflected the light in a bit of disconcerting and strange way so that very little of the pupils and irisi are actually visible - this is something that might have been reduced with a bit of cloning in PS or similar.  on the whle, i like it, the girls face is visually appealling and the technicial skill taking the shot is obviously very high.  perhaps it would be easier to view if reflected along one axis or rotated 180°, so the top of her head is closer to one of the top corners...   7.</td>', 'this is a nice picture, but the angle is a bit too interesting to fully appreciate, in that it hurts my neck to see the girls face.  the eyes have reflected the light in a bit of disconcerting and strange way so that very little of the pupils and irisi are actually visible - this is something that might have been reduced with a bit of cloning in PS or similar.  on the whle, i like it, the girls face is visually appealling and the technicial skill taking the shot is obviously very high.  perhaps it would be easier to view if reflected along one axis or rotated 180°, so the top of her head is closer to one of the top corners...   7.', '2004-06-29 15:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(785037, 85956, 9821, '<td valign="top">maybe just a touch too much photoshop to this one :) This person doesn''t look human.</td>', 'maybe just a touch too much photoshop to this one :) This person doesn''t look human.', '2004-06-29 15:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(785041, 85835, 9821, '<td valign="top">Flash is too bright (or whatever the light source was) ... and you can see where you''ve decided to selectively blur (middle boys necklace looks like a smoke ring). One boy has his eyes closed. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Flash is too bright (or whatever the light source was) ... and you can see where you''ve decided to selectively blur (middle boys necklace looks like a smoke ring). One boy has his eyes closed. Nice idea though.', '2004-06-29 15:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(785042, 86197, 9821, '<td valign="top">Seems nothing is in focus and the lipstick is a little bright. She has very pretty eyes.</td>', 'Seems nothing is in focus and the lipstick is a little bright. She has very pretty eyes.', '2004-06-29 15:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(785043, 86287, 9821, '<td valign="top">I think I would love this if I could see it better. It''s just too dark.</td>', 'I think I would love this if I could see it better. It''s just too dark.', '2004-06-29 15:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(785044, 86282, 9821, '<td valign="top">With the exception of the very bright highlights ... it''s pretty dark. I can''t really see it.</td>', 'With the exception of the very bright highlights ... it''s pretty dark. I can''t really see it.', '2004-06-29 15:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785048, 85526, 9821, '<td valign="top">The beads of sweat on her face are reflecting a lot of light which draws attention away from the girl. I''m left staring at all the the shiny-ness. Cool hair.</td>', 'The beads of sweat on her face are reflecting a lot of light which draws attention away from the girl. I''m left staring at all the the shiny-ness. Cool hair.', '2004-06-29 15:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(785049, 86084, 9821, '<td valign="top">Looks like she''s blinking ... I wonder why you didn''t submit one with her eyes open?</td>', 'Looks like she''s blinking ... I wonder why you didn''t submit one with her eyes open?', '2004-06-29 15:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(785052, 86280, 9821, '<td valign="top">Cool graphic affect ... but as a portrait it falls a little short. I like it, but I wouldn''t really call it a portrait.</td>', 'Cool graphic affect ... but as a portrait it falls a little short. I like it, but I wouldn''t really call it a portrait.', '2004-06-29 15:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(785054, 86305, 9821, '<td valign="top">I''d like it much more if his ears were in the correct position and if there were some light in his eyes. Also, I think a little more depth of field would have helped.</td>', 'I''d like it much more if his ears were in the correct position and if there were some light in his eyes. Also, I think a little more depth of field would have helped.', '2004-06-29 15:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(785055, 85698, 9821, '<td valign="top">Must have been hard to get them both to smile at the same time. There seems to be a blue cast on the photo and perhaps some more depth of field would have rendered both guys in sharp focus.</td>', 'Must have been hard to get them both to smile at the same time. There seems to be a blue cast on the photo and perhaps some more depth of field would have rendered both guys in sharp focus.', '2004-06-29 15:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(785057, 86219, 9821, '<td valign="top">The sky in the background is unfortunate, it draws a lot of attention - also, it makes the shadows on their faces a little more obvious. Nice expression, good pose.</td>', 'The sky in the background is unfortunate, it draws a lot of attention - also, it makes the shadows on their faces a little more obvious. Nice expression, good pose.', '2004-06-29 15:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(785059, 86147, 9821, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a quick grab shot rather than a formal portrait. Perhaps it''s cropped a little tight as well.</td>', 'This looks more like a quick grab shot rather than a formal portrait. Perhaps it''s cropped a little tight as well.', '2004-06-29 15:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(785061, 86265, 9821, '<td valign="top">Not quite in focus ... cute kid though.</td>', 'Not quite in focus ... cute kid though.', '2004-06-29 15:54:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(785064, 86281, 9821, '<td valign="top">Her face isn''t very well lit, which is what you want to draw attention to ... and her pose seems a bit awkward. Pretty girl.</td>', 'Her face isn''t very well lit, which is what you want to draw attention to ... and her pose seems a bit awkward. Pretty girl.', '2004-06-29 15:55:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(785067, 85542, 9821, '<td valign="top">Light source looks a little bright, it''s making her skin glow and her eyes are blown out. Something to diffuse the light would have helped (like a sheer scarf or sheet)</td>', 'Light source looks a little bright, it''s making her skin glow and her eyes are blown out. Something to diffuse the light would have helped (like a sheer scarf or sheet)', '2004-06-29 15:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
