(785380, 85894, 18780, '<td valign="top">Love the way you juxtaposed the crispness of the child against the softness of the chair. No other portrait in this category comes close to its excellence. - 10</td>', 'Love the way you juxtaposed the crispness of the child against the softness of the chair. No other portrait in this category comes close to its excellence. - 10', '2004-06-29 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(785383, 85897, 18780, '<td valign="top">Great dimension and intrigue with a twist of humor - 9</td>', 'Great dimension and intrigue with a twist of humor - 9', '2004-06-29 19:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(785385, 85623, 18780, '<td valign="top">Interesting side lighting - 9</td>', 'Interesting side lighting - 9', '2004-06-29 20:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(785389, 85265, 18780, '<td valign="top">The chair surface seems to take away from the wistfulness of the portrait...might it have been a less intense surface? I like the lighting and the way the girl fills the frame. 9</td>', 'The chair surface seems to take away from the wistfulness of the portrait...might it have been a less intense surface? I like the lighting and the way the girl fills the frame. 9', '2004-06-29 20:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(785391, 86121, 11518, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the burning around the face...</td>', 'Not sure I like the burning around the face...', '2004-06-29 20:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(785392, 85855, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, nice background, nice lighting...well done.</td>', 'Nice pose, nice background, nice lighting...well done.', '2004-06-29 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(785394, 86228, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting, too much empty space above her head, would have cropped it more tightly.</td>', 'Nice soft lighting, too much empty space above her head, would have cropped it more tightly.', '2004-06-29 20:11:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(785397, 85865, 11518, '<td valign="top">Could be a tad sharper, lighting is slightly harsh, maybe a -1 FEC would be better here.</td>', 'Could be a tad sharper, lighting is slightly harsh, maybe a -1 FEC would be better here.', '2004-06-29 20:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(785401, 85629, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, interesting idea, good non-distracting background...But the lighting is too harsh, lots of distracting reflections on the hair.</td>', 'Nice pose, interesting idea, good non-distracting background...But the lighting is too harsh, lots of distracting reflections on the hair.', '2004-06-29 20:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(785403, 85698, 11518, '<td valign="top">Bluish cast,, blown highlights...distracting background...but great models</td>', 'Bluish cast,, blown highlights...distracting background...but great models', '2004-06-29 20:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(785407, 85265, 11518, '<td valign="top">Light is a tad harsh, the table is not level.  Nice pose though.</td>', 'Light is a tad harsh, the table is not level.  Nice pose though.', '2004-06-29 20:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(785410, 86125, 11518, '<td valign="top">Lighting is way too harsh, a -1 FEC or the addition of a small backlight could have worked better.</td>', 'Lighting is way too harsh, a -1 FEC or the addition of a small backlight could have worked better.', '2004-06-29 20:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(785414, 85623, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice use of side lighting.  Nice pose.</td>', 'Nice use of side lighting.  Nice pose.', '2004-06-29 20:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(785418, 86167, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, slight magenta colour cast.</td>', 'Nicely done, slight magenta colour cast.', '2004-06-29 20:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(785421, 86089, 11518, '<td valign="top">Original, but I''m not sure I like the washed out highlights or the effect it produces...so it just comes down to my taste.  Technically well done.</td>', 'Original, but I''m not sure I like the washed out highlights or the effect it produces...so it just comes down to my taste.  Technically well done.', '2004-06-29 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(785425, 86134, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice pose, good crop, but the colour seems a bit off, the white balance needs to be adjusted, there seems to be a magenta colour cast...look at the white of her eyes...not white but pinkish/purplish colour.</td>', 'Nice pose, good crop, but the colour seems a bit off, the white balance needs to be adjusted, there seems to be a magenta colour cast...look at the white of her eyes...not white but pinkish/purplish colour.', '2004-06-29 20:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(785429, 86219, 11518, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the blurred subject in front of a very sharp background.  The background becomes distracting this way, you kinda expect the subjects to be sharp and the background to be blurred.</td>', 'Not sure I like the blurred subject in front of a very sharp background.  The background becomes distracting this way, you kinda expect the subjects to be sharp and the background to be blurred.', '2004-06-29 20:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(785431, 86271, 11518, '<td valign="top">Too much emty space on the left, it couyld have been cropped out.</td>', 'Too much emty space on the left, it couyld have been cropped out.', '2004-06-29 20:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(785433, 86084, 11518, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus, harsh lighting.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus, harsh lighting.', '2004-06-29 20:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(785438, 85334, 11518, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t consider dogs to be persons.  Nice shot though, I like the shallow DOF</td>', 'Sorry I don''t consider dogs to be persons.  Nice shot though, I like the shallow DOF', '2004-06-29 20:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(785439, 85910, 11518, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t consider dogs to be persons.  Cute thoough, lighting is a tad harsh.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t consider dogs to be persons.  Cute thoough, lighting is a tad harsh.', '2004-06-29 20:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(785441, 86309, 11254, '<td valign="top">this is great! I havent seen a shot like this in a while- i like the "old" feel..and the innocence of the girl.... good choice of clothing also. Maybe too tight of a crop?</td>', 'this is great! I havent seen a shot like this in a while- i like the "old" feel..and the innocence of the girl.... good choice of clothing also. Maybe too tight of a crop?', '2004-06-29 20:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(785442, 86305, 11518, '<td valign="top">Sorry I don''t consider dogs to be persons. Nice shot though.</td>', 'Sorry I don''t consider dogs to be persons. Nice shot though.', '2004-06-29 20:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(785444, 86307, 11518, '<td valign="top">Very harsh lighting and out of focus.</td>', 'Very harsh lighting and out of focus.', '2004-06-29 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(785446, 85622, 11518, '<td valign="top">Good pose, but the lighting and white balance seem off.</td>', 'Good pose, but the lighting and white balance seem off.', '2004-06-29 20:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(785448, 86046, 12962, '<td valign="top">Great photo .. shows strength.  Maybe dodge the left eye a little bit ...</td>', 'Great photo .. shows strength.  Maybe dodge the left eye a little bit ...', '2004-06-29 20:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(785449, 86076, 11518, '<td valign="top">Good idea but way too blurry.</td>', 'Good idea but way too blurry.', '2004-06-29 20:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(785457, 85718, 6999, '<td valign="top">Of course one is open to misunderstanding taking a stance on the challenge theme, but it seems to me the ''formal studio portrait'' element was pretty strongly stated. This looks like a crop from a snapshot, I fear: weak and indistinct lighting, poor processing; a certainn moodiness, but the cropping lets it down and doesn''t bring much life to the image. It seems the kind of thing that would benefit hugely from a black and white presentation - and that tells as much about its suitability for this challenge as anything else. 3</td>', 'Of course one is open to misunderstanding taking a stance on the challenge theme, but it seems to me the ''formal studio portrait'' element was pretty strongly stated. This looks like a crop from a snapshot, I fear: weak and indistinct lighting, poor processing; a certainn moodiness, but the cropping lets it down and doesn''t bring much life to the image. It seems the kind of thing that would benefit hugely from a black and white presentation - and that tells as much about its suitability for this challenge as anything else. 3', '2004-06-29 20:39:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(785458, 86255, 11518, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems off, white balance doesn;t seem right.  Your eye is drawn to the bright white dress distracting you from looking at the face.</td>', 'The lighting seems off, white balance doesn;t seem right.  Your eye is drawn to the bright white dress distracting you from looking at the face.', '2004-06-29 20:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785459, 86103, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice idea but doesn''t look quite right...</td>', 'Nice idea but doesn''t look quite right...', '2004-06-29 20:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(785460, 85938, 23554, '<td valign="top">This is such an adorable shot, and it really looks professional. I would love to have my little sister photographed like this.</td>', 'This is such an adorable shot, and it really looks professional. I would love to have my little sister photographed like this.', '2004-06-29 20:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(785462, 86231, 23554, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bride, beautiful shot!</td>', 'Beautiful bride, beautiful shot!', '2004-06-29 20:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785463, 86271, 6999, '<td valign="top">Compositionally unbalanced - I don''t see the benefit of all that negative space image left ... just looks like a mistake; especially whne it places your main subject on the terribly weak central plane of the image. The weight of this composition is more about the djembe than about the child. That said,  the light is pretty good (though his head seems under-lit compared with his body, slightly), and there''s texture to the clothes; the pose is awkward, and the expression a touch bizarre for a really happy formal portrait. 5</td>', 'Compositionally unbalanced - I don''t see the benefit of all that negative space image left ... just looks like a mistake; especially whne it places your main subject on the terribly weak central plane of the image. The weight of this composition is more about the djembe than about the child. That said,  the light is pretty good (though his head seems under-lit compared with his body, slightly), and there''s texture to the clothes; the pose is awkward, and the expression a touch bizarre for a really happy formal portrait. 5', '2004-06-29 20:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(785465, 86309, 23554, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful shot, this girl will treasure this when she''s older! Hang it over the mantle. Lighting is beautiful, the rose adds a touch of vibrant color. I love it.</td>', 'Another beautiful shot, this girl will treasure this when she''s older! Hang it over the mantle. Lighting is beautiful, the rose adds a touch of vibrant color. I love it.', '2004-06-29 20:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
