(785528, 85894, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a cutie patootie!  I adore bare baby feet.  This is a great portrait...pose, lighting, everything.  Hope you win a ribbon on this one!  :o)</td>', 'What a cutie patootie!  I adore bare baby feet.  This is a great portrait...pose, lighting, everything.  Hope you win a ribbon on this one!  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
