(785533, 86306, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice portrait...The skin tones are great, the lighting is well-done.  One tiny nitpick is that the right side, along his hair he kind of fades into the background, but that isn''t that big of a deal.  Very well done.  :o)</td>', 'This is a very nice portrait...The skin tones are great, the lighting is well-done.  One tiny nitpick is that the right side, along his hair he kind of fades into the background, but that isn''t that big of a deal.  Very well done.  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(785535, 85897, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is just great...I love it!  The lighting works well, and so does the landscape presentation.   Great high-tech take on the challenge.  I''ll be interested to read about your technique after the challenge ends!  :o)</td>', 'This is just great...I love it!  The lighting works well, and so does the landscape presentation.   Great high-tech take on the challenge.  I''ll be interested to read about your technique after the challenge ends!  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
