(785538, 85241, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites.  I could see this in a fashion magazine or cosmetic ad.  Wonderful pose, great expression, lighting and all the technical aspects are well done and the composition is superb.  She looks a bit like Liv Tyler.  Beautiful!  :o)</td>', 'This is one of my favorites.  I could see this in a fashion magazine or cosmetic ad.  Wonderful pose, great expression, lighting and all the technical aspects are well done and the composition is superb.  She looks a bit like Liv Tyler.  Beautiful!  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(785539, 85923, 18349, '<td valign="top">Love the high-key effect...it''s really well done!  Her eye color is stunning as well.  Adorable portrait!  :o)</td>', 'Love the high-key effect...it''s really well done!  Her eye color is stunning as well.  Adorable portrait!  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(785540, 86099, 18349, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.  I love the yellows.  Composition is wonderful.  Soft focus is perfect for this portrait.  :o)</td>', 'Simply beautiful.  I love the yellows.  Composition is wonderful.  Soft focus is perfect for this portrait.  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:11:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(785541, 86231, 18349, '<td valign="top">How stunning!  This bride is simply beautiful; lighting and softness are perfect.  I do have one tiny nitpick...the gown appears to not fit very well, making her a bit "boxy" in appearance in the torso...like the gown is too big.  Still, a beautiful portrait.  :o)</td>', 'How stunning!  This bride is simply beautiful; lighting and softness are perfect.  I do have one tiny nitpick...the gown appears to not fit very well, making her a bit "boxy" in appearance in the torso...like the gown is too big.  Still, a beautiful portrait.  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(785542, 86140, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is great...love the attitude and the pose.  The leggy look given by the legs in the foreground works well with her posture and pose.  Great lighting; love the furniture.  Wonderful!  :o)</td>', 'This is great...love the attitude and the pose.  The leggy look given by the legs in the foreground works well with her posture and pose.  Great lighting; love the furniture.  Wonderful!  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(785544, 85970, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a good portrait.  Lighting is effective, background is neutral and not distracting.  Focus is good.  I do have a bit of a problem with the "busy" nature of the shirt...not that I don''t love hawaiian shirts, mind you, but it is a bit busy...especially with the slip of undershirt at the neck.  Maybe no undershirt, or outer shirt open with a more complimentary undershirt color?  I don''t know, I''m not a fashion guru.  It''s still a good portrait and is one of my top ten picks.</td>', 'This is a good portrait.  Lighting is effective, background is neutral and not distracting.  Focus is good.  I do have a bit of a problem with the "busy" nature of the shirt...not that I don''t love hawaiian shirts, mind you, but it is a bit busy...especially with the slip of undershirt at the neck.  Maybe no undershirt, or outer shirt open with a more complimentary undershirt color?  I don''t know, I''m not a fashion guru.  It''s still a good portrait and is one of my top ten picks.', '2004-06-29 22:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(785545, 85554, 18349, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a school picture...a well-done school picture, mind you...lighting and pose are great, background is as well.  None of my school pictures were ever in focus this well.  :o)</td>', 'This reminds me of a school picture...a well-done school picture, mind you...lighting and pose are great, background is as well.  None of my school pictures were ever in focus this well.  :o)', '2004-06-29 22:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(785549, 85816, 2344, '<td valign="top">I totally and completely love this picture.. unfortunately for you I am not a member so I can only comment.. I would be giving this a 10</td>', 'I totally and completely love this picture.. unfortunately for you I am not a member so I can only comment.. I would be giving this a 10', '2004-06-29 22:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(785550, 85934, 11518, '<td valign="top">Harsh light, lots of blown highlights, reflections on the forehead, cheeks arms, t-shirt...Nice pose but I think a reflector to bounce the flash on would have made it better.  In formal portraits lighting is critical, it makes or breaks the photo.</td>', 'Harsh light, lots of blown highlights, reflections on the forehead, cheeks arms, t-shirt...Nice pose but I think a reflector to bounce the flash on would have made it better.  In formal portraits lighting is critical, it makes or breaks the photo.', '2004-06-29 22:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(785551, 85923, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well done high key.  The touch of pinkish lighting on right side of her head is a nice touch.  May be better if thge drsss on the left side of the frame didn''t merge into th background.  Beautiful brown eyes - I think I would like it better if she were looking somewhat at the lens.  Overall - a very strong studio portrait, congrats!</td>', 'Exceptionally well done high key.  The touch of pinkish lighting on right side of her head is a nice touch.  May be better if thge drsss on the left side of the frame didn''t merge into th background.  Beautiful brown eyes - I think I would like it better if she were looking somewhat at the lens.  Overall - a very strong studio portrait, congrats!', '2004-06-29 22:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785552, 86306, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - great model.  The guitar is so white it attracts way tyo much attention.</td>', 'Nice lighting - great model.  The guitar is so white it attracts way tyo much attention.', '2004-06-29 22:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
