(785613, 86276, 19608, '<td valign="top">The idea is great - but model looks to be just holding or blowing on the lolipop.  Black background really makes the hair color stand out.  My biggest problem with it though is that fact that the eyes are so hidden.</td>', 'The idea is great - but model looks to be just holding or blowing on the lolipop.  Black background really makes the hair color stand out.  My biggest problem with it though is that fact that the eyes are so hidden.', '2004-06-29 23:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
