(785615, 86140, 12252, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. The model''s pose is refreshingly different and says something about her. The only nit I have is that the cushion has little saggy lines in the corner under hand. Now THAT''s a NIT! I can''t vote, but that nit wouldn''t take away anything from a truly good photo.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. The model''s pose is refreshingly different and says something about her. The only nit I have is that the cushion has little saggy lines in the corner under hand. Now THAT''s a NIT! I can''t vote, but that nit wouldn''t take away anything from a truly good photo.', '2004-06-29 23:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(785616, 85612, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model taken with great lighting.  Pose seems a bit static for some reason.  Great choice of background for the model and her clothing.</td>', 'Beautiful model taken with great lighting.  Pose seems a bit static for some reason.  Great choice of background for the model and her clothing.', '2004-06-29 23:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(785617, 86280, 12252, '<td valign="top">Thisi s a fascinating image but, to me, it doesn''t work well as a portrait. The way it makes her eye look on the right side kind of creeps me out, and the disembodied head adds to that effect. I guess I''m admiring the technique but suggesting it isn''t working for me as a portrait. Just my two cents -- and I can''t even vote!</td>', 'Thisi s a fascinating image but, to me, it doesn''t work well as a portrait. The way it makes her eye look on the right side kind of creeps me out, and the disembodied head adds to that effect. I guess I''m admiring the technique but suggesting it isn''t working for me as a portrait. Just my two cents -- and I can''t even vote!', '2004-06-29 23:13:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(785618, 85568, 15891, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately this looks a little too much like a passport photo - and maybe the traveler is on something?</td>', 'Unfortunately this looks a little too much like a passport photo - and maybe the traveler is on something?', '2004-06-29 23:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(785619, 86226, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice outdoor capture of a beautiful young lady.  It''s a very good job for the terrible high-sun lighting.  Studio-like?  Hardly.</td>', 'A nice outdoor capture of a beautiful young lady.  It''s a very good job for the terrible high-sun lighting.  Studio-like?  Hardly.', '2004-06-29 23:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(785621, 86147, 19608, '<td valign="top">Good expression and lighting.  Unusual but effective composition.</td>', 'Good expression and lighting.  Unusual but effective composition.', '2004-06-29 23:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(785622, 85855, 12252, '<td valign="top">Nice, dreamy expression. The light on her arm is a bit too much, and there''s a wisp of hair going into her eye that is distracting. Lovely expression, though, and definately a keeper as a photo!</td>', 'Nice, dreamy expression. The light on her arm is a bit too much, and there''s a wisp of hair going into her eye that is distracting. Lovely expression, though, and definately a keeper as a photo!', '2004-06-29 23:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
