(785626, 86099, 15212, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Lighting! I love the soft look to this one, while still having sharp focus.<br/>Pose doesn''t do much for me, but it''s not a distraction either.<br/>Good job! 8<br/></td>', 'Beautiful Lighting! I love the soft look to this one, while still having sharp focus.Pose doesn''t do much for me, but it''s not a distraction either.Good job! 8', '2004-06-29 23:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(785628, 86305, 12252, '<td valign="top">Obviously, this doesn''t meet the challenge. It''s also a bit dark, particularly around the eyes and under the mouth. I like what''s going on with the ears (how did you do that?) but I miss being able to see those eyes.</td>', 'Obviously, this doesn''t meet the challenge. It''s also a bit dark, particularly around the eyes and under the mouth. I like what''s going on with the ears (how did you do that?) but I miss being able to see those eyes.', '2004-06-29 23:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(785629, 85554, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a great looking model in a very straight on formal portrait. Background does look studio-like.   There''s evidence of two light sources - but it''s not a strong demo of Rembrandt.</td>', 'You have a great looking model in a very straight on formal portrait. Background does look studio-like.   There''s evidence of two light sources - but it''s not a strong demo of Rembrandt.', '2004-06-29 23:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(785630, 85554, 15891, '<td valign="top">Duude!</td>', 'Duude!', '2004-06-29 23:18:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(785631, 86313, 15212, '<td valign="top">Focus could be a slight bit better in the eyes, otherwise a wonderful shot! 7<br/></td>', 'Focus could be a slight bit better in the eyes, otherwise a wonderful shot! 7', '2004-06-29 23:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(785633, 86115, 12252, '<td valign="top">Could have entered this in PURPLE! Neat shot, lovely use of ight, and a bit too dark on the left hand side (of the model) for my taste. Composition is excellent.</td>', 'Could have entered this in PURPLE! Neat shot, lovely use of ight, and a bit too dark on the left hand side (of the model) for my taste. Composition is excellent.', '2004-06-29 23:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(785634, 86309, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional model, lighting and composition.  It has a very classic feel.</td>', 'Exceptional model, lighting and composition.  It has a very classic feel.', '2004-06-29 23:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(785635, 85938, 15891, '<td valign="top">This is a sweet portrait! IMO the only improvement would be to tone down the lighting - photo looks washed out. Of course, maybe you were going for a high key image?</td>', 'This is a sweet portrait! IMO the only improvement would be to tone down the lighting - photo looks washed out. Of course, maybe you were going for a high key image?', '2004-06-29 23:20:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(785636, 85972, 15212, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of "Breakfast at Tiffany''s"  Great use of Lighting. Lovely model. 8</td>', 'Reminds me of "Breakfast at Tiffany''s"  Great use of Lighting. Lovely model. 8', '2004-06-29 23:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(785637, 86213, 12252, '<td valign="top">What? No scaly skin? Seriously -- another fine shot. You are really in the groove with your "model" by now... Good expression, great job making us almost stare into that right eye of yours (I mean, of his). This is a good portrait and would also have been good for the Off Screen challenge (or whatever it was called).</td>', 'What? No scaly skin? Seriously -- another fine shot. You are really in the groove with your "model" by now... Good expression, great job making us almost stare into that right eye of yours (I mean, of his). This is a good portrait and would also have been good for the Off Screen challenge (or whatever it was called).', '2004-06-29 23:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(785639, 86248, 19608, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous face under perfect lighting.  Your background looks like it was hand-picked to bring out her eyes - great!  The border has the highest contrast with that white line aginst black - so it draws way too much attention.  You image does not need a border - its superb without one.</td>', 'Gorgeous face under perfect lighting.  Your background looks like it was hand-picked to bring out her eyes - great!  The border has the highest contrast with that white line aginst black - so it draws way too much attention.  You image does not need a border - its superb without one.', '2004-06-29 23:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(785640, 85334, 12252, '<td valign="top">Funny looking "person"! Cute dog, though. I dunno, I wish the DOF was greater. But I will admit, that''s a killer facial expression!</td>', 'Funny looking "person"! Cute dog, though. I dunno, I wish the DOF was greater. But I will admit, that''s a killer facial expression!', '2004-06-29 23:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(785642, 86275, 15891, '<td valign="top">You know that gesture that people sometimes make when they are pissed off? That is what the position of her hands reminds me off and that distracted my focus from the photo. Otherwise, I like the photo and the lighting is very nice.</td>', 'You know that gesture that people sometimes make when they are pissed off? That is what the position of her hands reminds me off and that distracted my focus from the photo. Otherwise, I like the photo and the lighting is very nice.', '2004-06-29 23:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(785644, 86275, 19608, '<td valign="top">This has a nice soft feel to it. (Not soft focus but gentleness.)  Black background is perfect for her hairs and clothing.</td>', 'This has a nice soft feel to it. (Not soft focus but gentleness.)  Black background is perfect for her hairs and clothing.', '2004-06-29 23:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(785646, 85273, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful - and qualifies for the color purple too!  You  have an exceptionally well done image here.</td>', 'Beautiful - and qualifies for the color purple too!  You  have an exceptionally well done image here.', '2004-06-29 23:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(785647, 85827, 15891, '<td valign="top">IMO the lighting in this portrait creates too many unflattering shadows on your model''s face.</td>', 'IMO the lighting in this portrait creates too many unflattering shadows on your model''s face.', '2004-06-29 23:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(785648, 85910, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute, patriotic and well lit.  Sorry, but even a good title can''t turn a dog into a person.</td>', 'Cute, patriotic and well lit.  Sorry, but even a good title can''t turn a dog into a person.', '2004-06-29 23:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(785650, 86089, 15891, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - the expressions, what they are doing - it really works. But the harsh lighting almost ruins this photo.</td>', 'I love this photo - the expressions, what they are doing - it really works. But the harsh lighting almost ruins this photo.', '2004-06-29 23:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(785651, 85334, 19608, '<td valign="top">A beautiful cat in nice lighting.  Focus on the eyes is perfect.  (If you can call a dog a person, I can call it a cat.)</td>', 'A beautiful cat in nice lighting.  Focus on the eyes is perfect.  (If you can call a dog a person, I can call it a cat.)', '2004-06-29 23:28:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(785652, 86309, 15891, '<td valign="top">You nailed it! This is what a good portrait should look like. The lighting is beautiful, flattering, and it doesn''t look "staged" like some lighting set ups do. Her expression is wonderful and thoughtful. A solid 10!</td>', 'You nailed it! This is what a good portrait should look like. The lighting is beautiful, flattering, and it doesn''t look "staged" like some lighting set ups do. Her expression is wonderful and thoughtful. A solid 10!', '2004-06-29 23:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785653, 85970, 15891, '<td valign="top">I thought this was Bob!?!</td>', 'I thought this was Bob!?!', '2004-06-29 23:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(785654, 86271, 15891, '<td valign="top">L''il Duuude!</td>', 'L''il Duuude!', '2004-06-29 23:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(785655, 86305, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful animal in nice lighting.  You need another light to show the eyes more.  There was an article on Paul Harvey today - a small Mexican community elected a MULE as Mayor.  The local priest said thet "Mr. Pickle"  (the mule) was the only candidate that was not corrupt.  Since the instructions were clearly a person - I''m sorry I can''t rate this very high.</td>', 'Beautiful animal in nice lighting.  You need another light to show the eyes more.  There was an article on Paul Harvey today - a small Mexican community elected a MULE as Mayor.  The local priest said thet "Mr. Pickle"  (the mule) was the only candidate that was not corrupt.  Since the instructions were clearly a person - I''m sorry I can''t rate this very high.', '2004-06-29 23:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(785656, 86213, 15891, '<td valign="top">This is excellent! I love portraits that reveal personality and show some creativity on the part of the photographer. The total opposite of your typical Olan Mills portrait where everyone has a weird "stepford wife" smile on their face. Good job!</td>', 'This is excellent! I love portraits that reveal personality and show some creativity on the part of the photographer. The total opposite of your typical Olan Mills portrait where everyone has a weird "stepford wife" smile on their face. Good job!', '2004-06-29 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(785657, 86305, 15891, '<td valign="top">If you''re going to do a portrait of a pet this is the way to do it. To make it even better, add some fill light in front to catch the eyes.</td>', 'If you''re going to do a portrait of a pet this is the way to do it. To make it even better, add some fill light in front to catch the eyes.', '2004-06-29 23:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(785659, 85894, 10686, '<td valign="top">Hey Jacko!! He''s as cute as ever. Great job</td>', 'Hey Jacko!! He''s as cute as ever. Great job', '2004-06-29 23:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(785661, 86167, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic lighting. The color seems a bit subdued, I think that works here. Anyway, I like it well enough. - 8</td>', 'Nice dramatic lighting. The color seems a bit subdued, I think that works here. Anyway, I like it well enough. - 8', '2004-06-29 23:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(785662, 86287, 10686, '<td valign="top">Well, to be honest, I think you have a great subject, but the image is way too dark.</td>', 'Well, to be honest, I think you have a great subject, but the image is way too dark.', '2004-06-29 23:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(785665, 86140, 10686, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting, the expression, everything but the feet. If you cropped just below the bottom of the cushion on the couch, this would be really great, but as it is, it says  "Look how huge my feet are."</td>', 'Love the lighting, the expression, everything but the feet. If you cropped just below the bottom of the cushion on the couch, this would be really great, but as it is, it says  "Look how huge my feet are."', '2004-06-29 23:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(785668, 85923, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice high-key work - 7</td>', 'Nice high-key work - 7', '2004-06-29 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(785669, 85273, 10686, '<td valign="top">So sweet!!</td>', 'So sweet!!', '2004-06-29 23:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(785671, 86197, 10686, '<td valign="top">I think her shoulder is sharper than the rest of her. Lighting seems OK</td>', 'I think her shoulder is sharper than the rest of her. Lighting seems OK', '2004-06-29 23:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(785673, 86265, 1031, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems kind of harsh and the colors saturated, giving him almost a cut-out look. The last baby picture I did, which had some similar issues, I ended up converting to a duotone so that the emphasis would be on the baby''s cute expression and not on the surrounding colors.</td>', 'The lighting seems kind of harsh and the colors saturated, giving him almost a cut-out look. The last baby picture I did, which had some similar issues, I ended up converting to a duotone so that the emphasis would be on the baby''s cute expression and not on the surrounding colors.', '2004-06-29 23:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(785678, 85816, 19608, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Absolutely stunning and realistic.  Harsh directional lighting and negative space exceptionally well done.   The hint of detail on the back wall of your "studio" is an added wow!  I really hope voters recognize your talent and don''t vote on the nature of your subject.</td>', 'WOW!  Absolutely stunning and realistic.  Harsh directional lighting and negative space exceptionally well done.   The hint of detail on the back wall of your "studio" is an added wow!  I really hope voters recognize your talent and don''t vote on the nature of your subject.', '2004-06-29 23:49:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(785680, 86287, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a pleasant prrtrait but seems rather sad - especially for a clown.  Border is not good and detracts a lot.  I''d like more lighting on the face and not the background.</td>', 'It''s a pleasant prrtrait but seems rather sad - especially for a clown.  Border is not good and detracts a lot.  I''d like more lighting on the face and not the background.', '2004-06-29 23:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(785681, 86115, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the background, and the lines at the top, the side lighting. Great expression too, seems in conflict with the happy BG color. Nice work</td>', 'I like the background, and the lines at the top, the side lighting. Great expression too, seems in conflict with the happy BG color. Nice work', '2004-06-29 23:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(785682, 86197, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty even lighting and minimal shadows give you a good exposure. This seems as though it "can''t decide" whether to be sharp or a soft-focus portrait -- it seems kind of in-between without being OOF either ... I also can''t tell if your model is relaxed or tense ...</td>', 'Pretty even lighting and minimal shadows give you a good exposure. This seems as though it "can''t decide" whether to be sharp or a soft-focus portrait -- it seems kind of in-between without being OOF either ... I also can''t tell if your model is relaxed or tense ...', '2004-06-29 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(785683, 86231, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great Bridal Portrait!! Good work - 9</td>', 'Great Bridal Portrait!! Good work - 9', '2004-06-29 23:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785685, 85693, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very expressive - and qualifies for the color purple too!  It would be a bit stronger if you had opened up a bit - and let the background blur some.  You would still be able to tell they were flowers but it would not detract as it does now.</td>', 'Very expressive - and qualifies for the color purple too!  It would be a bit stronger if you had opened up a bit - and let the background blur some.  You would still be able to tell they were flowers but it would not detract as it does now.', '2004-06-29 23:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(785686, 86313, 10686, '<td valign="top">Love the WA distortion here, his expression is great, everything but the fact that his eyes are out of focus and his shirt is in. That really kills the whole shot for me. It would have been a straight up 10 otherwise.</td>', 'Love the WA distortion here, his expression is great, everything but the fact that his eyes are out of focus and his shirt is in. That really kills the whole shot for me. It would have been a straight up 10 otherwise.', '2004-06-29 23:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(785687, 86199, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to shoot one like this without catching yourself (or something undesirable) in the reflections in the sunglasses. A nice, relaxed "candid" portrait.</td>', 'It''s hard to shoot one like this without catching yourself (or something undesirable) in the reflections in the sunglasses. A nice, relaxed "candid" portrait.', '2004-06-29 23:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(785688, 85934, 19608, '<td valign="top">Looks to be a very friendly guy!  NIce formal portrait - good well balaced two-source lighting.  Classic pose.</td>', 'Looks to be a very friendly guy!  NIce formal portrait - good well balaced two-source lighting.  Classic pose.', '2004-06-29 23:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(785691, 86271, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hi Karson - you have a very talented mom or pop!  Nice exposure, composition and prop.  Frame it and give it to him when he graduates from (fill in the blank.)</td>', 'Hi Karson - you have a very talented mom or pop!  Nice exposure, composition and prop.  Frame it and give it to him when he graduates from (fill in the blank.)', '2004-06-29 23:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(785692, 86213, 10686, '<td valign="top">What can I say, this is a killer shot, the expression make the title superfluous. 9</td>', 'What can I say, this is a killer shot, the expression make the title superfluous. 9', '2004-06-29 23:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(785693, 86307, 19608, '<td valign="top">Attractive model - sassy pose.  Your background - with the vertical lines top left and behind her head doesn''t work for me.  Lighting well done.</td>', 'Attractive model - sassy pose.  Your background - with the vertical lines top left and behind her head doesn''t work for me.  Lighting well done.', '2004-06-29 23:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(785694, 86167, 19608, '<td valign="top">Captivating expression - great lighting and perfect selection of background color.  Border = not.  Focus on the eyes is perfect!</td>', 'Captivating expression - great lighting and perfect selection of background color.  Border = not.  Focus on the eyes is perfect!', '2004-06-29 23:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(785695, 86226, 10686, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is getting hammered for being an outside shot, I don''t really care about that. You captured a great expression on the rider. I think this would have been better if this were shot early morning or late afternoon when the light is warmer and less overhead.</td>', 'I''m sure this is getting hammered for being an outside shot, I don''t really care about that. You captured a great expression on the rider. I think this would have been better if this were shot early morning or late afternoon when the light is warmer and less overhead.', '2004-06-29 23:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(785696, 85241, 1031, '<td valign="top">Simple, unusual composition and limited color pallette make this effective, almost an abstract. The eyes usually look odd shot this way -- I''d try to have them look down and not at the camera so they don''t look dead/comatose. In this case, her eyes are partly-closed enough to mostly hide the effect.</td>', 'Simple, unusual composition and limited color pallette make this effective, almost an abstract. The eyes usually look odd shot this way -- I''d try to have them look down and not at the camera so they don''t look dead/comatose. In this case, her eyes are partly-closed enough to mostly hide the effect.', '2004-06-29 23:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(785697, 86037, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very pensive and very well done!  Lighting is right on.</td>', 'Very pensive and very well done!  Lighting is right on.', '2004-06-29 23:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(785698, 86219, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-06-29 23:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(785700, 85893, 10686, '<td valign="top">pure happiness</td>', 'pure happiness', '2004-06-30 00:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(785701, 86075, 19608, '<td valign="top">Cute - and a typical scene.  The border does not help - it draws attention to the closeness of the right hand tio the edge.  Good expouse.</td>', 'Cute - and a typical scene.  The border does not help - it draws attention to the closeness of the right hand tio the edge.  Good expouse.', '2004-06-30 00:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(785702, 86309, 10686, '<td valign="top">tooo cute! Very nicely done!</td>', 'tooo cute! Very nicely done!', '2004-06-30 00:01:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(785704, 85934, 10818, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites of the challenge.  He has a great smile, great eyes and just looks strong and confident.  You did a great job of bringing all that out.</td>', 'This is one of my favorites of the challenge.  He has a great smile, great eyes and just looks strong and confident.  You did a great job of bringing all that out.', '2004-06-30 00:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(785705, 86231, 19608, '<td valign="top">A stunning bride at that.  Beautiful eyes and the perfect gown to match.  The upper right dark areashould not be there.  The "flowy" feel of the veil is great.</td>', 'A stunning bride at that.  Beautiful eyes and the perfect gown to match.  The upper right dark areashould not be there.  The "flowy" feel of the veil is great.', '2004-06-30 00:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(785706, 85897, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a smirk!  Great lighting, exposure and gimmick!</td>', 'What a smirk!  Great lighting, exposure and gimmick!', '2004-06-30 00:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(785707, 86115, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle and background color works - but the "model airplane shape" on the wall that merges with his head is not good.</td>', 'Unusual angle and background color works - but the "model airplane shape" on the wall that merges with his head is not good.', '2004-06-30 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(785714, 86287, 7485, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but needs more light on the face and sharper focus, at lieast on the nose</td>', 'Interesting idea, but needs more light on the face and sharper focus, at lieast on the nose', '2004-06-30 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(785716, 85622, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting control (or removable lenses?) to shoot through the glasses with no reflections. I guess the "cold" lighting scheme suits the subject matter, but seems a little unusual for a portrait.</td>', 'Excellent lighting control (or removable lenses?) to shoot through the glasses with no reflections. I guess the "cold" lighting scheme suits the subject matter, but seems a little unusual for a portrait.', '2004-06-30 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(785717, 86279, 19608, '<td valign="top">A wonderful child and GREAT expression.  BAckground and its color is perfect for this.  The biggest problem is the hot spot on the hat just above her forehead.</td>', 'A wonderful child and GREAT expression.  BAckground and its color is perfect for this.  The biggest problem is the hot spot on the hat just above her forehead.', '2004-06-30 00:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(785718, 86213, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great high-key and exposure.  It''s very stong but I''d give you another point with the exact pose but with the eyes more towards the lens.  No points taken away but the border is not needed.</td>', 'Great high-key and exposure.  It''s very stong but I''d give you another point with the exact pose but with the eyes more towards the lens.  No points taken away but the border is not needed.', '2004-06-30 00:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(785719, 86275, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very good photo, but a little busy. My eye is bouncing between the eyes, glasses, lips, rings, hair... Not sure how to simplify, maybe no rings? Anyway the lighting is excellent and the overall effect is almost there. 7</td>', 'Very good photo, but a little busy. My eye is bouncing between the eyes, glasses, lips, rings, hair... Not sure how to simplify, maybe no rings? Anyway the lighting is excellent and the overall effect is almost there. 7', '2004-06-30 00:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(785720, 85568, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wide angle lens?  Nice colors, lighting, background.</td>', 'Wide angle lens?  Nice colors, lighting, background.', '2004-06-30 00:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(785721, 86163, 1031, '<td valign="top">...and a few other colors as well! The colors and black background make the flesh-tones pop out of the picture, but I find her hands/legs split the attention with her face. I''d try cropping just below the top of the grip on the umbrella, around her elbows but above the knees.</td>', '...and a few other colors as well! The colors and black background make the flesh-tones pop out of the picture, but I find her hands/legs split the attention with her face. I''d try cropping just below the top of the grip on the umbrella, around her elbows but above the knees.', '2004-06-30 00:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(785723, 86283, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect exposure with perfect lighting.  Black background is very effective.  Button the collar or put on a different shirt.</td>', 'Perfect exposure with perfect lighting.  Black background is very effective.  Button the collar or put on a different shirt.', '2004-06-30 00:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(785726, 86134, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect expression and a very well done portrait!  One minor comment - not sure I like the hair behind her right ear.</td>', 'Perfect expression and a very well done portrait!  One minor comment - not sure I like the hair behind her right ear.', '2004-06-30 00:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(785727, 86089, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unusual but effective not your typical wedding-album photo for sure, but has/shows distinct "personality" and liveliness.</td>', 'Unusual but effective not your typical wedding-album photo for sure, but has/shows distinct "personality" and liveliness.', '2004-06-30 00:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(785729, 85622, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lighting is very "flat looking" - it doesn''t allow any sparkle in the eyes.  Good model 0 nice colors and pose.</td>', 'Lighting is very "flat looking" - it doesn''t allow any sparkle in the eyes.  Good model 0 nice colors and pose.', '2004-06-30 00:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(785730, 86197, 7485, '<td valign="top">I think you may have been trying for a soft-focus effect, but it just looks out of focus. Check out the ''Soft-Focus'' challenge some months ago or search for soft focus in the forums, there are lots of ways to do it and I can certainly see how it might have worked here. Better luck next time!</td>', 'I think you may have been trying for a soft-focus effect, but it just looks out of focus. Check out the ''Soft-Focus'' challenge some months ago or search for soft focus in the forums, there are lots of ways to do it and I can certainly see how it might have worked here. Better luck next time!', '2004-06-30 00:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(785734, 86275, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good job handling the glasses, lighting, DOF.</td>', 'Good job handling the glasses, lighting, DOF.', '2004-06-30 00:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(785735, 86219, 19608, '<td valign="top">A nice looking couple in decent "outdoor" studio lighting.  White sky area top left detracts.</td>', 'A nice looking couple in decent "outdoor" studio lighting.  White sky area top left detracts.', '2004-06-30 00:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(785736, 85698, 7485, '<td valign="top">They are awfully cute, but the blue color-cast really detracts from the overall effect</td>', 'They are awfully cute, but the blue color-cast really detracts from the overall effect', '2004-06-30 00:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(785739, 85623, 19608, '<td valign="top">Stunnig model and expression.  Your background is the weakest part of this image.  Exceptional side lighting.</td>', 'Stunnig model and expression.  Your background is the weakest part of this image.  Exceptional side lighting.', '2004-06-30 00:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(785740, 85835, 19608, '<td valign="top">Unusual and whimsical, I like it!  Good exposure.</td>', 'Unusual and whimsical, I like it!  Good exposure.', '2004-06-30 00:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(785743, 86125, 7485, '<td valign="top">Love the pose and expression! Have to think about the harsh lighting some more, it''s unusual, but somehow it seem to fit. One of the best portraits overall - 9</td>', 'Love the pose and expression! Have to think about the harsh lighting some more, it''s unusual, but somehow it seem to fit. One of the best portraits overall - 9', '2004-06-30 00:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(785745, 86116, 1031, '<td valign="top">Model''s placement and expression add a lot of tension in this photo. This may be be a desired representation of her personality or mood, but if not it seems a departure from the main goal of portraiture which I see as representing the person in a somewhat "timeless" way, with less emphasis on immediate events or circumstances.</td>', 'Model''s placement and expression add a lot of tension in this photo. This may be be a desired representation of her personality or mood, but if not it seems a departure from the main goal of portraiture which I see as representing the person in a somewhat "timeless" way, with less emphasis on immediate events or circumstances.', '2004-06-30 00:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(785750, 85894, 14012, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of Sam, Jacko, as always. The lighing is spot on, which is really impressive, since it is white on white and you didn''t lose any of the chair to the background.<br/> <br/>The only thing that really stands out is the orange tint around his cheeks and nose. It looks like he went face first into a plate of spaghetti recently. :-) 9</td>', 'Nice shot of Sam, Jacko, as always. The lighing is spot on, which is really impressive, since it is white on white and you didn''t lose any of the chair to the background. The only thing that really stands out is the orange tint around his cheeks and nose. It looks like he went face first into a plate of spaghetti recently. :-) 9', '2004-06-30 00:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(785752, 86231, 7485, '<td valign="top">The doll-like appearance is quite unnerving. Technically this is a superb photo, but the featureless skin and staring eyes just freak me out.</td>', 'The doll-like appearance is quite unnerving. Technically this is a superb photo, but the featureless skin and staring eyes just freak me out.', '2004-06-30 00:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(785758, 86089, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, this one has it all, drama, beauty, composition, and successful high-key (such a rare thing!). Surely a winner. (But that''s the best title you could come up with?!?)</td>', 'Wow, this one has it all, drama, beauty, composition, and successful high-key (such a rare thing!). Surely a winner. (But that''s the best title you could come up with?!?)', '2004-06-30 00:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
