(786059, 86312, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  Love the look in her eyes!  Nicely composed.  The lighting here doesn''t do her justice though.  Your colors are a little dull which to me means ya need more light.  She also looks a little flat.  Try movin'' the lights around to the side a little more.  You did get the catch light in the eyes spot on.  Keep tryin'' and post ''em so I can see!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute!  Love the look in her eyes!  Nicely composed.  The lighting here doesn''t do her justice though.  Your colors are a little dull which to me means ya need more light.  She also looks a little flat.  Try movin'' the lights around to the side a little more.  You did get the catch light in the eyes spot on.  Keep tryin'' and post ''em so I can see!TC', '2004-06-30 02:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(786061, 86312, 19608, '<td valign="top">She''s a sweetheart in a nicely constructed studio.  Good pose.  Focus not quite as sharp as I''d like to see on the eyes.</td>', 'She''s a sweetheart in a nicely constructed studio.  Good pose.  Focus not quite as sharp as I''d like to see on the eyes.', '2004-06-30 02:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(786067, 86060, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great colors and background.  Lighting is ok - but needs more sparkle in the eyes.   Hair lighting perfect.</td>', 'Great colors and background.  Lighting is ok - but needs more sparkle in the eyes.   Hair lighting perfect.', '2004-06-30 02:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(786081, 86089, 9906, '<td valign="top">I understand what  you are trying to do with this, but I''ve never been too fond of the effect.  I DO like the compositioin and the emotion that come from your subjects!  They look comfortable together and that is a good thing!<br/>TC</td>', 'I understand what  you are trying to do with this, but I''ve never been too fond of the effect.  I DO like the compositioin and the emotion that come from your subjects!  They look comfortable together and that is a good thing!TC', '2004-06-30 02:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(786085, 86313, 19608, '<td valign="top">The wide angle perespective reminds me of the Margaret Keane paintings.  Colors are good but looks like tungsten lighting.  Focus on the eyes is not quite there.</td>', 'The wide angle perespective reminds me of the Margaret Keane paintings.  Colors are good but looks like tungsten lighting.  Focus on the eyes is not quite there.', '2004-06-30 02:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
