(786092, 86107, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very nice portrait with a single light.  Great model.  Lacking in the studio-like requirement.</td>', 'A very nice portrait with a single light.  Great model.  Lacking in the studio-like requirement.', '2004-06-30 02:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(786105, 85698, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful boys!  Too bad they look so flat.  It doesn''t do them justice...  Try moving your lights around to the sides.  Also, it looks like ya might have used a flash here, try it without.  You''ll definately need a tripod and a little luck cause kids are a little squrimy, but it should pay off!<br/>TC</td>', 'Beautiful boys!  Too bad they look so flat.  It doesn''t do them justice...  Try moving your lights around to the sides.  Also, it looks like ya might have used a flash here, try it without.  You''ll definately need a tripod and a little luck cause kids are a little squrimy, but it should pay off!TC', '2004-06-30 02:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(786108, 86089, 19608, '<td valign="top">I love this but would bet you get a strange bell curve!  It''s really unusual and almost an Annie Leibovitz style (= GREAT!)</td>', 'I love this but would bet you get a strange bell curve!  It''s really unusual and almost an Annie Leibovitz style (= GREAT!)', '2004-06-30 02:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(786112, 85865, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sam is great - shot in subdued lighting (looks like single source).  Black background works well with the skin and clothing colors.  Border detracts and should be removed.</td>', 'Sam is great - shot in subdued lighting (looks like single source).  Black background works well with the skin and clothing colors.  Border detracts and should be removed.', '2004-06-30 02:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(786120, 85835, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looks like a fun bunch of kids!  Wish they weren''t so harshly lit though.  It kind of makes them look flat.  If ya move the lights to the side it will help a lot!  It also looks like you tried to blur out all but their faces.  It looks a little contrived and is distracting.  With a little better lighting, and a little less editing this would be the bomb!<br/>TC</td>', 'Looks like a fun bunch of kids!  Wish they weren''t so harshly lit though.  It kind of makes them look flat.  If ya move the lights to the side it will help a lot!  It also looks like you tried to blur out all but their faces.  It looks a little contrived and is distracting.  With a little better lighting, and a little less editing this would be the bomb!TC', '2004-06-30 02:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(786121, 86197, 19608, '<td valign="top">Kat is a nice-looking model - shot with a single light (flash?)   For a portrait - try to get the eyes in 100% sharp focus.  It would also be better if you included all the hair at the top.</td>', 'Kat is a nice-looking model - shot with a single light (flash?)   For a portrait - try to get the eyes in 100% sharp focus.  It would also be better if you included all the hair at the top.', '2004-06-30 02:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(786127, 86140, 9906, '<td valign="top">Though your lighting may be a little harsh for my taste, your use of leading liines, simple set and almost monotone color scheme make this a pleasure to look at!  Love the use of perspective.<br/>TC</td>', 'Though your lighting may be a little harsh for my taste, your use of leading liines, simple set and almost monotone color scheme make this a pleasure to look at!  Love the use of perspective.TC', '2004-06-30 02:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(786134, 85894, 9906, '<td valign="top">One of the better kid pics.  You have great lighting here giving a sense of depth.  Pulls out the wonderful grin on his face also.  I like the high key effect.  Wanna know how ya didi it.<br/>TC</td>', 'One of the better kid pics.  You have great lighting here giving a sense of depth.  Pulls out the wonderful grin on his face also.  I like the high key effect.  Wanna know how ya didi it.TC', '2004-06-30 03:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(786137, 86084, 19608, '<td valign="top">Model = exceptional<br/>Pose = none<br/>Relaxing = not<br/>She seems like she is ready to say "that''s enough!" instead of what your title suggests.<br/></td>', 'Model = exceptionalPose = noneRelaxing = notShe seems like she is ready to say "that''s enough!" instead of what your title suggests.', '2004-06-30 03:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
