(786446, 85816, 15920, '<td valign="top">I gave this a ten because the subject was so strong emotionally right now, and the lighting is nearly perfect.  The pose and setting are also great for the subject matter.  This is my top pick of the challenge.<br/> <br/>In terms of making it slightly stronger, I might have cropped a little tighter, as the negative space helps, but you have to tradeoff close up of facial expression to get the space, and I think you could give back a little space, maintain the great effect you achieved, and still get a little larger facial area.  Just a thought.</td>', 'I gave this a ten because the subject was so strong emotionally right now, and the lighting is nearly perfect.  The pose and setting are also great for the subject matter.  This is my top pick of the challenge. In terms of making it slightly stronger, I might have cropped a little tighter, as the negative space helps, but you have to tradeoff close up of facial expression to get the space, and I think you could give back a little space, maintain the great effect you achieved, and still get a little larger facial area.  Just a thought.', '2004-06-30 07:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(786450, 85855, 15920, '<td valign="top">She must really like you because she looks a bit bored, and tired of "participating" in DPC.  That said, you did a great job on this image.  Lighting is perfect, hair, makeup, simple clothing to focus attention on your model, and great background.  -9 for a great piece of work.</td>', 'She must really like you because she looks a bit bored, and tired of "participating" in DPC.  That said, you did a great job on this image.  Lighting is perfect, hair, makeup, simple clothing to focus attention on your model, and great background.  -9 for a great piece of work.', '2004-06-30 07:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(786459, 86213, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very well done, with great choice of background, and good work on the hair and facial hair.  Those streaks of grey on a young guy add real interest and the impression of experience, and you caught them perfectly.  The model (who I seem to recognize?) helped you a lot with a perfect fun loving expression to offset the experience.<br/> <br/>The only thing I might think about changing is your crop.  If you moved him to the right, and let him look offscreen by looking across an empty white frame, it might feel like he had more space.  But this is a small suggestion.  This is an exceptionally well done portrait.</td>', 'Very well done, with great choice of background, and good work on the hair and facial hair.  Those streaks of grey on a young guy add real interest and the impression of experience, and you caught them perfectly.  The model (who I seem to recognize?) helped you a lot with a perfect fun loving expression to offset the experience. The only thing I might think about changing is your crop.  If you moved him to the right, and let him look offscreen by looking across an empty white frame, it might feel like he had more space.  But this is a small suggestion.  This is an exceptionally well done portrait.', '2004-06-30 07:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(786472, 85623, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Perfect lighting, and your title starts teh story, and the pose, expression, and focus all drive home the message. -9</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Perfect lighting, and your title starts teh story, and the pose, expression, and focus all drive home the message. -9', '2004-06-30 07:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(786476, 85956, 15920, '<td valign="top">Abstract doesn''t really strike me as something to expect in portrait shots, but I hope you have achieved exactly the results you are looking for.</td>', 'Abstract doesn''t really strike me as something to expect in portrait shots, but I hope you have achieved exactly the results you are looking for.', '2004-06-30 07:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(786477, 86282, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a well done shot, but the choice of subject make it hard for me to evaluate against the other entries, so I scored it harshly, but, that is for the competiton only.  Very good effort capturing detail in the dark areas.</td>', 'This is a well done shot, but the choice of subject make it hard for me to evaluate against the other entries, so I scored it harshly, but, that is for the competiton only.  Very good effort capturing detail in the dark areas.', '2004-06-30 07:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(786479, 85970, 18450, '<td valign="top">like the way the background focuses attention on your model <br/>lighting is lovely, good coloring on his skin and clothing, no shadows<br/>only nit....the boldness and color of the shirt takes attention away from your model''s face. <br/>overall ......a well done color studio portrait.</td>', 'like the way the background focuses attention on your model lighting is lovely, good coloring on his skin and clothing, no shadowsonly nit....the boldness and color of the shirt takes attention away from your model''s face. overall ......a well done color studio portrait.', '2004-06-30 07:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(786490, 86163, 18450, '<td valign="top">lovely skin tones and lighting in this portrait.</td>', 'lovely skin tones and lighting in this portrait.', '2004-06-30 07:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(786499, 86212, 18450, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and lighting on the model in this portrait. I would have preferred a less neutral colored background, the model''s skin almost seems to blend in with it. I feel that posing her with her chin raised very slightly would have given a more flattering line, also maybe having the shoulders a little more level. <br/>Overall though a nice color studio portrait</td>', 'Nice focus and lighting on the model in this portrait. I would have preferred a less neutral colored background, the model''s skin almost seems to blend in with it. I feel that posing her with her chin raised very slightly would have given a more flattering line, also maybe having the shoulders a little more level. Overall though a nice color studio portrait', '2004-06-30 07:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(786529, 86120, 18450, '<td valign="top">interesting creative idea.</td>', 'interesting creative idea.', '2004-06-30 08:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(786537, 86279, 18450, '<td valign="top">Cute kid shot! I really like the way her clothes are similar tones to the colour of the background ....makes me focus on the girl. Lovely lighting and skin tones. Pose is a bit different from the classic which adds interest. Good studio color portrait.</td>', 'Cute kid shot! I really like the way her clothes are similar tones to the colour of the background ....makes me focus on the girl. Lovely lighting and skin tones. Pose is a bit different from the classic which adds interest. Good studio color portrait.', '2004-06-30 08:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(786541, 86075, 18450, '<td valign="top">A lovely idea. To me the focus seems a little soft and would have preferred a soft warmer shade in the background as I find the present one very glarey. Lovely lighting and skin colouring on the little boy...........dog looks like a real sweetheart.</td>', 'A lovely idea. To me the focus seems a little soft and would have preferred a soft warmer shade in the background as I find the present one very glarey. Lovely lighting and skin colouring on the little boy...........dog looks like a real sweetheart.', '2004-06-30 08:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(786557, 86213, 8139, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite. Great portrait full of life.</td>', 'This is my favorite. Great portrait full of life.', '2004-06-30 08:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(786559, 86099, 8139, '<td valign="top">Warm,soft, ...beautiful.</td>', 'Warm,soft, ...beautiful.', '2004-06-30 09:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(786643, 85623, 12493, '<td valign="top">Wonderful lighting, exotic beauty</td>', 'Wonderful lighting, exotic beauty', '2004-06-30 10:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(786644, 85526, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting pic, I like the texture in the cloth and the color in her headband, but it needs softer lighting to eliminate the reflections from her lips, nose and forehead, and to bring the necklace out of shadow</td>', 'this is a very interesting pic, I like the texture in the cloth and the color in her headband, but it needs softer lighting to eliminate the reflections from her lips, nose and forehead, and to bring the necklace out of shadow', '2004-06-30 10:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(786651, 86212, 9821, '<td valign="top">The color seems off a bit and she''s too lose to the background and causing a shadow on it. I think moving her away a little and having her look more at the camera would have helped.</td>', 'The color seems off a bit and she''s too lose to the background and causing a shadow on it. I think moving her away a little and having her look more at the camera would have helped.', '2004-06-30 10:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(786652, 86103, 9821, '<td valign="top">I like what you were going for here. Looks a little overly photoshopped (the wall and the border). Funny outfit :)</td>', 'I like what you were going for here. Looks a little overly photoshopped (the wall and the border). Funny outfit :)', '2004-06-30 10:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(786657, 85938, 5728, '<td valign="top">Sonja!!! Kewl portrait, wonderful effect. Tres fantastique :)</td>', 'Sonja!!! Kewl portrait, wonderful effect. Tres fantastique :)', '2004-06-30 10:17:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(786658, 86255, 9821, '<td valign="top">Very pretty woman. Her hairline looks a little wierd (photoshop maybe) and the background is strange. Pretty eyes.</td>', 'Very pretty woman. Her hairline looks a little wierd (photoshop maybe) and the background is strange. Pretty eyes.', '2004-06-30 10:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(786661, 86262, 9821, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting ... I like her expression though :)</td>', 'Harsh lighting ... I like her expression though :)', '2004-06-30 10:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(786663, 86307, 9821, '<td valign="top">Her eyes aren''t quite in sharp focus and her lipstick kinda jumps out at me. Pretty girl, nice pose.</td>', 'Her eyes aren''t quite in sharp focus and her lipstick kinda jumps out at me. Pretty girl, nice pose.', '2004-06-30 10:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(786667, 86226, 9821, '<td valign="top">Not really a studio shot by any definition, but it''s nice. The ground is blown out which draws attention away from the main subject. Great Horse!</td>', 'Not really a studio shot by any definition, but it''s nice. The ground is blown out which draws attention away from the main subject. Great Horse!', '2004-06-30 10:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(786670, 85827, 9821, '<td valign="top">The lighting isn''t quite right here. There''s a few shadows on her face that are noticeable which kind of makes one eye dark, and one eye light. Very natural expression though.</td>', 'The lighting isn''t quite right here. There''s a few shadows on her face that are noticeable which kind of makes one eye dark, and one eye light. Very natural expression though.', '2004-06-30 10:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(786673, 85780, 9821, '<td valign="top">Harsh lighting hurts this one. Cool eye color.</td>', 'Harsh lighting hurts this one. Cool eye color.', '2004-06-30 10:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(786678, 85970, 9821, '<td valign="top">Nice smile, classic pose ... but the shirt is yelling loudest of all ... kind of distracting.</td>', 'Nice smile, classic pose ... but the shirt is yelling loudest of all ... kind of distracting.', '2004-06-30 10:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(786679, 86229, 16777, '<td valign="top">Background is to light, the subject seems to get lost.</td>', 'Background is to light, the subject seems to get lost.', '2004-06-30 10:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(786683, 85622, 9821, '<td valign="top">Looks a little underexposed and maybe a blue cast to it. His eye color isn''t realistic. I like the pose, but maybe without the watch. Glasses are great.</td>', 'Looks a little underexposed and maybe a blue cast to it. His eye color isn''t realistic. I like the pose, but maybe without the watch. Glasses are great.', '2004-06-30 10:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(786686, 85612, 9821, '<td valign="top">She''s a very pretty woman. Looks over sharpened and her jewelry is reflecting a lot of light. Personally, I think I''d prefer her to be looking at the camera ... but I know this is a matter of opinion.</td>', 'She''s a very pretty woman. Looks over sharpened and her jewelry is reflecting a lot of light. Personally, I think I''d prefer her to be looking at the camera ... but I know this is a matter of opinion.', '2004-06-30 10:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(786693, 85972, 11895, '<td valign="top">good shot, lovely woman, but it may have looked better if her glove were not  so close in color to the background, you almost can''t see it at all,  a lighter colored clove, a neutral background, or maybe just some additional light on it to bring out the green more</td>', 'good shot, lovely woman, but it may have looked better if her glove were not  so close in color to the background, you almost can''t see it at all,  a lighter colored clove, a neutral background, or maybe just some additional light on it to bring out the green more', '2004-06-30 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(786696, 86228, 16777, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but not crazy about the white background.</td>', 'I like the shot, but not crazy about the white background.', '2004-06-30 10:33:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(786701, 85972, 16777, '<td valign="top">My only thought is that this would have been better without the glove... her hand disappears wierdly into the background.</td>', 'My only thought is that this would have been better without the glove... her hand disappears wierdly into the background.', '2004-06-30 10:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(786718, 85894, 10819, '<td valign="top">this is one of two of my very favourites..you did really great in capturing him in a good pose.</td>', 'this is one of two of my very favourites..you did really great in capturing him in a good pose.', '2004-06-30 10:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(786723, 85938, 10819, '<td valign="top">this is my favourite of the challenge. i love the soft colours and the little girl is adorable</td>', 'this is my favourite of the challenge. i love the soft colours and the little girl is adorable', '2004-06-30 10:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(786726, 86248, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the way the lighting and the title work together but I think this needs a bit more depth of field, the sharpness in focus falls off from one side of her face to the other, her right cheek and eye are pretty sharp but the outline of her left cheek where it meets the hair is softer, enough difference that it detours my attention</td>', 'I like the way the lighting and the title work together but I think this needs a bit more depth of field, the sharpness in focus falls off from one side of her face to the other, her right cheek and eye are pretty sharp but the outline of her left cheek where it meets the hair is softer, enough difference that it detours my attention', '2004-06-30 10:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(786761, 86257, 11895, '<td valign="top">good shot, lots of color and texture, but I''d like the light from his left to be less harsh and a different balance (less chair and more subject, maybe cropped just below his waistline), also the top  of his head blends into the background too closely and loses definition</td>', 'good shot, lots of color and texture, but I''d like the light from his left to be less harsh and a different balance (less chair and more subject, maybe cropped just below his waistline), also the top  of his head blends into the background too closely and loses definition', '2004-06-30 10:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(786820, 86315, 11895, '<td valign="top">lightint is a bit harsh in some areas but not on the face, the background color is pretty close to her hair color, darker  bg would have let the hair stand out a bit more, lipstick and the dress''s color seem to match boosting both, on the whole a very good effort</td>', 'lightint is a bit harsh in some areas but not on the face, the background color is pretty close to her hair color, darker  bg would have let the hair stand out a bit more, lipstick and the dress''s color seem to match boosting both, on the whole a very good effort', '2004-06-30 11:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(786824, 86226, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice stance. Looking good!</td>', 'Nice stance. Looking good!', '2004-06-30 11:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(786838, 86125, 11895, '<td valign="top">very good photo but the lighting needs a minor adjustment to be more balanced, one side of his face is almost blown out and the other is too shaded</td>', 'very good photo but the lighting needs a minor adjustment to be more balanced, one side of his face is almost blown out and the other is too shaded', '2004-06-30 11:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(786841, 86314, 714, '<td valign="top">Lovely lady.  The background is very distracting.  Maybe sit her farther away from to get more blur.  The lighting is good.  Maybe a bit harsh on the left side of her face, but not bad.</td>', 'Lovely lady.  The background is very distracting.  Maybe sit her farther away from to get more blur.  The lighting is good.  Maybe a bit harsh on the left side of her face, but not bad.', '2004-06-30 11:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(786843, 85554, 714, '<td valign="top">Very proffessional looking.  The one thing that bugs me is his expression.  Why no smile?  7 vote</td>', 'Very proffessional looking.  The one thing that bugs me is his expression.  Why no smile?  7 vote', '2004-06-30 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(786847, 86219, 714, '<td valign="top">Lovely couple.  <br/> <br/>Critique:  The background is very sharp almost to sharp.  A good way to get a good blur in the background is to move the person about 5 feet or more away from the background.</td>', 'Lovely couple.   Critique:  The background is very sharp almost to sharp.  A good way to get a good blur in the background is to move the person about 5 feet or more away from the background.', '2004-06-30 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(786848, 85934, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and pose.<br/> <br/>Critique: The arms seem distorted a bit because they look bigger then his face. I wonder how close you were to the person and what lens you used.  Try back away from the person and zooming in.  Make sure you use a tripod when using the zoom.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and pose. Critique: The arms seem distorted a bit because they look bigger then his face. I wonder how close you were to the person and what lens you used.  Try back away from the person and zooming in.  Make sure you use a tripod when using the zoom.', '2004-06-30 11:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(786852, 86265, 8367, '<td valign="top">Such a cutie! I love his name, too.<br/>The photo appears to have lost some detail or something during processing. (I bet the original looks great.)</td>', 'Such a cutie! I love his name, too.The photo appears to have lost some detail or something during processing. (I bet the original looks great.)', '2004-06-30 11:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(786853, 86125, 714, '<td valign="top">This has an excellent feel to it, almost ''70 feel.  I don''t have a critique.</td>', 'This has an excellent feel to it, almost ''70 feel.  I don''t have a critique.', '2004-06-30 11:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(786854, 86212, 714, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful!  Doesn''t look 49!<br/> <br/>Critique: To close to the background.  Not sure I like the side view.  I would really like to see her smile and some eye contact, but that''s just me. :-)  Great lighting!</td>', 'She is beautiful!  Doesn''t look 49! Critique: To close to the background.  Not sure I like the side view.  I would really like to see her smile and some eye contact, but that''s just me. :-)  Great lighting!', '2004-06-30 11:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(786857, 86271, 2612, '<td valign="top">Great first attempt...<br/>A couple of thoughts for possible improvements:<br/>o The background is very light right behind the subject. This highlight area is a little distracting because it draws attention away from the subject.<br/>o It appears that there is light from both sides and a slight shadow down the middle of his face. I''m not sure why, but this seems to keep the facing from drawing the attention it needs. Maybe play with the fill light.<br/></td>', 'Great first attempt...A couple of thoughts for possible improvements:o The background is very light right behind the subject. This highlight area is a little distracting because it draws attention away from the subject.o It appears that there is light from both sides and a slight shadow down the middle of his face. I''m not sure why, but this seems to keep the facing from drawing the attention it needs. Maybe play with the fill light.', '2004-06-30 11:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(786858, 85698, 714, '<td valign="top">These little guys are just beautiful.  Kids are soooo hard to shoot.  I know from experience. I have 4.  <br/> <br/>Critique: You did good, but the background is very distracting.  Try using a solid color.  Black might be nice.</td>', 'These little guys are just beautiful.  Kids are soooo hard to shoot.  I know from experience. I have 4.   Critique: You did good, but the background is very distracting.  Try using a solid color.  Black might be nice.', '2004-06-30 11:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(786862, 86107, 714, '<td valign="top">She is beautiful!  <br/> <br/>Critique: You are to close to your subject.  Back the camera up a bit and zoom in on her.  This should prevent any distortion.  I also learned this.  Hope it works for you.</td>', 'She is beautiful!   Critique: You are to close to your subject.  Back the camera up a bit and zoom in on her.  This should prevent any distortion.  I also learned this.  Hope it works for you.', '2004-06-30 11:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(786867, 86313, 714, '<td valign="top">How cute!  Look at those eyes.  I bet he gets away with alot of stuff. hehe....<br/> <br/>Critique:  I like the wide angle use.  I would try using a background that doesnt blend with his skin and have him wear a shirt with no charactors.  Nice lighting, but try setting your white balance to indoors, it seems to have a yellow/orangy tint.</td>', 'How cute!  Look at those eyes.  I bet he gets away with alot of stuff. hehe.... Critique:  I like the wide angle use.  I would try using a background that doesnt blend with his skin and have him wear a shirt with no charactors.  Nice lighting, but try setting your white balance to indoors, it seems to have a yellow/orangy tint.', '2004-06-30 11:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(786872, 86306, 714, '<td valign="top">Good looking fellow here.  Nice lighting.<br/> <br/>Critique:  The quitar bugs me here.  I think maybe because only part of it is showing.  My eyes keep looking down to see the rest of the shot.  Maybe back up a bit and get his upper body, arms and hands with part of the quitar. I haven''t done a shot like this so not sure.</td>', 'Good looking fellow here.  Nice lighting. Critique:  The quitar bugs me here.  I think maybe because only part of it is showing.  My eyes keep looking down to see the rest of the shot.  Maybe back up a bit and get his upper body, arms and hands with part of the quitar. I haven''t done a shot like this so not sure.', '2004-06-30 11:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(786878, 85855, 714, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait.  <br/> <br/>Critique:  The hand is a bit bright.  I would love to get a better view of the beautiful brown eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait.   Critique:  The hand is a bit bright.  I would love to get a better view of the beautiful brown eyes.', '2004-06-30 11:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(786880, 86095, 714, '<td valign="top">Lighging and pose is good.<br/> <br/>Critique:  Why so serious? I would love to see a smile and remember to take off the sunglasses. :-)</td>', 'Lighging and pose is good. Critique:  Why so serious? I would love to see a smile and remember to take off the sunglasses. :-)', '2004-06-30 11:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(786886, 86116, 714, '<td valign="top">This is a very well taken photo.  Lighting is awesome and the color of the background is perfect.<br/> <br/>Critique: I would love to see more of her face on the left, not much though.</td>', 'This is a very well taken photo.  Lighting is awesome and the color of the background is perfect. Critique: I would love to see more of her face on the left, not much though.', '2004-06-30 11:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(786894, 86316, 14700, '<td valign="top">Aside from the hairlight the lighting is not creatve but it does qualify as a formal studio portait.... 7</td>', 'Aside from the hairlight the lighting is not creatve but it does qualify as a formal studio portait.... 7', '2004-06-30 11:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(786895, 86287, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice pose and expression.<br/> <br/>Critique: The photo is very dark on my monitor.  Not sure if this was what you intended or not.  Maybe a bit brighter is all.</td>', 'Nice pose and expression. Critique: The photo is very dark on my monitor.  Not sure if this was what you intended or not.  Maybe a bit brighter is all.', '2004-06-30 11:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(786897, 86279, 14700, '<td valign="top">NIce first!  Better than my first thats for sure. 7.</td>', 'NIce first!  Better than my first thats for sure. 7.', '2004-06-30 11:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(786898, 86305, 14700, '<td valign="top">9 for creativity alone.  Your lighting is also well done... he looks more like my Senator.</td>', '9 for creativity alone.  Your lighting is also well done... he looks more like my Senator.', '2004-06-30 12:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(786899, 86076, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting and background.<br/> <br/>Critique:  The head is to tilted for me and is a bit to soft.</td>', 'Very nice lighting and background. Critique:  The head is to tilted for me and is a bit to soft.', '2004-06-30 12:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(786904, 86140, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow, I love this pose and composition.  I have thought of doing this for a self portrait.  <br/>&lt;rant on&gt; How on earth can women wear shoes like that?&lt;rant off&gt; LOL<br/> <br/>Critique: Some parts of the skin are very bright almost washed out.  Maybe tone down on the lighting just a bit or back it away from the person.</td>', 'Wow, I love this pose and composition.  I have thought of doing this for a self portrait.  <rant on> How on earth can women wear shoes like that?<rant off> LOL Critique: Some parts of the skin are very bright almost washed out.  Maybe tone down on the lighting just a bit or back it away from the person.', '2004-06-30 12:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(786905, 86213, 18080, '<td valign="top">nice expression on your model<br/>8<br/>Looking at this superb capture again i think i must bump the score from 8 to a 10.<br/>This could be the winner.<br/>good luck</td>', 'nice expression on your model8Looking at this superb capture again i think i must bump the score from 8 to a 10.This could be the winner.good luck', '2004-06-30 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(786915, 85693, 714, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and background to compilment a beautiful smile.<br/> <br/>Critique:  A tripod would have made the composition better here.  You are almost to close to the camera.  The lighting isn''t bad but your right eye is a bit bright.  Try using the "burn" tool to correct it.</td>', 'Lovely colors and background to compilment a beautiful smile. Critique:  A tripod would have made the composition better here.  You are almost to close to the camera.  The lighting isn''t bad but your right eye is a bit bright.  Try using the "burn" tool to correct it.', '2004-06-30 12:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(786922, 86309, 714, '<td valign="top">Lovely, just lovely!  <br/> <br/></td>', 'Lovely, just lovely!   ', '2004-06-30 12:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(786955, 86116, 11895, '<td valign="top">the close crop on the left doesn''t work for me, not in a portrait; other than that  this is fine</td>', 'the close crop on the left doesn''t work for me, not in a portrait; other than that  this is fine', '2004-06-30 12:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(786977, 86115, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is very nice, I like the background color and the lines,  it might be a little better if the subject were positioned in the center of the spot of light behind him, and maybe another light source to put some, but not too much, light on the shaded side of his face</td>', 'this is very nice, I like the background color and the lines,  it might be a little better if the subject were positioned in the center of the spot of light behind him, and maybe another light source to put some, but not too much, light on the shaded side of his face', '2004-06-30 12:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(787001, 86076, 11895, '<td valign="top">soft focus is cool for this type of shot but yours is almost too soft, nice shot</td>', 'soft focus is cool for this type of shot but yours is almost too soft, nice shot', '2004-06-30 12:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(787011, 85865, 9821, '<td valign="top">Nice crop, nice pose ... but the light''s a little flat and the catchlights look fake.</td>', 'Nice crop, nice pose ... but the light''s a little flat and the catchlights look fake.', '2004-06-30 12:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787012, 86280, 14414, '<td valign="top">is this in water, then rotated?<br/>nice idea</td>', 'is this in water, then rotated?nice idea', '2004-06-30 12:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(787016, 86229, 9821, '<td valign="top">I wish she was looking at the camera, but that''s minor. The sky is very bright which pulls attention away ... beautiful woman.</td>', 'I wish she was looking at the camera, but that''s minor. The sky is very bright which pulls attention away ... beautiful woman.', '2004-06-30 12:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(787017, 86309, 5822, '<td valign="top">I love this vey classic looking picture!  Your little model is beautiful and meticulously made up. The chair and background give an antique look to the picture without being distracting, and I love the girl''s gaze at the rose. Lighting is very good, but I think that a spot on the flower could bring out more detail and maybe a little less light on the floor. Other than that I love it. High mark.</td>', 'I love this vey classic looking picture!  Your little model is beautiful and meticulously made up. The chair and background give an antique look to the picture without being distracting, and I love the girl''s gaze at the rose. Lighting is very good, but I think that a spot on the flower could bring out more detail and maybe a little less light on the floor. Other than that I love it. High mark.', '2004-06-30 12:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(787024, 85718, 9821, '<td valign="top">looks like her hair was probably moving when you took the shot, also maybe a little under exposed. The crop and closeness gives it a nice feel though.</td>', 'looks like her hair was probably moving when you took the shot, also maybe a little under exposed. The crop and closeness gives it a nice feel though.', '2004-06-30 12:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(787052, 86121, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great baby picture!  Love the look on his cute face. while the lighting appears good, it also looks as if you did it with some post process editing.  I''m not particularly fond of the neckless around his neck, though.</td>', 'Great baby picture!  Love the look on his cute face. while the lighting appears good, it also looks as if you did it with some post process editing.  I''m not particularly fond of the neckless around his neck, though.', '2004-06-30 13:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(787057, 86213, 16930, '<td valign="top">This is the yummest portrait of them all.  It is so flirtaceous.  I love it.</td>', 'This is the yummest portrait of them all.  It is so flirtaceous.  I love it.', '2004-06-30 13:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(787058, 85865, 14477, '<td valign="top">Great subject...color seems a little muted.</td>', 'Great subject...color seems a little muted.', '2004-06-30 13:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(787060, 85972, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful young lady!  (Have I seen her here before?)  Nice shot. I''m not sure I like the yellowish cast to it.  It also seems a little flat.  You lose her nose almost.  If more of the lighting was to the side it would help.  The black glove also gets lost but against the background.  I REALLY love the hair lighting and the catch light in her eyes.  I need to find out how to do those two things for myself!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very beautiful young lady!  (Have I seen her here before?)  Nice shot. I''m not sure I like the yellowish cast to it.  It also seems a little flat.  You lose her nose almost.  If more of the lighting was to the side it would help.  The black glove also gets lost but against the background.  I REALLY love the hair lighting and the catch light in her eyes.  I need to find out how to do those two things for myself!TC', '2004-06-30 13:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(787061, 86287, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like the concept but it needs some more light on the face, maybe not a lot more, but some</td>', 'I like the concept but it needs some more light on the face, maybe not a lot more, but some', '2004-06-30 13:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787062, 85934, 14477, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop a bit more at the top.</td>', 'Maybe crop a bit more at the top.', '2004-06-30 13:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(787064, 86306, 23656, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photograph over all, although the skin tones could be a bit richer to enhance the cupid-like quality of the subject.</td>', 'This is a very good photograph over all, although the skin tones could be a bit richer to enhance the cupid-like quality of the subject.', '2004-06-30 13:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(787065, 86115, 14477, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and background.  A little more light on his face to kill the shadow might be nice.</td>', 'I love the angle and background.  A little more light on his face to kill the shadow might be nice.', '2004-06-30 13:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(787066, 86243, 14477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Only thing I can suggest is that it be a little sharper.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Only thing I can suggest is that it be a little sharper.', '2004-06-30 13:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(787068, 85273, 14477, '<td valign="top">Great photo...would have liked it a little sharper.</td>', 'Great photo...would have liked it a little sharper.', '2004-06-30 13:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(787069, 85923, 9906, '<td valign="top">Lovely young lady in  a great pose!  I really like how she''s looking off frame too.  Hey, your lighting is a touch harsh though  making the shot look kinda flat.  You got awesome light on her hair.  A little catch light in her eyes would make them twinkle nicely!  I think this is done with a reflector or a smaller light to the front.<br/>TC</td>', 'Lovely young lady in  a great pose!  I really like how she''s looking off frame too.  Hey, your lighting is a touch harsh though  making the shot look kinda flat.  You got awesome light on her hair.  A little catch light in her eyes would make them twinkle nicely!  I think this is done with a reflector or a smaller light to the front.TC', '2004-06-30 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(787073, 85241, 14477, '<td valign="top">Great photo...only thing I would do is clone out the stray hairs on her shoulder</td>', 'Great photo...only thing I would do is clone out the stray hairs on her shoulder', '2004-06-30 13:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(787075, 85623, 14477, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!  Wouldn''t change a thing!!</td>', 'Wonderful!!  Wouldn''t change a thing!!', '2004-06-30 13:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(787078, 86140, 14477, '<td valign="top">I love the porportion of this photo.  Back of the sofa on the left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I love the porportion of this photo.  Back of the sofa on the left is a bit distracting.', '2004-06-30 13:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(787079, 86075, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like your choice of subject matter but find the exposure a bit too lacking in contrast.  Also, I wish there were a contrasting background instead of the blown out white.</td>', 'I really like your choice of subject matter but find the exposure a bit too lacking in contrast.  Also, I wish there were a contrasting background instead of the blown out white.', '2004-06-30 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(787081, 86099, 14477, '<td valign="top">Very pretty photo but a bit too much yellow.</td>', 'Very pretty photo but a bit too much yellow.', '2004-06-30 13:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(787082, 85893, 9906, '<td valign="top">Lovely young lady in a very cute pose!  Great use of catch light to get the twinkle in her eye.  Nice use of creative lighting to giver her face depth.  Two things that would take this from a good shot to a great shot, there''s a little bit of clutter in the background.  A simple cloth hung behind or a slightly different angle takes care of that.  Also, the left side of the shot is a tad too dark at the top.  I would try a simple reflector (spelled white poster board) to bounce back just a touch of light onto the headphones!<br/>TC</td>', 'Lovely young lady in a very cute pose!  Great use of catch light to get the twinkle in her eye.  Nice use of creative lighting to giver her face depth.  Two things that would take this from a good shot to a great shot, there''s a little bit of clutter in the background.  A simple cloth hung behind or a slightly different angle takes care of that.  Also, the left side of the shot is a tad too dark at the top.  I would try a simple reflector (spelled white poster board) to bounce back just a touch of light onto the headphones!TC', '2004-06-30 13:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(787084, 85334, 23656, '<td valign="top">This is a very good demonstration of depth of field!  The focus on the dog''s face enhances the "What''s that over there?" look in his eyes.</td>', 'This is a very good demonstration of depth of field!  The focus on the dog''s face enhances the "What''s that over there?" look in his eyes.', '2004-06-30 13:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787088, 86275, 14477, '<td valign="top">Good picture.  I can''t see if she''s holding onto a book or if her hands are just positioned that way.  Maybe move the hands apart a bit so we can see what''s underneath</td>', 'Good picture.  I can''t see if she''s holding onto a book or if her hands are just positioned that way.  Maybe move the hands apart a bit so we can see what''s underneath', '2004-06-30 13:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(787089, 86313, 14477, '<td valign="top">This picture is so cute...I''d love to do something similar with my little boy.  Maybe sharpen a bit.</td>', 'This picture is so cute...I''d love to do something similar with my little boy.  Maybe sharpen a bit.', '2004-06-30 13:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(787091, 86231, 14477, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...lips seem a little tense.</td>', 'Beautiful...lips seem a little tense.', '2004-06-30 13:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(787093, 86167, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think this would have scored better if you had brought the light forward to move the shadow line toward the edge of her face a little</td>', 'I think this would have scored better if you had brought the light forward to move the shadow line toward the edge of her face a little', '2004-06-30 13:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(787094, 85554, 14477, '<td valign="top">Crop a little more.</td>', 'Crop a little more.', '2004-06-30 13:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(787095, 86125, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very good choice of subject matter and I like your angle of view getting a clear shot of his face and the newspaper, as well.  I find the lighting to be too harsh and I wish the print on the newspaper was more blurred so as not to be distracting...in other words, get a shallower DOF.</td>', 'Very good choice of subject matter and I like your angle of view getting a clear shot of his face and the newspaper, as well.  I find the lighting to be too harsh and I wish the print on the newspaper was more blurred so as not to be distracting...in other words, get a shallower DOF.', '2004-06-30 13:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787097, 86116, 14477, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  The way she''s holding her lips seems a little off.  I love the way you''ve positioned her.</td>', 'Very pretty.  The way she''s holding her lips seems a little off.  I love the way you''ve positioned her.', '2004-06-30 13:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(787100, 86037, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot is simply precious!  I love how you managed to get two different poses (profile and full on) into the same portrait shot!  I''m not sure I like the yellowish cast though.  And while your lighting is spot on for depth, a touch of catch light in her eye would take this shot one step beyond!<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot is simply precious!  I love how you managed to get two different poses (profile and full on) into the same portrait shot!  I''m not sure I like the yellowish cast though.  And while your lighting is spot on for depth, a touch of catch light in her eye would take this shot one step beyond!TC', '2004-06-30 13:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787103, 85265, 14477, '<td valign="top">Would rather see her pretty face without the hair in front.  Butterfly on her shirt in lower left hand corner is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Would rather see her pretty face without the hair in front.  Butterfly on her shirt in lower left hand corner is a bit distracting.', '2004-06-30 13:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(787104, 85901, 14477, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Maybe just sharpen a bit.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Maybe just sharpen a bit.', '2004-06-30 13:24:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(787105, 85568, 5822, '<td valign="top">Looks more like a mug shot than a portrait.</td>', 'Looks more like a mug shot than a portrait.', '2004-06-30 13:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(787108, 85623, 11895, '<td valign="top">lighting is too harsh on one side of her face and it''s too dark on the other,  not that it has to be exactly balanced but this is just a little extreme to work for me, other than that a very good shot</td>', 'lighting is too harsh on one side of her face and it''s too dark on the other,  not that it has to be exactly balanced but this is just a little extreme to work for me, other than that a very good shot', '2004-06-30 13:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(787111, 86167, 14477, '<td valign="top">I''d play up those amazing eyes a bit more...eye on right side is cut off a bit with the light.</td>', 'I''d play up those amazing eyes a bit more...eye on right side is cut off a bit with the light.', '2004-06-30 13:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(787112, 85265, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome pose and beatiful shot of a lovely young lady!  I like how you have the lighting here.  You have great sense of depth, while maintaining the lovely pale creamy white skin without blowing it out.  Great catch light in the eyes.  Only real distraction is the butterflies on her shirt.  A different outfit (or a little cloning) and this would be the bomb!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome pose and beatiful shot of a lovely young lady!  I like how you have the lighting here.  You have great sense of depth, while maintaining the lovely pale creamy white skin without blowing it out.  Great catch light in the eyes.  Only real distraction is the butterflies on her shirt.  A different outfit (or a little cloning) and this would be the bomb!TC', '2004-06-30 13:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(787115, 85855, 14477, '<td valign="top">Great photo...some of the stray hairs are distracting.  You''ve made her skin look really pretty.</td>', 'Great photo...some of the stray hairs are distracting.  You''ve made her skin look really pretty.', '2004-06-30 13:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787117, 86229, 14477, '<td valign="top">A little dark on the bride.</td>', 'A little dark on the bride.', '2004-06-30 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(787118, 86115, 12475, '<td valign="top">I love this: exciting composition, angle, colors, and great expression.</td>', 'I love this: exciting composition, angle, colors, and great expression.', '2004-06-30 13:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(787121, 86130, 14477, '<td valign="top">I love her expression.  The light on her face is a bit harsh...filter a bit.</td>', 'I love her expression.  The light on her face is a bit harsh...filter a bit.', '2004-06-30 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(787123, 85698, 14477, '<td valign="top">Great photo.  How''d you get them both to smile??  Only thing I''d change is the background...darker without stars.  That way, those cuties would stand out even more.</td>', 'Great photo.  How''d you get them both to smile??  Only thing I''d change is the background...darker without stars.  That way, those cuties would stand out even more.', '2004-06-30 13:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(787126, 86315, 14477, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  There''s a bit of a shadow on the left side of the face...and the hair gets lost a bit in the background (maybe a different color?).</td>', 'Very pretty.  There''s a bit of a shadow on the left side of the face...and the hair gets lost a bit in the background (maybe a different color?).', '2004-06-30 13:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(787128, 85910, 9906, '<td valign="top">I have no problem with a dog as a subject for a portrait, in fact in some areas you can make AWESOME money doing pet portraits.  You have a beautiful dog here.  However, the shot doesn''t quite do him justice.  First off, it''s a little cluttered.  There are too many elements and most of them don''t really add too much.  The next thing (and probably most important) is the unimaginative lighting.  This looks dull and flat.  Moving more of the lights to one side or another would help give it depth.  More lights would help with the colors (as well as boosting the levels in PS).  You also managed to crop (either in editing or in camera) off his leg which to  me is a little distracting.<br/>TC</td>', 'I have no problem with a dog as a subject for a portrait, in fact in some areas you can make AWESOME money doing pet portraits.  You have a beautiful dog here.  However, the shot doesn''t quite do him justice.  First off, it''s a little cluttered.  There are too many elements and most of them don''t really add too much.  The next thing (and probably most important) is the unimaginative lighting.  This looks dull and flat.  Moving more of the lights to one side or another would help give it depth.  More lights would help with the colors (as well as boosting the levels in PS).  You also managed to crop (either in editing or in camera) off his leg which to  me is a little distracting.TC', '2004-06-30 13:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(787129, 86219, 14477, '<td valign="top">A little over-exposed.</td>', 'A little over-exposed.', '2004-06-30 13:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(787130, 86279, 14477, '<td valign="top">Crop a bit more.</td>', 'Crop a bit more.', '2004-06-30 13:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(787135, 86120, 14477, '<td valign="top">Exposure needs to be a bit more uniform over the picture.</td>', 'Exposure needs to be a bit more uniform over the picture.', '2004-06-30 13:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(787136, 86313, 23656, '<td valign="top">I wish both of this boy''s eyes were in sharp focus, I could live with the sharpness variations in the rest of the image if the eyes were sharp.</td>', 'I wish both of this boy''s eyes were in sharp focus, I could live with the sharpness variations in the rest of the image if the eyes were sharp.', '2004-06-30 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(787137, 86075, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO this looks more like a snapshot (edited to look like a portrait) than a true portrait.  I don''t have a problem with the boy posing with the dog.  Your lighting is very unimaginative.  If you used a couple of lamps and moved them off to one side you would end up with a shot with more depth.  What happened to the background?<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO this looks more like a snapshot (edited to look like a portrait) than a true portrait.  I don''t have a problem with the boy posing with the dog.  Your lighting is very unimaginative.  If you used a couple of lamps and moved them off to one side you would end up with a shot with more depth.  What happened to the background?TC', '2004-06-30 13:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(787138, 85970, 14477, '<td valign="top">Light seems a bit flat.</td>', 'Light seems a bit flat.', '2004-06-30 13:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(787140, 86226, 14477, '<td valign="top">Setting is a bit distracting.  Maybe if the horse was on the grass in front of the tree...no gravel.</td>', 'Setting is a bit distracting.  Maybe if the horse was on the grass in front of the tree...no gravel.', '2004-06-30 13:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(787142, 86314, 14477, '<td valign="top">Background is distracting.</td>', 'Background is distracting.', '2004-06-30 13:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(787143, 85923, 14477, '<td valign="top">Pretty girl...I think I would like this photo even more if it weren''t over-exposed.</td>', 'Pretty girl...I think I would like this photo even more if it weren''t over-exposed.', '2004-06-30 13:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(787145, 85498, 14477, '<td valign="top">Pose doesn''t look natural.</td>', 'Pose doesn''t look natural.', '2004-06-30 13:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(787147, 86307, 14477, '<td valign="top">Sharpen</td>', 'Sharpen', '2004-06-30 13:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(787150, 85827, 9906, '<td valign="top">Good creative use of lighting.  You do have some purplish cast in the shadows of her face though.  Not sure what caused this.  A white poster board reflector on that side would help with this I believe.  I love that you managed to get the catch light in her eyes. Very important in a portrait.  My biggest complaint with this shot though is that her outfit and the background kind of blend together.  THis makes her look like a floating head which is not as pleasant an image as she deserves.<br/>TC</td>', 'Good creative use of lighting.  You do have some purplish cast in the shadows of her face though.  Not sure what caused this.  A white poster board reflector on that side would help with this I believe.  I love that you managed to get the catch light in her eyes. Very important in a portrait.  My biggest complaint with this shot though is that her outfit and the background kind of blend together.  THis makes her look like a floating head which is not as pleasant an image as she deserves.TC', '2004-06-30 13:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787152, 85910, 14477, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems flat</td>', 'Lighting seems flat', '2004-06-30 13:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(787153, 86095, 14477, '<td valign="top">Too blurry.</td>', 'Too blurry.', '2004-06-30 13:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(787156, 86243, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice portrait, your background is more interesting than the plain ones but nicely blurred so it isn''t dominating, the color of her dress and her skintones compliment each other; since this is an advanced rules challenge  I think you would have improved it by cloneing out her right earring where it shows beneath her chin, that''s a distradtion at an important place in the pic</td>', 'very nice portrait, your background is more interesting than the plain ones but nicely blurred so it isn''t dominating, the color of her dress and her skintones compliment each other; since this is an advanced rules challenge  I think you would have improved it by cloneing out her right earring where it shows beneath her chin, that''s a distradtion at an important place in the pic', '2004-06-30 13:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(787157, 86257, 14477, '<td valign="top">I''d like this photo better if it was cropped about midway down the chair.</td>', 'I''d like this photo better if it was cropped about midway down the chair.', '2004-06-30 13:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(787158, 86121, 14477, '<td valign="top">Highlight is distracting</td>', 'Highlight is distracting', '2004-06-30 13:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(787159, 85284, 14477, '<td valign="top">A little too much shadow on her face but very pretty photo.</td>', 'A little too much shadow on her face but very pretty photo.', '2004-06-30 13:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787161, 86197, 14477, '<td valign="top">A little blurry.</td>', 'A little blurry.', '2004-06-30 13:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(787164, 86277, 14477, '<td valign="top">Crop a little on the bottom</td>', 'Crop a little on the bottom', '2004-06-30 13:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(787166, 85780, 14477, '<td valign="top">Soften the light a little on his face.</td>', 'Soften the light a little on his face.', '2004-06-30 13:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(787168, 86255, 14477, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...just a little too dark on one side of her face.</td>', 'Very pretty...just a little too dark on one side of her face.', '2004-06-30 13:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(787173, 86060, 14477, '<td valign="top">Crop some of the shirt out...overpowers the subject.</td>', 'Crop some of the shirt out...overpowers the subject.', '2004-06-30 13:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(787175, 86228, 14477, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...shadow from arm is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Very pretty...shadow from arm is a bit distracting.', '2004-06-30 13:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(787177, 85972, 14477, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Possibly crop on sides a bit more.</td>', 'Very nice.  Possibly crop on sides a bit more.', '2004-06-30 13:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(787179, 86212, 14477, '<td valign="top">A darker background would be better.</td>', 'A darker background would be better.', '2004-06-30 13:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(787182, 86283, 14477, '<td valign="top">Hue is a little too yellow.  I like the position of the subject.</td>', 'Hue is a little too yellow.  I like the position of the subject.', '2004-06-30 13:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(787183, 86121, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby boy and an awesome use of catch light to get the twinkle in his eye!  Did you PS the vignette effect or was it a spot type light creating this effect?  I''m not sure I like it, but it''s not too distracting.  I did notice that it is a touch flat and dull.  If you move your lights to one side more (rather than so direct in front) you''ll get more depth.  The dull part is either a need for more lights or a bit of tweaking in PS with the levels.<br/>TC</td>', 'Beautiful baby boy and an awesome use of catch light to get the twinkle in his eye!  Did you PS the vignette effect or was it a spot type light creating this effect?  I''m not sure I like it, but it''s not too distracting.  I did notice that it is a touch flat and dull.  If you move your lights to one side more (rather than so direct in front) you''ll get more depth.  The dull part is either a need for more lights or a bit of tweaking in PS with the levels.TC', '2004-06-30 13:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(787184, 86248, 14477, '<td valign="top">Light seems a bit harsh on her face.</td>', 'Light seems a bit harsh on her face.', '2004-06-30 13:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(787185, 85612, 14477, '<td valign="top">A little grainy.</td>', 'A little grainy.', '2004-06-30 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(787187, 85938, 14477, '<td valign="top">So pretty...maye a little more color in the dress.</td>', 'So pretty...maye a little more color in the dress.', '2004-06-30 13:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(787188, 86107, 14477, '<td valign="top">The chin is cut off.</td>', 'The chin is cut off.', '2004-06-30 13:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(787190, 86229, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of natural light to give this shot great depth and tone!  Lovely bride!  Great soft focus effect to make her glow even more on her big day!  A touch more catch light in her eye and this would be nearly perfect!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice use of natural light to give this shot great depth and tone!  Lovely bride!  Great soft focus effect to make her glow even more on her big day!  A touch more catch light in her eye and this would be nearly perfect!TC', '2004-06-30 13:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(787194, 85923, 11895, '<td valign="top">seems like the light on her right is more reddish or orangeish, too different than the other lighting, makes her look like a redhead on one side while a dirty blonde on the other; other than that a fine portrait</td>', 'seems like the light on her right is more reddish or orangeish, too different than the other lighting, makes her look like a redhead on one side while a dirty blonde on the other; other than that a fine portrait', '2004-06-30 13:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(787197, 86314, 5822, '<td valign="top">I wish the background were a bit more blurred with a shallower DOF so as not to be so distracting. Also, the lamp pole seems to be coming out of your subjects head and I wish that it were parallel with the side of the frame, and not converging.  Good lighting and color.</td>', 'I wish the background were a bit more blurred with a shallower DOF so as not to be so distracting. Also, the lamp pole seems to be coming out of your subjects head and I wish that it were parallel with the side of the frame, and not converging.  Good lighting and color.', '2004-06-30 13:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(787206, 85693, 11895, '<td valign="top">I love the colorfullness of this shot, the bright eyes and the smile are great too;  the lighting is just a bit harsh, putting a little shine on some parts of the face</td>', 'I love the colorfullness of this shot, the bright eyes and the smile are great too;  the lighting is just a bit harsh, putting a little shine on some parts of the face', '2004-06-30 13:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(787242, 85827, 11895, '<td valign="top">the shadows on the face and the bright spot on the forehead are negatives, background adds interest,  but the eyes and that smile are big positives</td>', 'the shadows on the face and the bright spot on the forehead are negatives, background adds interest,  but the eyes and that smile are big positives', '2004-06-30 14:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(787246, 86103, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a good idea, but something bothers me about the implementation.  I think it is the softness of the photo.  I am sure it is what you intended, but I am having a hard time enjoying as much as I am enjoying some of th eother entries.</td>', 'This is a good idea, but something bothers me about the implementation.  I think it is the softness of the photo.  I am sure it is what you intended, but I am having a hard time enjoying as much as I am enjoying some of th eother entries.', '2004-06-30 14:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(787249, 86089, 15920, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit overexposed to me, but that might be the effect you were striving for.  Apologies if I am judging this incorrectly.</td>', 'This looks a bit overexposed to me, but that might be the effect you were striving for.  Apologies if I am judging this incorrectly.', '2004-06-30 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(787261, 85855, 11895, '<td valign="top">good shot but a lighter background would let her hair show better</td>', 'good shot but a lighter background would let her hair show better', '2004-06-30 14:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(787273, 86060, 11895, '<td valign="top">a very good protrait, love the color in his shirt but maybe crop it at about the second button from the top so it doesn''t compete for your viewer''s attention quite so much.   I think a slightly lighter background color would have improved this,  his head doesn''t really stant out and loses definition.</td>', 'a very good protrait, love the color in his shirt but maybe crop it at about the second button from the top so it doesn''t compete for your viewer''s attention quite so much.   I think a slightly lighter background color would have improved this,  his head doesn''t really stant out and loses definition.', '2004-06-30 14:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(787275, 86229, 4007, '<td valign="top">The background is excellent and the shot is well composed/lit etc.  I''m not sure if your model has a lazy eye or if this photo just makes it look that way, but it is a bit distracting.</td>', 'The background is excellent and the shot is well composed/lit etc.  I''m not sure if your model has a lazy eye or if this photo just makes it look that way, but it is a bit distracting.', '2004-06-30 14:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(787282, 86089, 4007, '<td valign="top">Putting all that info in the title is a bit unnecessary.  The shot is awesome though.</td>', 'Putting all that info in the title is a bit unnecessary.  The shot is awesome though.', '2004-06-30 14:31:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(787290, 85970, 11895, '<td valign="top">nice shirt,  would like to see a slightly lighter background</td>', 'nice shirt,  would like to see a slightly lighter background', '2004-06-30 14:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(787301, 86107, 11895, '<td valign="top">I like this but since it''s an advanced rules challenge you could have cloned out that small shiny spot on her nose</td>', 'I like this but since it''s an advanced rules challenge you could have cloned out that small shiny spot on her nose', '2004-06-30 14:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(787309, 86199, 9821, '<td valign="top">Nice smile, pretty woman ... unfortunately, the big white thing in the background is kind of distracting.</td>', 'Nice smile, pretty woman ... unfortunately, the big white thing in the background is kind of distracting.', '2004-06-30 14:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787313, 85265, 9821, '<td valign="top">She looks more sad than ponderous, but that''s not important, I guess. The light is good, nice eyes ... but I''m not sure about her hair.</td>', 'She looks more sad than ponderous, but that''s not important, I guess. The light is good, nice eyes ... but I''m not sure about her hair.', '2004-06-30 14:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(787316, 85693, 9821, '<td valign="top">Nice color, makes me smile ... but it kind of looks like her head is floating rather than attached to a neck. Very cool earrings.</td>', 'Nice color, makes me smile ... but it kind of looks like her head is floating rather than attached to a neck. Very cool earrings.', '2004-06-30 14:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(787318, 85934, 2764, '<td valign="top">Great face! great triangluar composition!  Lots of wonderful leading lines, cheeks, arms, shirt folds, makes a nice flow for the viewers eyes.  lighting is a bit harsh and I find the cloth under his elbows distracting.  also that dip in his next commands too much attention, soften it out?</td>', 'Great face! great triangluar composition!  Lots of wonderful leading lines, cheeks, arms, shirt folds, makes a nice flow for the viewers eyes.  lighting is a bit harsh and I find the cloth under his elbows distracting.  also that dip in his next commands too much attention, soften it out?', '2004-06-30 14:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(787319, 86309, 11895, '<td valign="top">lovely shot, but I wish I could see her face a little better; some light, not a lot, from her right would have shown her face and the rose better</td>', 'lovely shot, but I wish I could see her face a little better; some light, not a lot, from her right would have shown her face and the rose better', '2004-06-30 14:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(787323, 85972, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think I would move her to the lft a little and leave an uneven amount of black.  whatever she is staring at or thinking about is also part of the image and he needs some room too.  The extra negative space on the right implys that there is another part to her life, but the extra negative space on the left is just extra space and doesn''t contribute.  try it</td>', 'I think I would move her to the lft a little and leave an uneven amount of black.  whatever she is staring at or thinking about is also part of the image and he needs some room too.  The extra negative space on the right implys that there is another part to her life, but the extra negative space on the left is just extra space and doesn''t contribute.  try it', '2004-06-30 14:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(787324, 86316, 9821, '<td valign="top">The lights looks maybe in wrong place (shining brightly on only one shoulder) - and maybe a little stiff.</td>', 'The lights looks maybe in wrong place (shining brightly on only one shoulder) - and maybe a little stiff.', '2004-06-30 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(787330, 85629, 9821, '<td valign="top">So much hair in front of her face is distracting to me. Awesome color eye ... kinda wish she was smiling.</td>', 'So much hair in front of her face is distracting to me. Awesome color eye ... kinda wish she was smiling.', '2004-06-30 14:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(787333, 86125, 9821, '<td valign="top">:) Looks like a Norman Rockwell painting ... very cool. Light source is a little bright.</td>', ':) Looks like a Norman Rockwell painting ... very cool. Light source is a little bright.', '2004-06-30 14:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(787337, 86306, 9821, '<td valign="top">This shot is odd to me - I can''t help but wonder why he isn''t wearing a shirt? Also, the bright guitar draws attention away from his face a little.</td>', 'This shot is odd to me - I can''t help but wonder why he isn''t wearing a shirt? Also, the bright guitar draws attention away from his face a little.', '2004-06-30 14:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(787342, 86095, 9821, '<td valign="top">Focus doesn''t look sharp and it''s a little noisy, but I think the lighting is good.</td>', 'Focus doesn''t look sharp and it''s a little noisy, but I think the lighting is good.', '2004-06-30 14:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(787343, 86046, 9821, '<td valign="top">I think a reflector on the right would have taken away a little of the harshness on the left. The shadows are just a little too dark.</td>', 'I think a reflector on the right would have taken away a little of the harshness on the left. The shadows are just a little too dark.', '2004-06-30 14:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787349, 86243, 9821, '<td valign="top">she seems sad to be posing ... a smile would have brightened this photo right up.</td>', 'she seems sad to be posing ... a smile would have brightened this photo right up.', '2004-06-30 14:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(787353, 86276, 9821, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to say ... I can''t figure this one out. Her eyes are closed. She''s hiding behind her hair and blowing on a lolly pop. Maybe I''m looking too deep, but I don''t get it.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to say ... I can''t figure this one out. Her eyes are closed. She''s hiding behind her hair and blowing on a lolly pop. Maybe I''m looking too deep, but I don''t get it.', '2004-06-30 14:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(787357, 86279, 9821, '<td valign="top">Excellent first attempt. She looks happy. There''s a strange shadow from her nose, but it''s not terrible. Nice job.</td>', 'Excellent first attempt. She looks happy. There''s a strange shadow from her nose, but it''s not terrible. Nice job.', '2004-06-30 14:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(787360, 86076, 9821, '<td valign="top">The light seems a bit off as it has created hot spots on the right of the frame above and below. I think you were going for soft focus, but it looks more out of focus than soft. She looks pretty.</td>', 'The light seems a bit off as it has created hot spots on the right of the frame above and below. I think you were going for soft focus, but it looks more out of focus than soft. She looks pretty.', '2004-06-30 15:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(787364, 85334, 9821, '<td valign="top">Well, he''s smiling :) The background is a little distracting.</td>', 'Well, he''s smiling :) The background is a little distracting.', '2004-06-30 15:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(787366, 86228, 9821, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes, good light. Her nose cuts off her eye a little and there''s too much space on the top of the frame, but it''s good.</td>', 'Nice eyes, good light. Her nose cuts off her eye a little and there''s too much space on the top of the frame, but it''s good.', '2004-06-30 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(787370, 86281, 11895, '<td valign="top">seems a bit dark toward the top of the pic, maybe you could have cropped off about half of the space above her head</td>', 'seems a bit dark toward the top of the pic, maybe you could have cropped off about half of the space above her head', '2004-06-30 15:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(787374, 86060, 9821, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming you must be the brother Dave :) I think the lighting is good, but man ... you guys have the loudest shirts ever.</td>', 'I''m assuming you must be the brother Dave :) I think the lighting is good, but man ... you guys have the loudest shirts ever.', '2004-06-30 15:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(787377, 85816, 9821, '<td valign="top">it''s creative ... no doubt about it</td>', 'it''s creative ... no doubt about it', '2004-06-30 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(787379, 85498, 9821, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems great, but the background is distracting.</td>', 'Lighting seems great, but the background is distracting.', '2004-06-30 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(787380, 85897, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice shot but a stretch for the challenge that depends on it''s title, I think you tried to put too much into this photo</td>', 'very nice shot but a stretch for the challenge that depends on it''s title, I think you tried to put too much into this photo', '2004-06-30 15:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(787381, 86248, 9821, '<td valign="top">she looks pissed off ... very nice eyes</td>', 'she looks pissed off ... very nice eyes', '2004-06-30 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(787384, 86075, 9821, '<td valign="top">plain white background seems out of place and takes away from the whole.</td>', 'plain white background seems out of place and takes away from the whole.', '2004-06-30 15:08:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(787389, 85623, 9821, '<td valign="top">Harsh light ... beautiful woman.</td>', 'Harsh light ... beautiful woman.', '2004-06-30 15:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
