(787433, 85334, 14593, '<td valign="top">nice sharp focus on the face...I tried to photograph a dog of this breed, and I found it difficult......the head kept looking distorted compared to the rest of the long short body...I like the angle and your approach here</td>', 'nice sharp focus on the face...I tried to photograph a dog of this breed, and I found it difficult......the head kept looking distorted compared to the rest of the long short body...I like the angle and your approach here', '2004-06-30 15:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
