(787580, 86229, 23454, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful, timeless photograph! Wonderful job. My only complaint is that her face is so shadowed. I like the backlighting, but a soft glow on her face would have made it perfect.</td>', 'This is a beautiful, timeless photograph! Wonderful job. My only complaint is that her face is so shadowed. I like the backlighting, but a soft glow on her face would have made it perfect.', '2004-06-30 16:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(787581, 85893, 15920, '<td valign="top">If the idea of taking a portrait is to capture a little of the model''s personality, you hammered this.  Colors, expression, context are all excellent.  A slightly sharper focus would have gotten a 9 or 10.  As is, 8 and a recomendation to save this picture for a long time to enjoy.</td>', 'If the idea of taking a portrait is to capture a little of the model''s personality, you hammered this.  Colors, expression, context are all excellent.  A slightly sharper focus would have gotten a 9 or 10.  As is, 8 and a recomendation to save this picture for a long time to enjoy.', '2004-06-30 16:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(787585, 86228, 23454, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great potrait. The focus, lighting and exposure are all well done. However, there is too much space at the top of the photo. If she were better centered, the photo would look much nicer.</td>', 'I think this is a great potrait. The focus, lighting and exposure are all well done. However, there is too much space at the top of the photo. If she were better centered, the photo would look much nicer.', '2004-06-30 16:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
