(787814, 86089, 16004, '<td valign="top">i won''t mention the title.  i won''t.  honest.  the photo:  very nice!  the pose seems a bit awkward, and not wanting to seem rude to the groom, but the bride is a bit more composed, and i think would be as if not more striking on her own. particularly photogenic.  i like what you did in terms of editting.  did you use PS for a cross processed look by any chance? (i''m teasing!)  it''s still a very nice drama-rich shot, very appealing.  8.  and a bit of brevity in title department might be nice.</td>', 'i won''t mention the title.  i won''t.  honest.  the photo:  very nice!  the pose seems a bit awkward, and not wanting to seem rude to the groom, but the bride is a bit more composed, and i think would be as if not more striking on her own. particularly photogenic.  i like what you did in terms of editting.  did you use PS for a cross processed look by any chance? (i''m teasing!)  it''s still a very nice drama-rich shot, very appealing.  8.  and a bit of brevity in title department might be nice.', '2004-06-30 17:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(787822, 85718, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like the semi-messed up hair, gives it a realistic look. It''s like a portrait of someone in real life, not just a set-up perfect model. I think the lighting could be a bit better.</td>', 'I like the semi-messed up hair, gives it a realistic look. It''s like a portrait of someone in real life, not just a set-up perfect model. I think the lighting could be a bit better.', '2004-06-30 18:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(787826, 86134, 16004, '<td valign="top">very nice well taken shot.  definately looks professional.  looks like it''s had a touch of post shot softening, but it''s been done to a gentle level and works really well.  kid has a good expression, and is very photogenic.  i think a coloured background might have given greater definition for her hair (kind of dissappears behind her ear), but it still works.  my fourth (and last) ten of the week.</td>', 'very nice well taken shot.  definately looks professional.  looks like it''s had a touch of post shot softening, but it''s been done to a gentle level and works really well.  kid has a good expression, and is very photogenic.  i think a coloured background might have given greater definition for her hair (kind of dissappears behind her ear), but it still works.  my fourth (and last) ten of the week.', '2004-06-30 18:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(787845, 85790, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is an interesting composition.  the clothing is very period, and i think it would have suited an B&amp;W / sepia type aged look very well (but obviously wouldn''t fit the challenge).  i like the lighting, and i like how she''s off-centre.  i''m not all that keen on the background - it''s just too oppressing because there is too much black.  i''m also not too sure that for a portrait, looking up to the left while face is at the camera works too well.  minor other thing (something i''ve been told off for too) the clasp from the necklace seems a bit distracting - putting it behind her neck might help.  what this does have though is ample style and a fair amount of flair and originality.  from me, it gets a 7</td>', 'this is an interesting composition.  the clothing is very period, and i think it would have suited an B&W / sepia type aged look very well (but obviously wouldn''t fit the challenge).  i like the lighting, and i like how she''s off-centre.  i''m not all that keen on the background - it''s just too oppressing because there is too much black.  i''m also not too sure that for a portrait, looking up to the left while face is at the camera works too well.  minor other thing (something i''ve been told off for too) the clasp from the necklace seems a bit distracting - putting it behind her neck might help.  what this does have though is ample style and a fair amount of flair and originality.  from me, it gets a 7', '2004-06-30 18:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(787854, 85623, 16004, '<td valign="top">right, easy one this.  beautiful model, great lighting, fantastic DOF (i love the greyish blurry backdrop), great pose and great cropping. perhaps a little too much softening?  dunno, left eyebrow seems less defined than the right one.  maybe that''s due to the lighting though...   still, very good - 9</td>', 'right, easy one this.  beautiful model, great lighting, fantastic DOF (i love the greyish blurry backdrop), great pose and great cropping. perhaps a little too much softening?  dunno, left eyebrow seems less defined than the right one.  maybe that''s due to the lighting though...   still, very good - 9', '2004-06-30 18:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(787855, 86147, 7291, '<td valign="top">I think the crop here is too "in your face."  There also appears to be a slight color cast.</td>', 'I think the crop here is too "in your face."  There also appears to be a slight color cast.', '2004-06-30 18:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(787858, 85334, 16004, '<td valign="top">SO cute.  there nothing wrong with portraits of doggies, and this is especially well done.  i love that his face is so sharp, and the background less well-defined - gives a conception of real depth.  not entirelt sure you''ve conveyed a taken-in-the-studio type shot, but in all, very nice.  also, perhaps a smidgeon too much couch is visible at the top (slightly tighter crop needed).  still, a cute and characterful shot.  7.</td>', 'SO cute.  there nothing wrong with portraits of doggies, and this is especially well done.  i love that his face is so sharp, and the background less well-defined - gives a conception of real depth.  not entirelt sure you''ve conveyed a taken-in-the-studio type shot, but in all, very nice.  also, perhaps a smidgeon too much couch is visible at the top (slightly tighter crop needed).  still, a cute and characterful shot.  7.', '2004-06-30 18:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(787861, 85241, 7291, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and beautiful girl.  I like the nice even lighting but, for some reason, I feel the mouth being open a little bit distracts a little.  Just knit-picking.</td>', 'Beautiful image and beautiful girl.  I like the nice even lighting but, for some reason, I feel the mouth being open a little bit distracts a little.  Just knit-picking.', '2004-06-30 18:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(787864, 86199, 9668, '<td valign="top">The train in the background is a bit distracting, but it also make the title. Doesn''t seem as much of a studio setup as it does a candid. But it still a nice shot. I like the reflections in the sunglasses.</td>', 'The train in the background is a bit distracting, but it also make the title. Doesn''t seem as much of a studio setup as it does a candid. But it still a nice shot. I like the reflections in the sunglasses.', '2004-06-30 18:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(787865, 86276, 7291, '<td valign="top">It seems like the WB if off a little bit.  No big deal though.</td>', 'It seems like the WB if off a little bit.  No big deal though.', '2004-06-30 18:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
