(787892, 85554, 15920, '<td valign="top">Most helpful suggestion I can think of for this is that the pose is very traditional and that it is hard to generate a "wow" factor with a standard pose.  This is a well done portrait that is up against some great ones.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Most helpful suggestion I can think of for this is that the pose is very traditional and that it is hard to generate a "wow" factor with a standard pose.  This is a well done portrait that is up against some great ones.  Best of luck.', '2004-06-30 18:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
