(787949, 86316, 7291, '<td valign="top">The white balance seems off.  I can see the yellow cast from the lights above and the bue-ish cast on the face from the flash.  This will happen with incorrect white balance.</td>', 'The white balance seems off.  I can see the yellow cast from the lights above and the bue-ish cast on the face from the flash.  This will happen with incorrect white balance.', '2004-06-30 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(787950, 85923, 16004, '<td valign="top">excellent - i like the brightness of the shot, and it''s technically great - sharp, and nicely noise-free.  it''s an especially good, expressive picture that will do well.  9.</td>', 'excellent - i like the brightness of the shot, and it''s technically great - sharp, and nicely noise-free.  it''s an especially good, expressive picture that will do well.  9.', '2004-06-30 18:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(787952, 86213, 12802, '<td valign="top">More a self portrait me thinks :-) <br/> <br/>I really like this shot, the lighting is perfect, negative space is great, the different tones captured in the skin are great, I imagine a blue ribbon coming your way soon :-)  Well done, a perfect portrait shot to be proud of!</td>', 'More a self portrait me thinks :-)  I really like this shot, the lighting is perfect, negative space is great, the different tones captured in the skin are great, I imagine a blue ribbon coming your way soon :-)  Well done, a perfect portrait shot to be proud of!', '2004-06-30 18:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
