(787957, 86213, 7291, '<td valign="top">Let me guess.....home-made softbox?  hehe.  Just kidding.  One of the better portraits in this challenge.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Let me guess.....home-made softbox?  hehe.  Just kidding.  One of the better portraits in this challenge.  Excellent work.', '2004-06-30 18:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
