(787964, 86313, 7291, '<td valign="top">This would have been perfect with better focus.  I''m sure you''ve already heard this but the focus is on his hands and shirt rather than his eyes.</td>', 'This would have been perfect with better focus.  I''m sure you''ve already heard this but the focus is on his hands and shirt rather than his eyes.', '2004-06-30 18:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
