(787971, 85241, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like the pose and the expression.  Her skin seems just a tad light, and I hesitate to suggest this for a teenager, but a touch more makeup might help bring in the skin tones.  The hair is perfect.</td>', 'I like the pose and the expression.  Her skin seems just a tad light, and I hesitate to suggest this for a teenager, but a touch more makeup might help bring in the skin tones.  The hair is perfect.', '2004-06-30 18:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
