(787996, 86140, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great pose and facial expression.  The might be just a little too much light on her right arm and forehead.  But, that might just be the contrast from the dark outfit, I''m not good enough at portraits to know.  I hope you do well with this shot, as it is very well done overall.</td>', 'Great pose and facial expression.  The might be just a little too much light on her right arm and forehead.  But, that might just be the contrast from the dark outfit, I''m not good enough at portraits to know.  I hope you do well with this shot, as it is very well done overall.', '2004-06-30 18:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
