(788008, 86262, 9668, '<td valign="top">This picture is a little bit freaky too me.  The soft focus works well. What''s on her arms? It could be a bit bigger as well</td>', 'This picture is a little bit freaky too me.  The soft focus works well. What''s on her arms? It could be a bit bigger as well', '2004-06-30 19:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
