(788012, 85893, 7291, '<td valign="top">What a smile.  This looks like an advertisement.</td>', 'What a smile.  This looks like an advertisement.', '2004-06-30 19:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(788013, 85897, 15920, '<td valign="top">That background idea is so clever, I think it distracts a little from the portrait, which is very well done on its own: good choice of dark shirt to balance the light skin tones, great expression, and good pose.  -8</td>', 'That background idea is so clever, I think it distracts a little from the portrait, which is very well done on its own: good choice of dark shirt to balance the light skin tones, great expression, and good pose.  -8', '2004-06-30 19:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(788014, 86060, 22293, '<td valign="top">Am I the first to make the Dan-Akroyd-lookalike-comment?  Not a ribbon winner for me (seems a bit dark), but above average in my book.</td>', 'Am I the first to make the Dan-Akroyd-lookalike-comment?  Not a ribbon winner for me (seems a bit dark), but above average in my book.', '2004-06-30 19:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(788018, 86134, 14053, '<td valign="top">Very well done   I like the warm light</td>', 'Very well done   I like the warm light', '2004-06-30 19:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(788021, 86130, 7291, '<td valign="top">Did mom ever tell you that your face will stick if you do that?  LOL!</td>', 'Did mom ever tell you that your face will stick if you do that?  LOL!', '2004-06-30 19:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(788026, 85273, 7291, '<td valign="top">Oh no, here we go.  You''ve probably received a million "10"s simply for the cute factor.  This is so sweet my teeth hurt!  Wow, look at those eyes.  Anyway, my only gripe is that there is too much of the face that is soft.  But that''s it.  10</td>', 'Oh no, here we go.  You''ve probably received a million "10"s simply for the cute factor.  This is so sweet my teeth hurt!  Wow, look at those eyes.  Anyway, my only gripe is that there is too much of the face that is soft.  But that''s it.  10', '2004-06-30 19:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(788027, 86228, 22293, '<td valign="top">My favorite thus far (not to worry, I''m close to the end)!  Not only did you meet the challenge well, the pose and model are outstanding.  I''m drawn right to those blue eyes, which do so well in conveying emotion.  Great work.</td>', 'My favorite thus far (not to worry, I''m close to the end)!  Not only did you meet the challenge well, the pose and model are outstanding.  I''m drawn right to those blue eyes, which do so well in conveying emotion.  Great work.', '2004-06-30 19:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(788033, 86279, 22293, '<td valign="top">I''d have gone in for a closer shot, and/or cropped the one here further.  Love the pose and expression.</td>', 'I''d have gone in for a closer shot, and/or cropped the one here further.  Love the pose and expression.', '2004-06-30 19:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(788035, 86095, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like everythng about this except the grain.  The pose is great and the expression matches the title perfectly.</td>', 'I like everythng about this except the grain.  The pose is great and the expression matches the title perfectly.', '2004-06-30 19:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(788042, 85972, 22293, '<td valign="top">Top 3 shot.  Love it.</td>', 'Top 3 shot.  Love it.', '2004-06-30 19:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(788047, 86282, 14053, '<td valign="top">What studio would do this</td>', 'What studio would do this', '2004-06-30 19:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(788076, 86134, 15920, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nearly perfect child portrait.  Personally, I wouldn''t have used wet hair, but that is a small suggestion.  You made the skin tones look perfect, and that is what creates the Wow factor I think.</td>', 'I think this is a nearly perfect child portrait.  Personally, I wouldn''t have used wet hair, but that is a small suggestion.  You made the skin tones look perfect, and that is what creates the Wow factor I think.', '2004-06-30 19:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(788082, 86248, 15920, '<td valign="top">Having the eyes match the background adds a lot to this image.  It offsets the somber look on the model quite nicely.</td>', 'Having the eyes match the background adds a lot to this image.  It offsets the somber look on the model quite nicely.', '2004-06-30 19:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(788097, 86140, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice work. An attractive, unusual looking person shot in a confrontational kind of way. One hand may have been better offset somewhere else to counter the symmetry slightly and take some emhasis away from them as they are the brightest elements in the shot.<br/> <br/>Looks like NeatImage has been at work here since this is super-clean - but it''s very strong.</td>', 'Nice work. An attractive, unusual looking person shot in a confrontational kind of way. One hand may have been better offset somewhere else to counter the symmetry slightly and take some emhasis away from them as they are the brightest elements in the shot. Looks like NeatImage has been at work here since this is super-clean - but it''s very strong.', '2004-06-30 19:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(788098, 86099, 8860, '<td valign="top">Flattering angle, beautiful face, great composition. Yellow cast is a bit overpowering (I understand the blonde emphasis) but overall a lovely image. This little angel reminds me of a shot by Louison (the same perhaps??!). :)</td>', 'Flattering angle, beautiful face, great composition. Yellow cast is a bit overpowering (I understand the blonde emphasis) but overall a lovely image. This little angel reminds me of a shot by Louison (the same perhaps??!). :)', '2004-06-30 19:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(788099, 85816, 8860, '<td valign="top">Obviously a strong image and a well taken shot. Composition suits the theme well with good environment. Should do well - probably in the ribbons. Hostage is quite well dressed though, so a bit more dishevellment would be a nice touch.</td>', 'Obviously a strong image and a well taken shot. Composition suits the theme well with good environment. Should do well - probably in the ribbons. Hostage is quite well dressed though, so a bit more dishevellment would be a nice touch.', '2004-06-30 19:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(788110, 85970, 8860, '<td valign="top">This really needs directional lighting. The flash is harsh and has created tight shadowing. He''s obviously a nice guy though so a warmer background would probably suit his character more. That shirt is deafening!</td>', 'This really needs directional lighting. The flash is harsh and has created tight shadowing. He''s obviously a nice guy though so a warmer background would probably suit his character more. That shirt is deafening!', '2004-06-30 20:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(788118, 85612, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think in a portrait the eyes should be a center of focus.  Her eyes are nice and bright with good catch light but they are they same brightness as her finger tips,  Well, it is a nice french manicure but unless she was the manicurist or particularly values her hands, I think the fingernails command too much importance.  The best light falls on her hand also and the jewelry is ver interesting,  That leaves her face with a secondary importance.  What about cropping just below her knuckles, that looks more balanced to me and makes her lovely face stand out.  I do like the way you have left more space on the left, leaving room for her gaze to be part of the picture.  Maybe the white balance is too pink?</td>', 'I think in a portrait the eyes should be a center of focus.  Her eyes are nice and bright with good catch light but they are they same brightness as her finger tips,  Well, it is a nice french manicure but unless she was the manicurist or particularly values her hands, I think the fingernails command too much importance.  The best light falls on her hand also and the jewelry is ver interesting,  That leaves her face with a secondary importance.  What about cropping just below her knuckles, that looks more balanced to me and makes her lovely face stand out.  I do like the way you have left more space on the left, leaving room for her gaze to be part of the picture.  Maybe the white balance is too pink?', '2004-06-30 20:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(788119, 86305, 15920, '<td valign="top">This has got to be one of the most fun shots in the competition.  The title really works as well. More definition on the eyes might have helped a little.</td>', 'This has got to be one of the most fun shots in the competition.  The title really works as well. More definition on the eyes might have helped a little.', '2004-06-30 20:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(788123, 85623, 16493, '<td valign="top">this one will finnish in top 10</td>', 'this one will finnish in top 10', '2004-06-30 20:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(788125, 85265, 2764, '<td valign="top">First - your title needs to be changed. perhaps English isn''t your first language.  The dictionary definiton of ponderous is 1 : of very great weight  2 : unwieldy or clumsy because of weight and size<br/>3 : oppressively or unpleasantly dull.  An elephant might be ponderous but I think you meant thoughtful.  <br/>Second, the picture is wonderful.  (actually it does have some weight of sadness to it) The lighting is perfect, the mood is so strong, ugh- to be a teenager again, no thanks.</td>', 'First - your title needs to be changed. perhaps English isn''t your first language.  The dictionary definiton of ponderous is 1 : of very great weight  2 : unwieldy or clumsy because of weight and size3 : oppressively or unpleasantly dull.  An elephant might be ponderous but I think you meant thoughtful.  Second, the picture is wonderful.  (actually it does have some weight of sadness to it) The lighting is perfect, the mood is so strong, ugh- to be a teenager again, no thanks.', '2004-06-30 20:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(788132, 86075, 2764, '<td valign="top">Wonderful portrait. Tells a great story.  reminds me of Lassie.  Is the whole picture tilted slightly to the right?  Would it look better straighter?  I like the muted tones. Sometimes if you take the sponge tool and saturate the color only on his eyes it gives the face a bit of a focus.</td>', 'Wonderful portrait. Tells a great story.  reminds me of Lassie.  Is the whole picture tilted slightly to the right?  Would it look better straighter?  I like the muted tones. Sometimes if you take the sponge tool and saturate the color only on his eyes it gives the face a bit of a focus.', '2004-06-30 20:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(788133, 86213, 16493, '<td valign="top">this one will be near the top</td>', 'this one will be near the top', '2004-06-30 20:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(788148, 86287, 16493, '<td valign="top">needs a bit more light</td>', 'needs a bit more light', '2004-06-30 20:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(788157, 86307, 15920, '<td valign="top">The soft focus doesn''t help this in my opinion, but everything else is quite good.</td>', 'The soft focus doesn''t help this in my opinion, but everything else is quite good.', '2004-06-30 20:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(788164, 86089, 18349, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key effect of this shot.  The pose is interesting, and the bride has a dramatic beauty about her.  The groom''s head tends to disappear into the BG, however...which is a little distracting.  His shoulders and back also appear to have been in motion or something...but this is still a good effort.  :o)</td>', 'I like the high-key effect of this shot.  The pose is interesting, and the bride has a dramatic beauty about her.  The groom''s head tends to disappear into the BG, however...which is a little distracting.  His shoulders and back also appear to have been in motion or something...but this is still a good effort.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(788168, 85284, 18349, '<td valign="top">I have to be honest and say that I have mixed emotions about this shot.  The lighting and soft focus are beautiful, but I am confused about the implied nudity of what appears to be a rather young woman...and that is a bit off-putting.  I could be way off base, and she could very well be a grown woman, but she does look rather youthful.  Aside from that, it is a visually interesting portrait.</td>', 'I have to be honest and say that I have mixed emotions about this shot.  The lighting and soft focus are beautiful, but I am confused about the implied nudity of what appears to be a rather young woman...and that is a bit off-putting.  I could be way off base, and she could very well be a grown woman, but she does look rather youthful.  Aside from that, it is a visually interesting portrait.', '2004-06-30 20:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(788169, 86243, 15920, '<td valign="top">A little sharper focus on the eyes and a little less depth of field would have made this much stronger competition entry given the competition.  As a general portrait, I like this alot, and think that the background and dress color work really well together.</td>', 'A little sharper focus on the eyes and a little less depth of field would have made this much stronger competition entry given the competition.  As a general portrait, I like this alot, and think that the background and dress color work really well together.', '2004-06-30 20:27:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(788170, 86277, 18349, '<td valign="top">I really like this portrait...the setting is great.  The pose appears natural, and I like the "smirk" kind of grin rather than a posed smile.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'I really like this portrait...the setting is great.  The pose appears natural, and I like the "smirk" kind of grin rather than a posed smile.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(788171, 86229, 18349, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo...love the soft focus.  I do find her gaze a bit distracting, as I wonder what she''s looking at rather than the camera.  Beautiful lighting.  :o)</td>', 'Gorgeous photo...love the soft focus.  I do find her gaze a bit distracting, as I wonder what she''s looking at rather than the camera.  Beautiful lighting.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(788176, 85934, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a near-perfect portrait, IMHO.  Lighting is excellent, pose is great, focus, color, etc. is simply well done.   A very distinguished looking gentleman, too!  Great effort.  :o)</td>', 'This is a near-perfect portrait, IMHO.  Lighting is excellent, pose is great, focus, color, etc. is simply well done.   A very distinguished looking gentleman, too!  Great effort.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(788178, 86115, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love this one...the background is fabulous and interesting without being a distraction, and the pose is great as well.  I do wish the left knee weren''t cut off, but aside from that, it''s great.  Model is very striking...kinda wish he was smiling a bit more, but that serious look is fitting as well.  :o)</td>', 'I love this one...the background is fabulous and interesting without being a distraction, and the pose is great as well.  I do wish the left knee weren''t cut off, but aside from that, it''s great.  Model is very striking...kinda wish he was smiling a bit more, but that serious look is fitting as well.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(788179, 86315, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, pose, color, focus, etc. etc. etc.  Just simply well done.  :o)</td>', 'Nice lighting, pose, color, focus, etc. etc. etc.  Just simply well done.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(788181, 85623, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait indeed. Composition is excellent, and the lighting is very fitting for the mood.  Wonderful job.  :o)</td>', 'Very nice portrait indeed. Composition is excellent, and the lighting is very fitting for the mood.  Wonderful job.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(788183, 86307, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice job on this one.  I am a bit distracted by the dark area in the top left, but aside from that, beautifully done.  Maybe a tad too much gaussian blur, but not enough to sway my opinion.  :o)</td>', 'Nice job on this one.  I am a bit distracted by the dark area in the top left, but aside from that, beautifully done.  Maybe a tad too much gaussian blur, but not enough to sway my opinion.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(788185, 86275, 18349, '<td valign="top">The lighting, focus, and color in this portrait are all fine, but I don''t particularly care for the pose and the dead-on center composition.  Her hands are in a bit of an awkward pose, and they are casting a shadow across her chin.  You are on the right track, however.  Good effort.  :o)  PS...had to add that I just figured out she is holding something...a book perhaps?  It would look less awkward if it were more visible IMHO.  :o)</td>', 'The lighting, focus, and color in this portrait are all fine, but I don''t particularly care for the pose and the dead-on center composition.  Her hands are in a bit of an awkward pose, and they are casting a shadow across her chin.  You are on the right track, however.  Good effort.  :o)  PS...had to add that I just figured out she is holding something...a book perhaps?  It would look less awkward if it were more visible IMHO.  :o)', '2004-06-30 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(788246, 86287, 17837, '<td valign="top">Very very dark shot. I think this shot would have potential had it not been so dark.</td>', 'Very very dark shot. I think this shot would have potential had it not been so dark.', '2004-06-30 21:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(788248, 85938, 17837, '<td valign="top">Very well composed. Great color. All around a wonderful shot. I wouldnt be suprised to see this top 10.</td>', 'Very well composed. Great color. All around a wonderful shot. I wouldnt be suprised to see this top 10.', '2004-06-30 21:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(788252, 86262, 17837, '<td valign="top">Very out of focus. Harsh lighting.</td>', 'Very out of focus. Harsh lighting.', '2004-06-30 21:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(788253, 86271, 17837, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.</td>', 'Very nice shot.', '2004-06-30 21:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(788255, 86229, 17837, '<td valign="top">It seems a bit soft. I dont know if you were going for that, but I think that because she is softly focused, it sort of takes away from the picture. I do however love the church, perfect amount of blur there.</td>', 'It seems a bit soft. I dont know if you were going for that, but I think that because she is softly focused, it sort of takes away from the picture. I do however love the church, perfect amount of blur there.', '2004-06-30 21:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(788256, 86265, 17837, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a bit soft in focus.</td>', 'Seems to be a bit soft in focus.', '2004-06-30 21:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(788258, 86046, 17837, '<td valign="top">I believe that if you are going to include "the plumber" you should have had him holding some plumbing tools, If not, I would have left that part out.</td>', 'I believe that if you are going to include "the plumber" you should have had him holding some plumbing tools, If not, I would have left that part out.', '2004-06-30 21:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(788259, 86314, 17837, '<td valign="top">the background is very distracting, especially around where her dark hair meets the wood table.</td>', 'the background is very distracting, especially around where her dark hair meets the wood table.', '2004-06-30 21:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(788263, 86147, 17837, '<td valign="top">This doesnt really portray a studio shot in my opinion. The crop is extremely tight. I would have zoomed out a bit, to include at the least, the rest of his head and probably his shoulders.</td>', 'This doesnt really portray a studio shot in my opinion. The crop is extremely tight. I would have zoomed out a bit, to include at the least, the rest of his head and probably his shoulders.', '2004-06-30 21:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(788265, 85780, 17837, '<td valign="top">The hat seems to cut off his head...</td>', 'The hat seems to cut off his head...', '2004-06-30 21:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(788266, 86313, 17837, '<td valign="top">Did you use a fisheye on this?<br/> <br/>His head looks way out of propotion with his body.</td>', 'Did you use a fisheye on this? His head looks way out of propotion with his body.', '2004-06-30 21:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(788275, 85923, 21154, '<td valign="top">Lovely</td>', 'Lovely', '2004-06-30 22:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(788278, 86103, 21154, '<td valign="top">IS that a man??</td>', 'IS that a man??', '2004-06-30 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(788280, 86213, 11738, '<td valign="top">Another self portrait.  My, my.  Aren''t we a bit narcissistic?  Just kidding...  Love this shot.  By far one of the best.  Great high key image.  One of, if not the only one, where I find the hand actually has its place in the shot.  It shows that you have been playing with the portrait format before and are comfortable with it.  I''ll be very surprised if it doesn''t ribbon.</td>', 'Another self portrait.  My, my.  Aren''t we a bit narcissistic?  Just kidding...  Love this shot.  By far one of the best.  Great high key image.  One of, if not the only one, where I find the hand actually has its place in the shot.  It shows that you have been playing with the portrait format before and are comfortable with it.  I''ll be very surprised if it doesn''t ribbon.', '2004-06-30 22:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(788290, 86275, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice head shot, but the position of the hands looks unnatural and gives a stronger "staged" feeling to the image than it should have and gives an overall feeling of awkwardness.  However, I do like that themodel is looking over her glasses and that we don''t see any reflections.    I little more work could have removed the darkness under the eyes.</td>', 'Nice head shot, but the position of the hands looks unnatural and gives a stronger "staged" feeling to the image than it should have and gives an overall feeling of awkwardness.  However, I do like that themodel is looking over her glasses and that we don''t see any reflections.    I little more work could have removed the darkness under the eyes.', '2004-06-30 22:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(788314, 85622, 18349, '<td valign="top">The pose and most of the technical aspects of this photo are fine, however, I find the lighting to be a bit flat and dim on my monitor.  I would have liked to see a bit more brightness in the face, possibly the catchlights in the eyes.  I understand that with glasses, that is extremely difficult to pull off effectively.  It is nice as it stands, but could be better with some lighting adjustment.  Good effort.  :o)</td>', 'The pose and most of the technical aspects of this photo are fine, however, I find the lighting to be a bit flat and dim on my monitor.  I would have liked to see a bit more brightness in the face, possibly the catchlights in the eyes.  I understand that with glasses, that is extremely difficult to pull off effectively.  It is nice as it stands, but could be better with some lighting adjustment.  Good effort.  :o)', '2004-06-30 22:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(788315, 85938, 23673, '<td valign="top">Best photo I''ve seen today!</td>', 'Best photo I''ve seen today!', '2004-06-30 22:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(788317, 85865, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is another one of my favorites...it''s well composed, lighting is effective, focus is good, and colors are complimentary.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'This is another one of my favorites...it''s well composed, lighting is effective, focus is good, and colors are complimentary.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-06-30 22:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(788318, 86309, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  I love the almost-Victorian or maybe Italian renaissance feel of this photo.  Lighting is excellent, focus and colors are good.  Nice job!  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful image.  I love the almost-Victorian or maybe Italian renaissance feel of this photo.  Lighting is excellent, focus and colors are good.  Nice job!  :o)', '2004-06-30 22:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(788319, 86134, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  I like the soft lighting and the focus.  I am a bit distracted by the shadow on her right eye and cheek, and her hair tends to blend in with the background.  Nonetheless, it is a beautiful image.  :o)</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  I like the soft lighting and the focus.  I am a bit distracted by the shadow on her right eye and cheek, and her hair tends to blend in with the background.  Nonetheless, it is a beautiful image.  :o)', '2004-06-30 22:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(788324, 86103, 9747, '<td valign="top">I can'' t say I like the borders, they threw me off. Maybe make them more subtle (not so ragged)? In my opinion, the large empty area is quite distracting, but then again it does help focus the attention on the models. Great models, costume, and posture, they give the picture an authentic and antiquated feel, as if an old picture was painted over with color paint. Cool effect!</td>', 'I can'' t say I like the borders, they threw me off. Maybe make them more subtle (not so ragged)? In my opinion, the large empty area is quite distracting, but then again it does help focus the attention on the models. Great models, costume, and posture, they give the picture an authentic and antiquated feel, as if an old picture was painted over with color paint. Cool effect!', '2004-06-30 22:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(788329, 85816, 14448, '<td valign="top">Great mood, interesting composition and lighting.  Is it a portrait though?</td>', 'Great mood, interesting composition and lighting.  Is it a portrait though?', '2004-06-30 23:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(788340, 86271, 9747, '<td valign="top">Hey, cute kid! Blue shirt on blue background doesn''t really help bring out the main subject (the boy). Perhaps a darker background might help. The wrinkled floor is distracting. Also, the boy and the drum are tilting to the right... needs to be straightened. The drum is an unique and excellent prop! All in all, a very good portrait.</td>', 'Hey, cute kid! Blue shirt on blue background doesn''t really help bring out the main subject (the boy). Perhaps a darker background might help. The wrinkled floor is distracting. Also, the boy and the drum are tilting to the right... needs to be straightened. The drum is an unique and excellent prop! All in all, a very good portrait.', '2004-06-30 23:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(788343, 86197, 14448, '<td valign="top">Model''s expressive eyes and mouth capture interest.  Do facial and body skin tones mismatch a little?  Softness is a little distracting.  Would be better if the top of her head were entirely in frame.</td>', 'Model''s expressive eyes and mouth capture interest.  Do facial and body skin tones mismatch a little?  Softness is a little distracting.  Would be better if the top of her head were entirely in frame.', '2004-06-30 23:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(788349, 86279, 14448, '<td valign="top">Yea!  A portrait with some life and humour!  Focus, sharpness, colour, lighting of facial features all commendable.  Wrinkled drapery and trousers at bottom of frame are distracting; you don''t want to crop fingers though, so to fix that would require reshoot.  Might have cropped a little higher, so that her head was a little farther from top of frame.  Give that model a lollipop for a job well done!</td>', 'Yea!  A portrait with some life and humour!  Focus, sharpness, colour, lighting of facial features all commendable.  Wrinkled drapery and trousers at bottom of frame are distracting; you don''t want to crop fingers though, so to fix that would require reshoot.  Might have cropped a little higher, so that her head was a little farther from top of frame.  Give that model a lollipop for a job well done!', '2004-06-30 23:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(788360, 85956, 9747, '<td valign="top">Wish I could see the rest of the model''s face, perhaps that will help give the picture some expression? The lighting/color doesn''t agree with me (in my opinion, anyway) - less blue might be better. The picture gives out a nice surreal feeling - the reddish highlight in the eyes helped reinforce this. Very creative!</td>', 'Wish I could see the rest of the model''s face, perhaps that will help give the picture some expression? The lighting/color doesn''t agree with me (in my opinion, anyway) - less blue might be better. The picture gives out a nice surreal feeling - the reddish highlight in the eyes helped reinforce this. Very creative!', '2004-06-30 23:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(788362, 86315, 7969, '<td valign="top">nice shot eddy, what lens did you use for this shot?</td>', 'nice shot eddy, what lens did you use for this shot?', '2004-06-30 23:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(788364, 85901, 21367, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space and the lighting you used in this shot.  It adds quite a bit of emotion.   I might have cropped a little more of the negative space but this is a might nice shot.</td>', 'I like the negative space and the lighting you used in this shot.  It adds quite a bit of emotion.   I might have cropped a little more of the negative space but this is a might nice shot.', '2004-06-30 23:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(788372, 85894, 7969, '<td valign="top">another great shot jacko, very well done, I suspect you may have another ribbon coming  :  )</td>', 'another great shot jacko, very well done, I suspect you may have another ribbon coming  :  )', '2004-06-30 23:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(788388, 86130, 9747, '<td valign="top">Hehehe, I like the humorous expression! Background is great in that it is a dark/light gradation. Although I think it might look better if the area behind the model is made a bit darker in order to bring her out more. Normally I don''t go for empty space but in this case, the empty space on the right is very effective. Nicely done!</td>', 'Hehehe, I like the humorous expression! Background is great in that it is a dark/light gradation. Although I think it might look better if the area behind the model is made a bit darker in order to bring her out more. Normally I don''t go for empty space but in this case, the empty space on the right is very effective. Nicely done!', '2004-06-30 23:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(788393, 86140, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wonderful intense image.  One of my favorites.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Wonderful intense image.  One of my favorites.  Jacko.  10', '2004-06-30 23:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(788395, 86120, 2716, '<td valign="top">I like the high feel to this image.  I find the jewellery distracting.  Still an overall strong image.  Jacko.  8</td>', 'I like the high feel to this image.  I find the jewellery distracting.  Still an overall strong image.  Jacko.  8', '2004-06-30 23:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(788397, 86167, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  Her eyes are awesome and you''re made them the focus of your photo.  Great job.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Excellent.  Her eyes are awesome and you''re made them the focus of your photo.  Great job.  Jacko.  10', '2004-06-30 23:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(788402, 86312, 2716, '<td valign="top">What a cutie pie.  Maybe place your model further away from the backdrop to avoid the hard shadows.  Still a veyr effective cute pic.</td>', 'What a cutie pie.  Maybe place your model further away from the backdrop to avoid the hard shadows.  Still a veyr effective cute pic.', '2004-06-30 23:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(788405, 86115, 9747, '<td valign="top">Cool portrait, it gives me a neon/futuristic feeling - I like the varying shades of purple and lines in the background. The model looks like he is floating (since the seat is almost hidden) which reinforces the futurstic feel. My only two nitpicks are that the model should be closer to the camera, and a solid shirt instead of striped probably would''ve been better. Good, serious expression by the model, and very nice lighting!</td>', 'Cool portrait, it gives me a neon/futuristic feeling - I like the varying shades of purple and lines in the background. The model looks like he is floating (since the seat is almost hidden) which reinforces the futurstic feel. My only two nitpicks are that the model should be closer to the camera, and a solid shirt instead of striped probably would''ve been better. Good, serious expression by the model, and very nice lighting!', '2004-06-30 23:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(788411, 85334, 2716, '<td valign="top">lol.  This shot just rocks.  I love how just his head is in focus.  Thanks for sharing.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'lol.  This shot just rocks.  I love how just his head is in focus.  Thanks for sharing.  Jacko.  10', '2004-06-30 23:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(788414, 86116, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I love how her lips match the background.  The colors work well together.  Jacko.</td>', 'Wow!  I love how her lips match the background.  The colors work well together.  Jacko.', '2004-06-30 23:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(788441, 85542, 9668, '<td valign="top">But soft, what light through yonder window breaks./It is the east and Katherine is the sun. =). Sorry, I usaully don''t quote Shakespeare when voting through images. But I thought of the soft focus, then the expresiion on her face, and it could be Juliet. Random, I know. Oh, and nice picture BTW.</td>', 'But soft, what light through yonder window breaks./It is the east and Katherine is the sun. =). Sorry, I usaully don''t quote Shakespeare when voting through images. But I thought of the soft focus, then the expresiion on her face, and it could be Juliet. Random, I know. Oh, and nice picture BTW.', '2004-06-30 23:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(788448, 85816, 9668, '<td valign="top">This shot stands out to me. It isn''t a normal portrait. But it is definatly in color, and looks like it is in a studio. The light on the wall distracts me. I want to see more of it or not see it at all. I like the composition, off center works well. Good story shot. Spotlight is good. Nice job.</td>', 'This shot stands out to me. It isn''t a normal portrait. But it is definatly in color, and looks like it is in a studio. The light on the wall distracts me. I want to see more of it or not see it at all. I like the composition, off center works well. Good story shot. Spotlight is good. Nice job.', '2004-07-01 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(788453, 85827, 9668, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like how the shirt fades into the background. I think it could be cropped closer. Lighting is good. Background is interesting, but I notice miniture pixalation in it. Is it a TV or a projecter?. Neat image or slight selective blurring whould have cleaned that up. Expression is good, got the sparkle in the eyes.</td>', 'I don''t really like how the shirt fades into the background. I think it could be cropped closer. Lighting is good. Background is interesting, but I notice miniture pixalation in it. Is it a TV or a projecter?. Neat image or slight selective blurring whould have cleaned that up. Expression is good, got the sparkle in the eyes.', '2004-07-01 00:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(788465, 86226, 9668, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really look like a studio, more of a candid. But it is still a portait. It is outdoor lighting so the exposure is uneven. But I like that shows her doing what she likes. Usaually portraits focus on the eyes. So her face sees too close to the border for my liking. But both creatures in this shot are beautiful.</td>', 'Doesn''t really look like a studio, more of a candid. But it is still a portait. It is outdoor lighting so the exposure is uneven. But I like that shows her doing what she likes. Usaually portraits focus on the eyes. So her face sees too close to the border for my liking. But both creatures in this shot are beautiful.', '2004-07-01 00:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(788472, 86271, 9668, '<td valign="top">That''s good that you''re trying something for the first time. I don''t know if you need to tell voters that or not, it seems like you''re trying to get better votes from sympathy that it is you first attempt. But it is well done nevertheles. Would like to see more of the bottom cropped off, wrinkles in the sheet are a bit annoying.</td>', 'That''s good that you''re trying something for the first time. I don''t know if you need to tell voters that or not, it seems like you''re trying to get better votes from sympathy that it is you first attempt. But it is well done nevertheles. Would like to see more of the bottom cropped off, wrinkles in the sheet are a bit annoying.', '2004-07-01 00:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(788476, 86315, 15920, '<td valign="top">This model looks an awful lot like EddyG''s "Jennifer" so, full marks to you for good taste.  Only suggestion here is that the similarity between the background and the hair looses a little possible impact of the great haircolor.  The expression on the model is priceless: large amounts of patience and a good nature are what this photo seems to be saying.  <br/> <br/>In short: Nicely done.</td>', 'This model looks an awful lot like EddyG''s "Jennifer" so, full marks to you for good taste.  Only suggestion here is that the similarity between the background and the hair looses a little possible impact of the great haircolor.  The expression on the model is priceless: large amounts of patience and a good nature are what this photo seems to be saying.   In short: Nicely done.', '2004-07-01 00:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(788479, 86306, 15920, '<td valign="top">A darker guitar would have given a little more contrast, but this works, as the lighting is well done.</td>', 'A darker guitar would have given a little more contrast, but this works, as the lighting is well done.', '2004-07-01 00:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(788494, 86046, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Not sure it would help, but moving the background back physically might help blur it a little help it focus attention on the subject a little more.</td>', 'Nice.  Not sure it would help, but moving the background back physically might help blur it a little help it focus attention on the subject a little more.', '2004-07-01 00:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(788496, 86099, 19608, '<td valign="top">Absolutely a winner!  A very unusual angle but wow!  The colors you selected for the background are also perfect as is your use of two well-balanced light sources.  I normally try to prove a suggestion for improvement - but I am at a loss for words.  I expect you are heading for the land of ribbons.</td>', 'Absolutely a winner!  A very unusual angle but wow!  The colors you selected for the background are also perfect as is your use of two well-balanced light sources.  I normally try to prove a suggestion for improvement - but I am at a loss for words.  I expect you are heading for the land of ribbons.', '2004-07-01 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(788499, 85334, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF.  Background is a little busy (though the blurring helps.)</td>', 'Good use of DOF.  Background is a little busy (though the blurring helps.)', '2004-07-01 00:31:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(788501, 86219, 15920, '<td valign="top">This might be a touch oversaturated.</td>', 'This might be a touch oversaturated.', '2004-07-01 00:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(788506, 86120, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is well done.  Against the the other entries in the competition though, an abstract might have a tough time.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is well done.  Against the the other entries in the competition though, an abstract might have a tough time.  Good luck.', '2004-07-01 00:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(788513, 86313, 15920, '<td valign="top">Neat lens effect, but, against the strong traditional portraits in the competition this might have a hard time.</td>', 'Neat lens effect, but, against the strong traditional portraits in the competition this might have a hard time.', '2004-07-01 00:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(788518, 86084, 15920, '<td valign="top">Nicely lit.</td>', 'Nicely lit.', '2004-07-01 00:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(788519, 86262, 15920, '<td valign="top">A touch oversaturated.</td>', 'A touch oversaturated.', '2004-07-01 00:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(788530, 86167, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed and lighting is effective.  Beautiful model. Good work!  :o)</td>', 'Nicely composed and lighting is effective.  Beautiful model. Good work!  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(788533, 86076, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice soft lighting...but the focus or gaussian blur is a tad too soft for my taste.  The portrait itself is nice, with pleasing tones and nice composition.  :o)</td>', 'Nice soft lighting...but the focus or gaussian blur is a tad too soft for my taste.  The portrait itself is nice, with pleasing tones and nice composition.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(788535, 86279, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is adorable.  You know she will probably want to crawl under the nearest rock when you show this to her prom date, right?  Great portrait.  The look on her face is priceless.  I would prefer a more right-handed presentation...crop off to the right and leave negative space on the left in the direction to where she looks.  Good effort!  :o)</td>', 'This is adorable.  You know she will probably want to crawl under the nearest rock when you show this to her prom date, right?  Great portrait.  The look on her face is priceless.  I would prefer a more right-handed presentation...crop off to the right and leave negative space on the left in the direction to where she looks.  Good effort!  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(788538, 86283, 18349, '<td valign="top">Effective use of lighting; good effort.  :o)</td>', 'Effective use of lighting; good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(788541, 86125, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very interesting portraiture...not the run of the mill.  Effective pose and composition.  Lighting is a tad hot; perhaps that was intentional for the high-key effect.  I would prefer a bit less harsh, but that''s just me.  Good effort.  :o)</td>', 'Very interesting portraiture...not the run of the mill.  Effective pose and composition.  Lighting is a tad hot; perhaps that was intentional for the high-key effect.  I would prefer a bit less harsh, but that''s just me.  Good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(788545, 86248, 18349, '<td valign="top">Background works well for this pose; compliments her eyes very well.  Good pose, effective use of lighting.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'Background works well for this pose; compliments her eyes very well.  Good pose, effective use of lighting.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(788547, 86163, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is really cute...I''d like a tighter crop in to see more of her and less umbrella, but that''s just me.  Love the bright colors.  :o)</td>', 'This is really cute...I''d like a tighter crop in to see more of her and less umbrella, but that''s just me.  Love the bright colors.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(788549, 85265, 18349, '<td valign="top">What a sad expression...makes you want to hug or console.  Effective use of lighting.  I would have preferred the swatch of hair to be pulled back, but that''s just me.  Good effort.  :o)</td>', 'What a sad expression...makes you want to hug or console.  Effective use of lighting.  I would have preferred the swatch of hair to be pulled back, but that''s just me.  Good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(788551, 85816, 18349, '<td valign="top">What an unusual portraiture.  Very effective use of lighting for the pose.  Certainly draws an emotive response.  :o)</td>', 'What an unusual portraiture.  Very effective use of lighting for the pose.  Certainly draws an emotive response.  :o)', '2004-07-01 00:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(788573, 86140, 13381, '<td valign="top">I love the perspective in this shot.  The lighting is nice, and the shot has a lot of interest.  Nice job.</td>', 'I love the perspective in this shot.  The lighting is nice, and the shot has a lot of interest.  Nice job.', '2004-07-01 01:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(788591, 85894, 13381, '<td valign="top">I know I''ve been too active on DPChallenge when I recognize Jacko''s kid without even reading his name.  Adorable as always.</td>', 'I know I''ve been too active on DPChallenge when I recognize Jacko''s kid without even reading his name.  Adorable as always.', '2004-07-01 01:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(788598, 85526, 13381, '<td valign="top">There''s something distracting about the arm that''s portruding out of your model''s head.  I think you''ve cropped down a bigger photo -- I wonder if the full-sized picture would''ve worked better?</td>', 'There''s something distracting about the arm that''s portruding out of your model''s head.  I think you''ve cropped down a bigger photo -- I wonder if the full-sized picture would''ve worked better?', '2004-07-01 01:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(788661, 86287, 13381, '<td valign="top">well, it''s certainly got color. :)  I bet you''re getting a lot of comments about how the lighting is too dark.  It''s true, actualy, but it gives the photo a bit of a painterly feel.</td>', 'well, it''s certainly got color. :)  I bet you''re getting a lot of comments about how the lighting is too dark.  It''s true, actualy, but it gives the photo a bit of a painterly feel.', '2004-07-01 01:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(788670, 86213, 15403, '<td valign="top">You''re proving that self-portraits can be great art!  Nice job again...</td>', 'You''re proving that self-portraits can be great art!  Nice job again...', '2004-07-01 01:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(788681, 85273, 8860, '<td valign="top">What a lovely expression - she''s a cute little Cabbage Patch Doll! Eyes are so clear. Great composition, light and focus - although it does look like some selective blurring is at work, but it''s sensitively done. Deserves to do well.</td>', 'What a lovely expression - she''s a cute little Cabbage Patch Doll! Eyes are so clear. Great composition, light and focus - although it does look like some selective blurring is at work, but it''s sensitively done. Deserves to do well.', '2004-07-01 01:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(788695, 86213, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and technically a sound shot although the composition is a little awkward on the eye. I do feel that this is quite a shallow portrait though, in that you look very conscious of the fact you''re taking a picture of yourself, but are pretending this is candid. <br/> <br/>If it was not so obvious that your arm was holding the camera (or seeming to be) this would work much better, since your expression suggests some off-screen interaction, yet you''re clicking the shutter and the two things don''t fit.</td>', 'Good lighting and technically a sound shot although the composition is a little awkward on the eye. I do feel that this is quite a shallow portrait though, in that you look very conscious of the fact you''re taking a picture of yourself, but are pretending this is candid.  If it was not so obvious that your arm was holding the camera (or seeming to be) this would work much better, since your expression suggests some off-screen interaction, yet you''re clicking the shutter and the two things don''t fit.', '2004-07-01 01:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(788817, 86116, 10680, '<td valign="top">i''m not a big fan of the crop, but otherwise the photo is great. color is great, and the eyes look excellent.</td>', 'i''m not a big fan of the crop, but otherwise the photo is great. color is great, and the eyes look excellent.', '2004-07-01 02:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(788833, 86140, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the wide angle perspective as it distorts the scale of size of different parts of the model and couch. Well done.</td>', 'I like the wide angle perspective as it distorts the scale of size of different parts of the model and couch. Well done.', '2004-07-01 02:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(788863, 86312, 5822, '<td valign="top">And she is!  Wonderful expression and pose of model, choice of hat and dress combined with high-key tonality very good.  Lighting is too strong and I also don''t like the shadow picture right (girl''s left), which shows some noise.</td>', 'And she is!  Wonderful expression and pose of model, choice of hat and dress combined with high-key tonality very good.  Lighting is too strong and I also don''t like the shadow picture right (girl''s left), which shows some noise.', '2004-07-01 02:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(788881, 85265, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very delicate study and expertly photographed. Being that it exudes that traditional looks, like the early paintings I would have prefered a simple gown without the drawings.</td>', 'A very delicate study and expertly photographed. Being that it exudes that traditional looks, like the early paintings I would have prefered a simple gown without the drawings.', '2004-07-01 03:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(788907, 86243, 22734, '<td valign="top">A truly beautiful study. Soft all through out with great colors. I would have gone a a tad higher to avoid the other earring showing or would have cloned it out. It still remains one of my favorites.</td>', 'A truly beautiful study. Soft all through out with great colors. I would have gone a a tad higher to avoid the other earring showing or would have cloned it out. It still remains one of my favorites.', '2004-07-01 03:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(788912, 85897, 22734, '<td valign="top">A very ingenuous execution. Going to look at your port.lol Of course, a slight higher clarity to find the eyes would have made this complete.</td>', 'A very ingenuous execution. Going to look at your port.lol Of course, a slight higher clarity to find the eyes would have made this complete.', '2004-07-01 03:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(788975, 86313, 18450, '<td valign="top">good strong colours, lighting, skin tones. To me the pose makes his body seem small and out of proportion.</td>', 'good strong colours, lighting, skin tones. To me the pose makes his body seem small and out of proportion.', '2004-07-01 03:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(788981, 85334, 18450, '<td valign="top">you''ve captured a very sweet expression on her face. Lovely focus and colours on her head.  For a portrait I would have liked it if her face had filled more of the frame, also find the line on the background behind her head a little distracting. <br/></td>', 'you''ve captured a very sweet expression on her face. Lovely focus and colours on her head.  For a portrait I would have liked it if her face had filled more of the frame, also find the line on the background behind her head a little distracting. ', '2004-07-01 04:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(788989, 86306, 18450, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and focus here, the background means that you focus on the model.....good skin tones. Not sure about the guitar though......the way the white reflects the light seems a little distracting to me........like the idea though and would really like to see this with a different/darker guitar.</td>', 'I like the lighting and focus here, the background means that you focus on the model.....good skin tones. Not sure about the guitar though......the way the white reflects the light seems a little distracting to me........like the idea though and would really like to see this with a different/darker guitar.', '2004-07-01 04:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(788992, 85835, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely creative idea. The boys look like they are having fun. I like the lighting, skin tones and  lack of shadows</td>', 'Lovely creative idea. The boys look like they are having fun. I like the lighting, skin tones and  lack of shadows', '2004-07-01 04:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(788994, 85273, 18450, '<td valign="top">what a beautifully innocent face. Lovely skin tones and lighting. Would have liked to see both cheeks in focus.</td>', 'what a beautifully innocent face. Lovely skin tones and lighting. Would have liked to see both cheeks in focus.', '2004-07-01 04:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(788997, 86305, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely focus, color......and really like the pose, the direct stare of the mayor! Would have liked less shadows (especially under the chin) and to be able to see the color of his eyes</td>', 'Lovely focus, color......and really like the pose, the direct stare of the mayor! Would have liked less shadows (especially under the chin) and to be able to see the color of his eyes', '2004-07-01 04:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(788998, 85284, 18450, '<td valign="top">this is really quite lovely. The focus and lighting on the model, the soft shadings on the background....it all adds up to a very attractive color studio portrait</td>', 'this is really quite lovely. The focus and lighting on the model, the soft shadings on the background....it all adds up to a very attractive color studio portrait', '2004-07-01 04:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(789015, 86257, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Good and generally well balanced, with a nice catchlight in the eyes.  However, there are a couple of small hot spots (left elbow and upper ear, and a rather harsh shadow under the chin.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The expression conveys a bit about his character, which is a good thing; but spreading his legs around an open-backed chair was probably not the best choice for a formal portrait.  Cropping just above the waist would have removed this problem.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The black works well with this subject, with the exception of the hair on his head.  The head needs a strong separation from the background and could have been achieved with a small wattage backlight aimed at his head.<br/></td>', 'Lighting:  Good and generally well balanced, with a nice catchlight in the eyes.  However, there are a couple of small hot spots (left elbow and upper ear, and a rather harsh shadow under the chin.Pose:  The expression conveys a bit about his character, which is a good thing; but spreading his legs around an open-backed chair was probably not the best choice for a formal portrait.  Cropping just above the waist would have removed this problem.Background:  The black works well with this subject, with the exception of the hair on his head.  The head needs a strong separation from the background and could have been achieved with a small wattage backlight aimed at his head.', '2004-07-01 04:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(789135, 86309, 23055, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photograph. OK let''s play guess the camera...it seems to have that Canon 10D look to it, but I don''t much about cameras or how to get a picture like this. It''s really really nice though.</td>', 'I think this is a great photograph. OK let''s play guess the camera...it seems to have that Canon 10D look to it, but I don''t much about cameras or how to get a picture like this. It''s really really nice though.', '2004-07-01 07:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(789145, 86212, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Lighting is well balanced, with a nice catchlight.  But there seems to be a bit of a color-cast to the image as a whole, and the harshness of the lighting is not flattering her skin tone.  Judging from the contrast and the well-defined shadow on the background, the portrait would have benefitted from the use of something to diffuse the light more.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Having her look up is good as it flatters the face and neck.  However, with the raised head, the shot should be taken from above her level with her head tilted toward you (revealing both eyes) instead of away.  Also, lifting the right shoulder gives me a feeling of her pitching backwards, so the left shoulder would have been better.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background is a nice neutral shade and fits the subject quite well.  The only thing I would sugest on this would be to put more distance between the model and the background; this would have reduced or eliminated the shadow behind her.<br/>It is a shame the cropping did not include the back of her head.</td>', 'Lighting:  Lighting is well balanced, with a nice catchlight.  But there seems to be a bit of a color-cast to the image as a whole, and the harshness of the lighting is not flattering her skin tone.  Judging from the contrast and the well-defined shadow on the background, the portrait would have benefitted from the use of something to diffuse the light more.Pose:  Having her look up is good as it flatters the face and neck.  However, with the raised head, the shot should be taken from above her level with her head tilted toward you (revealing both eyes) instead of away.  Also, lifting the right shoulder gives me a feeling of her pitching backwards, so the left shoulder would have been better.Background:  The background is a nice neutral shade and fits the subject quite well.  The only thing I would sugest on this would be to put more distance between the model and the background; this would have reduced or eliminated the shadow behind her.It is a shame the cropping did not include the back of her head.', '2004-07-01 07:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(789242, 86255, 2716, '<td valign="top">Wow wow !  the posing is perfect and the color saturation and contrast rock.  I love this one .  Jacko.  10</td>', 'Wow wow !  the posing is perfect and the color saturation and contrast rock.  I love this one .  Jacko.  10', '2004-07-01 08:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(789267, 85901, 18450, '<td valign="top">really like the use of light and shadows here</td>', 'really like the use of light and shadows here', '2004-07-01 08:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(789276, 85526, 18450, '<td valign="top">like the focus, color and skin tone in this portrait.</td>', 'like the focus, color and skin tone in this portrait.', '2004-07-01 08:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(789310, 86312, 18450, '<td valign="top">very pretty colors ...would have liked to have seen a sharper focus on the model''s face. Found my eye drawn to the hat which to me seems to have the sharper focus</td>', 'very pretty colors ...would have liked to have seen a sharper focus on the model''s face. Found my eye drawn to the hat which to me seems to have the sharper focus', '2004-07-01 08:26:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(789332, 86262, 18450, '<td valign="top">to me the light reflecting from the model''s face is distracting and her pose looks a little awkward. Would love to see this with a slightly darker background and softer lighting on her face.</td>', 'to me the light reflecting from the model''s face is distracting and her pose looks a little awkward. Would love to see this with a slightly darker background and softer lighting on her face.', '2004-07-01 08:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(789342, 86228, 18450, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and skin tones. With the title I''d really like to see a more misty background......? shallower dof</td>', 'Lovely lighting and skin tones. With the title I''d really like to see a more misty background......? shallower dof', '2004-07-01 08:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(789366, 86099, 20941, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite portrait of the challenge. the model, the lighting, the colors are all spectacular. if there are any faults, im not qualified to find them but wouldnt care because this isnt science its art...hope you get the blue!</td>', 'this is my favorite portrait of the challenge. the model, the lighting, the colors are all spectacular. if there are any faults, im not qualified to find them but wouldnt care because this isnt science its art...hope you get the blue!', '2004-07-01 08:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(789428, 86276, 20941, '<td valign="top">i really like this...wish i could give you some constructive criticism, but i guess i dont know enough about the technicalities of portraiture cuz i cant really find anything wrong here. maybe you could help others by commenting on their portrait shots so they (me) could gorw up to shoot just like you lol!</td>', 'i really like this...wish i could give you some constructive criticism, but i guess i dont know enough about the technicalities of portraiture cuz i cant really find anything wrong here. maybe you could help others by commenting on their portrait shots so they (me) could gorw up to shoot just like you lol!', '2004-07-01 08:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(789447, 85972, 20941, '<td valign="top">beautiful, classic, no suggestions from me on how to make this better, just my compliments on a well composed all around great portrait, sorry if that doesnt help you, but doesnt seem like you need help here.</td>', 'beautiful, classic, no suggestions from me on how to make this better, just my compliments on a well composed all around great portrait, sorry if that doesnt help you, but doesnt seem like you need help here.', '2004-07-01 08:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(789464, 86095, 18450, '<td valign="top">What a lovely strong color studio portrait! Lighting, skin tones, focus are all great.</td>', 'What a lovely strong color studio portrait! Lighting, skin tones, focus are all great.', '2004-07-01 09:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(789483, 85693, 20941, '<td valign="top">this is such a virbrant, happy portrait, that it probably didnt need the flowers to detract from focusing on the wonderful smile. I cant help but smile right back.</td>', 'this is such a virbrant, happy portrait, that it probably didnt need the flowers to detract from focusing on the wonderful smile. I cant help but smile right back.', '2004-07-01 09:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(789509, 85629, 20941, '<td valign="top">im so glad we had a portrait challenge, which i did enter with my first attempt. I have learned alot about being creatve, lighting and backround from shots like this one.  sorry if i cant help with suggestions on how to make this better.</td>', 'im so glad we had a portrait challenge, which i did enter with my first attempt. I have learned alot about being creatve, lighting and backround from shots like this one.  sorry if i cant help with suggestions on how to make this better.', '2004-07-01 09:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(789530, 85893, 20941, '<td valign="top">IMHO, this would be an INCREDIBLE portrait had there been a backdrop behind her.  as it is its still a great shot of an obviously very happy, pretty little girl.</td>', 'IMHO, this would be an INCREDIBLE portrait had there been a backdrop behind her.  as it is its still a great shot of an obviously very happy, pretty little girl.', '2004-07-01 09:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(789534, 85972, 14448, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes.  Nice skin tones.  I like the simple framing.  Unfortunately her hand (it is gloved, right?) gets lost in the background.  Better not to have cropped the pendant, or else have her remove it entirely.</td>', 'Lovely eyes.  Nice skin tones.  I like the simple framing.  Unfortunately her hand (it is gloved, right?) gets lost in the background.  Better not to have cropped the pendant, or else have her remove it entirely.', '2004-07-01 09:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(789542, 85334, 20941, '<td valign="top">beautiful smile, gorgeous eyes, LOOKs like my uncle Louie, but im not sure he''s human either.</td>', 'beautiful smile, gorgeous eyes, LOOKs like my uncle Louie, but im not sure he''s human either.', '2004-07-01 09:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(789559, 86248, 14448, '<td valign="top">Good, but could be better.  I would crop out a little more of the background on the right side, and crop higher to leave some background above her head, for better compositional balance- following the rule of thirds or golden ratio, based on the focal point, her eyes, would add to aesthetic appeal.  She appears a little tense - the tip I have heard is, just before pressing the shutter, to have the subject puff up her cheeks then blow out the air, which will relax the muscles in her cheeks and lightens the mood.</td>', 'Good, but could be better.  I would crop out a little more of the background on the right side, and crop higher to leave some background above her head, for better compositional balance- following the rule of thirds or golden ratio, based on the focal point, her eyes, would add to aesthetic appeal.  She appears a little tense - the tip I have heard is, just before pressing the shutter, to have the subject puff up her cheeks then blow out the air, which will relax the muscles in her cheeks and lightens the mood.', '2004-07-01 09:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(789610, 85894, 656, '<td valign="top">nice shot, Jacko.  Could do with being a shade tighter perhaps</td>', 'nice shot, Jacko.  Could do with being a shade tighter perhaps', '2004-07-01 10:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(789614, 85273, 18165, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but a tad over-softened<br/></td>', 'Great shot, but a tad over-softened', '2004-07-01 10:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(789616, 85622, 656, '<td valign="top">Lighting is quite flat - really needs some life/light in his eyes to create some catchlights - it would really lift the whole feel</td>', 'Lighting is quite flat - really needs some life/light in his eyes to create some catchlights - it would really lift the whole feel', '2004-07-01 10:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(789620, 86076, 656, '<td valign="top">really feels like you''ve gone overboard with the softness - looks like it could have been a good portrait, but I can''t really tell any more</td>', 'really feels like you''ve gone overboard with the softness - looks like it could have been a good portrait, but I can''t really tell any more', '2004-07-01 10:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(789622, 85893, 656, '<td valign="top">fun shot, good catchlights too and a great smile</td>', 'fun shot, good catchlights too and a great smile', '2004-07-01 10:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(789625, 85241, 656, '<td valign="top">interesting composition/ pose - though her eyes could maybe be a bit more open  ?   The hair sweeping around her neck unfortunately looks like it might have been growing from there - something to pay a bit more attention to perhaps but a lot of potential</td>', 'interesting composition/ pose - though her eyes could maybe be a bit more open  ?   The hair sweeping around her neck unfortunately looks like it might have been growing from there - something to pay a bit more attention to perhaps but a lot of potential', '2004-07-01 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(789628, 86163, 656, '<td valign="top">the props are a good attempt to make this more interesting, but the light from the single source below left is pretty harsh - underexposing a lot of the background and giving you pretty strong shadows that don''t do much for me</td>', 'the props are a good attempt to make this more interesting, but the light from the single source below left is pretty harsh - underexposing a lot of the background and giving you pretty strong shadows that don''t do much for me', '2004-07-01 10:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(789631, 85827, 656, '<td valign="top">really needs some more light to balance out your main source - the shadows on the cheek and eye sockets and under the hair could do with some balancing</td>', 'really needs some more light to balance out your main source - the shadows on the cheek and eye sockets and under the hair could do with some balancing', '2004-07-01 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(789633, 85865, 656, '<td valign="top">Very even, soft lighting - over all feel is a touch flat/ lacking in contrast though.  Arm placement feels a little uncomfortable, crossing/ cutting the right arm in particular</td>', 'Very even, soft lighting - over all feel is a touch flat/ lacking in contrast though.  Arm placement feels a little uncomfortable, crossing/ cutting the right arm in particular', '2004-07-01 10:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(789636, 85265, 656, '<td valign="top">the leading arm towards the camera makes it look much heavier than it probably is.  Not convinced that the hair position helps her either - particularly as it dissappears in to the background and appears on the table too - looks like some of it has almost been cut off and ended up lying on the table - some better arrangement might have been more flattering</td>', 'the leading arm towards the camera makes it look much heavier than it probably is.  Not convinced that the hair position helps her either - particularly as it dissappears in to the background and appears on the table too - looks like some of it has almost been cut off and ended up lying on the table - some better arrangement might have been more flattering', '2004-07-01 10:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(789643, 86120, 656, '<td valign="top">Your processing has almost removed all the detail from her eyes - giving big black pools - could be what you are going for - but the title seems to contradict that</td>', 'Your processing has almost removed all the detail from her eyes - giving big black pools - could be what you are going for - but the title seems to contradict that', '2004-07-01 10:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(789646, 86130, 656, '<td valign="top">love it - plenty of personality, great lighting - cool shot.</td>', 'love it - plenty of personality, great lighting - cool shot.', '2004-07-01 10:17:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(789668, 86037, 11895, '<td valign="top">this is a very good shot,  a novel and  interesting approach to the challenge, however there are some fairly large areas that are smooth and texture-less that keep grabbing my attention; also  a  blotchy patch on her nose in the reflection, a few minor flaws in an otherwise pleasing photo</td>', 'this is a very good shot,  a novel and  interesting approach to the challenge, however there are some fairly large areas that are smooth and texture-less that keep grabbing my attention; also  a  blotchy patch on her nose in the reflection, a few minor flaws in an otherwise pleasing photo', '2004-07-01 10:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
