(789878, 85972, 656, '<td valign="top">Don''t think the black/green glove works well with the black background - not enough contrast so it looks like a gap or her shoulder has been cut off and is floating in space  S niy more DoF to keep the hair all in focus, or less DoF to blow it out more would work better I think too - feels stuck somewhere between those extremes</td>', 'Don''t think the black/green glove works well with the black background - not enough contrast so it looks like a gap or her shoulder has been cut off and is floating in space  S niy more DoF to keep the hair all in focus, or less DoF to blow it out more would work better I think too - feels stuck somewhere between those extremes', '2004-07-01 12:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
