(790596, 86255, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  While you have a nice catchlight in her eyes, a small backlight aimed at the back of her head would have provided some very needed separation between her dark hair and the dark background.  The lack of detail, color shift and banding (hair mainly) in the dark areas suggests this was underexposed and then lightened during post-processing.  The right side of her face needs a fill light to counteract the harsh shadows.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is nice, very well executed.  However, it was likely not the best pose for her choice of clothing.  With her leaning back as she is, the shirt falls too heavily on her undergarment providing some very distracting lines to an otherwise excellent draping of the fabric.  Finally, on a related note, the tight cropping on the left (removing her arm) is undesirable.<br/><b>Background:</b>  There is not enough detail left in the background to say more than I mentioned above, except that a lighter background would have bounced light back on the model, helping to light her, instead of pulling the light from her.<br/> <br/>A shot with a lot of potential lost due to what appears to be low lighting.</td>', 'Lighting:  While you have a nice catchlight in her eyes, a small backlight aimed at the back of her head would have provided some very needed separation between her dark hair and the dark background.  The lack of detail, color shift and banding (hair mainly) in the dark areas suggests this was underexposed and then lightened during post-processing.  The right side of her face needs a fill light to counteract the harsh shadows.Pose:  The pose is nice, very well executed.  However, it was likely not the best pose for her choice of clothing.  With her leaning back as she is, the shirt falls too heavily on her undergarment providing some very distracting lines to an otherwise excellent draping of the fabric.  Finally, on a related note, the tight cropping on the left (removing her arm) is undesirable.Background:  There is not enough detail left in the background to say more than I mentioned above, except that a lighter background would have bounced light back on the model, helping to light her, instead of pulling the light from her. A shot with a lot of potential lost due to what appears to be low lighting.', '2004-07-01 17:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(790601, 86231, 10720, '<td valign="top">Almost a doll like quality to the bride -</td>', 'Almost a doll like quality to the bride -', '2004-07-01 17:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(790603, 85526, 6477, '<td valign="top">beautiful model and shot. The only thing I would change here is the light, maybe less yellow and to use some kind of filter...  the pose and the expression is great. Good luck</td>', 'beautiful model and shot. The only thing I would change here is the light, maybe less yellow and to use some kind of filter...  the pose and the expression is great. Good luck', '2004-07-01 17:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(790622, 85938, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Very nice, even and well balanced, light that is giving wonderful skin tones.  However, there is a touch of over-exposure in the crown and lower-left gown and the harsh shadow under the chin is not flattering.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Near perfect.  The only think I could recommend would be to raise her head just a bit (diminishing the shadow) and placing her left hand on her lap.  On a related note, the tip of her wand seems to be outside your DOF or blurred from motion and is quite distracting from an otherwise well posed shot.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Not much to say about the background.  A very (very) light shade of pink would have kept with the theme better, but would have provided much less separation.</td>', 'Lighting:  Very nice, even and well balanced, light that is giving wonderful skin tones.  However, there is a touch of over-exposure in the crown and lower-left gown and the harsh shadow under the chin is not flattering.Pose:  Near perfect.  The only think I could recommend would be to raise her head just a bit (diminishing the shadow) and placing her left hand on her lap.  On a related note, the tip of her wand seems to be outside your DOF or blurred from motion and is quite distracting from an otherwise well posed shot.Background:  Not much to say about the background.  A very (very) light shade of pink would have kept with the theme better, but would have provided much less separation.', '2004-07-01 17:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(790634, 86315, 6477, '<td valign="top">i would change the back color because the color of her hair, maybe a black back color or something dark. And maybe different light to avoid the shadows on her face... good luck</td>', 'i would change the back color because the color of her hair, maybe a black back color or something dark. And maybe different light to avoid the shadows on her face... good luck', '2004-07-01 17:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(790652, 85623, 6477, '<td valign="top">model, light, composition, colors, mood, crop, etc... everything perfect:) =10</td>', 'model, light, composition, colors, mood, crop, etc... everything perfect:) =10', '2004-07-01 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(790682, 86271, 6477, '<td valign="top">beautiful color studio portrait, light, composition and colors are pretty good here... good luck</td>', 'beautiful color studio portrait, light, composition and colors are pretty good here... good luck', '2004-07-01 18:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(790731, 85893, 9668, '<td valign="top">I like how you caught the sparkle in the eyes.</td>', 'I like how you caught the sparkle in the eyes.', '2004-07-01 18:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(790743, 86116, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and color.  The crop adds interest to the subject.  I wonder if using a longer lens would help minimize the apparent exaggeration of her nose?  Little noise in the background evident on my screen.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and color.  The crop adds interest to the subject.  I wonder if using a longer lens would help minimize the apparent exaggeration of her nose?  Little noise in the background evident on my screen.', '2004-07-01 18:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(790744, 85816, 16488, '<td valign="top">An unusual subject for this challenge.  The lighting is dramatic and the color very strong.  Like the use of negative space.</td>', 'An unusual subject for this challenge.  The lighting is dramatic and the color very strong.  Like the use of negative space.', '2004-07-01 18:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(790754, 86046, 16488, '<td valign="top">Good strong lighting but there is an unfortunate shadow cast on the bridge of the nose.  Good facial expression.  Kinda wish he was sitting up a bit more--though its not too bad for the casual feel of this portrait.  I think "plumber" in your title throws it a little out of whack as there''s no indication elsewhere of his trade.</td>', 'Good strong lighting but there is an unfortunate shadow cast on the bridge of the nose.  Good facial expression.  Kinda wish he was sitting up a bit more--though its not too bad for the casual feel of this portrait.  I think "plumber" in your title throws it a little out of whack as there''s no indication elsewhere of his trade.', '2004-07-01 18:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(790761, 86229, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo and nice applicatio of soft focus.  I think her expression would look less startled if the pupils were more dialated--perhaps having the subject close her eyes for a moment before shooting would do the trick.</td>', 'Pretty photo and nice applicatio of soft focus.  I think her expression would look less startled if the pupils were more dialated--perhaps having the subject close her eyes for a moment before shooting would do the trick.', '2004-07-01 18:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(790770, 86281, 16488, '<td valign="top">A nice expressive portrait.  She looks a bit too sad, perhaps, while it seems you were going for wistful.  I''m one of those who thinks of "studio" as an inside place--so it''s not quite perfect for the challenge, in my opinion.</td>', 'A nice expressive portrait.  She looks a bit too sad, perhaps, while it seems you were going for wistful.  I''m one of those who thinks of "studio" as an inside place--so it''s not quite perfect for the challenge, in my opinion.', '2004-07-01 18:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(790774, 86309, 16488, '<td valign="top">Charming!  Expert lighting and wonderful expression!  To be critical, the pigtail on the right is unfortunately sharp and contrasty--spot editing might help diminish its intrusion to the composition.</td>', 'Charming!  Expert lighting and wonderful expression!  To be critical, the pigtail on the right is unfortunately sharp and contrasty--spot editing might help diminish its intrusion to the composition.', '2004-07-01 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(790778, 86037, 16488, '<td valign="top">A moody shot!  The skin tones are nice but perhaps a little deep.  I''d prefer to see a little more neck on the "me" on the left--the crop just seems a little tight.</td>', 'A moody shot!  The skin tones are nice but perhaps a little deep.  I''d prefer to see a little more neck on the "me" on the left--the crop just seems a little tight.', '2004-07-01 18:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(790792, 86212, 16488, '<td valign="top">Good strong face on your subject!  I think this could be improved in the pose in one of two ways: 1. have the subject look more toward the camera so the eye can be enjoyed or 2. turn the head a bit farther away so it becomes a true profile.  The lighting is even without being flat and seems to do its proper job of flattering the subject.</td>', 'Good strong face on your subject!  I think this could be improved in the pose in one of two ways: 1. have the subject look more toward the camera so the eye can be enjoyed or 2. turn the head a bit farther away so it becomes a true profile.  The lighting is even without being flat and seems to do its proper job of flattering the subject.', '2004-07-01 18:41:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(790804, 85241, 16488, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model and well lit.  I''m uncomfortable with the angle of the shot and keep trying to tilt my head to view it.  I expect you were going for a "look" but it seems just a little too upside down to me.</td>', 'A beautiful model and well lit.  I''m uncomfortable with the angle of the shot and keep trying to tilt my head to view it.  I expect you were going for a "look" but it seems just a little too upside down to me.', '2004-07-01 18:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(790814, 85334, 16488, '<td valign="top">Ahh, a person in dog''s clothing!  That aside, I think the fore-paws need to be in the picture--perhaps a less limited depth of field.  And I don''t think the baseboard hides enough for me to get the "studio" feel asked for in the challenge.</td>', 'Ahh, a person in dog''s clothing!  That aside, I think the fore-paws need to be in the picture--perhaps a less limited depth of field.  And I don''t think the baseboard hides enough for me to get the "studio" feel asked for in the challenge.', '2004-07-01 18:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(790820, 86275, 16488, '<td valign="top">This does have that "sophisticated" look about it, due in part, no doubt, to the lovely lighting.  I think the hand could be better posed--perhaps the head could rest more on them or the fingers could open a bit more.  The shadow they cast on the chin also hurts the feel of the composition a bit.</td>', 'This does have that "sophisticated" look about it, due in part, no doubt, to the lovely lighting.  I think the hand could be better posed--perhaps the head could rest more on them or the fingers could open a bit more.  The shadow they cast on the chin also hurts the feel of the composition a bit.', '2004-07-01 18:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(790824, 86282, 16488, '<td valign="top">The idea of darkness and mystery is present here.  But the loss of detail in the black accessories detracts from the overall effect.  Perhaps soft secondary lighting could bring up the detail.</td>', 'The idea of darkness and mystery is present here.  But the loss of detail in the black accessories detracts from the overall effect.  Perhaps soft secondary lighting could bring up the detail.', '2004-07-01 18:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(790963, 86140, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is a unique pose and angle.They give character to this big eyed woman.  I like all the gray and black in this picture, makes her pale flesh tone stand out more.  One of my favorites.</td>', 'This is a unique pose and angle.They give character to this big eyed woman.  I like all the gray and black in this picture, makes her pale flesh tone stand out more.  One of my favorites.', '2004-07-01 19:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(790972, 85241, 7628, '<td valign="top">This unusual pose makes this photo stand out from all the more typical (right side up) portraits in the challenge,  She almost seems to be floating, especially with all that soft hair.  Those dreamy almost closed eyes give an etherial air to the photo as well.</td>', 'This unusual pose makes this photo stand out from all the more typical (right side up) portraits in the challenge,  She almost seems to be floating, especially with all that soft hair.  Those dreamy almost closed eyes give an etherial air to the photo as well.', '2004-07-01 19:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(790983, 86243, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love your choice of background - adds charcter and texture without being too distracting.  I like the colors also - the dark wood, her golden skin, and the earthy green of the shawl.  The pose is very relaxes and contemplative.  My only complaint would be that the lighting is too flat - I like how it is soft on her face, but I''d like to see some contrast with the background -</td>', 'I love your choice of background - adds charcter and texture without being too distracting.  I like the colors also - the dark wood, her golden skin, and the earthy green of the shawl.  The pose is very relaxes and contemplative.  My only complaint would be that the lighting is too flat - I like how it is soft on her face, but I''d like to see some contrast with the background -', '2004-07-01 19:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(790995, 86213, 7628, '<td valign="top">Well, how can you go wrong with a face like that?  Technically very goosd with the lighting and focus.I like your choice of the white background and the textured white shirt - the dark hair and eyes really pop out at you as a result.  The expression on the face and the gesture of the hand are very telling and natural, combined with the composition that places the subject at the left side off the frame looking out  - all this creates a story that goes beyond the individual.  There is a lot of personality, but the viewer is left wondering "what or who is he looking at?"  Well done! A favorite of mine. 9</td>', 'Well, how can you go wrong with a face like that?  Technically very goosd with the lighting and focus.I like your choice of the white background and the textured white shirt - the dark hair and eyes really pop out at you as a result.  The expression on the face and the gesture of the hand are very telling and natural, combined with the composition that places the subject at the left side off the frame looking out  - all this creates a story that goes beyond the individual.  There is a lot of personality, but the viewer is left wondering "what or who is he looking at?"  Well done! A favorite of mine. 9', '2004-07-01 19:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(791006, 86313, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love this picture!  Like the one entitled "Veronique"  the lense gives a interesting perspective and angle which creates some real personality!  I love his eyes, and how they have become the focus of the picture.  OH, but I wish they were in focus!!!  I also wish the light wasnt so yellow.  Please try this shot again after the challenge - it is a real treasure! 6</td>', 'I love this picture!  Like the one entitled "Veronique"  the lense gives a interesting perspective and angle which creates some real personality!  I love his eyes, and how they have become the focus of the picture.  OH, but I wish they were in focus!!!  I also wish the light wasnt so yellow.  Please try this shot again after the challenge - it is a real treasure! 6', '2004-07-01 19:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791019, 86167, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the colors in this picture - the background, her hair, her eyes and skin tone.  The lighting on the face is good, focus is sharp.  What I cant get past is that the pose seems uncomfortable.  Perhaps if you included the bottom arm, or just a little more context all around. 6</td>', 'I like the colors in this picture - the background, her hair, her eyes and skin tone.  The lighting on the face is good, focus is sharp.  What I cant get past is that the pose seems uncomfortable.  Perhaps if you included the bottom arm, or just a little more context all around. 6', '2004-07-01 19:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(791033, 86115, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting set up  - I like the differing shades of purple and the lines and different angles - it suits the angle of his kneesin the chair, and the tilt of the camera.  I like the angles lighting.  I wish the expression on his face was less pained or bored.  The face is the central piece here it should carry more weight, show more of the subject''s character.</td>', 'Interesting set up  - I like the differing shades of purple and the lines and different angles - it suits the angle of his kneesin the chair, and the tilt of the camera.  I like the angles lighting.  I wish the expression on his face was less pained or bored.  The face is the central piece here it should carry more weight, show more of the subject''s character.', '2004-07-01 19:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(791041, 86121, 7628, '<td valign="top">This child has a terrific face!  That smile and those eyes.  I think the necklace just distracts from from what is important - I see you are highlighting this kids "party personality," perhaps a less bold necklace?  Something that matched the subjects pale complexion better?  Also the halo of light arounf the face is quite unnatural.  I''d crop closer to the face.</td>', 'This child has a terrific face!  That smile and those eyes.  I think the necklace just distracts from from what is important - I see you are highlighting this kids "party personality," perhaps a less bold necklace?  Something that matched the subjects pale complexion better?  Also the halo of light arounf the face is quite unnatural.  I''d crop closer to the face.', '2004-07-01 20:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(791054, 85897, 23279, '<td valign="top">Now that''s cool!!  You have that devilish "how''s that" look in your eyes and grin, so I figure you are very knowledgeable about picture taking.   A 10 for originality for you, young man!!!</td>', 'Now that''s cool!!  You have that devilish "how''s that" look in your eyes and grin, so I figure you are very knowledgeable about picture taking.   A 10 for originality for you, young man!!!', '2004-07-01 20:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(791058, 86228, 23279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue eyes and she looks like she is dreaming.  Good one.</td>', 'Beautiful blue eyes and she looks like she is dreaming.  Good one.', '2004-07-01 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(791060, 85273, 23279, '<td valign="top">Adorable!</td>', 'Adorable!', '2004-07-01 20:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(791070, 85554, 23279, '<td valign="top">Nice Portrait!</td>', 'Nice Portrait!', '2004-07-01 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(791071, 86130, 23279, '<td valign="top">Funny!!  lol</td>', 'Funny!!  lol', '2004-07-01 20:15:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(791079, 86231, 23279, '<td valign="top">Striking....absolutely beautiful.  Good job.</td>', 'Striking....absolutely beautiful.  Good job.', '2004-07-01 20:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(791083, 85241, 23373, '<td valign="top">Find the hair on her neck distracting.</td>', 'Find the hair on her neck distracting.', '2004-07-01 20:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(791089, 86312, 23279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful child, excellent portrait and color.  Would have been better without lipstick though.</td>', 'Beautiful child, excellent portrait and color.  Would have been better without lipstick though.', '2004-07-01 20:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(791092, 86279, 23279, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice.  Good job.', '2004-07-01 20:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(791093, 86305, 18349, '<td valign="top">As good as this portrait is, I can''t award you full credit due to the fact that the instructions specifically stated to shoot a portrait of a person.  Sorry!  :o)</td>', 'As good as this portrait is, I can''t award you full credit due to the fact that the instructions specifically stated to shoot a portrait of a person.  Sorry!  :o)', '2004-07-01 20:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(791095, 85334, 18349, '<td valign="top">As good as this portrait is, I can''t award you full credit due to the fact that the instructions specifically stated to shoot a portrait of a person.  Sorry!  :o)</td>', 'As good as this portrait is, I can''t award you full credit due to the fact that the instructions specifically stated to shoot a portrait of a person.  Sorry!  :o)', '2004-07-01 20:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(791096, 85910, 18349, '<td valign="top">As good as this portrait is, I can''t award you full credit due to the fact that the instructions specifically stated to shoot a portrait of a person.  Sorry!  :o)</td>', 'As good as this portrait is, I can''t award you full credit due to the fact that the instructions specifically stated to shoot a portrait of a person.  Sorry!  :o)', '2004-07-01 20:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(791099, 86228, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is very well done, but looks a little contrived for your title (so I ignored your title.)  Great job on the eyes, and good placement of background.  Finally, I like the way the background matches the shirt.</td>', 'This is very well done, but looks a little contrived for your title (so I ignored your title.)  Great job on the eyes, and good placement of background.  Finally, I like the way the background matches the shirt.', '2004-07-01 20:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(791100, 86282, 18349, '<td valign="top">As dark as this portrait is, it makes it difficult to make out much detail in the facial features.  It also appears inhuman, whereas the challenge instructions specifically stated to create a portrait of a person.  I do appreciate the uniqueness and the risk-taking you have shown.</td>', 'As dark as this portrait is, it makes it difficult to make out much detail in the facial features.  It also appears inhuman, whereas the challenge instructions specifically stated to create a portrait of a person.  I do appreciate the uniqueness and the risk-taking you have shown.', '2004-07-01 20:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791103, 86212, 15920, '<td valign="top">Just a little too grainy.  Great pose, and expression.</td>', 'Just a little too grainy.  Great pose, and expression.', '2004-07-01 20:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(791104, 86248, 23279, '<td valign="top">Beautiful girl, beautiful colorful portrait, but I don''t think "Dreamer" fits the look on her face and in her eyes.  She looks upset...like..."and where have you been?"...ha, ha, ha   Otherwise, it is absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful girl, beautiful colorful portrait, but I don''t think "Dreamer" fits the look on her face and in her eyes.  She looks upset...like..."and where have you been?"...ha, ha, ha   Otherwise, it is absolutely beautiful.', '2004-07-01 20:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(791106, 86075, 23279, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  So real.  Good job.</td>', 'Adorable.  So real.  Good job.', '2004-07-01 20:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791110, 86121, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great baby picture.  A little less DOF might pull out some of the background distraction, but that is a personal taste.</td>', 'Great baby picture.  A little less DOF might pull out some of the background distraction, but that is a personal taste.', '2004-07-01 20:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(791114, 86276, 15920, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, with nice lighting, but showing the eyes might strengthen the image overall.</td>', 'Cool idea, with nice lighting, but showing the eyes might strengthen the image overall.', '2004-07-01 20:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(791119, 85284, 15920, '<td valign="top">Just a little extra light on her left eye area is something I might try.  The colors and pose are good.</td>', 'Just a little extra light on her left eye area is something I might try.  The colors and pose are good.', '2004-07-01 20:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(791126, 85972, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very well done, with perfect lighting.  The dark green glove is a great touch, it doesn''t distract from the model, but adds just a alittle interest.</td>', 'Very well done, with perfect lighting.  The dark green glove is a great touch, it doesn''t distract from the model, but adds just a alittle interest.', '2004-07-01 20:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(791132, 85855, 23279, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  She has that "someday" look in her eyes.</td>', 'Very nice.  She has that "someday" look in her eyes.', '2004-07-01 20:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(791133, 85612, 23279, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.</td>', 'Very, very nice.', '2004-07-01 20:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(791142, 85698, 23279, '<td valign="top">Adorable.  Good job.</td>', 'Adorable.  Good job.', '2004-07-01 20:52:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(791144, 85622, 17203, '<td valign="top">Composition and exposure are good, but lighting appears flat. Without a compelling expression on the subject, dramatic lighting is almost a necessity to create interest. Either one or both would probably boost your score dramatically. BTW- I think I have the same watch.  ;-)</td>', 'Composition and exposure are good, but lighting appears flat. Without a compelling expression on the subject, dramatic lighting is almost a necessity to create interest. Either one or both would probably boost your score dramatically. BTW- I think I have the same watch.  ;-)', '2004-07-01 20:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791153, 85698, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cute kids, especially the expression on the left. Focus appears a little soft, but that could be from resizing. Would love to see more dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Cute kids, especially the expression on the left. Focus appears a little soft, but that could be from resizing. Would love to see more dramatic lighting.', '2004-07-01 20:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(791229, 86315, 4967, '<td valign="top">I like what you were trying to do here... make it a very sophisticated shot, but there are a couple of things that I would suggest you go back, and maybe try and shoot again and improve if possible.  1) It looks to me like there is too much light concentrated on her left wrist and the armchairmy eye immediately goes to that spot because of how bright it is.  2) The position of her head seems somewhat off to me, I don''t think it looks natural or comfortable, and 3) I feel there is too much extra space on the left side of the picture (to her right).  I also think there are too many patterns and too much to look at here... a portrait should focus on her face (classically) and then from there you should find the other things.  Nice job with a slightly softer look.</td>', 'I like what you were trying to do here... make it a very sophisticated shot, but there are a couple of things that I would suggest you go back, and maybe try and shoot again and improve if possible.  1) It looks to me like there is too much light concentrated on her left wrist and the armchairmy eye immediately goes to that spot because of how bright it is.  2) The position of her head seems somewhat off to me, I don''t think it looks natural or comfortable, and 3) I feel there is too much extra space on the left side of the picture (to her right).  I also think there are too many patterns and too much to look at here... a portrait should focus on her face (classically) and then from there you should find the other things.  Nice job with a slightly softer look.', '2004-07-01 21:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(791231, 86099, 4967, '<td valign="top">Beautifully done, I love the slight color cast to it... definitely gives you a different feeling then if her eyes were pure white.  I also like the different approach, very pretty... good luck.</td>', 'Beautifully done, I love the slight color cast to it... definitely gives you a different feeling then if her eyes were pure white.  I also like the different approach, very pretty... good luck.', '2004-07-01 21:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(791233, 86229, 4967, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you are hearing this a lot... but this was supposed to be in a studio... (studio color portrait) or at least a studio like setup... I may be wrong however it could be a painting in the background?!  Anyway... I like the soft focus, but I don''t think the pose is particularly flattering to someone who looks like a beautiful woman, did you try playing around with poses?</td>', 'I''m sure you are hearing this a lot... but this was supposed to be in a studio... (studio color portrait) or at least a studio like setup... I may be wrong however it could be a painting in the background?!  Anyway... I like the soft focus, but I don''t think the pose is particularly flattering to someone who looks like a beautiful woman, did you try playing around with poses?', '2004-07-01 21:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(791236, 86046, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The heavy lighting coming only from his right is causing heavy shadows on his left side; so heavy the eye and features beside the nose are almost lost.  A lower amp fill light (or reflector) on his left would have taken care of this, while a difuser on the main light would have been less harsh on his skin tones and prevent the near hot spot on his forhead.  The catchlight in his eyes are what save the left half of his face from vanishing into the shadow.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  There is nothing drastically wrong with the pose, it is good;  but it could have helped to prevent other problems if done slightly differently.  His slouched posture gives him a feeling of being at ease with himself and his surroundings, which is good.  However, it also produced the wringles in his clothing that help to accent how strong the light is (again, a fill light could help here).<br/>The tilt of his head is a bit too straight on for my tastes.  Having him look slightly more to his right (just enough to hide his right ear) would have moved his face more into the light, without his features casting such harse shadows.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The only thing I would change about the background would be to move him further from it (to get it to blur more), as it is nearly as sharp as he is, which can be a bit distracting.</td>', 'Lighting:  The heavy lighting coming only from his right is causing heavy shadows on his left side; so heavy the eye and features beside the nose are almost lost.  A lower amp fill light (or reflector) on his left would have taken care of this, while a difuser on the main light would have been less harsh on his skin tones and prevent the near hot spot on his forhead.  The catchlight in his eyes are what save the left half of his face from vanishing into the shadow.Pose:  There is nothing drastically wrong with the pose, it is good;  but it could have helped to prevent other problems if done slightly differently.  His slouched posture gives him a feeling of being at ease with himself and his surroundings, which is good.  However, it also produced the wringles in his clothing that help to accent how strong the light is (again, a fill light could help here).The tilt of his head is a bit too straight on for my tastes.  Having him look slightly more to his right (just enough to hide his right ear) would have moved his face more into the light, without his features casting such harse shadows.Background:  The only thing I would change about the background would be to move him further from it (to get it to blur more), as it is nearly as sharp as he is, which can be a bit distracting.', '2004-07-01 21:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(791237, 85901, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice... I like it... good use of empty space.. great use of lighting.  Very well done... Now step over to the dark side ;-). J/K... -10-</td>', 'Nice... I like it... good use of empty space.. great use of lighting.  Very well done... Now step over to the dark side ;-). J/K... -10-', '2004-07-01 21:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(791242, 86307, 4967, '<td valign="top">It looks like you went for a soft focus here... but I think I have to disagree with that usage... the model''s stance, her look, everything about her including the choice of colors (black and white and the red lipstick) all seem to give the opposite of a softness.  Also might have been nice to see her standing against the pole maybe slightly to the side, as it looks like it is growing straight out of her head.  I do like the black and white on her though... and the little amount of red is wonderful.</td>', 'It looks like you went for a soft focus here... but I think I have to disagree with that usage... the model''s stance, her look, everything about her including the choice of colors (black and white and the red lipstick) all seem to give the opposite of a softness.  Also might have been nice to see her standing against the pole maybe slightly to the side, as it looks like it is growing straight out of her head.  I do like the black and white on her though... and the little amount of red is wonderful.', '2004-07-01 21:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(791256, 85273, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love the softness here... and the innocence... what HUGE eyes!  I would have liked her mouth to be maybe a tad bit sharper.. but its not too big of a deal... good job with your lighting.... really nicely done.</td>', 'I love the softness here... and the innocence... what HUGE eyes!  I would have liked her mouth to be maybe a tad bit sharper.. but its not too big of a deal... good job with your lighting.... really nicely done.', '2004-07-01 21:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(791266, 85554, 7628, '<td valign="top">This young man does have an air of the young Rembrant.  It is a very simple honest portrait.  It doesn''t say much about the subject however - a bit of a year-book photo, but a good one as far as those go.</td>', 'This young man does have an air of the young Rembrant.  It is a very simple honest portrait.  It doesn''t say much about the subject however - a bit of a year-book photo, but a good one as far as those go.', '2004-07-01 21:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(791275, 85623, 7628, '<td valign="top">There is a lovely glow to the light here.  While the background is a blur, the mottled light and patterns give depth to the photo without distracting.  The brightest spots on her face seem a bit too bright, and the shadowy side feels a bit mottled.</td>', 'There is a lovely glow to the light here.  While the background is a blur, the mottled light and patterns give depth to the photo without distracting.  The brightest spots on her face seem a bit too bright, and the shadowy side feels a bit mottled.', '2004-07-01 22:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(791283, 85526, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The light is well suited for the model, but it seems to come from directly over your head.  This has caused rather strong shadows under the nose, lips and chin, and flattened out your models features.  Using two lights, a strong one from one side and another, weaker, from the other to fill in the shadows slightly would have corrected this.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Her pose is pleasant, but again the perspective is from straight on.  it is generally more flattering for the model for the perspective to be from slightly above her eye level.  On a related note, a portrait should be of the person you are taking the photo of, having someone else in the shot is distracting, particularly when they are not fully in the shot and are blocking some of the light that would have been better used lighting your model (top of head).<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background is nice, although it is a bit close as there are pronounced shadows visible on it.</td>', 'Lighting:  The light is well suited for the model, but it seems to come from directly over your head.  This has caused rather strong shadows under the nose, lips and chin, and flattened out your models features.  Using two lights, a strong one from one side and another, weaker, from the other to fill in the shadows slightly would have corrected this.Pose:  Her pose is pleasant, but again the perspective is from straight on.  it is generally more flattering for the model for the perspective to be from slightly above her eye level.  On a related note, a portrait should be of the person you are taking the photo of, having someone else in the shot is distracting, particularly when they are not fully in the shot and are blocking some of the light that would have been better used lighting your model (top of head).Background:  The background is nice, although it is a bit close as there are pronounced shadows visible on it.', '2004-07-01 22:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(791284, 85816, 17377, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this photo! The lighting is unique and well done. If I was to change one thing I may have zoomed in a bit tighter.  Great job, I think this photo deserves a ribbon!</td>', 'I really enjoy this photo! The lighting is unique and well done. If I was to change one thing I may have zoomed in a bit tighter.  Great job, I think this photo deserves a ribbon!', '2004-07-01 22:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(791299, 86248, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is nice and evenly distributed over what it is intended to be on.  The only thing I would have changed would be to add a catchlight, the blue would have sparkled,  giving the eyes a much needed spark of life.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Frankly I do not care for the expression or the hair to the right of her face.  The expression does not say dreamer to me.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background is perfect.  It is blurred out well, and matches her eyes.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is nice and evenly distributed over what it is intended to be on.  The only thing I would have changed would be to add a catchlight, the blue would have sparkled,  giving the eyes a much needed spark of life.Pose:  Frankly I do not care for the expression or the hair to the right of her face.  The expression does not say dreamer to me.Background:  The background is perfect.  It is blurred out well, and matches her eyes.', '2004-07-01 22:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(791300, 86140, 4967, '<td valign="top">I love it... sexy... unique... nice lighting... I love the leading lines great use of browns, blacks and greys, Very nicely done.... I might have liked to have seen some sort of an expression on her face... maybe a sexy smirk or something?  Otherwise wonderful -9-</td>', 'I love it... sexy... unique... nice lighting... I love the leading lines great use of browns, blacks and greys, Very nicely done.... I might have liked to have seen some sort of an expression on her face... maybe a sexy smirk or something?  Otherwise wonderful -9-', '2004-07-01 22:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(791304, 85241, 4967, '<td valign="top">very nice... very sexy... might be a tad bit oversharpened?  I can''t really tell... Some lipstick might have been nice to go with her eyes which are beautiful, and stand out... Nicely done though.</td>', 'very nice... very sexy... might be a tad bit oversharpened?  I can''t really tell... Some lipstick might have been nice to go with her eyes which are beautiful, and stand out... Nicely done though.', '2004-07-01 22:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(791334, 86107, 19311, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo!  Unfortunately I can''t vote but this would sure be a 10.  This deserves top 3, hopefully number 1.  Good luck.</td>', 'Amazing photo!  Unfortunately I can''t vote but this would sure be a 10.  This deserves top 3, hopefully number 1.  Good luck.', '2004-07-01 22:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(791399, 86275, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, Hopper, but I liked the lighting soooo much better on your last Portrait challenge entry. This is fairly flat by comparison. Composition and focus are good- just a little more contrast on that light would help immensely.</td>', 'Nice photo, Hopper, but I liked the lighting soooo much better on your last Portrait challenge entry. This is fairly flat by comparison. Composition and focus are good- just a little more contrast on that light would help immensely.', '2004-07-01 23:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(791415, 85241, 17203, '<td valign="top">My favorite composition of the challenge. Unfortunately, the light is a bit too flat for my taste, and it seems a little grainy. Maybe you had to crop too much? Still one of my top picks, but could''ve been a 10 with very little effort. Nice job!</td>', 'My favorite composition of the challenge. Unfortunately, the light is a bit too flat for my taste, and it seems a little grainy. Maybe you had to crop too much? Still one of my top picks, but could''ve been a 10 with very little effort. Nice job!', '2004-07-01 23:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(791426, 86167, 17203, '<td valign="top">Well done! One of my favorites in this group. One of the few softly lit shots that work well, too. I wish there was a little more saturation in the color because the hair and eyes look like they could be quite rich. I like the drama of the dark areas, but I might have burned in the left background a bit to pull the balance away from the heavy right side.</td>', 'Well done! One of my favorites in this group. One of the few softly lit shots that work well, too. I wish there was a little more saturation in the color because the hair and eyes look like they could be quite rich. I like the drama of the dark areas, but I might have burned in the left background a bit to pull the balance away from the heavy right side.', '2004-07-01 23:27:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(791432, 85273, 17203, '<td valign="top">Love those glassy eyes. The expression and composition are great. If the focus were sharper and there was a bit more color saturation, this would be one of my top three. Well worth framing for yourself!</td>', 'Love those glassy eyes. The expression and composition are great. If the focus were sharper and there was a bit more color saturation, this would be one of my top three. Well worth framing for yourself!', '2004-07-01 23:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(791441, 86313, 17203, '<td valign="top">The caricature-like angle on this shot really makes it stand out from the crowd. Good choice of background color, too. The expression could be better, but the soft focus on the eyes is the only real weak spot here.</td>', 'The caricature-like angle on this shot really makes it stand out from the crowd. Good choice of background color, too. The expression could be better, but the soft focus on the eyes is the only real weak spot here.', '2004-07-01 23:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(791546, 86279, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great expression. The light is somewhat dark at the bottom, and the focus is a little soft, but if this is your first attempt, you might want to consider a cereer in portraits.  ;-)</td>', 'Great expression. The light is somewhat dark at the bottom, and the focus is a little soft, but if this is your first attempt, you might want to consider a cereer in portraits.  ;-)', '2004-07-02 00:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(791550, 86199, 18349, '<td valign="top">Although this is a nice snapshot of your model, it really doesn''t say "studio portrait" to me.  The area behind her head and the highlights along her arm are extremely hot, and the reflections in her sunglasses are distracting.  I do like the off-center composition and her natural pose.  :o)</td>', 'Although this is a nice snapshot of your model, it really doesn''t say "studio portrait" to me.  The area behind her head and the highlights along her arm are extremely hot, and the reflections in her sunglasses are distracting.  I do like the off-center composition and her natural pose.  :o)', '2004-07-02 00:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(791557, 85956, 18349, '<td valign="top">This image is just a bit to artsy for my taste, especially when considering a color studio portrait...it isn''t really what comes to mind.  Interesting lighting and effect, however.  :o)</td>', 'This image is just a bit to artsy for my taste, especially when considering a color studio portrait...it isn''t really what comes to mind.  Interesting lighting and effect, however.  :o)', '2004-07-02 00:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(791561, 86084, 18349, '<td valign="top">If she were looking up at the camera or off into the distance, this would work so much better.  Her pose, hair color, and the soft lighting are all in place to make a good portrait, but her downward glance just does it in.  :o)</td>', 'If she were looking up at the camera or off into the distance, this would work so much better.  Her pose, hair color, and the soft lighting are all in place to make a good portrait, but her downward glance just does it in.  :o)', '2004-07-02 00:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(791564, 86226, 18349, '<td valign="top">This really isn''t what comes to mind when considering a "studio portrait" IMHO.  It is a good picture of the young lady and the horse, however some of the highlights are a bit blown out.  The shadow cast on her face from the hat is a bit distracting as well.  :o)</td>', 'This really isn''t what comes to mind when considering a "studio portrait" IMHO.  It is a good picture of the young lady and the horse, however some of the highlights are a bit blown out.  The shadow cast on her face from the hat is a bit distracting as well.  :o)', '2004-07-02 00:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(791567, 86287, 18349, '<td valign="top">This would be a really nice portrait or even a poster if it were cropped a bit more on the right and the lighting were a touch brighter, so we could see more detail of the sad expression.  :o)</td>', 'This would be a really nice portrait or even a poster if it were cropped a bit more on the right and the lighting were a touch brighter, so we could see more detail of the sad expression.  :o)', '2004-07-02 00:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(791599, 86213, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little high-key, and I''m not generally a fan of subjects leading the viewer out of the frame. Oh... who am I kidding? My second-favorite of the bunch! Looks like you may finally get a ribbon Mehmet. Judging by your expression here, you already knew that, didn''t you? Congrats!</td>', 'A little high-key, and I''m not generally a fan of subjects leading the viewer out of the frame. Oh... who am I kidding? My second-favorite of the bunch! Looks like you may finally get a ribbon Mehmet. Judging by your expression here, you already knew that, didn''t you? Congrats!', '2004-07-02 00:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(791604, 86243, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks. The light seems a little flat, and I''d like to see a more engaging expression, but still very well photographed.</td>', 'One of my top picks. The light seems a little flat, and I''d like to see a more engaging expression, but still very well photographed.', '2004-07-02 00:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(791615, 86140, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, background and focus, and the exaggerated angle provides an interesting composition. Skin tines are a little hot, but not too bad. I wish she had a more more expressive look on her face, but that''s about all I can criticize. A very good shot overall, Sahko.</td>', 'Good lighting, background and focus, and the exaggerated angle provides an interesting composition. Skin tines are a little hot, but not too bad. I wish she had a more more expressive look on her face, but that''s about all I can criticize. A very good shot overall, Sahko.', '2004-07-02 00:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(791625, 86287, 17203, '<td valign="top">Send in the light while you''re at it. A very good concept, but wasted by poor lighting, and I don''t feel like there''s enough contrast between dark and light tones to pass as moody. The bright colors could have made a dazzling entry with more light in the room. The obvious artifacts around the hair and arms don''t help, either.</td>', 'Send in the light while you''re at it. A very good concept, but wasted by poor lighting, and I don''t feel like there''s enough contrast between dark and light tones to pass as moody. The bright colors could have made a dazzling entry with more light in the room. The obvious artifacts around the hair and arms don''t help, either.', '2004-07-02 01:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(791637, 85956, 17203, '<td valign="top">OK, that''s just scary. I admire your daring approach, but it''s just too over the top for me. Not quite the "formal studio portrait" that I think many are expecting here. It might have worked better with a good exposure turned into a duotone, but this looks like it''s reversed and solarized and the result is... well, weird.</td>', 'OK, that''s just scary. I admire your daring approach, but it''s just too over the top for me. Not quite the "formal studio portrait" that I think many are expecting here. It might have worked better with a good exposure turned into a duotone, but this looks like it''s reversed and solarized and the result is... well, weird.', '2004-07-02 01:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(791642, 86130, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice color, and funny too. I wish the light had been less harsh, as I think it distracts somewhat from the fun expression. So this is a formal studio portrait, huh? I wonder what casual would look like? Sure is expressive, though! ;-)</td>', 'Nice color, and funny too. I wish the light had been less harsh, as I think it distracts somewhat from the fun expression. So this is a formal studio portrait, huh? I wonder what casual would look like? Sure is expressive, though! ;-)', '2004-07-02 01:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(791666, 86283, 1031, '<td valign="top">An interesting choice to use the relatively wild-colored plaid with a photo in which large blocks of smooth color predominate. I''m not sure if it was an esthetic choice, meant to convey something about the personality of the subject, or was just the only clean short available :) I''d like to see this with a solid dark blue or brown shirt for comparison. Lighting and focus and stuff look fine to me.</td>', 'An interesting choice to use the relatively wild-colored plaid with a photo in which large blocks of smooth color predominate. I''m not sure if it was an esthetic choice, meant to convey something about the personality of the subject, or was just the only clean short available :) I''d like to see this with a solid dark blue or brown shirt for comparison. Lighting and focus and stuff look fine to me.', '2004-07-02 01:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(791671, 86076, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good time to use a soft-focus technique, and I like the colors. I personally like the negative space, but it would probably be stronger as a "portrait" if cropped from the left to about the center of her arm.</td>', 'Good time to use a soft-focus technique, and I like the colors. I personally like the negative space, but it would probably be stronger as a "portrait" if cropped from the left to about the center of her arm.', '2004-07-02 01:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791675, 85934, 1031, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel like I''m sitting across the table from George :)</td>', 'Makes me feel like I''m sitting across the table from George :)', '2004-07-02 01:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(791678, 86130, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like after 200 shots she got tired of posing.</td>', 'Looks like after 200 shots she got tired of posing.', '2004-07-02 01:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791688, 86099, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting, color, pose are all great. Only tiny change I''d have made would be to clone out the lower catchlight in her right eye to make the pupils symmetrical.</td>', 'Lighting, color, pose are all great. Only tiny change I''d have made would be to clone out the lower catchlight in her right eye to make the pupils symmetrical.', '2004-07-02 01:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(791692, 85265, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good lighting to see the hair on the table, "limited color scheme" works well.</td>', 'Good lighting to see the hair on the table, "limited color scheme" works well.', '2004-07-02 02:02:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(791698, 86305, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m missing the top hat, cigar, and "Vote for Me" button :)<br/>S/he looks very "dignified" under the circumstances -- good job getting the focal plane centered around his/her eyes.</td>', 'I''m missing the top hat, cigar, and "Vote for Me" button :)S/he looks very "dignified" under the circumstances -- good job getting the focal plane centered around his/her eyes.', '2004-07-02 02:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(791732, 85923, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Beautifully done high-key.  The only change I would consider would be a stronger catchlight, but I am not certain about that.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is good, perhaps her head could be turned a bit more to her right, just enough to hide that ear is what I am thinking.  Doing so would, I believe, allow the light to give the face better depth and make the left ear not quite so obvious.  Very minor points to consider toward an image that works.<br/><b>Background:</b>  What background?  :)</td>', 'Lighting:  Beautifully done high-key.  The only change I would consider would be a stronger catchlight, but I am not certain about that.Pose:  The pose is good, perhaps her head could be turned a bit more to her right, just enough to hide that ear is what I am thinking.  Doing so would, I believe, allow the light to give the face better depth and make the left ear not quite so obvious.  Very minor points to consider toward an image that works.Background:  What background?  :)', '2004-07-02 02:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(791735, 85284, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Lighting is good, and well balanced, with a catchlight giving a strong sense of interest in her eyes.  The shadows could use a bit of lightening around the left eye, and the hair has lost some of its detail, but minor issues of personal taste.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose works.  The shoulders work with the eyes to create a pair of leading lines that draw the attention.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Nicely done.</td>', 'Lighting:  Lighting is good, and well balanced, with a catchlight giving a strong sense of interest in her eyes.  The shadows could use a bit of lightening around the left eye, and the hair has lost some of its detail, but minor issues of personal taste.Pose:  The pose works.  The shoulders work with the eyes to create a pair of leading lines that draw the attention.Background:  Nicely done.', '2004-07-02 02:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(791738, 85698, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Well balanced with strong spark of life from the catchlight.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The poses work well as they are each displaying their individuality in the face of the obvious similarities.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Works well with the models.  the only thing I would attempt to change would be to move the models and the background further apart to minimize the shadows.</td>', 'Lighting:  Well balanced with strong spark of life from the catchlight.Pose:  The poses work well as they are each displaying their individuality in the face of the obvious similarities.Background:  Works well with the models.  the only thing I would attempt to change would be to move the models and the background further apart to minimize the shadows.', '2004-07-02 02:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(791743, 85241, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is wonderful, but I would have liked to see more life in her eyes, that can be provided by a catchlight.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Sorry, with the pupils of her eyes covered by her eyelids she looks more asleep than posed.  A beautiful model in a good composition, but the eyes are killing it for me.<br/><b>Background:</b> Using her hair as a background to frame her face is fabulous.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is wonderful, but I would have liked to see more life in her eyes, that can be provided by a catchlight.Pose:  Sorry, with the pupils of her eyes covered by her eyelids she looks more asleep than posed.  A beautiful model in a good composition, but the eyes are killing it for me.Background: Using her hair as a background to frame her face is fabulous.', '2004-07-02 03:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(791757, 86089, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Fabulous.  The obviously intenional brightness on the dress conveys well the inner glow of their affection.  The details in the faces and indeed the entire image are incredible considering the small range of very bright colors you limited yourself to.  The only thing I find even slightly distracting is the shadow of his nose -- a minor distraction to be sure, but still there for me.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  From the positioning of their bodies to the expressions on their faces, I am definitely intruding on them as they bask in the glow.<br/><b>Background:</b>  A private place.  It matches the tone of the image perfectly.<br/> <br/>I would love to hear more about the wrokflow you mention in the title after the challenge.</td>', 'Lighting:  Fabulous.  The obviously intenional brightness on the dress conveys well the inner glow of their affection.  The details in the faces and indeed the entire image are incredible considering the small range of very bright colors you limited yourself to.  The only thing I find even slightly distracting is the shadow of his nose -- a minor distraction to be sure, but still there for me.Pose:  From the positioning of their bodies to the expressions on their faces, I am definitely intruding on them as they bask in the glow.Background:  A private place.  It matches the tone of the image perfectly. I would love to hear more about the wrokflow you mention in the title after the challenge.', '2004-07-02 03:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(791830, 86130, 19952, '<td valign="top">Too funny! Would like a bit more light on her left side, but the background lighting is really outstanding.</td>', 'Too funny! Would like a bit more light on her left side, but the background lighting is really outstanding.', '2004-07-02 04:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(791832, 86167, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and excellent soft focus and composition. Really great portrait.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and excellent soft focus and composition. Really great portrait.', '2004-07-02 04:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(791833, 86248, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot with perfect lighting. My only nitpick is that the crop in the top left corner makes her head seem a bit misshapen, but that''s just an optical illusion. Still, might look better with either a tighter or wider crop. Otherwise, absolutely wonderful shot - one of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful shot with perfect lighting. My only nitpick is that the crop in the top left corner makes her head seem a bit misshapen, but that''s just an optical illusion. Still, might look better with either a tighter or wider crop. Otherwise, absolutely wonderful shot - one of the best in the challenge.', '2004-07-02 04:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(791836, 86213, 19952, '<td valign="top">Wow - this is more depth and clarity than you sould be able to achieve with a digital camera. Nice shot, Theodore! ;-)</td>', 'Wow - this is more depth and clarity than you sould be able to achieve with a digital camera. Nice shot, Theodore! ;-)', '2004-07-02 04:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(791838, 86099, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft focus and excellent job with color and lighting. One of the best photos in this challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful soft focus and excellent job with color and lighting. One of the best photos in this challenge.', '2004-07-02 04:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(791839, 85241, 19952, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. It seems just a bit oversharpened around the eyes and mouth, so it might have looked better in softer focus, but it''s absolutely stunning as it is. Great job!</td>', 'I really love this shot. It seems just a bit oversharpened around the eyes and mouth, so it might have looked better in softer focus, but it''s absolutely stunning as it is. Great job!', '2004-07-02 04:42:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(791840, 85923, 19952, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! The underexposure might be just a bit much, but it really brings out those eyes. Really great job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot! The underexposure might be just a bit much, but it really brings out those eyes. Really great job.', '2004-07-02 04:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(791873, 85612, 15920, '<td valign="top">I thought this was really well done.  I might have tried to light her face just a fraction more.</td>', 'I thought this was really well done.  I might have tried to light her face just a fraction more.', '2004-07-02 07:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(791874, 85629, 15920, '<td valign="top">The choice of dark blue hood against the pure black background provides a very subtle but nice frame.  I like it.</td>', 'The choice of dark blue hood against the pure black background provides a very subtle but nice frame.  I like it.', '2004-07-02 07:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(791877, 86226, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a good outdoor portrait, and captures a bit of your subject very well.  Only thing I can think to recomend is that you use a little less DOF to reduce emphasis on the background.</td>', 'This is a good outdoor portrait, and captures a bit of your subject very well.  Only thing I can think to recomend is that you use a little less DOF to reduce emphasis on the background.', '2004-07-02 07:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(791881, 86312, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great expression.</td>', 'Great expression.', '2004-07-02 07:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(791882, 86265, 15920, '<td valign="top">Congratulations.  Hope you are saving for college.  I always find these start of life photos amazing, and though there isn''t much you can do during shooting them, a tight crop that shows only a signle color backgroud might focus more attention on this little future superstar.</td>', 'Congratulations.  Hope you are saving for college.  I always find these start of life photos amazing, and though there isn''t much you can do during shooting them, a tight crop that shows only a signle color backgroud might focus more attention on this little future superstar.', '2004-07-02 07:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(791883, 85780, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great title, good exposure with great lighting.  Only issue is the skin seems to have less texture than you would expect for someone this age, so I am guessing that you processed it out.  If not, my apologies.</td>', 'Great title, good exposure with great lighting.  Only issue is the skin seems to have less texture than you would expect for someone this age, so I am guessing that you processed it out.  If not, my apologies.', '2004-07-02 07:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(791940, 85934, 18450, '<td valign="top">lovely portrait......really like the lighting, skin tones and pose of the model. His personality seems to shine through</td>', 'lovely portrait......really like the lighting, skin tones and pose of the model. His personality seems to shine through', '2004-07-02 08:43:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(791947, 85923, 18450, '<td valign="top">I love the focus, dof, natural pose of the model, skin tonings, and color of the hair, eyes etc but the lighting seems to me to be a bit too bright, the background and model''s outfit too white.</td>', 'I love the focus, dof, natural pose of the model, skin tonings, and color of the hair, eyes etc but the lighting seems to me to be a bit too bright, the background and model''s outfit too white.', '2004-07-02 08:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(791970, 86279, 20981, '<td valign="top">!st time very good.</td>', '!st time very good.', '2004-07-02 09:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(791976, 86226, 21714, '<td valign="top">It''s not really a studio portrait, is it?</td>', 'It''s not really a studio portrait, is it?', '2004-07-02 09:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(791979, 85334, 21714, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it''s a studio portrait of a person.  Interesting image though.</td>', 'I don''t think it''s a studio portrait of a person.  Interesting image though.', '2004-07-02 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(791980, 85816, 21714, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea. Love the uniqueness of the image. Good thinking.</td>', 'Very cool idea. Love the uniqueness of the image. Good thinking.', '2004-07-02 09:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(791981, 86305, 21714, '<td valign="top">Studio portrait of a person?</td>', 'Studio portrait of a person?', '2004-07-02 09:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(792004, 86287, 18450, '<td valign="top">a lovely idea.....would have liked to have seen more light on the model so I could see him clearly</td>', 'a lovely idea.....would have liked to have seen more light on the model so I could see him clearly', '2004-07-02 10:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(792033, 85835, 18349, '<td valign="top">I love the wonderful, happy expression on the boys'' faces...I have three sons myself, and there''s just nothing like seeing them so joyful.  I do find this to be a bit of a stretch for a formal studio portrait, given the spontaneous nature of this image.  That said, the lighting is effective, focus is good.  :o)</td>', 'I love the wonderful, happy expression on the boys'' faces...I have three sons myself, and there''s just nothing like seeing them so joyful.  I do find this to be a bit of a stretch for a formal studio portrait, given the spontaneous nature of this image.  That said, the lighting is effective, focus is good.  :o)', '2004-07-02 10:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(792036, 85718, 18349, '<td valign="top">This has potential...it needs to be in sharper focus.  I understand that you may have been going for a soft focus look, but there''s a fine line between soft focus and out of focus.  You are close, however.  I like the composition of the shot, her downward gaze, and the warm lighting.  :o)</td>', 'This has potential...it needs to be in sharper focus.  I understand that you may have been going for a soft focus look, but there''s a fine line between soft focus and out of focus.  You are close, however.  I like the composition of the shot, her downward gaze, and the warm lighting.  :o)', '2004-07-02 10:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(792038, 85273, 18177, '<td valign="top">seems to be little outfocused</td>', 'seems to be little outfocused', '2004-07-02 11:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(792039, 86262, 18349, '<td valign="top">I am a big fan of the diffuse glow filter.  It seems to be applied a tad too heavily to her forehead and nose, causing them to appear out of balance with the rest of her features.  The right side of the portrait is also darker than the left, creating more imbalance.  Her red hair and blue shirt compliment each other nicely.  On my monitor, the lipstick seems a bit too saturated, which kind of makes it clash with the colors in the rest of the photo.  Cute pose, great expression.  :o)</td>', 'I am a big fan of the diffuse glow filter.  It seems to be applied a tad too heavily to her forehead and nose, causing them to appear out of balance with the rest of her features.  The right side of the portrait is also darker than the left, creating more imbalance.  Her red hair and blue shirt compliment each other nicely.  On my monitor, the lipstick seems a bit too saturated, which kind of makes it clash with the colors in the rest of the photo.  Cute pose, great expression.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(792041, 86075, 18349, '<td valign="top">How sweet!  The lighting in this picture is just a bit flat, almost creating a hazy look.  Perhaps a different background or a bit stronger key light could help.  :o)</td>', 'How sweet!  The lighting in this picture is just a bit flat, almost creating a hazy look.  Perhaps a different background or a bit stronger key light could help.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(792045, 86280, 18349, '<td valign="top">Quite an interesting take on the challenge.  The image appears, on my monitor, to be a bit soft on focus.  The skin is a bit shiny as well, which is distracting.  Good effort, and kudos for being different.  :o)</td>', 'Quite an interesting take on the challenge.  The image appears, on my monitor, to be a bit soft on focus.  The skin is a bit shiny as well, which is distracting.  Good effort, and kudos for being different.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(792048, 86276, 18349, '<td valign="top">The light coming down on her face is a bit harsh...creates a glow on her hair.  Also, there is a wisp of hair in her bangs that covers the iris of her right eye, which causes her eye too look completly white and unnatural.  Pose is cute, but the pop casts a big shadow on the left side of her face.  The sleeve covering her hand is a distraction to me.  The highlight on the tip of her nose creates a glow that almost causes that part of her nose to disappear.  With a bit of a lighting adjustment, this could be a very nice portrait.  :o)</td>', 'The light coming down on her face is a bit harsh...creates a glow on her hair.  Also, there is a wisp of hair in her bangs that covers the iris of her right eye, which causes her eye too look completly white and unnatural.  Pose is cute, but the pop casts a big shadow on the left side of her face.  The sleeve covering her hand is a distraction to me.  The highlight on the tip of her nose creates a glow that almost causes that part of her nose to disappear.  With a bit of a lighting adjustment, this could be a very nice portrait.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(792050, 86265, 18349, '<td valign="top">Cute baby, but the image is out of focus.  I think the colors and contrast could be tweaked a bit to maximize this adorable image.  :o)</td>', 'Cute baby, but the image is out of focus.  I think the colors and contrast could be tweaked a bit to maximize this adorable image.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(792052, 86121, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very sweet...cute pose.  IMHO, the necklace is more of a distraction than anything.  She has such a sweet expression, the catchlight in her eyes highlights it perfectly.  Not crazy about the vignette, but it isn''t a distraction.  :o)</td>', 'Very sweet...cute pose.  IMHO, the necklace is more of a distraction than anything.  She has such a sweet expression, the catchlight in her eyes highlights it perfectly.  Not crazy about the vignette, but it isn''t a distraction.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(792053, 86255, 18349, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful model.  The contrasts between the blouse and the dark surroundings creates a bit of a distraction to me.  Maybe more light for the BG or a more muted color for her blouse?  Her face is shadowed heavily on its right side.    I think that with a lighting adjustment, this could be a beautiful portrait.  :o)</td>', 'Such a beautiful model.  The contrasts between the blouse and the dark surroundings creates a bit of a distraction to me.  Maybe more light for the BG or a more muted color for her blouse?  Her face is shadowed heavily on its right side.    I think that with a lighting adjustment, this could be a beautiful portrait.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(792055, 86130, 18349, '<td valign="top">Love your sense of humor.  It''s refreshing when things get a bit serious on this site!  :o)  Great background and lighting.  There are some severely highlighted/shadowed areas on the face which make details difficult to see, but overall it''s a cutie.  :o)</td>', 'Love your sense of humor.  It''s refreshing when things get a bit serious on this site!  :o)  Great background and lighting.  There are some severely highlighted/shadowed areas on the face which make details difficult to see, but overall it''s a cutie.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(792056, 86313, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very cute kiddo.  Love the pose.  The angle kind of makes him look like a bobblehead doll...good focus and lighting.  :o)</td>', 'Very cute kiddo.  Love the pose.  The angle kind of makes him look like a bobblehead doll...good focus and lighting.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(792057, 86316, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait; could use a bit more brightness in her face, IMHO.  The light on her shoulder is a tad distracting.  Nice, muted background.  :o)</td>', 'Nice portrait; could use a bit more brightness in her face, IMHO.  The light on her shoulder is a tad distracting.  Nice, muted background.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(792061, 86197, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is a nice portrait...she seems a bit close to the background, creating some shadowing/halo looking effect around her shoulders and neck.  I understand that you were probably going for a soft focus look, which is great, but it is just a touch too soft for my taste around her eyes, which I think should appear sharper and more detailed.  It works well for the rest of the portrait, however.  Very good effort.  :o)</td>', 'This is a nice portrait...she seems a bit close to the background, creating some shadowing/halo looking effect around her shoulders and neck.  I understand that you were probably going for a soft focus look, which is great, but it is just a touch too soft for my taste around her eyes, which I think should appear sharper and more detailed.  It works well for the rest of the portrait, however.  Very good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(792064, 85790, 18349, '<td valign="top">This has a sort of VIctorian appeal to it.  I like the choice of costume and hat.  The portrait is too dark on her right side, IMHO.  I would rather see a bit more detail all over than just on one side.  The light seems to blow out on the pearls a bit.  This does have potential, perhaps with minor lighting adjustments.  :o)</td>', 'This has a sort of VIctorian appeal to it.  I like the choice of costume and hat.  The portrait is too dark on her right side, IMHO.  I would rather see a bit more detail all over than just on one side.  The light seems to blow out on the pearls a bit.  This does have potential, perhaps with minor lighting adjustments.  :o)', '2004-07-02 11:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(792212, 86046, 18349, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pose.  The lighting is a bit harsh and one-sided, however, leaving the face shadowed to the point that many details in his expression are lost.  The light right under the brim of his hat kind of blows out the forehead a bit as well.  This could be a very good portrait with a few minor lighting adjustments.  :o)</td>', 'Wonderful pose.  The lighting is a bit harsh and one-sided, however, leaving the face shadowed to the point that many details in his expression are lost.  The light right under the brim of his hat kind of blows out the forehead a bit as well.  This could be a very good portrait with a few minor lighting adjustments.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(792215, 86147, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail.  Filling the frame is important in portraits, and you''ve certainly done that.  The worried expression creates an emotive response in the viewer.  :o)</td>', 'Great focus and detail.  Filling the frame is important in portraits, and you''ve certainly done that.  The worried expression creates an emotive response in the viewer.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(792217, 86314, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and expression on the model''s face.  I would have preferred to see it without the lamp and pillow/furniture in the background.  Good effort.  :o)</td>', 'Good lighting and expression on the model''s face.  I would have preferred to see it without the lamp and pillow/furniture in the background.  Good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(792221, 85568, 18349, '<td valign="top">Clear and focused; however it does resemble a driver''s license picture rather than a studio portrait...perhaps from the expressionless pose and the centered composition.  Reshooting with a more dynamic pose and expression would give you a different result.  Good effort.  :o)</td>', 'Clear and focused; however it does resemble a driver''s license picture rather than a studio portrait...perhaps from the expressionless pose and the centered composition.  Reshooting with a more dynamic pose and expression would give you a different result.  Good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(792224, 85972, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful model, lighiting, and focus.  I am a bit confused, however, as the title is "My Love" yet she looks more angry than in love.  I would crop the left side a bit, giving her more negative space on the right, as that is the direction she is looking.  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful model, lighiting, and focus.  I am a bit confused, however, as the title is "My Love" yet she looks more angry than in love.  I would crop the left side a bit, giving her more negative space on the right, as that is the direction she is looking.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(792226, 86095, 18349, '<td valign="top">The back of her jacket seems to be bunched up around her neck.  This, along with the wrinkles in the blouse, serve as distractions to an otherwise good portrait.  I like the lighting on her face.  :o)</td>', 'The back of her jacket seems to be bunched up around her neck.  This, along with the wrinkles in the blouse, serve as distractions to an otherwise good portrait.  I like the lighting on her face.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(792229, 86107, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful child.  I would have preferred to see this in portrait mode rather than in landscape, to get the full length of the face.  As it is, her chin and forehead are chopped off, which is a bit disconcerting IMHO.  Excellent focus and detail.  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful child.  I would have preferred to see this in portrait mode rather than in landscape, to get the full length of the face.  As it is, her chin and forehead are chopped off, which is a bit disconcerting IMHO.  Excellent focus and detail.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(792231, 86103, 18349, '<td valign="top">Kudos for going out on a limb with this one.  I think it would be much more effective without the distractions of the border and the cat.   :o)</td>', 'Kudos for going out on a limb with this one.  I think it would be much more effective without the distractions of the border and the cat.   :o)', '2004-07-02 12:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(792234, 86243, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed.  Would like a bit more sharpness around the eyes.  :o)</td>', 'Very nicely composed.  Would like a bit more sharpness around the eyes.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(792237, 86219, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nice; love the dreamy quality.  Not sure about the "studio" portion of the challenge, as it is debatable whether or not outside is a studio, but it''s a good shot nonetheless...so I won''t down it for that reason.  :o)</td>', 'Very nice; love the dreamy quality.  Not sure about the "studio" portion of the challenge, as it is debatable whether or not outside is a studio, but it''s a good shot nonetheless...so I won''t down it for that reason.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(792240, 86281, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed; would like a crop from the top to bring her into the frame more.  Perhaps a levels adjustment or some slight dodging to highlight her a bit more?  She seems a tad dark on my monitor.  :o)</td>', 'Nicely composed; would like a crop from the top to bring her into the frame more.  Perhaps a levels adjustment or some slight dodging to highlight her a bit more?  She seems a tad dark on my monitor.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(792260, 85273, 18349, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful.</td>', 'Simply beautiful.', '2004-07-02 12:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(792263, 86212, 18349, '<td valign="top">Good pose, lighting seems to work well; there''s just something I can''t put my finger on that seems a bit harsh.  Perhaps a bit too much warmth or red?  I don''t know.  Excellent focus and detail.  :o)</td>', 'Good pose, lighting seems to work well; there''s just something I can''t put my finger on that seems a bit harsh.  Perhaps a bit too much warmth or red?  I don''t know.  Excellent focus and detail.  :o)', '2004-07-02 12:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(792264, 85827, 18349, '<td valign="top">Lighting appears to be a bit harsh, resulting in shadows on her face, neck, and chest.  The BG is also a bit distracting.  Good pose and focus, would like a bit of an off-centered approach but that''s just me.  This has a lot of potential with some minor lighting adjustments IMHO.  :o)</td>', 'Lighting appears to be a bit harsh, resulting in shadows on her face, neck, and chest.  The BG is also a bit distracting.  Good pose and focus, would like a bit of an off-centered approach but that''s just me.  This has a lot of potential with some minor lighting adjustments IMHO.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(792266, 85891, 18349, '<td valign="top">I would really like this one except for one thing...the reflections in the glasses seem to show clothing and miscellaneous equipment rather than something more visually appealing.  Focus and detail are excellent, and I love the background.  The reflections may be just a nitpick, but I would really like to see something more interesting or attention grabbing than laundry.  Excellent attempt.  :o)</td>', 'I would really like this one except for one thing...the reflections in the glasses seem to show clothing and miscellaneous equipment rather than something more visually appealing.  Focus and detail are excellent, and I love the background.  The reflections may be just a nitpick, but I would really like to see something more interesting or attention grabbing than laundry.  Excellent attempt.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(792269, 86037, 18349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...maybe a bit more light or some dodging around her shirt/face in the mirror?  Wonderful job.  :o)</td>', 'Beautiful...maybe a bit more light or some dodging around her shirt/face in the mirror?  Wonderful job.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(792272, 86060, 18349, '<td valign="top">Does Dave know you borrowed his shirt?  LOL<br/>Good portrait; lighting is effective but a bit warm for my taste.  The shirt is also a bit "busy," along with the undershirt peeking out...it seems to have a bit of print on it and together that gives the eye too much to take in, IMHO.  I would have preferred either no undershirt or the hawaiian shirt opened with a more complimentary undershirt.  But that''s just me.  Good effort, regardless.  :o)</td>', 'Does Dave know you borrowed his shirt?  LOLGood portrait; lighting is effective but a bit warm for my taste.  The shirt is also a bit "busy," along with the undershirt peeking out...it seems to have a bit of print on it and together that gives the eye too much to take in, IMHO.  I would have preferred either no undershirt or the hawaiian shirt opened with a more complimentary undershirt.  But that''s just me.  Good effort, regardless.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(792273, 85698, 18349, '<td valign="top">How very cute.  Love their expressions.  You had tow ork hard on this one, I''m sure!!!!  Great poses, expressive eyes, good catchlights.   Well done for working with babies!  :o)</td>', 'How very cute.  Love their expressions.  You had tow ork hard on this one, I''m sure!!!!  Great poses, expressive eyes, good catchlights.   Well done for working with babies!  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(792277, 86120, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Like the high-key effect.  Eyes are expressive, but the reflections in the right eye are distracting, as is the ring on her ring finger...it''s turned a bit.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'Nicely done.  Like the high-key effect.  Eyes are expressive, but the reflections in the right eye are distracting, as is the ring on her ring finger...it''s turned a bit.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(792279, 85855, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and focus.  Would have preferred more of a crop on the right side to give her more left sided negative space to stare off into.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'Nice lighting and focus.  Would have preferred more of a crop on the right side to give her more left sided negative space to stare off into.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(792281, 86312, 18349, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed; would like a bit more sharpness in her expressive eyes.  :o)</td>', 'Very nicely composed; would like a bit more sharpness in her expressive eyes.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(792282, 85894, 14593, '<td valign="top">what a cutie.....nice photo....taken at a great angle for such a little one.....nice props too.....love the hat!    <br/>After reviewing my voting scores I am bumping this photo up to a 10.....</td>', 'what a cutie.....nice photo....taken at a great angle for such a little one.....nice props too.....love the hat!    After reviewing my voting scores I am bumping this photo up to a 10.....', '2004-07-02 13:14:02.000000', NULL, 1),
