(792286, 86271, 18349, '<td valign="top">Not bad for a first attempt!  :o)  Lighting is effective and focus/detail are good.  Would like a bit more sharpness in the eyes.  Floor is a tad distracting due to the bunching up around his feet and the base of the drum.  Good effort.  :o)</td>', 'Not bad for a first attempt!  :o)  Lighting is effective and focus/detail are good.  Would like a bit more sharpness in the eyes.  Floor is a tad distracting due to the bunching up around his feet and the base of the drum.  Good effort.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(792291, 85693, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Love the bright colors and the joyful expression.  Highlights on the face are just a tad bright, but well done nonetheless.  :o)</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Love the bright colors and the joyful expression.  Highlights on the face are just a tad bright, but well done nonetheless.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(792293, 85629, 18349, '<td valign="top">Effective lighting and focus is very sharp.  I also like the off-center composition.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'Effective lighting and focus is very sharp.  I also like the off-center composition.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(792297, 85526, 18349, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed; skin appears a bit shiny in areas.  Perhaps some curves or levels adjustments could enrich the lovely dark skin tones and help eliminate the shadowed area on the neck.  Well done.  :o)</td>', 'Nicely composed; skin appears a bit shiny in areas.  Perhaps some curves or levels adjustments could enrich the lovely dark skin tones and help eliminate the shadowed area on the neck.  Well done.  :o)', '2004-07-02 13:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
