(792391, 86257, 18349, '<td valign="top">Great pose; love the expression on his face ("...you finished yet???").  Lighting is good; his hair does kind of fade into the BG just a bit and there are a few shadows on his leg/under his chin.  Maybe a bit more of a zoom into his upper body/face?  His left eye also appears to be watering...you didn''t make him cry, did you?  LOL :o)</td>', 'Great pose; love the expression on his face ("...you finished yet???").  Lighting is good; his hair does kind of fade into the BG just a bit and there are a few shadows on his leg/under his chin.  Maybe a bit more of a zoom into his upper body/face?  His left eye also appears to be watering...you didn''t make him cry, did you?  LOL :o)', '2004-07-02 14:01:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(792522, 85938, 2764, '<td valign="top">Of course this is the winner!  Everything is just perfect.  I love the hand colored look, remember when we did it with inks? the light is lovely but that shadow along the back of her face, neck, arm is exquisite. 10</td>', 'Of course this is the winner!  Everything is just perfect.  I love the hand colored look, remember when we did it with inks? the light is lovely but that shadow along the back of her face, neck, arm is exquisite. 10', '2004-07-02 15:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(792524, 85923, 2764, '<td valign="top">I am loving the high key entries into the challenge.  I think this is my third favorite over all, not just of the high keys. The lighting and the color are sooo nice, her eyes are perfectly placed to draw attention, her gaze and the tilt of her head make the photo move.</td>', 'I am loving the high key entries into the challenge.  I think this is my third favorite over all, not just of the high keys. The lighting and the color are sooo nice, her eyes are perfectly placed to draw attention, her gaze and the tilt of her head make the photo move.', '2004-07-02 15:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(792527, 85790, 2764, '<td valign="top">What an odd, wonderful portrait!  Make you wonder who is Margaret, she must have a story to tell.  She''s too old for pure dress ups, too young to really wear this get up.  He strange expression adds to the mystery.  The phoot itself is really well done, the lighting enhances the drama and makes her look more trapped in her odd life.  Her upward glance is tentative to the point of being afraid.  Great work!</td>', 'What an odd, wonderful portrait!  Make you wonder who is Margaret, she must have a story to tell.  She''s too old for pure dress ups, too young to really wear this get up.  He strange expression adds to the mystery.  The phoot itself is really well done, the lighting enhances the drama and makes her look more trapped in her odd life.  Her upward glance is tentative to the point of being afraid.  Great work!', '2004-07-02 15:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(792542, 86140, 9941, '<td valign="top">Love the informal pose, perhaps because it''s a bit erotic with the pointy heels.  My favorite of the group.  10.</td>', 'Love the informal pose, perhaps because it''s a bit erotic with the pointy heels.  My favorite of the group.  10.', '2004-07-02 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(792707, 86099, 13026, '<td valign="top">Hmm....I think I recognize this girl, from another picture.... I wonder if this photo was taken by who I think it was done by?  : )</td>', 'Hmm....I think I recognize this girl, from another picture.... I wonder if this photo was taken by who I think it was done by?  : )', '2004-07-02 18:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(792710, 86309, 13026, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  Beautiful little girl.  Maybe would''ve liked a bit more light on her face, though.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  Beautiful little girl.  Maybe would''ve liked a bit more light on her face, though.', '2004-07-02 18:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(792778, 86163, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is well lit, well posed, and the model''s expression is great.  Only thing I might change is to get a different umbrella.  That one is so colorful, is distracts from the model a bit.</td>', 'This is well lit, well posed, and the model''s expression is great.  Only thing I might change is to get a different umbrella.  That one is so colorful, is distracts from the model a bit.', '2004-07-02 19:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(792782, 86283, 15920, '<td valign="top">Needs just a little more light.</td>', 'Needs just a little more light.', '2004-07-02 19:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(792783, 86107, 16488, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully intense look on such a soft face!  I think the cropping makes it seem more like a magazine photo as opposed to a "studio shot" but I may be thinking too formally.  I guess I wish there was something more to give me a hint of her personality.</td>', 'Wonderfully intense look on such a soft face!  I think the cropping makes it seem more like a magazine photo as opposed to a "studio shot" but I may be thinking too formally.  I guess I wish there was something more to give me a hint of her personality.', '2004-07-02 19:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(792785, 85622, 15920, '<td valign="top">Eyes look just a little unreal on this monitor,  Pose and title are perfect together.</td>', 'Eyes look just a little unreal on this monitor,  Pose and title are perfect together.', '2004-07-02 19:20:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(792786, 86121, 16488, '<td valign="top">Hard, I''m sure to get a child this young to hold still for a shot like this.  I think the beaded necklace really detracts from your subject.   The spotlighting is creative but I don''t think it helps the overall effect.</td>', 'Hard, I''m sure to get a child this young to hold still for a shot like this.  I think the beaded necklace really detracts from your subject.   The spotlighting is creative but I don''t think it helps the overall effect.', '2004-07-02 19:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(792788, 85568, 15920, '<td valign="top">The straight on pose and serious look give a very teenager like feel to teh subject.  I might have changed the shirt to a solid color.</td>', 'The straight on pose and serious look give a very teenager like feel to teh subject.  I might have changed the shirt to a solid color.', '2004-07-02 19:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(792789, 86276, 16488, '<td valign="top">This is a nice head shot.  For a portrait I think you need to show the eyes--open the shades on the window to the soul, if you will.</td>', 'This is a nice head shot.  For a portrait I think you need to show the eyes--open the shades on the window to the soul, if you will.', '2004-07-02 19:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(792790, 85901, 15920, '<td valign="top">I like this, but don''t understand the negative space on the right, but the rest is quite good.</td>', 'I like this, but don''t understand the negative space on the right, but the rest is quite good.', '2004-07-02 19:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(792791, 85623, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting for this subject.  The background desaturation helps make this pop.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting for this subject.  The background desaturation helps make this pop.', '2004-07-02 19:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(792793, 86103, 16488, '<td valign="top">An unusual choice for this challenge.  Quite a trick to get the cat to cooperate, I''m sure.  A bit too soft for my tastes, though.</td>', 'An unusual choice for this challenge.  Quite a trick to get the cat to cooperate, I''m sure.  A bit too soft for my tastes, though.', '2004-07-02 19:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(792796, 85934, 16488, '<td valign="top">Whoa!  Nice strong portrait!  I don''t think the lighting, color, expression, anything! could be improved here.  Superior!</td>', 'Whoa!  Nice strong portrait!  I don''t think the lighting, color, expression, anything! could be improved here.  Superior!', '2004-07-02 19:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(792797, 86314, 15920, '<td valign="top">Background is a little busy, as she needed just a bit more space.  Or cropping tightly on her makes this great, as she helped with the perfect expression.</td>', 'Background is a little busy, as she needed just a bit more space.  Or cropping tightly on her makes this great, as she helped with the perfect expression.', '2004-07-02 19:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(792798, 85972, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting--the all important elements in a portrait.  I''m afraid the glove blends a bit too much with the background.  Perhaps a soft light placed behind her would have brought up the edge details.</td>', 'Nice color and lighting--the all important elements in a portrait.  I''m afraid the glove blends a bit too much with the background.  Perhaps a soft light placed behind her would have brought up the edge details.', '2004-07-02 19:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(792799, 85827, 15920, '<td valign="top">That bright white stripe on the background really distracts from her.  Pose and clothing choices work well.</td>', 'That bright white stripe on the background really distracts from her.  Pose and clothing choices work well.', '2004-07-02 19:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(792801, 86271, 16488, '<td valign="top">OoooH!  He looks like a troublemaker!  Nicely done!</td>', 'OoooH!  He looks like a troublemaker!  Nicely done!', '2004-07-02 19:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(792804, 85698, 16488, '<td valign="top">Cute!  You must like to be hard on yourself, trying to do two at once!  I''m guessing its motion blur that causes the twin on the left to be slightly fuzzy?  Lighting could be softened somewhat to prevent the harsh lights in the eyes (or you could photoshop them out)--just that they look a little like deer in headlights, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Cute!  You must like to be hard on yourself, trying to do two at once!  I''m guessing its motion blur that causes the twin on the left to be slightly fuzzy?  Lighting could be softened somewhat to prevent the harsh lights in the eyes (or you could photoshop them out)--just that they look a little like deer in headlights, I''m afraid.', '2004-07-02 19:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(792824, 85897, 16488, '<td valign="top">Awesome idea! I think you''ll discover different takes on this--perhaps making the projected image with a seperate expression.  You look so clever in the color shot!</td>', 'Awesome idea! I think you''ll discover different takes on this--perhaps making the projected image with a seperate expression.  You look so clever in the color shot!', '2004-07-02 19:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(792829, 86120, 16488, '<td valign="top">There''s obviously a great deal of thought put into the making of this portrait.  The high key is interesting.  I don''t think the selective toning works--it makes the hair somewhat green and unbalances the eyes.  The complexity of the room reflected in her right eye also doesn''t add.</td>', 'There''s obviously a great deal of thought put into the making of this portrait.  The high key is interesting.  I don''t think the selective toning works--it makes the hair somewhat green and unbalances the eyes.  The complexity of the room reflected in her right eye also doesn''t add.', '2004-07-02 19:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(792832, 85855, 16488, '<td valign="top">Pleasant.  I like the lighting on this and the posture of the hand is great.  Nice casual portrait.</td>', 'Pleasant.  I like the lighting on this and the posture of the hand is great.  Nice casual portrait.', '2004-07-02 19:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(792837, 86140, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great way to express character!  Expertly done.  (And I''m sure she''s a really nice person--but I wouldn''t go messin'' with her!)</td>', 'Great way to express character!  Expertly done.  (And I''m sure she''s a really nice person--but I wouldn''t go messin'' with her!)', '2004-07-02 19:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(792840, 85910, 16488, '<td valign="top">Another person in doggy fur!  A complicated shot, well done.  I think it would be preferable to have the missing forepaw in the picture, however.</td>', 'Another person in doggy fur!  A complicated shot, well done.  I think it would be preferable to have the missing forepaw in the picture, however.', '2004-07-02 19:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(792843, 85865, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice!  That''s the kind of shot that even the subject will like...even if not until he''s older.  I think the bright light in the center of the eyes is harsh.  I''ll hope that some of the other voters gave you a solution for it, and I''ll look for it after the challenge is closed.  Luck!</td>', 'Nice!  That''s the kind of shot that even the subject will like...even if not until he''s older.  I think the bright light in the center of the eyes is harsh.  I''ll hope that some of the other voters gave you a solution for it, and I''ll look for it after the challenge is closed.  Luck!', '2004-07-02 19:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(792864, 86103, 17134, '<td valign="top">Funny shot, but what happened to the left side? If origiinality was rated it would be a 10!</td>', 'Funny shot, but what happened to the left side? If origiinality was rated it would be a 10!', '2004-07-02 20:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
