(793140, 85855, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice combination of softness and detail. I''m OK with the brightness of the exposure on the arm, but what looks like some haloing along the shoulder on the right is a teensy bit distracting.</td>', 'Nice combination of softness and detail. I''m OK with the brightness of the exposure on the arm, but what looks like some haloing along the shoulder on the right is a teensy bit distracting.', '2004-07-03 00:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
