(793341, 86075, 7151, '<td valign="top">This coulda made a great advertisement shot, but it looks a bit too candid for what I think of as a portrait.</td>', 'This coulda made a great advertisement shot, but it looks a bit too candid for what I think of as a portrait.', '2004-07-03 02:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(793361, 85273, 7151, '<td valign="top">Just a tad too soft for my taste.  (Just a tad - I get that its intentionally soft.)  :)  The lighting, composition and subject are excellent.</td>', 'Just a tad too soft for my taste.  (Just a tad - I get that its intentionally soft.)  :)  The lighting, composition and subject are excellent.', '2004-07-03 02:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(793364, 86277, 7151, '<td valign="top">Something about the the crop/composition/orientation creates a sort of tension I don''t like in this shot.  It has something to do with him facing to the right, but having that side cut off.  Other than that, well done.</td>', 'Something about the the crop/composition/orientation creates a sort of tension I don''t like in this shot.  It has something to do with him facing to the right, but having that side cut off.  Other than that, well done.', '2004-07-03 02:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
