(793372, 86103, 7151, '<td valign="top">There seems something incongrous between the color and the rest of the effect.  But a lot of work obviously went into this, and the antique feel was really well done.  Nice work.  It''s just that color....  :)</td>', 'There seems something incongrous between the color and the rest of the effect.  But a lot of work obviously went into this, and the antique feel was really well done.  Nice work.  It''s just that color....  :)', '2004-07-03 02:54:01.000000', NULL, 1),
