(793378, 86197, 19009, '<td valign="top">Focus seems just a bit short, like the right shoulder is focused but not the face.  Shame.  It is a really nice photo otherwise.  Maybe cropped too close at top.</td>', 'Focus seems just a bit short, like the right shoulder is focused but not the face.  Shame.  It is a really nice photo otherwise.  Maybe cropped too close at top.', '2004-07-03 02:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(793380, 86130, 19009, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  What fun! Orange works well. 8</td>', 'Great shot.  What fun! Orange works well. 8', '2004-07-03 02:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(793383, 86120, 19009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, enjoyed it.  The tonal difference between left and right side make it a challenging shot.  Good job. 8</td>', 'Nice shot, enjoyed it.  The tonal difference between left and right side make it a challenging shot.  Good job. 8', '2004-07-03 02:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(793384, 86262, 19009, '<td valign="top">Focus a bit too soft.</td>', 'Focus a bit too soft.', '2004-07-03 02:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(793388, 86307, 19009, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, a little too soft for my taste but nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, a little too soft for my taste but nice shot.', '2004-07-03 03:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(793389, 85816, 19009, '<td valign="top">Timely, thought this was the portrait contest...not the Newspaper.  Nice shot.  7</td>', 'Timely, thought this was the portrait contest...not the Newspaper.  Nice shot.  7', '2004-07-03 03:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(793392, 86140, 19009, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, same Veronique as before?  Very elegant looking lady. 7</td>', 'Nice DOF, same Veronique as before?  Very elegant looking lady. 7', '2004-07-03 03:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(793397, 86226, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The natural light is nice, but the heavy shadows, especially across the eyes detracts greatly from the photo.  The shadows and the lack of a catchlight hide the expressiveness of the eyes.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The rider and horse are both posed well, but the image needed to be rotated clockwise a bit.  As it is they look as if they are about to pitch forward.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background does not appear  to have been planned for a studio portrait, ranging from too dark to decern detail and very hot bright areas.</td>', 'Lighting:  The natural light is nice, but the heavy shadows, especially across the eyes detracts greatly from the photo.  The shadows and the lack of a catchlight hide the expressiveness of the eyes.Pose:  The rider and horse are both posed well, but the image needed to be rotated clockwise a bit.  As it is they look as if they are about to pitch forward.Background:  The background does not appear  to have been planned for a studio portrait, ranging from too dark to decern detail and very hot bright areas.', '2004-07-03 03:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(793420, 86121, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is even, without any harsh shadows, and the eyes sparkle with the catchlight, but the whitebalance seems a bit off.  With the light directly overhead, as opposed to the side, the face loses much of its features, but with this face that is not a problem.  I do not care for the extreme vignetting, not that I do not like the effect at all, just not this extreme.  IMHO, if you wanted the area of the image to be such a small area in the center, why not just crop it smaller to begin with?<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is classic baby, time honored and well accepted; nothing to say about it.  However, with his head tiled up so much, I think I would have raised the level of the camera to just above his eye level.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background is a very nice touch.  The soft neutral tones complement the subject very well.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is even, without any harsh shadows, and the eyes sparkle with the catchlight, but the whitebalance seems a bit off.  With the light directly overhead, as opposed to the side, the face loses much of its features, but with this face that is not a problem.  I do not care for the extreme vignetting, not that I do not like the effect at all, just not this extreme.  IMHO, if you wanted the area of the image to be such a small area in the center, why not just crop it smaller to begin with?Pose:  The pose is classic baby, time honored and well accepted; nothing to say about it.  However, with his head tiled up so much, I think I would have raised the level of the camera to just above his eye level.Background:  The background is a very nice touch.  The soft neutral tones complement the subject very well.', '2004-07-03 03:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(793438, 85897, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The window light is great, and works well.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The tilt of the head is nearly perfect to make full use of the available light and expression.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The use of the negative projection of your portrait as taken is a novel idea.  The neutral grey works well, without over-powering any aspect of the image.  The use of a negative projection of your portrait as it is being taken is a novel idea, kudos for originality in the challenge.  However, it would have made a much better portrait of you if the projector and cam were not in the frame.  As it is, it showcases the technology more than it does you.  IMHO, technology is at its best when invisible.</td>', 'Lighting:  The window light is great, and works well.Pose:  The tilt of the head is nearly perfect to make full use of the available light and expression.Background:  The use of the negative projection of your portrait as taken is a novel idea.  The neutral grey works well, without over-powering any aspect of the image.  The use of a negative projection of your portrait as it is being taken is a novel idea, kudos for originality in the challenge.  However, it would have made a much better portrait of you if the projector and cam were not in the frame.  As it is, it showcases the technology more than it does you.  IMHO, technology is at its best when invisible.', '2004-07-03 03:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(793464, 85865, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Very nicely done.  The only comment I have on it is the position of the catch-light, in conjuction with the dead-center gaze, is unsettling.  It does however pull the attention to the eyes very well, but hold it without letting it wonder the image.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is great.  The lines of the body and legs, together with the space created by the arms, serve to pull the eye to the bottom of the face, where the tilt of the head moves it on to the eyes.  As I mentioned, the catchlight and gaze work well to hold the eye, but I am think moving one slightly off center of the other would have directed the eye to wonder the image a bit more, only to be pulled back in.  I can''t help but think, if the captivatingness of the eyes was your intent, if a tighter crop (cutting the left arm on the bottom and right) would prevent me from feeling like I am missing part of the image by being stuck in the eyes.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Black works very well with this.  Just so someone says so, I like the white border, it works well to do what a border is suppose to do - support the image.  the large black border around the white border I could do without, but the white works.</td>', 'Lighting:  Very nicely done.  The only comment I have on it is the position of the catch-light, in conjuction with the dead-center gaze, is unsettling.  It does however pull the attention to the eyes very well, but hold it without letting it wonder the image.Pose:  The pose is great.  The lines of the body and legs, together with the space created by the arms, serve to pull the eye to the bottom of the face, where the tilt of the head moves it on to the eyes.  As I mentioned, the catchlight and gaze work well to hold the eye, but I am think moving one slightly off center of the other would have directed the eye to wonder the image a bit more, only to be pulled back in.  I can''t help but think, if the captivatingness of the eyes was your intent, if a tighter crop (cutting the left arm on the bottom and right) would prevent me from feeling like I am missing part of the image by being stuck in the eyes.Background:  Black works very well with this.  Just so someone says so, I like the white border, it works well to do what a border is suppose to do - support the image.  the large black border around the white border I could do without, but the white works.', '2004-07-03 04:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(793478, 86125, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Too bright, and could use a fill light on his left.  There are several hot spots.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Well posed.<br/><b>Background:</b>  works well.</td>', 'Lighting:  Too bright, and could use a fill light on his left.  There are several hot spots.Pose:  Well posed.Background:  works well.', '2004-07-03 04:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(793482, 86283, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Well balanced with good catchlight.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Pose is good, expression is a bit odd for a portrait.  The DOF was a bit short, the right shoulder is blurred slightly.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Very licely done black.</td>', 'Lighting:  Well balanced with good catchlight.Pose:  Pose is good, expression is a bit odd for a portrait.  The DOF was a bit short, the right shoulder is blurred slightly.Background:  Very licely done black.', '2004-07-03 04:17:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(793485, 86095, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The catchlight adds depth to her expression, but her left side would have benefitted from some fill light.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Well posed, although I believe it would have been captured better from slightly higher than eye level.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The black background was done well.</td>', 'Lighting:  The catchlight adds depth to her expression, but her left side would have benefitted from some fill light.Pose:  Well posed, although I believe it would have been captured better from slightly higher than eye level.Background:  The black background was done well.', '2004-07-03 04:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(793511, 85910, 18450, '<td valign="top">love the direct stare of the pug. Good colours, focus, dof.....this is a different idea and to me it works.</td>', 'love the direct stare of the pug. Good colours, focus, dof.....this is a different idea and to me it works.', '2004-07-03 05:13:35.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(793518, 86099, 18450, '<td valign="top">lovely color studio portrait</td>', 'lovely color studio portrait', '2004-07-03 05:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(793521, 85893, 18450, '<td valign="top">delightful</td>', 'delightful', '2004-07-03 05:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(793532, 86213, 18450, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2004-07-03 05:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(793547, 86309, 18450, '<td valign="top">lovely pose, background, skin tones.....would have really liked to see a little more light on her face</td>', 'lovely pose, background, skin tones.....would have really liked to see a little more light on her face', '2004-07-03 05:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(793554, 86037, 18450, '<td valign="top">very effective....lovely colors, skin tones. Awesome!</td>', 'very effective....lovely colors, skin tones. Awesome!', '2004-07-03 05:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(793563, 86130, 18450, '<td valign="top">great colors and sense of humour</td>', 'great colors and sense of humour', '2004-07-03 05:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(793569, 85894, 18450, '<td valign="top">a very lovely color studio portrait</td>', 'a very lovely color studio portrait', '2004-07-03 06:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(793582, 86089, 18450, '<td valign="top">cool, creative.....I love this one!</td>', 'cool, creative.....I love this one!', '2004-07-03 06:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(793583, 86279, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Nicely done, although the shadow on the nose may be a bit strong.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Her expression is the shot, so a tighter framing around her face and shoulders would have made this a much stronger portrait of her.  Other than that, I would have prefered the camera angle to have been a bit above her eye level.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background is great.  It compliments her shirt nicely.</td>', 'Lighting:  Nicely done, although the shadow on the nose may be a bit strong.Pose:  Her expression is the shot, so a tighter framing around her face and shoulders would have made this a much stronger portrait of her.  Other than that, I would have prefered the camera angle to have been a bit above her eye level.Background:  The background is great.  It compliments her shirt nicely.', '2004-07-03 06:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(793588, 85934, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is amoung the best in the challenge, although I would have liked to see it a bit more diffused to try and counter the shine on some parts of his skin.  The catchlight in his eyes is just barely noticable, just enough to subtly do its job.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is good.  It and his expression communicate a lot.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The black works well with this and is well done.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is amoung the best in the challenge, although I would have liked to see it a bit more diffused to try and counter the shine on some parts of his skin.  The catchlight in his eyes is just barely noticable, just enough to subtly do its job.Pose:  The pose is good.  It and his expression communicate a lot.Background:  The black works well with this and is well done.', '2004-07-03 06:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(793589, 86314, 18450, '<td valign="top">lovely skin tones and focus on this portrait......to me the details in the background take the focus away from the model</td>', 'lovely skin tones and focus on this portrait......to me the details in the background take the focus away from the model', '2004-07-03 06:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(793595, 86099, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The light is well balanced with a good catchlight, but perhaps needed difused a bit more as its treatment of her skin is a bit harsh in places.  The yellow cast works well with the hair, but not with the blue of th eyes and the reds of the skin and lips.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose works well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The yellow background works well against the hair, but the color-cast it is giving the rest of the image does not work for me as I mentioned above.</td>', 'Lighting:  The light is well balanced with a good catchlight, but perhaps needed difused a bit more as its treatment of her skin is a bit harsh in places.  The yellow cast works well with the hair, but not with the blue of th eyes and the reds of the skin and lips.Pose:  The pose works well.Background:  The yellow background works well against the hair, but the color-cast it is giving the rest of the image does not work for me as I mentioned above.', '2004-07-03 06:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(793598, 86116, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Well balanced, but a bit too harsh on her skin.  The catchlights make for a strong expressiveness in the eyes.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is good, but I think the crop should have placed her more toward the center.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background completments the various shades of red throughout the image.  Nicely chosen.</td>', 'Lighting:  Well balanced, but a bit too harsh on her skin.  The catchlights make for a strong expressiveness in the eyes.Pose:  The pose is good, but I think the crop should have placed her more toward the center.Background:  The background completments the various shades of red throughout the image.  Nicely chosen.', '2004-07-03 06:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(793674, 86275, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I gave it a nine, because everything is well executed (lighting, makeup, focus on eyes, etc.)  It would have been a 10 if she wasn''t looking straight at the camera.<br/> <br/>One last thing: those glasses are a great touch, and drive home your title, and the hairdo perfectly sopports it.</td>', 'This is great.  I gave it a nine, because everything is well executed (lighting, makeup, focus on eyes, etc.)  It would have been a 10 if she wasn''t looking straight at the camera. One last thing: those glasses are a great touch, and drive home your title, and the hairdo perfectly sopports it.', '2004-07-03 09:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(793676, 85498, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a great portrait in terms of speaking about the model''s character.  For me, it brings back memories of playing cribbage with my grandfather and brings hope that my kids have as great a relationship with my dad.  After thinking through that, I thought about how you accomplished the effect.  I think my favorite parts of this photo are:<br/> <br/>Props:  Chair and storybook are absolutely spot on.<br/>Costume:  Exactly what one expects<br/>Facial expression on model: again, spot on<br/>Lighting seems exactly right as well, as model is perfectly lit.<br/> <br/>The only suggestion I have is to move the dark background further back from the model.  As is it is just a little distracting.<br/> <br/>Oops, I must need to give you another point on the score.  After writing this, I really like this shot. -8</td>', 'This is a great portrait in terms of speaking about the model''s character.  For me, it brings back memories of playing cribbage with my grandfather and brings hope that my kids have as great a relationship with my dad.  After thinking through that, I thought about how you accomplished the effect.  I think my favorite parts of this photo are: Props:  Chair and storybook are absolutely spot on.Costume:  Exactly what one expectsFacial expression on model: again, spot onLighting seems exactly right as well, as model is perfectly lit. The only suggestion I have is to move the dark background further back from the model.  As is it is just a little distracting. Oops, I must need to give you another point on the score.  After writing this, I really like this shot. -8', '2004-07-03 09:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(793680, 86275, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting and skin tones are excellent. I think DOF is slightily too narrow and I don''t particularly like her pose...too confrontative and seems to be showing off her rings.</td>', 'Lighting and skin tones are excellent. I think DOF is slightily too narrow and I don''t particularly like her pose...too confrontative and seems to be showing off her rings.', '2004-07-03 09:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(793689, 85284, 5822, '<td valign="top">Very interesting and unique looking portrait.  I like your model''s pose and gaze but I would prefer that she did not have a smile, but rather a more pensive and serious look. Skin tone/color appears too orange/magenta looking.  Lighting is a bit too harsh and with the soft look you''ve acheived (with NeatImage?) to me the overall feel of the image seems to be somewhat confused .  Gradient background is good.  I also think I would prefer to see more detail in her hair, maybe with some fill lighting.</td>', 'Very interesting and unique looking portrait.  I like your model''s pose and gaze but I would prefer that she did not have a smile, but rather a more pensive and serious look. Skin tone/color appears too orange/magenta looking.  Lighting is a bit too harsh and with the soft look you''ve acheived (with NeatImage?) to me the overall feel of the image seems to be somewhat confused .  Gradient background is good.  I also think I would prefer to see more detail in her hair, maybe with some fill lighting.', '2004-07-03 09:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(793693, 86212, 5822, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred had you not cut off the back of her head.  Skin tone appears a bit too orange. I do like the gaze and look of your model.</td>', 'I would have preferred had you not cut off the back of her head.  Skin tone appears a bit too orange. I do like the gaze and look of your model.', '2004-07-03 09:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(793702, 86276, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting is too harsh and concentrated in certain areas and missing in others, such as the side of her head and causing ugly shadows on her face.  Especially concentrated on her bangs over her eyes causing a blown out area so that, along with her bangs, you can''t see her eyes, which I think greatly detracts from the impact of this image.  Had the lighting been implemented better I think I would have liked the colors a lot better too, which appear to be brown clothing contrasting with your model''s beautiful red hair, lipstick and lollipop.  I also think the lolli prop detracts from your model''s provacative and sexy look and is confused with your model''s apparent sophistication.  Maybe an outstretched open palm as if blowing a kiss would have been better? Just my opinion and hope you don''t take my comments negatively, as they were not meant to be.</td>', 'Lighting is too harsh and concentrated in certain areas and missing in others, such as the side of her head and causing ugly shadows on her face.  Especially concentrated on her bangs over her eyes causing a blown out area so that, along with her bangs, you can''t see her eyes, which I think greatly detracts from the impact of this image.  Had the lighting been implemented better I think I would have liked the colors a lot better too, which appear to be brown clothing contrasting with your model''s beautiful red hair, lipstick and lollipop.  I also think the lolli prop detracts from your model''s provacative and sexy look and is confused with your model''s apparent sophistication.  Maybe an outstretched open palm as if blowing a kiss would have been better? Just my opinion and hope you don''t take my comments negatively, as they were not meant to be.', '2004-07-03 10:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(793705, 85923, 5822, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful high-key portrait!  Lighting is excellent and I love her pose, smile and gaze.  Color is good too, especially your model''s hair, although skin tones may be a little washed out around her cheeks, but I think that is in the look you were going after.  Very well done, and congratulations.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful high-key portrait!  Lighting is excellent and I love her pose, smile and gaze.  Color is good too, especially your model''s hair, although skin tones may be a little washed out around her cheeks, but I think that is in the look you were going after.  Very well done, and congratulations.', '2004-07-03 10:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(793708, 86248, 5822, '<td valign="top">This portrait is excellent but I don''t get the impression of your model being a dreamer from her somber and sad look.  The lighting is really wonderful and skin tones and color are very good.  Maybe a different pose (say with her head resting on her arms?) would express a dreamer to me. Technically very well done.</td>', 'This portrait is excellent but I don''t get the impression of your model being a dreamer from her somber and sad look.  The lighting is really wonderful and skin tones and color are very good.  Maybe a different pose (say with her head resting on her arms?) would express a dreamer to me. Technically very well done.', '2004-07-03 10:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(793709, 86140, 14603, '<td valign="top">Don`t know if it is the title or the overall feel of the image but it has a very French influence to it.<br/>I really like the sombre tones..they give the image bite.<br/>Nice work</td>', 'Don`t know if it is the title or the overall feel of the image but it has a very French influence to it.I really like the sombre tones..they give the image bite.Nice work', '2004-07-03 10:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(793720, 86095, 14603, '<td valign="top">Nice candid shot with lovely natural lighting which shows off the models blue eyes and facial bone structure to perfection.<br/>Definite Scandinavian/German/Icelandic feel to this.<br/>Slight halo at the top of the head..presumably you have darkened the background ? Doesn`t take away from this excellent image though.<br/>Good work</td>', 'Nice candid shot with lovely natural lighting which shows off the models blue eyes and facial bone structure to perfection.Definite Scandinavian/German/Icelandic feel to this.Slight halo at the top of the head..presumably you have darkened the background ? Doesn`t take away from this excellent image though.Good work', '2004-07-03 10:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(793721, 85816, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and very threatrical and I love the negative space, but not sure I would call this a portrait.  Well done.</td>', 'Great lighting and very threatrical and I love the negative space, but not sure I would call this a portrait.  Well done.', '2004-07-03 10:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(793725, 86076, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like her pose and expression and also like the soft, unfocused look of this image.  I also like inclusion of negative space.  Lighting is good too, and I especially like her red/brown hair color near to frames edge.  Skin tones appear too green.</td>', 'I like her pose and expression and also like the soft, unfocused look of this image.  I also like inclusion of negative space.  Lighting is good too, and I especially like her red/brown hair color near to frames edge.  Skin tones appear too green.', '2004-07-03 10:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(793731, 86231, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lighting and color are really excellent!  I love the high-key tonality.  Your model''s neutral expression and almost vacant gaze makes her to look like a Barbie doll.</td>', 'Lighting and color are really excellent!  I love the high-key tonality.  Your model''s neutral expression and almost vacant gaze makes her to look like a Barbie doll.', '2004-07-03 10:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(793734, 85612, 5822, '<td valign="top">Natural looking pose and expression on your model and I like your angle of view.  Colors and skin tones good too.  Black background really make your model stand out. Well done.</td>', 'Natural looking pose and expression on your model and I like your angle of view.  Colors and skin tones good too.  Black background really make your model stand out. Well done.', '2004-07-03 10:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(793738, 85698, 5822, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the wonderful expressions of these babies!  Lighting may be a bit too strong, but still an excellent portrait.</td>', 'Great capture of the wonderful expressions of these babies!  Lighting may be a bit too strong, but still an excellent portrait.', '2004-07-03 11:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(793739, 86243, 5822, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait with good pose and expression.  Skin tones and color are very good and natural looking.  Perhaps a bit more blur to the background would have been better as it''s somewhat distracting and the relief on the furniture of the horsemen have their spears aimed at her head! lol Excellent work, nonetheless.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait with good pose and expression.  Skin tones and color are very good and natural looking.  Perhaps a bit more blur to the background would have been better as it''s somewhat distracting and the relief on the furniture of the horsemen have their spears aimed at her head! lol Excellent work, nonetheless.', '2004-07-03 11:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(793769, 85901, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the low key effect and neg. space!  Great lighting.  I gotta figure out how to do the catchlight thing...<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the low key effect and neg. space!  Great lighting.  I gotta figure out how to do the catchlight thing...TC', '2004-07-03 12:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(793770, 86167, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Love the soft lighting, especially the catchlight in her eyes!<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Love the soft lighting, especially the catchlight in her eyes!TC', '2004-07-03 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(793841, 85970, 15574, '<td valign="top">awesome shot..this looks like a professional job!</td>', 'awesome shot..this looks like a professional job!', '2004-07-03 13:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(793870, 86271, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty good first try ... I like the colors and the lighting is pretty good in the important parts. I think I''d try a small counter-clockwise rotation to level the drumhead (the point of maximum contrast; it attracts the eye), but not so much as to get his eyes too out of level --the drumt is a good prop for this shot.</td>', 'Pretty good first try ... I like the colors and the lighting is pretty good in the important parts. I think I''d try a small counter-clockwise rotation to level the drumhead (the point of maximum contrast; it attracts the eye), but not so much as to get his eyes too out of level --the drumt is a good prop for this shot.', '2004-07-03 13:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(793872, 85816, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting and composition well-suited to and reinforce your unusual interpretation. Good job avoiding haloing and artifacts under those lighting conditions.</td>', 'Lighting and composition well-suited to and reinforce your unusual interpretation. Good job avoiding haloing and artifacts under those lighting conditions.', '2004-07-03 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(793875, 85273, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the strong diagonal composition. Focus is a little too soft for my taste, and I''d like to see how it would look with some reflected light from the right to soften (not eliminate) the deeper shadows.</td>', 'I like the strong diagonal composition. Focus is a little too soft for my taste, and I''d like to see how it would look with some reflected light from the right to soften (not eliminate) the deeper shadows.', '2004-07-03 13:44:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(793878, 85693, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great colors/exposure, "busy" background works in this case. Since this was an Advanced rules challenge, I''d have re-touched the iris of the left eye to cover the bright area.</td>', 'Great colors/exposure, "busy" background works in this case. Since this was an Advanced rules challenge, I''d have re-touched the iris of the left eye to cover the bright area.', '2004-07-03 13:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(793881, 86248, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor it seems a bit bright for the mood I think you''re trying to evoke; otherwise I like idea, composition, background, detail. etc.....</td>', 'On my monitor it seems a bit bright for the mood I think you''re trying to evoke; otherwise I like idea, composition, background, detail. etc.....', '2004-07-03 13:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(793884, 85542, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good combination of softness and detail. Square crop works well with proportions of large underlying shapes.</td>', 'Good combination of softness and detail. Square crop works well with proportions of large underlying shapes.', '2004-07-03 13:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(793887, 85780, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think maybe a square crop would reinforce/concentrate the intensity of your subject -- right now, I don''t think the extra image on the sides adds that much, and you''ll still be able to tell it''s a hat.</td>', 'I think maybe a square crop would reinforce/concentrate the intensity of your subject -- right now, I don''t think the extra image on the sides adds that much, and you''ll still be able to tell it''s a hat.', '2004-07-03 14:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(793888, 85938, 1031, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... yes, the crinkly light dress is a studio mainstay. Nice example of the genre ...</td>', 'Hmmm... yes, the crinkly light dress is a studio mainstay. Nice example of the genre ...', '2004-07-03 14:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(793891, 86167, 1031, '<td valign="top">My first impulse is to crop a little more off the right, but it doesn''t seem to be a big deal. A good use of the "non-portrait" format.</td>', 'My first impulse is to crop a little more off the right, but it doesn''t seem to be a big deal. A good use of the "non-portrait" format.', '2004-07-03 14:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(793893, 86212, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand the reason for the rather unusual profile composition. Exposure, detail, etc. seem good.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand the reason for the rather unusual profile composition. Exposure, detail, etc. seem good.', '2004-07-03 14:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(793902, 86280, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty well-executed example of this technique -- I might have used the Burn or Clone tools to tone down the brightest highlights on the chin.</td>', 'Pretty well-executed example of this technique -- I might have used the Burn or Clone tools to tone down the brightest highlights on the chin.', '2004-07-03 14:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(793945, 86095, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting seems a little harsh to me, maybe especially with your title. Maybe if you were trying to convery "startled" then the brighter light and deep shadows would "fit" better.</td>', 'Lighting seems a little harsh to me, maybe especially with your title. Maybe if you were trying to convery "startled" then the brighter light and deep shadows would "fit" better.', '2004-07-03 15:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(793948, 85835, 1031, '<td valign="top">A clever take on the challenge, and you somehow seem to have gotten them to enjoy cooperating!</td>', 'A clever take on the challenge, and you somehow seem to have gotten them to enjoy cooperating!', '2004-07-03 15:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(793953, 85901, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know your motivation for the negative space ... it works OK but I don''t immediately see the purpose of it. With the lighting and exposure you have, you could crop this in half and have a very nicely-rendered "typical" portrait -- maybe that''s reason enough for the treatment you gave it.</td>', 'I''d like to know your motivation for the negative space ... it works OK but I don''t immediately see the purpose of it. With the lighting and exposure you have, you could crop this in half and have a very nicely-rendered "typical" portrait -- maybe that''s reason enough for the treatment you gave it.', '2004-07-03 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(793959, 85893, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think I''d make a mask for the far background and blur the heck out of it (or fill with a gradient) so this would look more like a studio shot than a candid portrait. Great pose/expression.</td>', 'I think I''d make a mask for the far background and blur the heck out of it (or fill with a gradient) so this would look more like a studio shot than a candid portrait. Great pose/expression.', '2004-07-03 15:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(793963, 86120, 1031, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, comes off pretty well. I find the reflections in her right eye distracting -- either more indirect lighting, a better angle, or some careful cloning could reduce that.</td>', 'Cool idea, comes off pretty well. I find the reflections in her right eye distracting -- either more indirect lighting, a better angle, or some careful cloning could reduce that.', '2004-07-03 15:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(793971, 85629, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea; it''s so close now I think I''d crop it square -- unless you deliberately want to introduce that additional element of oddness.</td>', 'Interesting idea; it''s so close now I think I''d crop it square -- unless you deliberately want to introduce that additional element of oddness.', '2004-07-03 15:19:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(793975, 86312, 1031, '<td valign="top">Very cute pose. Some of the lighter tones seem a bit "flattened" and maybe reddened, but that could also be my monitor or my eyes (I typically have trouble with red tones).</td>', 'Very cute pose. Some of the lighter tones seem a bit "flattened" and maybe reddened, but that could also be my monitor or my eyes (I typically have trouble with red tones).', '2004-07-03 15:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(793979, 85910, 1031, '<td valign="top">Aren''t Pugs Chinese? This one looks quite at home though ...</td>', 'Aren''t Pugs Chinese? This one looks quite at home though ...', '2004-07-03 15:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(793983, 85623, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good use of contrasty, oblique lighting, even though on my monitor it''s a teensy bit brighter than I might have made it.</td>', 'I think this is a good use of contrasty, oblique lighting, even though on my monitor it''s a teensy bit brighter than I might have made it.', '2004-07-03 15:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(794025, 86229, 1031, '<td valign="top">If this is a set-up shot then, your model gets bonus points for capturing the expresion of anticipation (dread?) just before heading in ...</td>', 'If this is a set-up shot then, your model gets bonus points for capturing the expresion of anticipation (dread?) just before heading in ...', '2004-07-03 15:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(794200, 86089, 2158, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully creative shot.</td>', 'Wonderfully creative shot.', '2004-07-03 19:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794222, 86140, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is mostly good, but is hot in a few places (right arm, wrist).  She could use a stronger catchlight in her eyes to give them some life.  <br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose and expression really don''t tell me anything abou the person.  It could be from the perspective of an infant or pet, but the lack of expression make me think of someone watching zoning out in front of a TV.  Which if that was your intent, it succeeds very well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background compliments the over all tone of the image, well chosen.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is mostly good, but is hot in a few places (right arm, wrist).  She could use a stronger catchlight in her eyes to give them some life.  Pose:  The pose and expression really don''t tell me anything abou the person.  It could be from the perspective of an infant or pet, but the lack of expression make me think of someone watching zoning out in front of a TV.  Which if that was your intent, it succeeds very well.Background:  The background compliments the over all tone of the image, well chosen.', '2004-07-03 19:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(794228, 86197, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The light is bright enough to keep the image evenly lit; however, even with it being difused, it seems you only had one light source.   Several smaller light sources from different angles would have prevented the harshness in her skin tones.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose works, although a more genuine smile would have worked much better.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background works well with the model.  I would suggest putting more distance between the model and the background; which would have virtually eliminated the shadow and blue glow around some of the hair caused by light reflecting back on her from behind.</td>', 'Lighting:  The light is bright enough to keep the image evenly lit; however, even with it being difused, it seems you only had one light source.   Several smaller light sources from different angles would have prevented the harshness in her skin tones.Pose:  The pose works, although a more genuine smile would have worked much better.Background:  The background works well with the model.  I would suggest putting more distance between the model and the background; which would have virtually eliminated the shadow and blue glow around some of the hair caused by light reflecting back on her from behind.', '2004-07-03 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(794233, 86280, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is well done.  Considering the subject is wet, it is suprising the highlights are not more hot than they are (which is not at all hot).<br/><b>Pose:</b>  There is not much in the way of pose, but I would like to suggest that the camera''s viewpoint and the drection of the eyes are at odds with each other.  One (the perspective) moves the eyes into the frame, while the modes expression pushes it out of the frame.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Wonderful black, although I would have liked to have some separation between the background and the model''s hair.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is well done.  Considering the subject is wet, it is suprising the highlights are not more hot than they are (which is not at all hot).Pose:  There is not much in the way of pose, but I would like to suggest that the camera''s viewpoint and the drection of the eyes are at odds with each other.  One (the perspective) moves the eyes into the frame, while the modes expression pushes it out of the frame.Background:  Wonderful black, although I would have liked to have some separation between the background and the model''s hair.', '2004-07-03 19:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794261, 86277, 17203, '<td valign="top">Technically excellent and a good expression. This is one of those "just doesn''t speak to me shots," but I can''t put my finger on the reason. I think if the background were more interesting, it might give the image better context. Still a very good portrait.</td>', 'Technically excellent and a good expression. This is one of those "just doesn''t speak to me shots," but I can''t put my finger on the reason. I think if the background were more interesting, it might give the image better context. Still a very good portrait.', '2004-07-03 20:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(794268, 86107, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots in this group, but a little to tightly cropped for me, like an uncomfortably close conversation. Color and exposure are good, yet the focus looks soft on the sides- a bit more DOF would help.</td>', 'One of the better shots in this group, but a little to tightly cropped for me, like an uncomfortably close conversation. Color and exposure are good, yet the focus looks soft on the sides- a bit more DOF would help.', '2004-07-03 20:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(794279, 86099, 17203, '<td valign="top">A very good portrait and interesting angle (probably top-20). The color on the left side looks great, but the yellow (blond) light seems to camouflage the subject rather than highlight. I think a more neutral light source would provide a better contrast.</td>', 'A very good portrait and interesting angle (probably top-20). The color on the left side looks great, but the yellow (blond) light seems to camouflage the subject rather than highlight. I think a more neutral light source would provide a better contrast.', '2004-07-03 20:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(794289, 85923, 17203, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots this week, and I attribute a lot of that to your expressive little model. I think the red light on the left side works against you, and this particular shot might have been better without the high-key treatment, but B&amp;W might solve both concerns.</td>', 'One of the better shots this week, and I attribute a lot of that to your expressive little model. I think the red light on the left side works against you, and this particular shot might have been better without the high-key treatment, but B&W might solve both concerns.', '2004-07-03 20:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(794294, 85623, 17203, '<td valign="top">This belongs in the top 10. Reminds me of Librodo''s moody portraits. Contrast is just a bit too high for me though- a little more light on the left would balance it out nicely.</td>', 'This belongs in the top 10. Reminds me of Librodo''s moody portraits. Contrast is just a bit too high for me though- a little more light on the left would balance it out nicely.', '2004-07-03 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(794300, 86315, 17203, '<td valign="top">A fine portrait and among the best here. Two complaints... the bottom right corner is overexposed, and the background color is too close to that great hair to make the subject stand out. Fix those, and you''re in the top 5.</td>', 'A fine portrait and among the best here. Two complaints... the bottom right corner is overexposed, and the background color is too close to that great hair to make the subject stand out. Fix those, and you''re in the top 5.', '2004-07-03 21:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(794305, 85855, 17203, '<td valign="top">Fabulous expression. The background looks artificial around the shirt and hair, and the arm is a little overexposed, but still one of the better images this week.</td>', 'Fabulous expression. The background looks artificial around the shirt and hair, and the arm is a little overexposed, but still one of the better images this week.', '2004-07-03 21:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(794307, 86305, 17203, '<td valign="top">I can''t really say this meets the challenge of shooting a PERSON, but it is a good studio portrait. Good overall lighting, color and focus (I''d just like to see the eyes a little better).</td>', 'I can''t really say this meets the challenge of shooting a PERSON, but it is a good studio portrait. Good overall lighting, color and focus (I''d just like to see the eyes a little better).', '2004-07-03 21:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(794320, 86257, 1054, '<td valign="top">A very well-done portrait that brings out your subjects personality.</td>', 'A very well-done portrait that brings out your subjects personality.', '2004-07-03 21:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794321, 85901, 1054, '<td valign="top">Exceedingly well done. Great lighting.</td>', 'Exceedingly well done. Great lighting.', '2004-07-03 21:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(794323, 85855, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. This one made me stop and think... and with the number of submissions waiting for votes, that''s quite an accomplishment. This entry would have been great for "Off-screen expectations" as well. I can''t help but wonder what she''s daydreaming about.</td>', 'Great portrait. This one made me stop and think... and with the number of submissions waiting for votes, that''s quite an accomplishment. This entry would have been great for "Off-screen expectations" as well. I can''t help but wonder what she''s daydreaming about.', '2004-07-03 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(794328, 86213, 1054, '<td valign="top">This is not only technically flawless; it brings out your subjects personality as well.</td>', 'This is not only technically flawless; it brings out your subjects personality as well.', '2004-07-03 22:04:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(794331, 85629, 1054, '<td valign="top">I like the concept you were going for here; however the lighting is a little hard and something just does not look right about the eyes.</td>', 'I like the concept you were going for here; however the lighting is a little hard and something just does not look right about the eyes.', '2004-07-03 22:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(794334, 86271, 1054, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve probably heard this quite a few times by now, but I would have liked to have seen this image straightened. Other than that, an outstansding entry. Also... don''t apologize for your entry in your title... the voters tend not to like it.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve probably heard this quite a few times by now, but I would have liked to have seen this image straightened. Other than that, an outstansding entry. Also... don''t apologize for your entry in your title... the voters tend not to like it.', '2004-07-03 22:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(794336, 86279, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great expression but I would have liked a tighter crop. Also... don''t apologize for your entry in your title... the voters tend not to like it.</td>', 'Great expression but I would have liked a tighter crop. Also... don''t apologize for your entry in your title... the voters tend not to like it.', '2004-07-03 22:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(794337, 86099, 1054, '<td valign="top">Amazingly well done. Great color, light and pose. DOF is perfect.</td>', 'Amazingly well done. Great color, light and pose. DOF is perfect.', '2004-07-03 22:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(794342, 86307, 10883, '<td valign="top">This photo has a nice soft feel to it.  The model seems relaxed.  What bothers me in this picture is that a solid background would have been nicer.</td>', 'This photo has a nice soft feel to it.  The model seems relaxed.  What bothers me in this picture is that a solid background would have been nicer.', '2004-07-03 22:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794343, 86130, 10883, '<td valign="top">Fun picture, not your standard portrait :)</td>', 'Fun picture, not your standard portrait :)', '2004-07-03 22:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(794345, 86231, 10883, '<td valign="top">This is a good example of how to do a portrait.  Nice soft lighting and the model seems fairly relaxed.  Good job.</td>', 'This is a good example of how to do a portrait.  Nice soft lighting and the model seems fairly relaxed.  Good job.', '2004-07-03 22:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794347, 85938, 1054, '<td valign="top">An absolutely outstanding portrait. The "rule" is that the eyes make a portrait, but this is one of those cases where breaking the rules (not showing her eyes) really works. Excellent! I bet she gets her good looks from her mommy, too!</td>', 'An absolutely outstanding portrait. The "rule" is that the eyes make a portrait, but this is one of those cases where breaking the rules (not showing her eyes) really works. Excellent! I bet she gets her good looks from her mommy, too!', '2004-07-03 22:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794348, 86099, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait, good angle and the photo has a nice soft feel to it.</td>', 'Nice portrait, good angle and the photo has a nice soft feel to it.', '2004-07-03 22:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(794350, 86306, 10883, '<td valign="top">Why is he topless? :)  Good setup but the facial expression of the model seems a  it unnatural.</td>', 'Why is he topless? :)  Good setup but the facial expression of the model seems a  it unnatural.', '2004-07-03 22:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(794354, 85334, 1054, '<td valign="top">Nobody said a portrait had to be of a human! Nicely done, but doesn''t have a studio feel because of the sofa in the background. A 6, would be an 8 or 9 with a better background.</td>', 'Nobody said a portrait had to be of a human! Nicely done, but doesn''t have a studio feel because of the sofa in the background. A 6, would be an 8 or 9 with a better background.', '2004-07-03 22:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(794356, 85816, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very good picture, nice lighting and mood.  The problem is that it doesn´t exactly meet the challenge as a portrait.</td>', 'Very good picture, nice lighting and mood.  The problem is that it doesn´t exactly meet the challenge as a portrait.', '2004-07-03 22:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(794359, 86199, 1054, '<td valign="top">Not really a studio shot, and the reflection in the sunglasses is distracting. Portraits are all about the eyes... asking your model to take off her glasses would have helped a lot here. Your background is also distracting... a shorter DOF would have been a tremendous help for this image.</td>', 'Not really a studio shot, and the reflection in the sunglasses is distracting. Portraits are all about the eyes... asking your model to take off her glasses would have helped a lot here. Your background is also distracting... a shorter DOF would have been a tremendous help for this image.', '2004-07-03 22:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(794360, 85972, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good portrait.  Nice even lighting and the model doesn´t look right into the lens, which is always a good thing when portraits are concerned :)</td>', 'Good portrait.  Nice even lighting and the model doesn´t look right into the lens, which is always a good thing when portraits are concerned :)', '2004-07-03 22:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(794362, 86130, 1054, '<td valign="top">ROFLMAO! That''s great! Rechnically perfect except for a bit of oversharpening (note the halos on the right side of your model). 9.</td>', 'ROFLMAO! That''s great! Rechnically perfect except for a bit of oversharpening (note the halos on the right side of your model). 9.', '2004-07-03 22:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(794364, 85816, 1054, '<td valign="top">Incredible. Great concept, great lighting. 10.</td>', 'Incredible. Great concept, great lighting. 10.', '2004-07-03 22:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(794368, 86167, 10883, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait!  The lighting is excellent and the pose is very relaxed and good.  The model is also very beautiful.  Excellent work!</td>', 'Very good portrait!  The lighting is excellent and the pose is very relaxed and good.  The model is also very beautiful.  Excellent work!', '2004-07-03 22:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(794369, 85894, 1054, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. You know... when #2 is born you''re not gonna know which way to point your camera!</td>', 'Outstanding. You know... when #2 is born you''re not gonna know which way to point your camera!', '2004-07-03 22:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(794371, 86120, 10883, '<td valign="top">Unusual and a very good portrait!  I like the high-key feel to it.<br/> <br/>Good job!</td>', 'Unusual and a very good portrait!  I like the high-key feel to it. Good job!', '2004-07-03 22:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(794374, 86076, 1054, '<td valign="top">Great portrait. The expression really brings out her shyness, and the soft focus adds mystery.</td>', 'Great portrait. The expression really brings out her shyness, and the soft focus adds mystery.', '2004-07-03 22:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(794375, 86248, 10883, '<td valign="top">I like this portrait alot.  The background is very good and I like how the lighting comes from below.  Nice expression from the model, good job!</td>', 'I like this portrait alot.  The background is very good and I like how the lighting comes from below.  Nice expression from the model, good job!', '2004-07-03 22:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(794378, 85855, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice dreamy look from the model.  Seems like natural lighting, looks good!</td>', 'Nice dreamy look from the model.  Seems like natural lighting, looks good!', '2004-07-03 22:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(794381, 86140, 10883, '<td valign="top">I like this picture...nice pose and angle.  Good job.</td>', 'I like this picture...nice pose and angle.  Good job.', '2004-07-03 22:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(794383, 85622, 10883, '<td valign="top">The colors are too cold in this portrait, it might be a little lighter also.</td>', 'The colors are too cold in this portrait, it might be a little lighter also.', '2004-07-03 22:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(794597, 86277, 1031, '<td valign="top">I think this would be a stronger portrait with the somewhat tighter crop.</td>', 'I think this would be a stronger portrait with the somewhat tighter crop.', '2004-07-04 01:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794601, 86257, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting/coloring; good job dropping the background. On the "informal" side for a studio portrait, but Troy may be an informal guy ...</td>', 'Nice lighting/coloring; good job dropping the background. On the "informal" side for a studio portrait, but Troy may be an informal guy ...', '2004-07-04 01:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(794602, 86147, 1031, '<td valign="top">Not your usual subject for a portrait, but you certainly convey the idea well enough.</td>', 'Not your usual subject for a portrait, but you certainly convey the idea well enough.', '2004-07-04 01:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(794603, 85284, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the lighter end (of the color gradient) for the negative space; I think I like having her looking into the space.</td>', 'Interesting use of the lighter end (of the color gradient) for the negative space; I think I like having her looking into the space.', '2004-07-04 01:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(794604, 85790, 1031, '<td valign="top">A case where (personally) I''d like a more descriptive title. There''s obviously something going on besides someone sitting for a formal portrait -- I''m curious as to what it is.</td>', 'A case where (personally) I''d like a more descriptive title. There''s obviously something going on besides someone sitting for a formal portrait -- I''m curious as to what it is.', '2004-07-04 01:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(794606, 86314, 1031, '<td valign="top">Subject is well-lit and with good detail. I think I''d prefer a less busy or blurrier background so she''d be the sole focus of attention.</td>', 'Subject is well-lit and with good detail. I think I''d prefer a less busy or blurrier background so she''d be the sole focus of attention.', '2004-07-04 01:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(794607, 86125, 1031, '<td valign="top">Where''s the green eyeshade? :)<br/> <br/>For some reason this has the feel of a frame from a 1950''s-era movie ... maybe the tones remind me of aged TechniColor ... as a portrait it feels more like a candid than studio -- would have been an interesting entry for the Newspaper challenge!</td>', 'Where''s the green eyeshade? :) For some reason this has the feel of a frame from a 1950''s-era movie ... maybe the tones remind me of aged TechniColor ... as a portrait it feels more like a candid than studio -- would have been an interesting entry for the Newspaper challenge!', '2004-07-04 01:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(794608, 86276, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks a little bright on my monitor ... would be a great "concert" shot if that was a microphone instead of a lollipop.</td>', 'Looks a little bright on my monitor ... would be a great "concert" shot if that was a microphone instead of a lollipop.', '2004-07-04 01:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(794622, 86313, 1031, '<td valign="top">Odd perspective definitely makes the face the focus of attention!</td>', 'Odd perspective definitely makes the face the focus of attention!', '2004-07-04 02:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(794623, 86121, 1031, '<td valign="top">Great expression, nice use of the "glowing effect" lighting/processing.</td>', 'Great expression, nice use of the "glowing effect" lighting/processing.', '2004-07-04 02:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794625, 85970, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like a friendly guy who won''t even hurt his brother if he doesn''t win a ribbon :)<br/> <br/>Nice lighting, focus and background.</td>', 'Looks like a friendly guy who won''t even hurt his brother if he doesn''t win a ribbon :) Nice lighting, focus and background.', '2004-07-04 02:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(794627, 86277, 9906, '<td valign="top">Great use of lighting.  Love the contrast between the light shirt and darp background.  Nice negative space with a bit o detail in it!  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Great use of lighting.  Love the contrast between the light shirt and darp background.  Nice negative space with a bit o detail in it!  KudosTC', '2004-07-04 02:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(794628, 85956, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect -- I''d like to see the lighting a little more even on the eyes. Reminds me of a Joni Mitchell album cover.</td>', 'Interesting effect -- I''d like to see the lighting a little more even on the eyes. Reminds me of a Joni Mitchell album cover.', '2004-07-04 02:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794629, 86120, 9906, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually go for the high key approach when it comes to portraits, but this is nicely done.  My only real complaint is the blue light between under her left eye...<br/>TC</td>', 'I don''t usually go for the high key approach when it comes to portraits, but this is nicely done.  My only real complaint is the blue light between under her left eye...TC', '2004-07-04 02:53:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794631, 86309, 9906, '<td valign="top">AT first I thought that this was a high key approach to portraiture, but the more I look, the more I love the warm tones.  The rose and her look at it is key here!  Nice job!<br/>TC</td>', 'AT first I thought that this was a high key approach to portraiture, but the more I look, the more I love the warm tones.  The rose and her look at it is key here!  Nice job!TC', '2004-07-04 02:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(794632, 86125, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is the only portraiture in the challenge that seems to show the subject in his realm.  Love the added detail.  My only real complaint is that the pen is a little blown out drawing my eye to it and away from the subject.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is the only portraiture in the challenge that seems to show the subject in his realm.  Love the added detail.  My only real complaint is that the pen is a little blown out drawing my eye to it and away from the subject.TC', '2004-07-04 02:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(794633, 85780, 9906, '<td valign="top">With a different crop, this is a CD cover!  Nice lob of lighting without blowing out.<br/>TC</td>', 'With a different crop, this is a CD cover!  Nice lob of lighting without blowing out.TC', '2004-07-04 02:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794635, 85938, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done high key portraiture.  You are a little over exposed, expecially in her dress but it isn''t too distracting.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely done high key portraiture.  You are a little over exposed, expecially in her dress but it isn''t too distracting.TC', '2004-07-04 02:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(794636, 85629, 9906, '<td valign="top">This takes me back to the late 80''s.  I never could do this haircut, my hair is too waivy.  Very Thompson Twins though.  Great lighting.  Love the catch light in the visible eye!<br/>TC</td>', 'This takes me back to the late 80''s.  I never could do this haircut, my hair is too waivy.  Very Thompson Twins though.  Great lighting.  Love the catch light in the visible eye!TC', '2004-07-04 03:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(794637, 85718, 9906, '<td valign="top">Skin tones and background go together very well!  Nice subtle lighitng that brings out depth without blown out highlights.  Nice soft focus.  Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Skin tones and background go together very well!  Nice subtle lighitng that brings out depth without blown out highlights.  Nice soft focus.  KudosTC', '2004-07-04 03:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(794638, 85273, 9906, '<td valign="top">A touchb too soft for my taste, but nicely done none the less.  Great job of capturing the innocence of youth.<br/>TC</td>', 'A touchb too soft for my taste, but nicely done none the less.  Great job of capturing the innocence of youth.TC', '2004-07-04 03:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(794639, 85897, 9906, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the negative image in the background myself, but it doesn''t really detract from the portraiture itself.  Good lighting.  Would love to see the technical details even though I wouldn''t use it quite this way myself.<br/>TC</td>', 'Don''t care for the negative image in the background myself, but it doesn''t really detract from the portraiture itself.  Good lighting.  Would love to see the technical details even though I wouldn''t use it quite this way myself.TC', '2004-07-04 03:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(794651, 86115, 1031, '<td valign="top">Odd angle and perspective for a portrait; for some reason I really like the geometry/lines/color of the background.</td>', 'Odd angle and perspective for a portrait; for some reason I really like the geometry/lines/color of the background.', '2004-07-04 03:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(794656, 86107, 1031, '<td valign="top">Fine lighting to isolate her face. I wish there was just the tiniest bit more contrast between her irises and pupils so her eye color would show more; that could be a monitor issue though. A square crop might/might not make an even stronger "portrait" image.</td>', 'Fine lighting to isolate her face. I wish there was just the tiniest bit more contrast between her irises and pupils so her eye color would show more; that could be a monitor issue though. A square crop might/might not make an even stronger "portrait" image.', '2004-07-04 03:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794660, 86226, 1031, '<td valign="top">If her head were tipped back a bit, there would be less shadow on her face; right now we have a slightly better view of the horse.<br/> <br/>Unless ... the horse IS Samantha ...</td>', 'If her head were tipped back a bit, there would be less shadow on her face; right now we have a slightly better view of the horse. Unless ... the horse IS Samantha ...', '2004-07-04 03:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(794664, 85972, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see how this looks with the hair in the back either more blurry, or the hair sharp throughout. Maybe because it holds the brightest highlights it somewhat draws the attention away from her face. Or perhaps burning it a little so it would fade into the background more smoothly would work instead. I think I''d also try a vertical crop of the same shot.</td>', 'I''d like to see how this looks with the hair in the back either more blurry, or the hair sharp throughout. Maybe because it holds the brightest highlights it somewhat draws the attention away from her face. Or perhaps burning it a little so it would fade into the background more smoothly would work instead. I think I''d also try a vertical crop of the same shot.', '2004-07-04 03:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(794665, 86084, 1031, '<td valign="top">Some of the best shots are when they''re not posing. Still, to make it more like a formal portrait I''d probably try cropping in a bit tighter.</td>', 'Some of the best shots are when they''re not posing. Still, to make it more like a formal portrait I''d probably try cropping in a bit tighter.', '2004-07-04 03:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(794666, 85568, 1031, '<td valign="top">Today''s youth certainly has a reputation for being straightforward and "in your face." This is a pretty good representation of that ...</td>', 'Today''s youth certainly has a reputation for being straightforward and "in your face." This is a pretty good representation of that ...', '2004-07-04 03:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(794668, 86316, 1031, '<td valign="top">The "nimbus" is a little overly-bright to me, but a good idea/effect anyway; like your background.</td>', 'The "nimbus" is a little overly-bright to me, but a good idea/effect anyway; like your background.', '2004-07-04 03:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(794672, 85554, 1031, '<td valign="top">I don''t thnk your color scheme quite goes with your title (more blues than reds/browns to me), nor is it quite as low-key (a "dangerous" thing to try at DPC anyway), but I like it quite a lot the way you have it.</td>', 'I don''t thnk your color scheme quite goes with your title (more blues than reds/browns to me), nor is it quite as low-key (a "dangerous" thing to try at DPC anyway), but I like it quite a lot the way you have it.', '2004-07-04 03:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(794675, 86262, 1031, '<td valign="top">Her emotions seem a bit ambiguous to me ... she could be saying "don''t take a picture NOW!" Or ... possibly having a great ol'' time :)</td>', 'Her emotions seem a bit ambiguous to me ... she could be saying "don''t take a picture NOW!" Or ... possibly having a great ol'' time :)', '2004-07-04 03:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(794677, 86140, 1031, '<td valign="top">Unusual pose (for "portrait") works with the geometry and coloring of your background elements, plus excellent lighting.</td>', 'Unusual pose (for "portrait") works with the geometry and coloring of your background elements, plus excellent lighting.', '2004-07-04 03:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(794679, 85698, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty hard to get a decent baby picture sometimes ... to "double-dip" like this seems like taking maximum advantage of a rare stroke of luck.</td>', 'Pretty hard to get a decent baby picture sometimes ... to "double-dip" like this seems like taking maximum advantage of a rare stroke of luck.', '2004-07-04 04:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(794680, 85891, 1031, '<td valign="top">That''s some serious-looking photography going on there ....</td>', 'That''s some serious-looking photography going on there ....', '2004-07-04 04:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(794764, 86060, 19035, '<td valign="top">What a great looking guy - he looks almost as good as his brother Dave. He could stand to lose  a few pounds thougg and I think he looks like Dan Akroyd.</td>', 'What a great looking guy - he looks almost as good as his brother Dave. He could stand to lose  a few pounds thougg and I think he looks like Dan Akroyd.', '2004-07-04 10:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794770, 86199, 8005, '<td valign="top">This looks more candid than a portrait studio to me.</td>', 'This looks more candid than a portrait studio to me.', '2004-07-04 10:26:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(794771, 85526, 8005, '<td valign="top">Too many reflections on her face.</td>', 'Too many reflections on her face.', '2004-07-04 10:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(794772, 85938, 8005, '<td valign="top">Good photo. Nice soft look. I think a background that showed a littel more contrast might be better. Very pretty girl.</td>', 'Good photo. Nice soft look. I think a background that showed a littel more contrast might be better. Very pretty girl.', '2004-07-04 10:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(794773, 85972, 8005, '<td valign="top">Very classy looking. The only thing I would change would be the color of the glove. It almost disappears in the background.</td>', 'Very classy looking. The only thing I would change would be the color of the glove. It almost disappears in the background.', '2004-07-04 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(794776, 86231, 8005, '<td valign="top">OK photo but the model has a weird blank look on her face. She should be smiling.</td>', 'OK photo but the model has a weird blank look on her face. She should be smiling.', '2004-07-04 10:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(794779, 86279, 8005, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Good expression, nice focus, good lighting. Great kid photo. 9</td>', 'Excellent! Good expression, nice focus, good lighting. Great kid photo. 9', '2004-07-04 10:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(794782, 86229, 8005, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the background. This looks very much like what you would see in a wedding photo album. Good job. Pretty girl too. 8</td>', 'Nice use of the background. This looks very much like what you would see in a wedding photo album. Good job. Pretty girl too. 8', '2004-07-04 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(794785, 85923, 8005, '<td valign="top">If the lighting would have been better this would have been great. Very washed out. 6</td>', 'If the lighting would have been better this would have been great. Very washed out. 6', '2004-07-04 10:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(794787, 86281, 8005, '<td valign="top">Needs tighter cropping.</td>', 'Needs tighter cropping.', '2004-07-04 10:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(794790, 85894, 8005, '<td valign="top">I would love to see a background with some contrast to the chair but it''s still a great portrait. 9</td>', 'I would love to see a background with some contrast to the chair but it''s still a great portrait. 9', '2004-07-04 10:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(794791, 86163, 8005, '<td valign="top">Too much going on here. Beautiful girl though.</td>', 'Too much going on here. Beautiful girl though.', '2004-07-04 10:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(794802, 85938, 14614, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful.. subject is placed well in the frame, pink highlights give it a hand-colored feel, high key provides a softness that matches the subject.  One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'Just wonderful.. subject is placed well in the frame, pink highlights give it a hand-colored feel, high key provides a softness that matches the subject.  One of my ribbon picks.', '2004-07-04 11:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(794803, 86167, 14614, '<td valign="top">Great composition/placement of your model - eye level and direct look into the lens engaged me immediately.  you''ve worked wonders with the light/shadow making this a unique and well done portrait.  One of my ribbon picks</td>', 'Great composition/placement of your model - eye level and direct look into the lens engaged me immediately.  you''ve worked wonders with the light/shadow making this a unique and well done portrait.  One of my ribbon picks', '2004-07-04 11:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(794805, 85972, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks this theme.. excellent lighting.  What would have made it a ribbon pick?  The negative space on either side could have been removed and thus moving your subject out of dead center.  Also there''s something hard/stiff about her mouth that don''t match the excellent gaze of her eyes. The pulled up hair distracts me a bit (could be the dof or the loose strands)  Lastley the hand fades too much into the background just around the chin. (please don''t get the feeling I don''t like it -- I do!)</td>', 'One of my top picks this theme.. excellent lighting.  What would have made it a ribbon pick?  The negative space on either side could have been removed and thus moving your subject out of dead center.  Also there''s something hard/stiff about her mouth that don''t match the excellent gaze of her eyes. The pulled up hair distracts me a bit (could be the dof or the loose strands)  Lastley the hand fades too much into the background just around the chin. (please don''t get the feeling I don''t like it -- I do!)', '2004-07-04 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(794808, 85934, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my top picks this theme.  Excellent expression on your model (you''ve capture warmth and a devilish sense of humor)  I would have liked a bit less right elbow.  Really like the gray/blue color palete.</td>', 'One of my top picks this theme.  Excellent expression on your model (you''ve capture warmth and a devilish sense of humor)  I would have liked a bit less right elbow.  Really like the gray/blue color palete.', '2004-07-04 11:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(794811, 85816, 14614, '<td valign="top">Powerful image, excellent use of light and shadow to tell your story.  One of my ribbon picks.</td>', 'Powerful image, excellent use of light and shadow to tell your story.  One of my ribbon picks.', '2004-07-04 11:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(794833, 86116, 17072, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful picture.  10</td>', 'This is a beautiful picture.  10', '2004-07-04 11:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794834, 85265, 17072, '<td valign="top">I wonder what she''s thinking</td>', 'I wonder what she''s thinking', '2004-07-04 11:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(794840, 85623, 11897, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting on this shot, well done 10</td>', 'I love the lighting on this shot, well done 10', '2004-07-04 11:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(794843, 86219, 17072, '<td valign="top">He looks happy, she looks worried. Nice pic tho</td>', 'He looks happy, she looks worried. Nice pic tho', '2004-07-04 11:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(794844, 85526, 11897, '<td valign="top">Great picture 10</td>', 'Great picture 10', '2004-07-04 11:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(794845, 86313, 17072, '<td valign="top">How cute!!</td>', 'How cute!!', '2004-07-04 11:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(794846, 85938, 17072, '<td valign="top">She''s a little green, but it could by my eyes are tired.</td>', 'She''s a little green, but it could by my eyes are tired.', '2004-07-04 11:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(794848, 86099, 11897, '<td valign="top">Lovely serene shot, the lighting is good and not too over softened. 10</td>', 'Lovely serene shot, the lighting is good and not too over softened. 10', '2004-07-04 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(794850, 86213, 11897, '<td valign="top">Guess who?  :) <br/>great picture, good luck.</td>', 'Guess who?  :) great picture, good luck.', '2004-07-04 11:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(794852, 86103, 11897, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but feel it just doesn''t work in colour, maybe sepia ?<br/>Nice to see different techniques, keep it up.</td>', 'I like the idea but feel it just doesn''t work in colour, maybe sepia ?Nice to see different techniques, keep it up.', '2004-07-04 11:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(794878, 85334, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting, focus, angle are all pretty good. At first I found the blurred line in the background (counter''s edge?) a distraction and thought it would look better with a smooth gradient, but since it''s right on a line with the eyes I guess it may also serve to draw the attention there ... it would be interesting to try evening out the BG to see how it looks.</td>', 'Lighting, focus, angle are all pretty good. At first I found the blurred line in the background (counter''s edge?) a distraction and thought it would look better with a smooth gradient, but since it''s right on a line with the eyes I guess it may also serve to draw the attention there ... it would be interesting to try evening out the BG to see how it looks.', '2004-07-04 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(794881, 86046, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''d prefer a little tighter crop to get more attention on the face, maybe even a square.</td>', 'I''d prefer a little tighter crop to get more attention on the face, maybe even a square.', '2004-07-04 12:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(794885, 86231, 1031, '<td valign="top">From the angle of her head I get the impression that there might have been just a LITTLE too much picture-taking going on :)<br/> <br/>Good exposure; I like the effect of the veil blending into the background.</td>', 'From the angle of her head I get the impression that there might have been just a LITTLE too much picture-taking going on :) Good exposure; I like the effect of the veil blending into the background.', '2004-07-04 12:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(794889, 86103, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the overall effect, good job conveying an "old-timey" look ... the "distressed" border is a good idea but maybe just a little too much; I''d like to compare with a version with a less aggressive application of the effect.</td>', 'I like the overall effect, good job conveying an "old-timey" look ... the "distressed" border is a good idea but maybe just a little too much; I''d like to compare with a version with a less aggressive application of the effect.', '2004-07-04 12:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(794896, 85498, 1031, '<td valign="top">This pose/composition seems a little "loose" to me, probablu due to trying to show him in the "environment." I usually think of a "studio portrait" as a bit tighter and concentrating a little more on the face. Given what you wanted to show here, I think you did a good job with the lighting, focus, etc.</td>', 'This pose/composition seems a little "loose" to me, probablu due to trying to show him in the "environment." I usually think of a "studio portrait" as a bit tighter and concentrating a little more on the face. Given what you wanted to show here, I think you did a good job with the lighting, focus, etc.', '2004-07-04 12:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794900, 86219, 1031, '<td valign="top">It''s usually hard to get a decent portrait outdoors, against a background of foliage, wiht a lot of backlighting -- you''ve done far better than most under the circumstances. Good combination of softness and detail, too.</td>', 'It''s usually hard to get a decent portrait outdoors, against a background of foliage, wiht a lot of backlighting -- you''ve done far better than most under the circumstances. Good combination of softness and detail, too.', '2004-07-04 12:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794907, 85718, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at a moody. evocative look; on my monitor it could use maybe just a touch more contrast.</td>', 'Good attempt at a moody. evocative look; on my monitor it could use maybe just a touch more contrast.', '2004-07-04 12:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794915, 86315, 1031, '<td valign="top">On my monitor it just loses the highlights in the right-foreground, but good exposure overall. Your simple setting is pretty studio-like :)</td>', 'On my monitor it just loses the highlights in the right-foreground, but good exposure overall. Your simple setting is pretty studio-like :)', '2004-07-04 12:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(794921, 85897, 1031, '<td valign="top">When they said "studio" portrait I don''t think they meant George Lucas'' ... very clever setup. Must have been hard to get adequate lighting without washing out the projection.<br/> <br/>I wish we could see some photographer''s notes so you wouldn''t need the long title though ...</td>', 'When they said "studio" portrait I don''t think they meant George Lucas'' ... very clever setup. Must have been hard to get adequate lighting without washing out the projection. I wish we could see some photographer''s notes so you wouldn''t need the long title though ...', '2004-07-04 12:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(794924, 86262, 9906, '<td valign="top">A very lovely young lady I''m sure!  However, IMHO this shot doesn''t do her justice.  The harsh highlights combined with the soft focus give this an almost creepy feeling to it.  THe bright red lipstick looks a tad bit oversaturated.  Were these effects intentional?  How much was done in post production?  Questions that pop into my head...<br/>TC</td>', 'A very lovely young lady I''m sure!  However, IMHO this shot doesn''t do her justice.  The harsh highlights combined with the soft focus give this an almost creepy feeling to it.  THe bright red lipstick looks a tad bit oversaturated.  Were these effects intentional?  How much was done in post production?  Questions that pop into my head...TC', '2004-07-04 12:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(794925, 86060, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting, exposure, background and focus are all good ... I might try cropping just a little tighter.</td>', 'Lighting, exposure, background and focus are all good ... I might try cropping just a little tighter.', '2004-07-04 12:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(794928, 85568, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot seems to be very flat.  The lighting doesn''t help to bring out the depth that helps make a portrait different from a snapshot.  What is the glow or halo like effect on the left side of his face?  Awesome catchlight in his eyes.  I gotta figure out how to do tthat so nicely!<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot seems to be very flat.  The lighting doesn''t help to bring out the depth that helps make a portrait different from a snapshot.  What is the glow or halo like effect on the left side of his face?  Awesome catchlight in his eyes.  I gotta figure out how to do tthat so nicely!TC', '2004-07-04 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(794930, 86147, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is not what I usually think of when I see the word portrait.  His expression is rather disheartening and makes me wonder what stress is going on in his world.  Your lighting looks to be a tad bit harsh.  If some of your light came more from the side, this would soften it up a touch and help even out the skin tones.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is not what I usually think of when I see the word portrait.  His expression is rather disheartening and makes me wonder what stress is going on in his world.  Your lighting looks to be a tad bit harsh.  If some of your light came more from the side, this would soften it up a touch and help even out the skin tones.TC', '2004-07-04 12:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794933, 86103, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell if this is a modern portrait made to look old, or a snap of an old portrait.  If it''s the first, you did a dang good job of it.  I don''t personally care for the effect, but it IS well done.  You got the framing down pat for an old school portrait, that''s for sure.  Placing the lady right up against the frame and putting the cat at the very bottom makes this feel un-ballanced and gives it a raw feeling also very reminiscent of shots from the early days of photography.<br/>TC</td>', 'I can''t tell if this is a modern portrait made to look old, or a snap of an old portrait.  If it''s the first, you did a dang good job of it.  I don''t personally care for the effect, but it IS well done.  You got the framing down pat for an old school portrait, that''s for sure.  Placing the lady right up against the frame and putting the cat at the very bottom makes this feel un-ballanced and gives it a raw feeling also very reminiscent of shots from the early days of photography.TC', '2004-07-04 13:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(794937, 86130, 9906, '<td valign="top">What a fun looking young lady!  This is definately one of the more unique shots from this set.  Not what I normally would look for in a portrait.  Personally I don''t care for a couple of elements.  The yellow cast, the HARSH sidelighting and the blown out highlights in her shirt are just not to MY taste.  Just my humble oppinion!<br/>TC</td>', 'What a fun looking young lady!  This is definately one of the more unique shots from this set.  Not what I normally would look for in a portrait.  Personally I don''t care for a couple of elements.  The yellow cast, the HARSH sidelighting and the blown out highlights in her shirt are just not to MY taste.  Just my humble oppinion!TC', '2004-07-04 13:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(794941, 85865, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed and very subtly lit.  Great use of negative space without it becoming overbearing.  Your colors are a tad bit pale for my taste.  A bit of a boost in lighting or in levels/curves in PS may make it look more vibrant.  How did you get the catchlight right in the center of his eyes?  It almost looks like you added the catchlights in...<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely posed and very subtly lit.  Great use of negative space without it becoming overbearing.  Your colors are a tad bit pale for my taste.  A bit of a boost in lighting or in levels/curves in PS may make it look more vibrant.  How did you get the catchlight right in the center of his eyes?  It almost looks like you added the catchlights in...TC', '2004-07-04 13:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(794943, 86075, 1031, '<td valign="top">Really good lighting and detail. With the flat background I''d be tempted to drop in something else, especially for printing. I''d also crop in tighter to make it more "portrait-like" -- I think your subjects are just a bit overbalanced by the amount of negative space.<br/> <br/>Edited for the ubiquitous typo ...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-05 12:37:39.</i></td>', 'Really good lighting and detail. With the flat background I''d be tempted to drop in something else, especially for printing. I''d also crop in tighter to make it more "portrait-like" -- I think your subjects are just a bit overbalanced by the amount of negative space. Edited for the ubiquitous typo ...', '2004-07-04 13:10:39.000000', '2004-07-05 13:37:39.000000', 1),
(794944, 86279, 9906, '<td valign="top">A lovely young lady!  Great expression.  Pose is a little to centered and straight on. This  makes the shot look a little flat.   If you turned her a little and croopped off side a bit (probably the right since she is looking  to the left) it would give a more potent composition.<br/>TC</td>', 'A lovely young lady!  Great expression.  Pose is a little to centered and straight on. This  makes the shot look a little flat.   If you turned her a little and croopped off side a bit (probably the right since she is looking  to the left) it would give a more potent composition.TC', '2004-07-04 13:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(794945, 86283, 9906, '<td valign="top">Your spot on with your lighting and pose here.  Very classic portrait if a bit unimaginitive.  Not sure I like the grain in this instance.  Great use of negative space.<br/>TC</td>', 'Your spot on with your lighting and pose here.  Very classic portrait if a bit unimaginitive.  Not sure I like the grain in this instance.  Great use of negative space.TC', '2004-07-04 13:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(794946, 86280, 9906, '<td valign="top">A bit gimmicky for my taste!  This was taken underwater right?  How did you light it and what kind of camera/case did you use?  Just wondering...<br/>TC</td>', 'A bit gimmicky for my taste!  This was taken underwater right?  How did you light it and what kind of camera/case did you use?  Just wondering...TC', '2004-07-04 13:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(794948, 85891, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition!  Great lighting.  My only complaint is that I find trying to figure out what is in the reflections rather than looking at the overall shot.  Was this a self portrait?  Or is that the photographer in the reflection?<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome composition!  Great lighting.  My only complaint is that I find trying to figure out what is in the reflections rather than looking at the overall shot.  Was this a self portrait?  Or is that the photographer in the reflection?TC', '2004-07-04 13:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(794951, 86287, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling that you achieved here with the (painted) facial expression and the blue background and soft lighting.  I do believe though that it is a little TOO dark and could benefit from cropping a tad bit off the right.  The white part of your border is distracting and too high key for the rest of the shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'I like the feeling that you achieved here with the (painted) facial expression and the blue background and soft lighting.  I do believe though that it is a little TOO dark and could benefit from cropping a tad bit off the right.  The white part of your border is distracting and too high key for the rest of the shot.TC', '2004-07-04 13:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(794954, 85612, 1031, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, detail, use of "blocks" of color/shapes.</td>', 'Good lighting, detail, use of "blocks" of color/shapes.', '2004-07-04 13:18:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(794957, 86095, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely light. I do think it could use just a touch more lighting on the right side (her left) so that her pony tail doesn''t look like it''s pinned to her jacket.   A simple reflector on that side would do the trick.  Composition is very classic if a tad bit unimaginitve.  The only real complaint in my mind is the glow around her glasses.  What is that?  Is it from a back light?<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely light. I do think it could use just a touch more lighting on the right side (her left) so that her pony tail doesn''t look like it''s pinned to her jacket.   A simple reflector on that side would do the trick.  Composition is very classic if a tad bit unimaginitve.  The only real complaint in my mind is the glow around her glasses.  What is that?  Is it from a back light?TC', '2004-07-04 13:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(794959, 85923, 1031, '<td valign="top">Effective use of a modified vignette effect; one of the few photos I''ve seen this week which might have benefitted from a few more pixels on the sides to support the fade-out.</td>', 'Effective use of a modified vignette effect; one of the few photos I''ve seen this week which might have benefitted from a few more pixels on the sides to support the fade-out.', '2004-07-04 13:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(794963, 86279, 1031, '<td valign="top">Lighting and expression work well ... I just think a much tighter crop would show this off to better effect.</td>', 'Lighting and expression work well ... I just think a much tighter crop would show this off to better effect.', '2004-07-04 13:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(794964, 86134, 1031, '<td valign="top">Especially good job controlling the facial shadows.</td>', 'Especially good job controlling the facial shadows.', '2004-07-04 13:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(794965, 86281, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed/composed.  Lighting is a tad bit flat (or maybe your levels).  Could definatly benefit from catchlight in her eyes.  Nice casual feel here.  Are you getting negative feed back about the studio part of the challenge discription?<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely posed/composed.  Lighting is a tad bit flat (or maybe your levels).  Could definatly benefit from catchlight in her eyes.  Nice casual feel here.  Are you getting negative feed back about the studio part of the challenge discription?TC', '2004-07-04 13:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(794969, 86037, 1031, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, good job controlling stray reflections or glare.</td>', 'Interesting idea, good job controlling stray reflections or glare.', '2004-07-04 13:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(794971, 85622, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed/posed and framed.  Your lighting gives a nice sense of depth, but is a little dull.  Colors also are a bit dull.  Crop wise, I am a tad bit distracted by the watch dial being cut off at the bottom.  Also I would have cloned out the tops of the letters on his shirt.  Nice job overall!<br/>TC<br/>Edited to add:  Could definately benefit from catch light in his eyes.</td>', 'Very nicely composed/posed and framed.  Your lighting gives a nice sense of depth, but is a little dull.  Colors also are a bit dull.  Crop wise, I am a tad bit distracted by the watch dial being cut off at the bottom.  Also I would have cloned out the tops of the letters on his shirt.  Nice job overall!TCEdited to add:  Could definately benefit from catch light in his eyes.', '2004-07-04 13:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(794974, 86228, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very day-dreamy pose.  You broke the rule about nostrils though.  Lighting does a decent job of giving depth to the shot, but is a touch dull as are the colors.  The background is a touch distracting IMHO and could stand to be not lit so much or toned down a bit in PS.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very day-dreamy pose.  You broke the rule about nostrils though.  Lighting does a decent job of giving depth to the shot, but is a touch dull as are the colors.  The background is a touch distracting IMHO and could stand to be not lit so much or toned down a bit in PS.TC', '2004-07-04 13:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(794977, 86060, 9906, '<td valign="top">Looking at the knowing half grin and the very noisy shirt, I would have to guess that Bob is a trouble maker or at least a character!  (just kidding, I''m sure he''s a very nice. fun guy!)  This shot seems to give off a feeling of what kind of person he is!  Lighting does the job, and gives the shot depth.  Could stand to have some catchlight in the eyes though.  Haven''t quite figured out how to do this myself...<br/>TC</td>', 'Looking at the knowing half grin and the very noisy shirt, I would have to guess that Bob is a trouble maker or at least a character!  (just kidding, I''m sure he''s a very nice. fun guy!)  This shot seems to give off a feeling of what kind of person he is!  Lighting does the job, and gives the shot depth.  Could stand to have some catchlight in the eyes though.  Haven''t quite figured out how to do this myself...TC', '2004-07-04 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(794978, 85894, 1031, '<td valign="top">Way to control the lighting to keep the detail in the white on white areas; a fluffy white butterfly net might have been a cool accessory, or maybe "overkill."</td>', 'Way to control the lighting to keep the detail in the white on white areas; a fluffy white butterfly net might have been a cool accessory, or maybe "overkill."', '2004-07-04 13:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(794980, 86212, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and light.  Love the tonality here.  Your choice of background goes very well with her skin tones.  THe only thing that I find distracting is her pose.  The fact that you can barely see her right eye makes this shot seem off somehow.  I think it would benefit from either full profile (only seeing one eye) or even better a three quarters profile (almost like you have here, but you can see both eyes.)<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nicely composed and light.  Love the tonality here.  Your choice of background goes very well with her skin tones.  THe only thing that I find distracting is her pose.  The fact that you can barely see her right eye makes this shot seem off somehow.  I think it would benefit from either full profile (only seeing one eye) or even better a three quarters profile (almost like you have here, but you can see both eyes.)TC', '2004-07-04 13:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(794982, 86306, 1031, '<td valign="top">Pretty good job of using the guitar set him in his "environment" without too much clutter.</td>', 'Pretty good job of using the guitar set him in his "environment" without too much clutter.', '2004-07-04 13:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(794983, 86316, 9906, '<td valign="top">A l.ovely young lady in a nice pose!  The lighting here seems to be to concentrated from above.  If you had a touch more sidelighting, it would give more depth to her face and might help with the blown out part of her shirt.  Nice background and background lighting!<br/>TC</td>', 'A l.ovely young lady in a nice pose!  The lighting here seems to be to concentrated from above.  If you had a touch more sidelighting, it would give more depth to her face and might help with the blown out part of her shirt.  Nice background and background lighting!TC', '2004-07-04 13:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(794985, 85526, 1031, '<td valign="top">Really great range of colors while staying somewhat subdued and in control. Maybe a little over-sharpened for my taste; I can see a little haloing at the points of maximum contrast around the hair and clothing, and it heightens the reflections too. I''d probably tone down the reflections with the Clone or Burn tools before printing. Very nice overall.</td>', 'Really great range of colors while staying somewhat subdued and in control. Maybe a little over-sharpened for my taste; I can see a little haloing at the points of maximum contrast around the hair and clothing, and it heightens the reflections too. I''d probably tone down the reflections with the Clone or Burn tools before printing. Very nice overall.', '2004-07-04 13:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(794986, 86243, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like the tones and textured background. I would try a little tighter crop than this.</td>', 'I like the tones and textured background. I would try a little tighter crop than this.', '2004-07-04 13:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(794987, 86228, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, background is OK, but I don''t think the negative space above adds that much (there''s maybe not enough for that) -- I think with this composition/pose you could crop to a square and have a stronger "portrait" photo.</td>', 'Nice lighting, background is OK, but I don''t think the negative space above adds that much (there''s maybe not enough for that) -- I think with this composition/pose you could crop to a square and have a stronger "portrait" photo.', '2004-07-04 13:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(794988, 86287, 1031, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a "backstage" shot, nice and moody. I''d have used a much darker blue or black for the outer border.</td>', 'Reminds me of a "backstage" shot, nice and moody. I''d have used a much darker blue or black for the outer border.', '2004-07-04 13:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(794989, 86281, 1031, '<td valign="top">I like this as a candid shot. For "portrait" (especially if "studio") I think it would be stronger if cropped to just a head nad shoulders shot, with her lips at about the lower-right 1/3-line intersection.</td>', 'I like this as a candid shot. For "portrait" (especially if "studio") I think it would be stronger if cropped to just a head nad shoulders shot, with her lips at about the lower-right 1/3-line intersection.', '2004-07-04 13:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(794991, 85865, 1031, '<td valign="top">Combination of pose and border really make the subject look "boxed-in." Makes me wonder if that''s an expression of the personality of the model or the photographer.</td>', 'Combination of pose and border really make the subject look "boxed-in." Makes me wonder if that''s an expression of the personality of the model or the photographer.', '2004-07-04 13:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(794993, 86213, 1031, '<td valign="top">Given the subject''s apparent interaction with someone off-camera, it seems odd to have al the negative space off in the other direction -- I''m expecting to see other people lined up at the bar or something. I think you could crop all that off into a standard vertical aspect ratio without compromising your theme at all. Lighting, exposure, focus, expression are all great.</td>', 'Given the subject''s apparent interaction with someone off-camera, it seems odd to have al the negative space off in the other direction -- I''m expecting to see other people lined up at the bar or something. I think you could crop all that off into a standard vertical aspect ratio without compromising your theme at all. Lighting, exposure, focus, expression are all great.', '2004-07-04 13:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795027, 85970, 12962, '<td valign="top">You caught a nice smile ...</td>', 'You caught a nice smile ...', '2004-07-04 14:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(795028, 85934, 12962, '<td valign="top">Very studio-like.  Maybe crop more from the top.</td>', 'Very studio-like.  Maybe crop more from the top.', '2004-07-04 14:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(795030, 86313, 12962, '<td valign="top">I like the DOF, more like a caricature than a portrait though ...</td>', 'I like the DOF, more like a caricature than a portrait though ...', '2004-07-04 14:32:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(795033, 85780, 12962, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a tad harsh to my liking.  Post processing is evident, could have been toned down a little bit.  Colors are good though.</td>', 'Lighting is a tad harsh to my liking.  Post processing is evident, could have been toned down a little bit.  Colors are good though.', '2004-07-04 14:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(795035, 85923, 12962, '<td valign="top">This is nice especially the highlighting of the eyes.  Contrast is very high though, maybe tone it down a little bit.</td>', 'This is nice especially the highlighting of the eyes.  Contrast is very high though, maybe tone it down a little bit.', '2004-07-04 14:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(795037, 86134, 12962, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait.  You were able to capture the grin very well ...</td>', 'Nice portrait.  You were able to capture the grin very well ...', '2004-07-04 14:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795045, 86277, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, the lighting is great not too harsh, if I could say anything in the way of a critque it would be the shoulder needed IMO to be in the shot, and the hair is such a warm dark color it blends in with the background a little too much, the facial expression is wonderful, great facial tones.Over all a good shot. 7</td>', 'Wonderful shot, the lighting is great not too harsh, if I could say anything in the way of a critque it would be the shoulder needed IMO to be in the shot, and the hair is such a warm dark color it blends in with the background a little too much, the facial expression is wonderful, great facial tones.Over all a good shot. 7', '2004-07-04 14:57:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(795048, 86116, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is over all a great image, the lighting is great, the only thing I see that would possibly need corrected is the face is too close to the side of the shot, an attempt to not be too centered is my guess. A wonderful subject, her facial features are wonderful, her hair coloring and facial tones are outstanding. 6</td>', 'This is over all a great image, the lighting is great, the only thing I see that would possibly need corrected is the face is too close to the side of the shot, an attempt to not be too centered is my guess. A wonderful subject, her facial features are wonderful, her hair coloring and facial tones are outstanding. 6', '2004-07-04 14:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(795049, 86275, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wondefully playful image. Great lighting, the glasses slightly slid down the nose adds a hint of playfulness. I like it, the over all shot is great, her hands look a little awkward,( the way she has them positioned does not look natural.) Other than that this is a great shot. Good tones and wonderful background selection. 7</td>', 'Wondefully playful image. Great lighting, the glasses slightly slid down the nose adds a hint of playfulness. I like it, the over all shot is great, her hands look a little awkward,( the way she has them positioned does not look natural.) Other than that this is a great shot. Good tones and wonderful background selection. 7', '2004-07-04 15:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(795050, 86228, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great lighting</td>', 'Great lighting', '2004-07-04 15:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(795053, 85780, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great title! lol, Wonderful capture, the eyes are phenominal, you managed to capture the green in the eyes wonderfully. The lighting on the face is just a bit harsh, other than that this is a great shot, and I like the model too by the way :), I have a soft spot for cowboys. 8</td>', 'Great title! lol, Wonderful capture, the eyes are phenominal, you managed to capture the green in the eyes wonderfully. The lighting on the face is just a bit harsh, other than that this is a great shot, and I like the model too by the way :), I have a soft spot for cowboys. 8', '2004-07-04 15:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795056, 85554, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the way you captured the eyes, great background selection, contrasts well with the dark hair. Great lighting.</td>', 'Great shot, love the way you captured the eyes, great background selection, contrasts well with the dark hair. Great lighting.', '2004-07-04 15:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(795058, 85855, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot, the title suits the facial expression perfectly. The lighting on the side of the face is a little harsh but over all a great shot. Beautiful eyes.</td>', 'Wonderful shot, the title suits the facial expression perfectly. The lighting on the side of the face is a little harsh but over all a great shot. Beautiful eyes.', '2004-07-04 15:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(795061, 86115, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture, love the background ! The stern look on the face certainly portrays the seriousness of a photographer after his capture :), I would like to have seen the whole face more accentuated, a slight shadow on the right side, (the subject''s left side) great tones. I like it !</td>', 'Wonderful capture, love the background ! The stern look on the face certainly portrays the seriousness of a photographer after his capture :), I would like to have seen the whole face more accentuated, a slight shadow on the right side, (the subject''s left side) great tones. I like it !', '2004-07-04 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(795063, 86287, 10848, '<td valign="top">Wonderful concept, and a great set up , a little dark, the colors are perfect. and I like the halo effect in the background, this would have been a phenominal shot if it had been a little brighter. I would definitely consider doing this again if I were you, (in another challenge) a little brighter an you would have a winner! 7</td>', 'Wonderful concept, and a great set up , a little dark, the colors are perfect. and I like the halo effect in the background, this would have been a phenominal shot if it had been a little brighter. I would definitely consider doing this again if I were you, (in another challenge) a little brighter an you would have a winner! 7', '2004-07-04 15:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795065, 86107, 10848, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary eyes, the skin tone is great, the lighting is wonderful, the only thing I can say that would make this shot better is if the whole face would have been captured. You did a phenominal job with the lighting. Over all a great capture !</td>', 'Extraordinary eyes, the skin tone is great, the lighting is wonderful, the only thing I can say that would make this shot better is if the whole face would have been captured. You did a phenominal job with the lighting. Over all a great capture !', '2004-07-04 15:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(795066, 86275, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is excellent<br/><b>Pose:</b>  I like the pose, but the nail-biter curl of the fingers does not seem to fit with the rest of the image.   I am assuming the shallow DOF was intentional on her shoulders, but I found the back of her hair being OOF to be a bit distracting.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Well done, with wonderful seperation.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is excellentPose:  I like the pose, but the nail-biter curl of the fingers does not seem to fit with the rest of the image.   I am assuming the shallow DOF was intentional on her shoulders, but I found the back of her hair being OOF to be a bit distracting.Background:  Well done, with wonderful seperation.', '2004-07-04 15:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795067, 86046, 10848, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully colorful subject ! Wonderful facial expression, great tones, the lighting is a little harsh on the side of the face leaving a strong shadow on the other side of the face, other than that I love this shot, it is a delightfully natural image. Congrats!</td>', 'What a wonderfully colorful subject ! Wonderful facial expression, great tones, the lighting is a little harsh on the side of the face leaving a strong shadow on the other side of the face, other than that I love this shot, it is a delightfully natural image. Congrats!', '2004-07-04 15:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(795070, 85970, 10848, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot, the background contrasts perfectly with the hair and the shirt, (I like that shirt, by the way :) ) The background also brings out the beautiful blue eye. The lighting is wonderful not too harsh. Over all a wonderful portrait.</td>', 'This is a great shot, the background contrasts perfectly with the hair and the shirt, (I like that shirt, by the way :) ) The background also brings out the beautiful blue eye. The lighting is wonderful not too harsh. Over all a wonderful portrait.', '2004-07-04 15:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(795071, 86099, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome composition and pose!  Love the lighting and tonality.  THe background compliments the subject nicely.  Great catchlight in the eyes and lips.  Great job<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome composition and pose!  Love the lighting and tonality.  THe background compliments the subject nicely.  Great catchlight in the eyes and lips.  Great jobTC', '2004-07-04 15:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(795073, 86248, 9906, '<td valign="top">I like the simple subtle subdued lighting in this shot.  Good job of matching the background with her eyes.  Could use a touch more catchlight in her eyes and maybe a touch of hairlight.  Nice shot overall.<br/>TC</td>', 'I like the simple subtle subdued lighting in this shot.  Good job of matching the background with her eyes.  Could use a touch more catchlight in her eyes and maybe a touch of hairlight.  Nice shot overall.TC', '2004-07-04 15:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(795074, 85972, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Great lighting, the background works well with the hair colors,and also brings out the darkness in her eyes.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Great lighting, the background works well with the hair colors,and also brings out the darkness in her eyes.', '2004-07-04 15:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(795075, 85542, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is good.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is good, but the perspective from below eye level is not as flattering as it could have been.  The soft focus works with the dreamy pose, but you lost a lot of detail, probably from noise reduction; which is most noticable in the plastic feel of the face and the lack of clear definition in the hair.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The background compliments her skin tone and makeup well.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is good.Pose:  The pose is good, but the perspective from below eye level is not as flattering as it could have been.  The soft focus works with the dreamy pose, but you lost a lot of detail, probably from noise reduction; which is most noticable in the plastic feel of the face and the lack of clear definition in the hair.Background:  The background compliments her skin tone and makeup well.', '2004-07-04 15:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(795076, 86255, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very warm tones.  Background and her skin tones compliment each other nicely.  The lighting is a touch dark for MY taste, but still very well done.  You have a nice sense of depth and you captured the folds in her blouse nicely!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very warm tones.  Background and her skin tones compliment each other nicely.  The lighting is a touch dark for MY taste, but still very well done.  You have a nice sense of depth and you captured the folds in her blouse nicely!TC', '2004-07-04 15:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(795078, 86116, 9906, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t care for the high key treatment of this shots subject.  However, the more I look at it the more I appreciate the more interesting crop and composition that you used here!  The skin tones are just a touch overexposed losing the definition on the left side of her nose.  Beautiful catch lights and nice hair lighting!<br/>TC</td>', 'At first I didn''t care for the high key treatment of this shots subject.  However, the more I look at it the more I appreciate the more interesting crop and composition that you used here!  The skin tones are just a touch overexposed losing the definition on the left side of her nose.  Beautiful catch lights and nice hair lighting!TC', '2004-07-04 15:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(795080, 85816, 9906, '<td valign="top">Not what I would normally consider a portrait, but what I''m hoping was done in a studio and not for real.  Nice lighitng, interesting composition and use of negative space make this a nice image to look at!<br/>TC</td>', 'Not what I would normally consider a portrait, but what I''m hoping was done in a studio and not for real.  Nice lighitng, interesting composition and use of negative space make this a nice image to look at!TC', '2004-07-04 15:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(795082, 85241, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Subtle lighting and very interesting posing/composition/framing make this a joy to look at.  Could be a make up ad!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice.  Subtle lighting and very interesting posing/composition/framing make this a joy to look at.  Could be a make up ad!TC', '2004-07-04 15:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(795083, 86277, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The ligting works well, although a small light behind the head would have provided some needed separation.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The pose is a good one, but the hunch in his shoulders and the open shirt change lay of the clothing to form leading lines pulling the eye away from his face.  Cropping his left arm off would not have been my first choice.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The black is done well, with the chairs balancing the composition, but I would have liked to have seen more separation between his hair and the background.</td>', 'Lighting:  The ligting works well, although a small light behind the head would have provided some needed separation.Pose:  The pose is a good one, but the hunch in his shoulders and the open shirt change lay of the clothing to form leading lines pulling the eye away from his face.  Cropping his left arm off would not have been my first choice.Background:  The black is done well, with the chairs balancing the composition, but I would have liked to have seen more separation between his hair and the background.', '2004-07-04 15:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(795085, 86107, 9906, '<td valign="top">I normally don''t like the type of portrait that is cropped as close as this.  However, your wonderful lighitng and subtly soft focus make this a joy to look at!  I would still like to see the rest of her chin though...<br/>TC</td>', 'I normally don''t like the type of portrait that is cropped as close as this.  However, your wonderful lighitng and subtly soft focus make this a joy to look at!  I would still like to see the rest of her chin though...TC', '2004-07-04 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(795086, 85623, 9906, '<td valign="top">Lighting with such a strong contrast seems like it would be difficult to pull of nicely.  You have done this here.  Great cropping/composition.  Background is a touch distracting, but it does not detract greatly.<br/>TC</td>', 'Lighting with such a strong contrast seems like it would be difficult to pull of nicely.  You have done this here.  Great cropping/composition.  Background is a touch distracting, but it does not detract greatly.TC', '2004-07-04 15:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795087, 85542, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely done, simple and elegant portrait.  Love the glow that you have achieved through soft lighting and focus.Great catchlight in eyes and lips.  Kudos!<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a nicely done, simple and elegant portrait.  Love the glow that you have achieved through soft lighting and focus.Great catchlight in eyes and lips.  Kudos!TC', '2004-07-04 15:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(795088, 85265, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lightin is good, with the exception of the lack of separation between the hair and the background<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Sorry, but the model looks seriously depressed, not the most flattering for a portrait.  The focus is on the elbow, and is not as sharp as it could have been once it gets to the face and ear.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Works well with the tone of the image.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lightin is good, with the exception of the lack of separation between the hair and the backgroundPose:  Sorry, but the model looks seriously depressed, not the most flattering for a portrait.  The focus is on the elbow, and is not as sharp as it could have been once it gets to the face and ear.Background:  Works well with the tone of the image.', '2004-07-04 15:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(795089, 86307, 9906, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be a clothing ad.  Nicely composed.  The only thing that detracts in my mind is that either your is a touch harsh for the soft focus or the focus is a touch soft for the lighting.<br/>TC</td>', 'This looks like it could be a clothing ad.  Nicely composed.  The only thing that detracts in my mind is that either your is a touch harsh for the soft focus or the focus is a touch soft for the lighting.TC', '2004-07-04 15:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(795090, 86076, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very cute composition.  The pose does make her look ''shy''.  The focus though IMHO is way too soft.  Nice lighting to bring out the depth, just needs more focus.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very cute composition.  The pose does make her look ''shy''.  The focus though IMHO is way too soft.  Nice lighting to bring out the depth, just needs more focus.TC', '2004-07-04 15:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(795091, 85693, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the portrait part of this shot, but IMHO the flowers make it a little busy and detract from the lovely subject!  Oh and this would have been a nice shot for the purple challenge also!<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the portrait part of this shot, but IMHO the flowers make it a little busy and detract from the lovely subject!  Oh and this would have been a nice shot for the purple challenge also!TC', '2004-07-04 15:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(795092, 86305, 9906, '<td valign="top">Of all the dog shots, this is porobably the nicest done.  You need some more light though.  Not a lot, just a bounce light from the bottom to fill in the lost details and a touch of catch light in tht eyes and this would be the bomb!<br/>TC</td>', 'Of all the dog shots, this is porobably the nicest done.  You need some more light though.  Not a lot, just a bounce light from the bottom to fill in the lost details and a touch of catch light in tht eyes and this would be the bomb!TC', '2004-07-04 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(795093, 86243, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice job.  Lighting, focus, pose, composition are all spot on!  The only thing that takes this from a great portrait to a nice portrait is the background.  IMHO it is a little busy.  A shallower DOF or more subdued lighting on the background would take this into the realm of great portrait!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice job.  Lighting, focus, pose, composition are all spot on!  The only thing that takes this from a great portrait to a nice portrait is the background.  IMHO it is a little busy.  A shallower DOF or more subdued lighting on the background would take this into the realm of great portrait!TC', '2004-07-04 15:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(795095, 86046, 9906, '<td valign="top">I can truly feel the personality here!  You did a great job of capturing it.  I would like to see just a touch of bounce or fill light on the right side (his left) of his face.  Great job.<br/>TC</td>', 'I can truly feel the personality here!  You did a great job of capturing it.  I would like to see just a touch of bounce or fill light on the right side (his left) of his face.  Great job.TC', '2004-07-04 15:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(795098, 86306, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  I like how you included the guitar.  Your skin tones seem a touch off though.  Not sure how exactly, but they don''t seem quite right.  Great use of lighting to give depth.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice composition.  I like how you included the guitar.  Your skin tones seem a touch off though.  Not sure how exactly, but they don''t seem quite right.  Great use of lighting to give depth.TC', '2004-07-04 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795099, 85334, 18722, '<td valign="top">Sorry, not a person, but:<br/> <br/><b>Lighting:</b>  Well lit with an expressive catchlight.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Works well for the subject.<br/><b>Background:</b>  cluttered, the lines cutting through the model, particularly at the head are disstractive.</td>', 'Sorry, not a person, but: Lighting:  Well lit with an expressive catchlight.Pose:  Works well for the subject.Background:  cluttered, the lines cutting through the model, particularly at the head are disstractive.', '2004-07-04 15:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(795100, 85790, 9906, '<td valign="top">Every time I look at this, I try and figure out just how old she is.  The lighting, costume and old school portrait framing, make it hard to determine!  Great shot.<br/>TC</td>', 'Every time I look at this, I try and figure out just how old she is.  The lighting, costume and old school portrait framing, make it hard to determine!  Great shot.TC', '2004-07-04 15:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(795101, 85970, 9906, '<td valign="top">LIghting is just a touch harsh here, making the face a little flatter than I would normally like.  You did a great job of capturing his personality though.  Looks like a fun loving individual!<br/>TC</td>', 'LIghting is just a touch harsh here, making the face a little flatter than I would normally like.  You did a great job of capturing his personality though.  Looks like a fun loving individual!TC', '2004-07-04 15:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(795102, 86115, 9906, '<td valign="top">Would love to see what the background really looks like here!  Probably the best job of lighting the background for effect that I''ve seen in this challenge.  The subject however is a tad bit too dark.  A little fill light to bring out the detail in his pants and a little catch light would make this the bomb!<br/>TC</td>', 'Would love to see what the background really looks like here!  Probably the best job of lighting the background for effect that I''ve seen in this challenge.  The subject however is a tad bit too dark.  A little fill light to bring out the detail in his pants and a little catch light would make this the bomb!TC', '2004-07-04 15:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(795103, 86312, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Well lit, but seems a tiny bit over-exposed.  There are a few places in the hat that have lost detail.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Wonderful, my only suggestion would be to have her look up a bit more.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Works well with the model and outfit, but could have been a bit further back to diminish the shadow.</td>', 'Lighting:  Well lit, but seems a tiny bit over-exposed.  There are a few places in the hat that have lost detail.Pose:  Wonderful, my only suggestion would be to have her look up a bit more.Background:  Works well with the model and outfit, but could have been a bit further back to diminish the shadow.', '2004-07-04 15:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(795104, 85498, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like how you capture the character of his face.  The older generations are so photogenic!  Your background is a little distractiong.  It either needs more light so you can really see it, or less light to make it less eye catching.  Your lighting could be toned down just a touch on the subject too.  All in all a very nice shot though!<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like how you capture the character of his face.  The older generations are so photogenic!  Your background is a little distractiong.  It either needs more light so you can really see it, or less light to make it less eye catching.  Your lighting could be toned down just a touch on the subject too.  All in all a very nice shot though!TC', '2004-07-04 15:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795105, 85934, 15511, '<td valign="top">Great capture, great face, good lighting...nine!</td>', 'Great capture, great face, good lighting...nine!', '2004-07-04 15:54:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(795106, 85554, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is great.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Works well, but the stare is unsettling.<br/><b>Background:</b>  well toned, but would be less distracting if more OOF.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is great.Pose:  Works well, but the stare is unsettling.Background:  well toned, but would be less distracting if more OOF.', '2004-07-04 15:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(795108, 85865, 15511, '<td valign="top">NIce capture, another "Obituary" border that could/should be thinner.</td>', 'NIce capture, another "Obituary" border that could/should be thinner.', '2004-07-04 15:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795109, 86231, 9906, '<td valign="top">A very lovely bride I must say!  Something about this shot doesn''t look right though.  She looks a little plastic, almost like a manequine.  Did you use Neat Image on this?  The detail in the veil is also just not there... <br/>TC</td>', 'A very lovely bride I must say!  Something about this shot doesn''t look right though.  She looks a little plastic, almost like a manequine.  Did you use Neat Image on this?  The detail in the veil is also just not there... TC', '2004-07-04 15:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(795110, 85934, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait!  Great job of capturing the depth in his face.  The colors, especially the skin tones, seem a little flat though.  Maybe needs more light?  Maybe needs a boost in levels?  Making skin tones right is not my forte unfortunately...<br/>TC</td>', 'Very nice portrait!  Great job of capturing the depth in his face.  The colors, especially the skin tones, seem a little flat though.  Maybe needs more light?  Maybe needs a boost in levels?  Making skin tones right is not my forte unfortunately...TC', '2004-07-04 15:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(795111, 86229, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting works well, but the catchlight could be stronger.  The sky in the background could be less hot, but I get the impression this was the effect you were after and it works well.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Wonderful.  First thoughts were that she needed to be not slouching in the shoulders, but it works to give a feel of anticipation and nervous excitement.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Perfect for the mood, but the bushes to make it a bit cluttered.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting works well, but the catchlight could be stronger.  The sky in the background could be less hot, but I get the impression this was the effect you were after and it works well.Pose:  Wonderful.  First thoughts were that she needed to be not slouching in the shoulders, but it works to give a feel of anticipation and nervous excitement.Background:  Perfect for the mood, but the bushes to make it a bit cluttered.', '2004-07-04 16:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(795112, 85554, 9906, '<td valign="top">Awesome job of capturing a ''school picture'' looking photograph!  Nice catch light and nearly flawless (though a little dull) lighting!  However, the pose is a little unimaganitive and I can''t get a feel for his character.  It doesn''t tell me much about the subject.  Does that make sense?<br/>TC</td>', 'Awesome job of capturing a ''school picture'' looking photograph!  Nice catch light and nearly flawless (though a little dull) lighting!  However, the pose is a little unimaganitive and I can''t get a feel for his character.  It doesn''t tell me much about the subject.  Does that make sense?TC', '2004-07-04 16:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795114, 86271, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nearly flawlessly executed if not so inspiring portrait.  Somehow it looks a little TOO contrived or posed.  A more natural pose would help bring life to the shot and bring out a beautiful boys personality!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nearly flawlessly executed if not so inspiring portrait.  Somehow it looks a little TOO contrived or posed.  A more natural pose would help bring life to the shot and bring out a beautiful boys personality!TC', '2004-07-04 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(795115, 86307, 15511, '<td valign="top">Shape on upper left could have been removed, and there''s something about the placement of the edge of the wall that shows at the upper right of her head. I would have tried to shoot from a slightly different angle or cloned or blended it during post procesing, to achieve the studio effect.<br/>Otherwise, I really like the picture and the "soft" effect. The model is good-looking, too!</td>', 'Shape on upper left could have been removed, and there''s something about the placement of the edge of the wall that shows at the upper right of her head. I would have tried to shoot from a slightly different angle or cloned or blended it during post procesing, to achieve the studio effect.Otherwise, I really like the picture and the "soft" effect. The model is good-looking, too!', '2004-07-04 16:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(795116, 86275, 9906, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots to use the technique of centering the subjects eyes in the frame!  Nearly flawless lighting.  Wonderfully subtle soft focus.  Only thing I think detracts slightly is the pose.  I keep expecting to see her gnawing on her finger nails.  Nice shot overall though!<br/>TC</td>', 'One of the few shots to use the technique of centering the subjects eyes in the frame!  Nearly flawless lighting.  Wonderfully subtle soft focus.  Only thing I think detracts slightly is the pose.  I keep expecting to see her gnawing on her finger nails.  Nice shot overall though!TC', '2004-07-04 16:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795117, 85334, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interresting use of shallow DOF here.  Makes the weiner dog look even longer somehow!  Nice lighting, but the catch light in the eyes is a little too much.  Nicely done pet portrait!<br/>TC</td>', 'Interresting use of shallow DOF here.  Makes the weiner dog look even longer somehow!  Nice lighting, but the catch light in the eyes is a little too much.  Nicely done pet portrait!TC', '2004-07-04 16:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795118, 86084, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice candid looking shot with very subtle yet adequate lighting.  The only thing I think would improve it greatly would be to see her beautiful eyes!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice candid looking shot with very subtle yet adequate lighting.  The only thing I think would improve it greatly would be to see her beautiful eyes!TC', '2004-07-04 16:06:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795119, 85241, 15511, '<td valign="top">Unusual angle for a "portrait." The lighting color seems harsh. Could you have tried something softer or incandescent?</td>', 'Unusual angle for a "portrait." The lighting color seems harsh. Could you have tried something softer or incandescent?', '2004-07-04 16:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795121, 86197, 9906, '<td valign="top">A lovely model!  Nearly flawless lighting, and classic pose make this a technically superior shot, but it is somehow lacking in something.  I think a more creative pose would take this one step beyond.  I do think the soft focus is a touch much here.<br/>TC</td>', 'A lovely model!  Nearly flawless lighting, and classic pose make this a technically superior shot, but it is somehow lacking in something.  I think a more creative pose would take this one step beyond.  I do think the soft focus is a touch much here.TC', '2004-07-04 16:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795122, 85693, 15511, '<td valign="top">This shot has good emotional impact (I love a happy face).</td>', 'This shot has good emotional impact (I love a happy face).', '2004-07-04 16:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(795123, 86276, 9906, '<td valign="top">THis shot makes me think of Chrissy Hines of the Pretenders.  Very eighties feel to it.  Love the matching lolipop/lipstick.  I do think that your lighting is a little harsh and takes away from the shot some though.<br/>TC</td>', 'THis shot makes me think of Chrissy Hines of the Pretenders.  Very eighties feel to it.  Love the matching lolipop/lipstick.  I do think that your lighting is a little harsh and takes away from the shot some though.TC', '2004-07-04 16:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(795125, 86115, 15511, '<td valign="top">Good idea for composition. Perhaps some soft lighting on the shadowy side of his face to match the reflection fron the front of the shirt.</td>', 'Good idea for composition. Perhaps some soft lighting on the shadowy side of his face to match the reflection fron the front of the shirt.', '2004-07-04 16:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(795126, 85526, 9906, '<td valign="top">Lovely young lady in nicely composed shot.  Your lighting is a bit flat though detracting from her lovely face and making it appear flat.  Very tough exposure to get with the darker skin tones and very light colored garb.  Nice job of capturing the textures in the cloth.<br/>TC</td>', 'Lovely young lady in nicely composed shot.  Your lighting is a bit flat though detracting from her lovely face and making it appear flat.  Very tough exposure to get with the darker skin tones and very light colored garb.  Nice job of capturing the textures in the cloth.TC', '2004-07-04 16:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795129, 86281, 15511, '<td valign="top">Lighting on the subject''s face needed, but just enough to keep the blouse from being the major impact in this image.</td>', 'Lighting on the subject''s face needed, but just enough to keep the blouse from being the major impact in this image.', '2004-07-04 16:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795130, 86257, 9906, '<td valign="top">It is obvious that you put a little more thought into posing the subject in this shot.  You did a pretty good job of lighting here including nice catch lights in the eyes.  I think a bit of reflected fill light to fill in under the back of the chair would be benificial.  Nice shot<br/>TC</td>', 'It is obvious that you put a little more thought into posing the subject in this shot.  You did a pretty good job of lighting here including nice catch lights in the eyes.  I think a bit of reflected fill light to fill in under the back of the chair would be benificial.  Nice shotTC', '2004-07-04 16:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(795131, 86315, 9906, '<td valign="top">A nearly flawless portrait shot IMHO.  The only thing I could see to improve would be a slightly different background.  You kind of lose her hair into the background because they are a little too close in color.<br/>TC</td>', 'A nearly flawless portrait shot IMHO.  The only thing I could see to improve would be a slightly different background.  You kind of lose her hair into the background because they are a little too close in color.TC', '2004-07-04 16:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795132, 86163, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great colors, the umbrella is a wonderful addition to this shot, the shadows distract somewhat, the subject''s facial expression is great, the red dress really contrasts well with the black background</td>', 'Great colors, the umbrella is a wonderful addition to this shot, the shadows distract somewhat, the subject''s facial expression is great, the red dress really contrasts well with the black background', '2004-07-04 16:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795133, 86084, 15511, '<td valign="top">In this portrait, the viewer should see more of her eyes. They would have been a good focal point.</td>', 'In this portrait, the viewer should see more of her eyes. They would have been a good focal point.', '2004-07-04 16:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(795134, 85284, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nicely posed/composed shot.  I like the tone of your background.  Compliments her skin tones nicely.  A touch more lighting on her hair (as simple as a reflector above and to the side of her) would make this go from a good portrait to a great one!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nicely posed/composed shot.  I like the tone of your background.  Compliments her skin tones nicely.  A touch more lighting on her hair (as simple as a reflector above and to the side of her) would make this go from a good portrait to a great one!TC', '2004-07-04 16:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(795136, 85934, 10848, '<td valign="top">Great shot, wonderful lighting, and great skin tones.9</td>', 'Great shot, wonderful lighting, and great skin tones.9', '2004-07-04 16:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(795137, 86309, 15511, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! I can look at this again and again.</td>', 'Wonderful! I can look at this again and again.', '2004-07-04 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(795138, 86099, 10848, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, great soft lighting, accentuates the blonde hair. Great capture</td>', 'Beautiful shot, great soft lighting, accentuates the blonde hair. Great capture', '2004-07-04 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(795139, 86314, 9906, '<td valign="top">Another nearly flawless techincal shot.  You obviously used natural light which is a nice touch that hardly anyone used.  The only complaint I have is the colors seem just a touch dull.<br/>TC</td>', 'Another nearly flawless techincal shot.  You obviously used natural light which is a nice touch that hardly anyone used.  The only complaint I have is the colors seem just a touch dull.TC', '2004-07-04 16:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(795141, 85855, 9906, '<td valign="top">A beautiful model in a nicely composed shot!  My only complaints have to do with the lighting.  You are a touch overexposed on the highlight side.  This loses the detail in her hand/wrist/arm and around her nose.  You also could use a touch more lighting on the hair as simple as a reflecter above and to the shadow side.  THis actually would perhaps even out the overall lighting making it easier to expose properly!<br/>TC</td>', 'A beautiful model in a nicely composed shot!  My only complaints have to do with the lighting.  You are a touch overexposed on the highlight side.  This loses the detail in her hand/wrist/arm and around her nose.  You also could use a touch more lighting on the hair as simple as a reflecter above and to the shadow side.  THis actually would perhaps even out the overall lighting making it easier to expose properly!TC', '2004-07-04 16:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795145, 85612, 9906, '<td valign="top">Beatiful lady in a simple elegant pose, nicely light.  Not much you can do to improve on this!  The only thing I find distracting is the purplish object between her hair and rist in the center of the shot.  Is it the color of her shirt?  A shirt underneath?<br/>TC</td>', 'Beatiful lady in a simple elegant pose, nicely light.  Not much you can do to improve on this!  The only thing I find distracting is the purplish object between her hair and rist in the center of the shot.  Is it the color of her shirt?  A shirt underneath?TC', '2004-07-04 16:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795161, 86316, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Works.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Classic but not over-done.  Could have possible been better with a slightly above eye level perspective.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Works, but while it does not conflict with the subject, it does not compliment either.<br/> <br/>The image is suffering from noise that could have been cleaned up.  Also, since this is an advanced challenge, smoothing out her skin tones would have made a more flattering portrait.</td>', 'Lighting:  Works.Pose:  Classic but not over-done.  Could have possible been better with a slightly above eye level perspective.Background:  Works, but while it does not conflict with the subject, it does not compliment either. The image is suffering from noise that could have been cleaned up.  Also, since this is an advanced challenge, smoothing out her skin tones would have made a more flattering portrait.', '2004-07-04 16:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
