(795453, 86262, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice composition but the lighting seems a bit harsh on the left and the expression almost seems forced a bit.  Good pose though but needs some work.  A 4</td>', 'Nice composition but the lighting seems a bit harsh on the left and the expression almost seems forced a bit.  Good pose though but needs some work.  A 4', '2004-07-04 22:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(795454, 86315, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  the eyes have a bit too much shadow, but there are a few small spots that are too bright.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works, but I would not have cut off her elbow.<br/><b>Background:</b>  too busy.  It pulls too much attention from her hair.  A shallower DOF would have created more separation I think.</td>', 'Lighting:  the eyes have a bit too much shadow, but there are a few small spots that are too bright.Pose:  works, but I would not have cut off her elbow.Background:  too busy.  It pulls too much attention from her hair.  A shallower DOF would have created more separation I think.', '2004-07-04 22:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795455, 86084, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice candid capture but the lighting and the focus seems a bit off.  I would have liked to seen one of the others.  A backlight to define her hair from the backdrop would help a great deal.  A 4</td>', 'A nice candid capture but the lighting and the focus seems a bit off.  I would have liked to seen one of the others.  A backlight to define her hair from the backdrop would help a great deal.  A 4', '2004-07-04 22:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(795456, 86314, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very lovely shot but the cropping could have been tighter on the left to take out the lamp, it''s a distraction in the end.   Also the print on the wall could be removed, giving you the solid background and then you could have cropped closer in on her face.  Nice expression, good lighting.  Started with a 4 but going to a 6</td>', 'This is a very lovely shot but the cropping could have been tighter on the left to take out the lamp, it''s a distraction in the end.   Also the print on the wall could be removed, giving you the solid background and then you could have cropped closer in on her face.  Nice expression, good lighting.  Started with a 4 but going to a 6', '2004-07-04 22:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(795457, 86229, 19035, '<td valign="top">This is my number one pic to win, I love the lighting, the softness of the shot and her beautiful expression - good luck.</td>', 'This is my number one pic to win, I love the lighting, the softness of the shot and her beautiful expression - good luck.', '2004-07-04 22:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(795458, 85891, 12448, '<td valign="top">Not sure exactly where you were headed with this shot but the mirrored sunglasses are very distracting, pulls you away from shot.  The camera is also more of a distraction than a help the to shot for me.  I like the pose of the person in the shot, just get rid of the glasses and the camera and you would have much cleaner, nicer shot.  A 4 as is</td>', 'Not sure exactly where you were headed with this shot but the mirrored sunglasses are very distracting, pulls you away from shot.  The camera is also more of a distraction than a help the to shot for me.  I like the pose of the person in the shot, just get rid of the glasses and the camera and you would have much cleaner, nicer shot.  A 4 as is', '2004-07-04 22:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795459, 86243, 19035, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites, the color of her skin go nicely with the background, she is lovely, a very earthy feel to this photo - 10 -</td>', 'One of my favorites, the color of her skin go nicely with the background, she is lovely, a very earthy feel to this photo - 10 -', '2004-07-04 22:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(795460, 85623, 19035, '<td valign="top">Ive come back to this shot several times, her eyes pull me into the picture and dont let go.....well done - 10 -</td>', 'Ive come back to this shot several times, her eyes pull me into the picture and dont let go.....well done - 10 -', '2004-07-04 22:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(795461, 85612, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a classic pose and her expression is almost perfect.  Her chin is tilted just a bit high, could bring it down just a bi so we aren''t looking up her nose so much ;)t.  Also the lighting seems rather flat, leaving her skin with a dull look.  And it looks like there is purple on her hair or neck on the left?  Not sure where that came from.  A 5</td>', 'This is a classic pose and her expression is almost perfect.  Her chin is tilted just a bit high, could bring it down just a bi so we aren''t looking up her nose so much ;)t.  Also the lighting seems rather flat, leaving her skin with a dull look.  And it looks like there is purple on her hair or neck on the left?  Not sure where that came from.  A 5', '2004-07-04 22:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(795463, 86197, 19035, '<td valign="top">Kat, you look wonderful, if the picture was just a tad sharper, you''d look perfect.  A big 9 for your score.  Nice Job!</td>', 'Kat, you look wonderful, if the picture was just a tad sharper, you''d look perfect.  A big 9 for your score.  Nice Job!', '2004-07-04 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(795464, 85273, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Works well for the desired effect, but the soft-focus may have been over-done.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  great capture.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The black is well done, but a lighter tone would have worked to convey the emotion better.</td>', 'Lighting:  Works well for the desired effect, but the soft-focus may have been over-done.Pose:  great capture.Background:  The black is well done, but a lighter tone would have worked to convey the emotion better.', '2004-07-04 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(795465, 86281, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but seems a bit tilted to the right, not sure why.  Maybe if you had come at her more head on instead of from the angle you did?  I like the backdrop, nice contrast to her white shirt and jeans but the lighting seems a bit dull overall.  Too muted, leaving the shot looking dull overall.  A 5</td>', 'A nice shot but seems a bit tilted to the right, not sure why.  Maybe if you had come at her more head on instead of from the angle you did?  I like the backdrop, nice contrast to her white shirt and jeans but the lighting seems a bit dull overall.  Too muted, leaving the shot looking dull overall.  A 5', '2004-07-04 22:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(795467, 85273, 19035, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful child, the only thing that bothers me are the edges of her face on the left side of the photo, but I''m not sure why...Well done - 9 - .</td>', 'What a beautiful child, the only thing that bothers me are the edges of her face on the left side of the photo, but I''m not sure why...Well done - 9 - .', '2004-07-04 22:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(795468, 85622, 12448, '<td valign="top">A nice shot but a classic error made.  If you worked for a portrait studio you would have gotten in trouble for the finger covering the mouth.  The pose is good, just need to brign the hand down so the mouth isn''t covered.  Also the lighting seems just a bit dull overall.  I do like the intense expression in his eyes though.  Nice capture.  Started at a 5, moving to a 6</td>', 'A nice shot but a classic error made.  If you worked for a portrait studio you would have gotten in trouble for the finger covering the mouth.  The pose is good, just need to brign the hand down so the mouth isn''t covered.  Also the lighting seems just a bit dull overall.  I do like the intense expression in his eyes though.  Nice capture.  Started at a 5, moving to a 6', '2004-07-04 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(795469, 86265, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Good, with expressive catchlights.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  not much can be done with an infant this small, but I would not have cut off his arm.<br/><b>Background:</b> works, and you do not appear to have much choice.<br/> <br/>congrats on the new baby.</td>', 'Lighting:  Good, with expressive catchlights.Pose:  not much can be done with an infant this small, but I would not have cut off his arm.Background: works, and you do not appear to have much choice. congrats on the new baby.', '2004-07-04 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(795471, 85972, 19035, '<td valign="top">If this is your love, you are truley fortunate, she is quite beautiful and so is the shot, the hot area of bright green on her glove is the only flaw for me.  Wonderfully done - 9 - .</td>', 'If this is your love, you are truley fortunate, she is quite beautiful and so is the shot, the hot area of bright green on her glove is the only flaw for me.  Wonderfully done - 9 - .', '2004-07-04 22:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(795474, 85970, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is good.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well.  I hope you and your brother had a fun with this.<br/><b>Background:</b>  good choice with good separation.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is good.Pose:  works well.  I hope you and your brother had a fun with this.Background:  good choice with good separation.', '2004-07-04 22:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795476, 86037, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The light is even, but there seems to be a color cast.  A catchlight would have helped I think.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Not very expressive.<br/><b>Background:</b>  the black works.</td>', 'Lighting:  The light is even, but there seems to be a color cast.  A catchlight would have helped I think.Pose:  Not very expressive.Background:  the black works.', '2004-07-04 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
