(795480, 86140, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful young lady and the studio set up is very well done.  I like the pose but what bothers me is that her feet look enourmous!  If you had her sitting in a more traditional pose or maybe moved her feet back?  Or even cropped her legs out completely?  As it is I give it a 5, if the feet were more proportioned I would give this an 8 or above</td>', 'This is a beautiful young lady and the studio set up is very well done.  I like the pose but what bothers me is that her feet look enourmous!  If you had her sitting in a more traditional pose or maybe moved her feet back?  Or even cropped her legs out completely?  As it is I give it a 5, if the feet were more proportioned I would give this an 8 or above', '2004-07-04 23:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795482, 86147, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes, he does look very worried.  I wonder if this is a candid moment caught or posed?   Very well done overall but the light seems a bit harsh, the shadow on his nose is a bit distracting and his lips look off for some reason, the color doesn''t look quite right, almost too pink.  The crop is well done though I would have liked to seen the whole chin to balance it out a bit more.  A 5</td>', 'Yes, he does look very worried.  I wonder if this is a candid moment caught or posed?   Very well done overall but the light seems a bit harsh, the shadow on his nose is a bit distracting and his lips look off for some reason, the color doesn''t look quite right, almost too pink.  The crop is well done though I would have liked to seen the whole chin to balance it out a bit more.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(795483, 85334, 19035, '<td valign="top">I love the focus on the dog''s face - it pulls you into the picture. - 8 -</td>', 'I love the focus on the dog''s face - it pulls you into the picture. - 8 -', '2004-07-04 23:02:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(795485, 86265, 12448, '<td valign="top">Harrison is a doll and very alert!  I love baby pictures.  This is a great capture but the focus is off and his eyes seem a bit blurry as a result.  Trying to get them sit still  when they are awake is a challenge in itself.  A 5</td>', 'Harrison is a doll and very alert!  I love baby pictures.  This is a great capture but the focus is off and his eyes seem a bit blurry as a result.  Trying to get them sit still  when they are awake is a challenge in itself.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(795487, 86163, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  even and nicely done, although there are a few places that would have been better if it was not quite so hot.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well, but I would have preferred the hair not be across her eye.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The black background is well done, but there needs to be more seperation between it and the umbrella.</td>', 'Lighting:  even and nicely done, although there are a few places that would have been better if it was not quite so hot.Pose:  works well, but I would have preferred the hair not be across her eye.Background:  The black background is well done, but there needs to be more seperation between it and the umbrella.', '2004-07-04 23:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(795488, 85554, 19035, '<td valign="top">Classic pose, nice colors, very crisp.  I might have turned his head just a bit, to avoid the deer in head lights look, but a very good picture overall. - 8 - .</td>', 'Classic pose, nice colors, very crisp.  I might have turned his head just a bit, to avoid the deer in head lights look, but a very good picture overall. - 8 - .', '2004-07-04 23:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(795489, 86280, 12448, '<td valign="top">Is it a mirror or water?  Interesting take on the challenge and a classic profile shot.  But the starkness of the blackness surrounding the face works against this shot for me.  Too much negative space for such a classic profile.  A 5</td>', 'Is it a mirror or water?  Interesting take on the challenge and a classic profile shot.  But the starkness of the blackness surrounding the face works against this shot for me.  Too much negative space for such a classic profile.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:04:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(795490, 85698, 12448, '<td valign="top">How adorable are they?  Very cute and nice capture, hard to catch them both looking I bet!<br/> <br/>The lighting seems a tad bright overall and the focus seems a bit too soft.  I had this at a 5 but am bumping to a 7</td>', 'How adorable are they?  Very cute and nice capture, hard to catch them both looking I bet! The lighting seems a tad bright overall and the focus seems a bit too soft.  I had this at a 5 but am bumping to a 7', '2004-07-04 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(795492, 86313, 12448, '<td valign="top">What a cute face!  Reminds me of those dogs with the really big heads?  And that is cute for the dogs but I don''t really like that look too much myself.  His hands look so tiny, it''s really a bit distracting to me.  Also the orange/flesh colored backdrop offer no contrast to him or his skin.  He almost blends in around the edges.  A 5</td>', 'What a cute face!  Reminds me of those dogs with the really big heads?  And that is cute for the dogs but I don''t really like that look too much myself.  His hands look so tiny, it''s really a bit distracting to me.  Also the orange/flesh colored backdrop offer no contrast to him or his skin.  He almost blends in around the edges.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(795494, 86120, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Well done high-key.  But that is exactly why the reflections in her eyes are so distracting, particularly the reflection of you in her right eye.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  nice.</td>', 'Lighting:  Well done high-key.  But that is exactly why the reflections in her eyes are so distracting, particularly the reflection of you in her right eye.Pose:  works well.Background:  nice.', '2004-07-04 23:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(795495, 85780, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The light is fairly even, but could be more so.  The catchlight in the eyes is nice.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  His expression could be better, but it is fine.  The shallow DOF works well here.  I would have preferred a little less processing on the skin, it is looking a bit plastic.<br/><b>Background:</b>  The folds a bit distracting, but not overly so.  I would have liked to see more separation on his right, however.</td>', 'Lighting:  The light is fairly even, but could be more so.  The catchlight in the eyes is nice.Pose:  His expression could be better, but it is fine.  The shallow DOF works well here.  I would have preferred a little less processing on the skin, it is looking a bit plastic.Background:  The folds a bit distracting, but not overly so.  I would have liked to see more separation on his right, however.', '2004-07-04 23:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795496, 85718, 12448, '<td valign="top">And a beautiful young lady she is.  I realize you were probably going for a soft focus here but it came out more blurred to me than a soft effect and the hair in her face is really a bit of distraction.  Did she just come out of the shower, hence the wet, tousled look?  It''s a classic pose and well done, just needs a bit more focus and a bit more light, it comes across a bit dull on that aspect.  A 5</td>', 'And a beautiful young lady she is.  I realize you were probably going for a soft focus here but it came out more blurred to me than a soft effect and the hair in her face is really a bit of distraction.  Did she just come out of the shower, hence the wet, tousled look?  It''s a classic pose and well done, just needs a bit more focus and a bit more light, it comes across a bit dull on that aspect.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(795497, 86309, 19035, '<td valign="top">Id like to see more of her face (her eyes), but still a nice photo - 8 -</td>', 'Id like to see more of her face (her eyes), but still a nice photo - 8 -', '2004-07-04 23:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(795498, 85934, 19035, '<td valign="top">The background seems a little flat - otherwise its a great shot. - 8 -</td>', 'The background seems a little flat - otherwise its a great shot. - 8 -', '2004-07-04 23:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(795499, 86167, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Nicely done, but is a bit too dark on the right and you lost detail in her hair for it.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  compliments the portrait nicely.</td>', 'Lighting:  Nicely done, but is a bit too dark on the right and you lost detail in her hair for it.Pose:  works well.Background:  compliments the portrait nicely.', '2004-07-04 23:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795502, 85265, 12448, '<td valign="top">A very classic pose on the desk, well done.  Now for the nitpicking, the hair across her forehead is very distracting and adds nothing to the shot for me.  Covering her hands like that is a big no=no in studio photography.  Also the lighting seems just a bit harsh, just a tad more shading, looks like natural light?   And a slightly tighter crop on the left, taking the shirt out of the picture, it also ends up being a bit of a distraction, taking away from the girl''s beautiful face.  A 5</td>', 'A very classic pose on the desk, well done.  Now for the nitpicking, the hair across her forehead is very distracting and adds nothing to the shot for me.  Covering her hands like that is a big no=no in studio photography.  Also the lighting seems just a bit harsh, just a tad more shading, looks like natural light?   And a slightly tighter crop on the left, taking the shirt out of the picture, it also ends up being a bit of a distraction, taking away from the girl''s beautiful face.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(795503, 85910, 19035, '<td valign="top">The picture has too many elements in it taking the focus away from the dog.  I hate to see pets dressed up, but thats just my opinion.</td>', 'The picture has too many elements in it taking the focus away from the dog.  I hate to see pets dressed up, but thats just my opinion.', '2004-07-04 23:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(795504, 86248, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very well done as far as posing and the background.  Both are classic and well executed.  The lighting seems a bit harsh though and slightly off for some reason.  The right side of her face doesn''t have a shadow but almost seems a bit darker for some odd reason.  But I like it, the more I look at it, the more I like it.  I started a 5 with this one because of the lighting but am going to a 7</td>', 'Very well done as far as posing and the background.  Both are classic and well executed.  The lighting seems a bit harsh though and slightly off for some reason.  The right side of her face doesn''t have a shadow but almost seems a bit darker for some odd reason.  But I like it, the more I look at it, the more I like it.  I started a 5 with this one because of the lighting but am going to a 7', '2004-07-04 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(795505, 86315, 19035, '<td valign="top">Her head seems tilted a bit too much, but overall still a very beautiful picture - 8 - .</td>', 'Her head seems tilted a bit too much, but overall still a very beautiful picture - 8 - .', '2004-07-04 23:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(795506, 86231, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  perfect, although it appears a bit overprocessed to the point of her skin looking at bit plastic.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  is not quite as expressive as I would have liked, particularly the stare, but it works well.  Also, since this is under the advanced editing rules, the tan line should have been burned to match the rest of her skin.<br/><b>Background:</b>  works well, but I wish it was not tilted.</td>', 'Lighting:  perfect, although it appears a bit overprocessed to the point of her skin looking at bit plastic.Pose:  is not quite as expressive as I would have liked, particularly the stare, but it works well.  Also, since this is under the advanced editing rules, the tan line should have been burned to match the rest of her skin.Background:  works well, but I wish it was not tilted.', '2004-07-04 23:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795507, 86313, 19035, '<td valign="top">His one eye seems a bit out of focus, but I love the colors and the look on his face.  Great job - 8 - .</td>', 'His one eye seems a bit out of focus, but I love the colors and the look on his face.  Great job - 8 - .', '2004-07-04 23:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(795508, 85780, 16488, '<td valign="top">A really unecessary title!</td>', 'A really unecessary title!', '2004-07-04 23:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(795509, 85855, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very nice pose with a beautiful young lady.  The hand could go back just a bit more, covers too much of her face and the focus, if meant to be a soft focus, came out more blurred to me than soft.  I like the lighting and the way her hair shines and it looks like you back lit also to define her from the background, almost a light line around her right shoulder and part of her hair.  A 5 to start, going to a 7</td>', 'Very nice pose with a beautiful young lady.  The hand could go back just a bit more, covers too much of her face and the focus, if meant to be a soft focus, came out more blurred to me than soft.  I like the lighting and the way her hair shines and it looks like you back lit also to define her from the background, almost a light line around her right shoulder and part of her hair.  A 5 to start, going to a 7', '2004-07-04 23:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(795511, 86115, 19035, '<td valign="top">I dont like the bright area behind his back, but I love the puple and the great angles. I give you an 8.</td>', 'I dont like the bright area behind his back, but I love the puple and the great angles. I give you an 8.', '2004-07-04 23:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(795512, 85894, 19035, '<td valign="top">Cute little guy - 8 -</td>', 'Cute little guy - 8 -', '2004-07-04 23:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(795513, 85827, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Good, with expressive catchlights, but would have been better with a reflector bouncing the light back up from below to soften the shadows.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  she just jumps right out and says ''hi'' doesn''t she.  I would have place her face more toward the upper-left third and not cut off her arm.<br/><b>Background:</b>  very busy, with not enough separation between the black shirt and the dark spots in the background.</td>', 'Lighting:  Good, with expressive catchlights, but would have been better with a reflector bouncing the light back up from below to soften the shadows.Pose:  she just jumps right out and says ''hi'' doesn''t she.  I would have place her face more toward the upper-left third and not cut off her arm.Background:  very busy, with not enough separation between the black shirt and the dark spots in the background.', '2004-07-04 23:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(795514, 86213, 12448, '<td valign="top">There you are!  You are your favorite model, aren''t you? :)<br/> <br/>The background is almost overpowering in this shot.  Too white, it almost hurts my eyes to look at it too long.  The lighting seems a bit harsh on the right, causing some shadows on the left side of your face right under your eye, yet I can see where light is coming in from the left as well.  The eyes have a nice smile factor to them but the lighting in them also seems off balance, the left eye has a nice sparkle while the right eye seems shadowed.  A 6</td>', 'There you are!  You are your favorite model, aren''t you? :) The background is almost overpowering in this shot.  Too white, it almost hurts my eyes to look at it too long.  The lighting seems a bit harsh on the right, causing some shadows on the left side of your face right under your eye, yet I can see where light is coming in from the left as well.  The eyes have a nice smile factor to them but the lighting in them also seems off balance, the left eye has a nice sparkle while the right eye seems shadowed.  A 6', '2004-07-04 23:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(795515, 85816, 18722, '<td valign="top">First I like this photo, added to my favorites, but just not as a  portrait.<br/> <br/><b>Lighting:</b>  The most expressive part of the person is the face, and it is hidden in shadows.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  Not really very expressive of the person.<br/><b>Background:</b>  works well.</td>', 'First I like this photo, added to my favorites, but just not as a  portrait. Lighting:  The most expressive part of the person is the face, and it is hidden in shadows.Pose:  Not really very expressive of the person.Background:  works well.', '2004-07-04 23:19:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(795516, 86134, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  well balanced with a good catchlight.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  Works, but there needs to be more separation between the hair and the background.</td>', 'Lighting:  well balanced with a good catchlight.Pose:  works well.Background:  Works, but there needs to be more separation between the hair and the background.', '2004-07-04 23:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(795517, 85972, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful model and a very classic pose.  The lighting seems to work very well though it seems a bit harsh on her hair on the left.  Also the focus on her hair is off in the back, maybe if her head was turned so the but didn''t show?  The green velvet glove is a nice touch but it blends right into the background and her necklace was cut off.  Normally that would work, giving a line going in and out of the shot but in studio shots they frown on jewelry getting cut off.  A 5 to start, bumping to a 7</td>', 'This is a beautiful model and a very classic pose.  The lighting seems to work very well though it seems a bit harsh on her hair on the left.  Also the focus on her hair is off in the back, maybe if her head was turned so the but didn''t show?  The green velvet glove is a nice touch but it blends right into the background and her necklace was cut off.  Normally that would work, giving a line going in and out of the shot but in studio shots they frown on jewelry getting cut off.  A 5 to start, bumping to a 7', '2004-07-04 23:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(795520, 85956, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  way too harsh with just a touch of a color cast.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  I do not care for the stare.<br/><b>Background:</b>  n/a</td>', 'Lighting:  way too harsh with just a touch of a color cast.Pose:  I do not care for the stare.Background:  n/a', '2004-07-04 23:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(795522, 86076, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is good, but seems to have a bit of a color cast.  The soft-focus is a bit much for me.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  conveys the emotion well, but I would not have cut off her arm.<br/><b>Background:</b>  works good.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is good, but seems to have a bit of a color cast.  The soft-focus is a bit much for me.Pose:  conveys the emotion well, but I would not have cut off her arm.Background:  works good.', '2004-07-04 23:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795523, 85623, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Wonderful lighting, but I would prefer the catchlight be over to her right a bit more since her eyes are so dark.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  great.<br/><b>Background:</b>  cluttered.</td>', 'Lighting:  Wonderful lighting, but I would prefer the catchlight be over to her right a bit more since her eyes are so dark.Pose:  great.Background:  cluttered.', '2004-07-04 23:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(795524, 86147, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  good, but may be a bit harsh.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  conveys the emotion well, but not sure it fits a portrait<br/><b>Background:</b>  good.</td>', 'Lighting:  good, but may be a bit harsh.Pose:  conveys the emotion well, but not sure it fits a portraitBackground:  good.', '2004-07-04 23:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(795525, 85891, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  even and good.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  The reflective glasses have got to go.<br/><b>Background:</b>  works well with the skin tone.</td>', 'Lighting:  even and good.Pose:  The reflective glasses have got to go.Background:  works well with the skin tone.', '2004-07-04 23:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(795527, 85901, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  Good, with an expressive catchlight.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  perfect.  Love how the shadows fall into it.</td>', 'Lighting:  Good, with an expressive catchlight.Pose:  works well.Background:  perfect.  Love how the shadows fall into it.', '2004-07-04 23:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(795529, 86271, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is good, but I would prefer a catchlight to accent his eyes.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  works well, but the expression could change.  (where are his shoes?)<br/><b>Background:</b>    works well.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is good, but I would prefer a catchlight to accent his eyes.Pose:  works well, but the expression could change.  (where are his shoes?)Background:    works well.', '2004-07-04 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(795530, 85629, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  well balanced, but perhaps just a tad harsh.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  conveys the message well.<br/><b>Background:</b>  wonderful.</td>', 'Lighting:  well balanced, but perhaps just a tad harsh.Pose:  conveys the message well.Background:  wonderful.', '2004-07-04 23:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(795531, 85835, 18722, '<td valign="top"><b>Lighting:</b>  The lighting is harsh.<br/><b>Pose:</b>  they could have been lined up better, to not give so much of a snap shot feel to it.<br/><b>Background:</b>  fine.</td>', 'Lighting:  The lighting is harsh.Pose:  they could have been lined up better, to not give so much of a snap shot feel to it.Background:  fine.', '2004-07-04 23:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(795533, 86307, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot, very classic, clean and nicely done.  The lighting is nice except for the shadows around her neckline and upper arm on the right.  The hair on her face is also a bit of a no-no in the studio sense.  The soft focus works well with this shot.  A 7</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot, very classic, clean and nicely done.  The lighting is nice except for the shadows around her neckline and upper arm on the right.  The hair on her face is also a bit of a no-no in the studio sense.  The soft focus works well with this shot.  A 7', '2004-07-04 23:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(795535, 85554, 12448, '<td valign="top">Classic High School shot.  Nicely done but the lighting seems a bit dull, leaving the subject''s skin a bit dull looking.  I started at a 6 but am raising to an 8 for the classic style and pose.</td>', 'Classic High School shot.  Nicely done but the lighting seems a bit dull, leaving the subject''s skin a bit dull looking.  I started at a 6 but am raising to an 8 for the classic style and pose.', '2004-07-04 23:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(795536, 86313, 11181, '<td valign="top">Very cute portrait... focus seems to be a bit off though. Excellent lighting btw. 8</td>', 'Very cute portrait... focus seems to be a bit off though. Excellent lighting btw. 8', '2004-07-04 23:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(795537, 85894, 11181, '<td valign="top">Very appealing... one of my favorites. Excellent work! 10</td>', 'Very appealing... one of my favorites. Excellent work! 10', '2004-07-04 23:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(795539, 85334, 11181, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF... excellent saturation, really well framed too.</td>', 'Wonderful DOF... excellent saturation, really well framed too.', '2004-07-04 23:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(795541, 85623, 11181, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10 .. well done! Going right into my favorites ;) Excellent work</td>', 'Perfect 10 .. well done! Going right into my favorites ;) Excellent work', '2004-07-04 23:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795544, 86316, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice shot, classic posing and well done overall.  The light on the top is a bit harsh and overpowers the rest of the shot and is unbalanced, giving light on the left shoulder leaving the right should dark.  Also the cropping could be just a bit lower on the bottom, bringing the entire arm into the shot.  A 5</td>', 'This is a very nice shot, classic posing and well done overall.  The light on the top is a bit harsh and overpowers the rest of the shot and is unbalanced, giving light on the left shoulder leaving the right should dark.  Also the cropping could be just a bit lower on the bottom, bringing the entire arm into the shot.  A 5', '2004-07-04 23:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(795563, 86099, 8159, '<td valign="top">Just a quick note to say this is my favorite shot in the challenge. Great work.</td>', 'Just a quick note to say this is my favorite shot in the challenge. Great work.', '2004-07-05 00:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(795565, 85894, 8159, '<td valign="top">Nice work Jacques! You captured little Samuel wonderfully in this shot. Definitely my choice for "best baby pic" in the challenge!</td>', 'Nice work Jacques! You captured little Samuel wonderfully in this shot. Definitely my choice for "best baby pic" in the challenge!', '2004-07-05 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(795602, 85835, 12448, '<td valign="top">These guys look familier!  But I can''t quite place them :)<br/> <br/>Nice shot but not classic in the sense of studio photography.  The back and forth style is okay but kind of distracting overall.  And I do beleive I just remembered where I saw them from!  Will have to do a little research ;)<br/> <br/>I gave this a 5, a more classical pose would garner a higher score. :)</td>', 'These guys look familier!  But I can''t quite place them :) Nice shot but not classic in the sense of studio photography.  The back and forth style is okay but kind of distracting overall.  And I do beleive I just remembered where I saw them from!  Will have to do a little research ;) I gave this a 5, a more classical pose would garner a higher score. :)', '2004-07-05 00:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(795605, 85568, 12448, '<td valign="top">Why on earth would this need validation?  It looks like a school shot, nothing to really hold my interest, but very classic and safe.  A 5</td>', 'Why on earth would this need validation?  It looks like a school shot, nothing to really hold my interest, but very classic and safe.  A 5', '2004-07-05 00:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(795610, 86130, 12448, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Love the expression.  But the lighting leaves me wanting a lot, too much orange and the cast on her face is really distracting.  A 5</td>', 'LOL!  Love the expression.  But the lighting leaves me wanting a lot, too much orange and the cast on her face is really distracting.  A 5', '2004-07-05 00:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(795612, 86197, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot and I like the posing and cropping very much.  The lighting seems a bit bright though and the focus, if you were going for a soft focus came out more of a blur to me than soft.  A 5</td>', 'This is a lovely shot and I like the posing and cropping very much.  The lighting seems a bit bright though and the focus, if you were going for a soft focus came out more of a blur to me than soft.  A 5', '2004-07-05 00:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(795619, 86276, 12448, '<td valign="top">Interesting pose and take on the subject.    The lighting is a bit harsh on the left and not being able to see her eyes is kind of disappointing.  A 5</td>', 'Interesting pose and take on the subject.    The lighting is a bit harsh on the left and not being able to see her eyes is kind of disappointing.  A 5', '2004-07-05 00:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(795631, 86075, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid shot but not really a classic studio shot.  the background is so stark, it''s ends being distracting.  A 4</td>', 'This is a nice candid shot but not really a classic studio shot.  the background is so stark, it''s ends being distracting.  A 4', '2004-07-05 00:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(795635, 86125, 14448, '<td valign="top">Great mood, creative pose, careful lighting, datsuration that adds to the feeling of maturaty, and well considered composition. 9</td>', 'Great mood, creative pose, careful lighting, datsuration that adds to the feeling of maturaty, and well considered composition. 9', '2004-07-05 00:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(795636, 85526, 12448, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful!  The light is a tad bit harsh on the face but otherwise perfect.  A 10</td>', 'This is beautiful!  The light is a tad bit harsh on the face but otherwise perfect.  A 10', '2004-07-05 00:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(795637, 86309, 12448, '<td valign="top">A perfect, classic studio shot.  The lighting, the pose, everything, perfect,  a 10</td>', 'A perfect, classic studio shot.  The lighting, the pose, everything, perfect,  a 10', '2004-07-05 00:56:37.000000', NULL, 1);
