(796009, 86125, 14603, '<td valign="top">Love this image Jon..your lighting threw me a bit as, judging from the shadows on the face (especially round the eye)it appeared to be coming from a lower level than the subject.Maybe just down to the angle of the head..you can tell I`m a real novice at this :)<br/> <br/>Great stuff.<br/>Gordon</td>', 'Love this image Jon..your lighting threw me a bit as, judging from the shadows on the face (especially round the eye)it appeared to be coming from a lower level than the subject.Maybe just down to the angle of the head..you can tell I`m a real novice at this :) Great stuff.Gordon', '2004-07-05 07:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
