(796084, 85938, 6900, '<td valign="top">With no 1''s, no 2''s and no 3''s, this shot avoided the bottom better than even Theodor''s winner.  Excellent excellent shot!  Well done ribbon!<br/> <br/>Mav</td>', 'With no 1''s, no 2''s and no 3''s, this shot avoided the bottom better than even Theodor''s winner.  Excellent excellent shot!  Well done ribbon! Mav', '2004-07-05 09:24:11.000000', NULL, 0),
