(796336, 85891, 16775, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neuferland:</b></div><hr/><i> Not sure exactly where you were headed with this shot but the mirrored sunglasses are very distracting, pulls you away from shot.  The camera is also more of a distraction than a help the to shot for me.  I like the pose of the person in the shot, just get rid of the glasses and the camera and you would have much cleaner, nicer shot.  A 4 as is </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>the camera and glasses ARE the shot</td>', 'Originally posted by Neuferland: Not sure exactly where you were headed with this shot but the mirrored sunglasses are very distracting, pulls you away from shot.  The camera is also more of a distraction than a help the to shot for me.  I like the pose of the person in the shot, just get rid of the glasses and the camera and you would have much cleaner, nicer shot.  A 4 as is   the camera and glasses ARE the shot', '2004-07-05 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 0),
