(796718, 86309, 14386, '<td valign="top">I enjoy your story about this shot. Wonderful picture. I gave it a 10 and will give you more than that after reading the photographer''s comment.<br/> <br/>What i like most about this shot is the fact that she was not looking at you.She looks more innocent, shy and delicate. That expression goes well with your subdued lighting. Congratulations. You should place higher than me.</td>', 'I enjoy your story about this shot. Wonderful picture. I gave it a 10 and will give you more than that after reading the photographer''s comment. What i like most about this shot is the fact that she was not looking at you.She looks more innocent, shy and delicate. That expression goes well with your subdued lighting. Congratulations. You should place higher than me.', '2004-07-05 15:52:02.000000', NULL, 0),
