(796923, 85284, 7743, '<td valign="top">*** Critique Club ***<br/> <br/>Me again, I drew two of yours in a row.<br/> <br/>The lighting on the left is wonderful, however I think maybe a small amount of light coming from the right to balance it would give this image greater impact and soften some of the shadows on your model''s face as well as bring out some detail in her hair.  This could be done using a reflector.<br/> <br/>You''ve done well with the catch light in her eyes.  The composition works well with your model looking into the negative space.<br/> <br/>Keep shooting.<br/> <br/>Colette</td>', '*** Critique Club *** Me again, I drew two of yours in a row. The lighting on the left is wonderful, however I think maybe a small amount of light coming from the right to balance it would give this image greater impact and soften some of the shadows on your model''s face as well as bring out some detail in her hair.  This could be done using a reflector. You''ve done well with the catch light in her eyes.  The composition works well with your model looking into the negative space. Keep shooting. Colette', '2004-07-05 19:20:46.000000', NULL, 0),
