(797586, 86219, 17036, '<td valign="top">TooCool, thanks for the portrait.  It was good to see you even if it was for such a short time.  Love ya brother.<br/> <br/>Hi everybody.  That''s me on the left and my beautiful wife of 10 years on the right.  You should know that TooCool moaned and complained about the lighting conditions.  He tried many different locations and this one worked out best.  For a spur of the moment shot, I think it turned out very good.  I''m sure he appreciates the postive criticism.<br/> <br/>TG73, I always look happy and she always looks a little worried.  We''re Mr. ;-P &amp; Mrs. :-|<br/> <br/>Thanks and good work everybody,<br/>RadioFlyer (aka. Bill)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-07-06 09:55:50.</i></td>', 'TooCool, thanks for the portrait.  It was good to see you even if it was for such a short time.  Love ya brother. Hi everybody.  That''s me on the left and my beautiful wife of 10 years on the right.  You should know that TooCool moaned and complained about the lighting conditions.  He tried many different locations and this one worked out best.  For a spur of the moment shot, I think it turned out very good.  I''m sure he appreciates the postive criticism. TG73, I always look happy and she always looks a little worried.  We''re Mr. ;-P & Mrs. :-| Thanks and good work everybody,RadioFlyer (aka. Bill)', '2004-07-06 10:51:05.000000', '2004-07-06 10:55:50.000000', 0),
