(799261, 86231, 200, '<td valign="top">it is shallow beauty. I entered it because I was curious of my color ability and my monitor calibration in relation to everyone else''s. I entered it as a last minute whim. This image is odd and I cant quite put my finger on it..but I think it is the lack of depth and soul. She was nothing but pose...I was unable to pull anything out of her. I did not neat image or overly process her skin. It is not that her skin looks plastic but maybe it is she who is plastic?...pondering and scratching my chin...</td>', 'it is shallow beauty. I entered it because I was curious of my color ability and my monitor calibration in relation to everyone else''s. I entered it as a last minute whim. This image is odd and I cant quite put my finger on it..but I think it is the lack of depth and soul. She was nothing but pose...I was unable to pull anything out of her. I did not neat image or overly process her skin. It is not that her skin looks plastic but maybe it is she who is plastic?...pondering and scratching my chin...', '2004-07-07 02:40:14.000000', NULL, 0),
